window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AH_THE_VILLAINS_I_FORCED_TO_TURN_EVIL_CAN_READ_MY_MIND_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: The Abandoned Child","paragraphs":["Lin Qing's mouth twitched, almost forming a smile.","The boss was visibly annoyed: \"What the hell? I was just about to enjoy myself, and they play this cheesy song? Make them stop it! It's ruining the vibe!\"","His subordinate nodded, walking out in irritation: \"The boss said—ah!\"","Two subordinates collapsed to the ground!","The other men in the room exchanged uneasy glances, drawing their guns and rushing out!","\"Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!!\"","The men were flung back as if hit by a flood, the force of the bullets knocking them down one after another, piling up like a human pyramid, groans filling the air!","Each of them had been precisely shot in the left and right shoulders. Some passed out immediately, while others groaned weakly, completely incapacitated.","The boss's face turned pale as he drew his gun and aimed at the doorway—","\"Bang!!\"","His gun was knocked out of his hand!","Qiao Chuchu walked in, dual pistols smoking, her expression icy: \"Don't move.\"","Lin Qing's eyes lit up: \"Woo!!\"","The boss turned pale, disbelief etched on his face: \"It's you?!\"","\"Me,\" Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow, stepping closer: \"Didn't expect it, did you? I'm a cold-blooded killer.\"","The boss: \"?\"","Lin Qing's eyes sparkled.","Before her stood Qiao Chuchu, her voluminous hair tied up with a stick she must have picked up somewhere, a few strands falling loosely. Though petite, she looked incredibly dashing with her dual pistols, her aura commanding!","Pei Buxian's eyes widened in delight.","The Qiao Chu from his novel had come to life!","She was a perfect match for the real-life Qiao Chuchu!","The boss gritted his teeth, his gaze sharp enough to skin Qiao Chuchu alive: \"You little brat, you dare cross me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked, pressing her gun to his forehead: \"Who sent you? Talk.\"","The man's pupils contracted, his chest heaving: \"I don't know!\"","Her other gun immediately aimed at his crotch!","The man's face changed dramatically, raising his hands in surrender: \"I—I really don't know! The client contacted us through a middleman! Their demand was to humiliate the rich girl, to make her suffer so much that she'd want to kill herself!!\"","Lin Qing: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes: \"Proof?\"","The man frantically pulled out his phone, handing it over with both hands: \"Here, it's all here! The password is 9527!\"","She took the phone and shot him in the crotch!","The man: \"Ah!!! Why are you still shooting me?!!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked puzzled: \"I never said I'd let you go. Why are you blaming me for overthinking?\"","The man stared in shock at his bleeding body before passing out.","She quickly untied Lin Qing: \"Let's go, Sister Lin Qing. I bragged to my brother that I'd rescue you in ten minutes. We’ve got two minutes left!\"","Lin Qing nodded, following her.","Pei Yuan, holding his phone, was stunned.","She really did it in ten minutes?","Lou Yuejue whistled: \"Ha! Sis really rescued Sister Lin Qing in ten minutes! You’re amazing, sis!!\"","The brothers breathed a sigh of relief, adjusting the surveillance cameras to watch Qiao Chuchu and Lin Qing leave the building.","This should be safe now.","Lin Qing tightly gripped Qiao Chuchu's hand, her voice trembling with gratitude: \"Chuchu, I don’t know how to thank you. I was so scared you’d get hurt for me. Are you okay?\"","\"I’m fine,\" Qiao Chuchu supported her, calm and composed: \"Let’s not talk about it now. We need to get to safety first. I parked the car over there and called the police. Senior Lin Shen and my brothers are probably on their way. Let’s hurry; we might run into them, and then we’ll be safe.\"","Lin Qing nodded eagerly: \"Okay, I’ll listen to you, whatever you say!\"","Qiao Chuchu led her toward the car.","A Maybach approached from the distance.","She immediately went on alert, shielding Lin Qing.","Lin Qing squinted, her voice rising in joy: \"It’s my dad!!\"","Chuchu froze, releasing her protective hold: \"Why is your dad here?\"","Lin Qing didn’t answer, rushing toward the Maybach, waving her hands: \"Dad!~\"","Mr. Lin stepped out of the car, followed by two burly bodyguards.","His face darkened as he approached Lin Qing, scrutinizing her: \"What are you doing here?\"","Lin Qing, overjoyed, clutched her chest, too excited to speak at first. After a moment, she managed: \"I was just kidnapped, almost assaulted by these men. Luckily, Chuchu arrived just in time and saved me!\"","Mr. Lin’s brows furrowed, his sharp gaze landing on Qiao Chuchu: \"This shorty saved you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Who’s he calling short? Baldy!!","Lin Qing smiled, stepping in front of her father, proudly boasting: \"Chuchu is incredible. She never misses a shot, she—\"","Lin Qing suddenly shuddered!","Her black cashmere coat inexplicably bloomed with a deep red stain.","She stared in disbelief at the hole in her chest, her shocked expression frozen as she collapsed backward, dead on the spot.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned.","As Lin Qing fell, she saw Mr. Lin holding a gun.","In the bitter cold, the silencer on Mr. Lin’s gun still smoked, his face splattered with Lin Qing’s blood.","His already ugly face looked even more sinister with the bloodstains, his calm eyes turning to Qiao Chuchu.","Chuchu instinctively drew her gun!","\"Bang!!!\"","She was flung to the ground, a bloody hole erupting in her shoulder!","The pain felt like her shoulder was being torn off!","Qiao Chuchu let out an indescribable groan, writhing on the ground in agony!","Damn it! It hurts so much!!","She was drenched in sweat, every muscle in her body tense, like a squid not yet dead on a hot plate. Through tear-filled eyes, she looked up at the grim Mr. Lin.","He stood beside Lin Qing, stepping on her face, his tone mocking: \"You’re just like your mother, a ticking time bomb by my side, always ready to explode. Understand me, child. How can anyone live with a bomb in their arms?\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t believe it!","He was the assassin!","He was the murderer!!","She tremblingly raised her gun at Mr. Lin: \"You old bastard!!\"","Mr. Lin sneered, raising his gun at her.","Qiao Chuchu tried to pull the trigger but lacked the strength. She faintly heard Pei Yuan’s desperate scream from the surveillance system: \"Don’t shoot!!!\"","\"Bang!!\"","-","Qiao Chuchu jolted upright, gasping for air.","The system floated in front of her: \"Come on, host. While the emotions are still fresh, let’s go again! Charge!!!\"","Before she could react, she was suddenly standing behind Lin Qing.","Lin Qing was happily running toward her father: \"Dad!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s alarm bells rang. She lunged forward, grabbing Lin Qing and pulling her away:","\"Run! Your dad’s the one who hired those men!!\""]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Lin Qing: We Are the Ultimate Winners","paragraphs":["Lin Qing: \"???\"","She thought she had misheard: \"What did you say?\"","Qiao Chuchu dragged Lin Qing to the back of the house to hide, her adrenaline surging from fear, her body feeling light and her voice trembling: \"Sister Lin Qing, look, this is a secluded place with no one around. This rundown house is clearly a hideout for these criminals. I only notified your brother and my brother, not your father. How would your father know you’re here?\"","Lin Qing was completely baffled: \"Maybe he saw my car? He came to check on me?\"","Qiao Chuchu froze, let out an incredulous laugh, and didn’t know what to say.","[I’ve already died once, and Sister Lin Qing died once too. I saw with my own eyes how Sister Lin Qing was shot dead by her father, right in the heart, without even a chance to speak!]","[That terrifying feeling, I don’t even know how to describe it.]","[I can only say that my shoulder still hurts from it!]","[After shooting, Lin Qing’s father said she was a ticking time bomb, and he couldn’t live with a bomb forever. At that time, Sister Lin Qing was already dead, so she couldn’t hear what he said.]","[But now, Sister Lin Qing hasn’t experienced being shot by her father. What can I say to make her believe me?]","[If it were me, and Sister Lin Qing told me my brother came here to kill me, I wouldn’t believe it either.]","[What should I do?!]","Sweat dripped from Qiao Chuchu’s forehead as she brainstormed furiously, her ears straining to catch any sounds.","Lin Qing stared at Qiao Chuchu in shock, completely stunned.","Not just Lin Qing, but everyone watching the backyard surveillance footage was dumbfounded.","Lin Qing and Qiao Chuchu... were killed by Lin Dahai?!","Lin Dahai was Lin Qing and Lin Shen’s biological father!","Lin Shen’s head was buzzing as he watched the two girls huddled behind the clutter on the screen.","Dad... killed my sister... killed the person I love.","Lin Shen’s hands trembled on the steering wheel, a wave of nausea and dull pain surging into his stomach.","His teeth chattered as he gasped for air, as if breathing through his nose would suffocate him instantly, but even taking deep breaths didn’t help.","He felt an indescribable suffocation.","So suffocating that his eyes gradually turned red.","Lin Qing, however, was surprisingly calm.","The stench of the men still clung to her, wafting into her nostrils with the wind.","It was disgusting.","But it wasn’t the smell that made her feel sick.","On the other side, Lin Dahai stood in the courtyard like a statue.","His gaze calmly swept over the figures inside the house, and he spoke gently: \"Daughter? What’s wrong? Are you hurt? Let Dad take a look at you.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s breath hitched, and she quickly covered Lin Qing’s mouth like a leopard!","\"Don’t make a sound!\" Qiao Chuchu’s voice was almost crushed by the wind: \"Don’t answer him, trust me!\"","[I don’t know how to save Sister Lin Qing, but if he shoots, even if I survive, Sister Lin Qing might still die! I can’t watch her die! She’s so amazing and good!!]","Lin Qing froze, tears suddenly filling her eyes.","Large teardrops rolled down her cheeks as she moved Qiao Chuchu’s hand away: \"I believe you.\"","She cried profusely, speaking solemnly: \"I only believe you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, but before she could process it, she heard footsteps closing in from both sides.","She grabbed her gun and fired in both directions!","Two bodyguards quickly took cover behind obstacles!","Qiao Chuchu grabbed Lin Qing’s hand and dashed into the overgrown weeds, but soon her gun ran out of bullets.","Damn it!","She had no choice but to drop the gun and run with Lin Qing.","The bodyguards aimed their guns at their retreating figures.","Lin Dahai pressed down on one of the bodyguards’ gun barrels: \"Don’t hurt her! She’s my precious daughter!!!\"","Lin Qing stumbled at these words, glancing back at Lin Dahai.","Lin Dahai lowered his voice to warn the bodyguard: \"Don’t shoot unless you’re absolutely sure. Don’t let them know I’m trying to kill them! Chase them!\"","The bodyguard nodded and pursued Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu sensed someone was catching up!","There was nothing here but a patch of overgrown weeds left from summer.","But that was enough to cover them!","She took off her fur coat and hung it on the weeds, then pulled Lin Qing in the opposite direction: \"This way!!\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her phone and shared her location in a WeChat group: \"Hurry up and come! Or you’ll be collecting our corpses!!\"","The bodyguard pushed through the weeds and saw Qiao Chuchu’s coat standing in the distance. He ran over and reached out—","\"Damn it?! Just a coat?!\"","The other bodyguard was furious: \"That bitch knows how to set a decoy?!\"","Lin Qing stumbled behind Qiao Chuchu, her high heels making it difficult to walk: \"Do you have any bullets left?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head cautiously: \"No, not a single one.\"","Lin Qing frowned, her foot twisting, and a sharp pain shot through her ankle: \"Ah!\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled but didn’t hesitate. She hoisted Lin Qing onto her shoulder and kept running!","Lin Qing: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu carried her as if she were a sack of rice: \"We can’t stop, or they’ll find us!\"","Lin Qing was shocked, but a strange sense of security washed over her.","Qiao Chuchu broke through the weeds and reached the main road.","A bodyguard was already waiting at the end, running toward them: \"Miss Lin, Miss Qiao, we’re here to rescue you!\"","Qiao Chuchu gritted her teeth.","It seemed there was no escape.","Fine!","She set Lin Qing down and screamed as she lunged at the man: \"Then I’m so happy! Thank you hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!\"","Bodyguard: \"?!\"","Lin Qing: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu aimed for the bodyguard’s waist, thrusting forward with all her might!","?","It didn’t budge.","The bodyguard looked at her in confusion: \"Miss, I work out every day. My body is as hard as iron.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened, and she kicked him in the groin: \"I don’t believe it!!!!\"","The bodyguard’s veins bulged as he doubled over in pain: \"Ugh!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed: \"Ha! Your ass is so high now, you could balance a soda bottle on it!\"","Suddenly, a shadow loomed behind her!","She turned in shock!","Another bodyguard was swinging a punch at her!","Caught off guard, she widened her eyes—","Lin Qing leapt up with a brick in hand and smashed it into the bodyguard’s head: \"Go to hell!!!\"","Bodyguard: \"!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","She watched as the bodyguard went limp, his eyes rolling back as he collapsed to the ground, blood soaking the earth.","Lin Qing held the bloodied brick, her eyes filled with murderous intent: \"We’re the ones who’ll win in the end! Do you hear me?!\"","The man groaned, trying to get up.","Lin Qing slammed the brick into his head again with a loud \"thud\"!","The man was completely knocked out!","Lin Qing panted heavily, looking at Qiao Chuchu: \"Are you okay, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head in a daze: \"I’m fine.\"","Lin Qing had already taken off her cumbersome high heels and limped over to take Qiao Chuchu’s hand: \"Let’s go quickly.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded repeatedly, but when she turned around, she saw six bodyguards emerging from the weeds, their eyes cold and menacing.","Lin Qing’s face turned pale.","Qiao Chuchu: \"????????\"","[No way... Am I going to die again?!]","[I only have four chances left!]"]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: Brother Save Me","paragraphs":["Lin Qing gritted her teeth, shielding Qiao Chuchu. \"Chuchu, go.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"Sister Lin Qing?\"","Lin Qing stood barefoot on the icy ground, her body steady and her voice unwavering. \"I'll hold them off. You go.\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head without hesitation. \"No, we’ll leave together!\"","\"I can’t run anymore,\" Lin Qing said calmly, gripping her hand. \"At least one of us has to survive.\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless, tears welling up in her eyes.","Lin Qing’s makeup was smudged, but it didn’t diminish her beauty. She smiled at Qiao Chuchu with a look of resignation.","\"You’re better than me, so if one of us has to die, it should be me.\"","Tears streamed down Qiao Chuchu’s face as she grasped Lin Qing’s hand. \"No, I won’t leave you behind.\"","She glanced at the real-time location-sharing interface. \"We can survive this.\"","Lin Qing was taken aback.","Six bodyguards were closing in on them.","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath and shouted at the top of her lungs, \"Brother!!! Save me!!!\"","Pei Buxian roared onto the scene in his G-Class like a madman. \"I’m here!!\"","He slammed on the brakes and flung the door open. \"Sic them!!!\"","A pack of ferocious dogs leaped out of the car, charging at the black-clad men with snarls!","The men paled, reaching for their weapons, but the dogs pounced on them, pinning them to the ground!","Pei Che, who had pulled over nearby, adjusted his tie and stepped out of his car, a scalpel twirling in his hand. With a swift motion, he plunged it into a bodyguard’s shoulder!","Pei Yuan, still in his hospital gown, was full of energy as he grabbed three sticks and tossed them to his brothers. He swung one at a bodyguard with practiced ease!","Pei Buxian charged forward with his stick, yelling, \"Who the hell dares to mess with our little sister!!!!\"","Pei Fengnong arrived late, his sharp eyes narrowing as he drove straight at a bodyguard trying to flee!","The bodyguard rolled out of the way!","Pei Fengnong stepped out of the car, picked up a baseball bat, and delivered a crushing blow to the man!","Lin Dahai, standing in the weeds, was utterly dumbfounded.","Where did all these people come from?!","Where did all these people come from!!!","Panicking, he turned to run but collided with Lin Shen’s icy gaze.","Lin Dahai stumbled, forcing an awkward smile. \"Son? What are you doing here?\"","Lin Shen punched him square in the face!","Lin Dahai crashed to the ground, clutching his face in shock. \"What are you doing?! I’m your father!!!\"","\"You hurt my sister and the person I love,\" Lin Shen said, his eyes filled with murderous intent. \"You’re no father of mine.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood surrounded by her brothers, watching the men writhing on the ground and the dogs standing guard. Her heart finally settled.","She felt a sudden wave of exhaustion. \"We’re safe...\"","Lin Qing, tears in her eyes, looked at her with overwhelming emotion. \"Yes, Chuchu, we’re safe! You saved me!!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled weakly, her body collapsing.","Lin Qing instinctively caught her. \"Chuchu!\"","The other brothers shouted in unison, \"Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu felt her consciousness drifting, as if being lured away by something.","When she opened her eyes again, she was in the system’s world.","The world was a blank, white expanse. She sat up, exhausted, and rubbed her forehead. \"Did I die again?\"","\"Not dead,\" the system said, circling her. \"It was just an emergency recall. I knew you had a lot of questions, so I brought you back here. Now that you’re safe, we have plenty of time to talk. Ask away.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed in relief. \"Why didn’t you talk to me earlier?\"","The system chirped, \"Your emotions were at their peak earlier—your adrenaline was through the roof, and your anger and hatred for the enemy were at their max. If we’d chatted, it would’ve disrupted your focus, and your adrenaline would’ve dropped. How would you have handled that emergency then, huh?\"","Qiao Chuchu thought it made sense and got straight to the point. \"Even though this world is real, can we still treat it like a novel?\"","The system nodded. \"Of course.\"","She pressed on, \"The novel you gave me earlier—as a reader, I should have a god’s-eye view, right? So why didn’t I know who the real culprit behind Lin Qing’s suffering was?\"","The system didn’t hesitate. \"Readers enter the novel through the protagonist’s perspective. Blame Xia Xuechun for being so love-struck that she didn’t bother to investigate the dark forces targeting Lin Qing.\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent for a moment, then sat cross-legged, feeling uneasy. \"So, there aren’t any really bad people around me now, right?\"","The system sighed. \"Host, get a grip. You’re one of the villainesses. Everyone around you is a villain. Do you know what that means? It means you’re all part of a crew of morally bankrupt, utterly wicked people. No one’s worse than you lot.\"","\"The ones attacking you are the ‘good guys,’ and they’re all on Xia Xuechun’s side!\"","Qiao Chuchu was baffled. \"Wait, so Lin Dahai is a good guy?\"","The system nodded.","She laughed in disbelief. \"That guy tried to kill Lin Qing or have her assaulted to drive her to suicide!\"","The system replied, \"Yes, but he did it to protect his new family. He knew that Lin Qing, though his daughter, was ruthless and would never allow anyone but Lin Shen to share the family fortune. Once she found out he had a wife and son, she’d act. So he struck first.\"","Qiao Chuchu was speechless. \"How the hell is that being a good guy?!\"","The world had truly gone mad beyond her comprehension!","The system shrugged. \"Host, don’t forget, Xia Xuechun is the chosen one, the ‘heroine.’ To her, love is everything.\"","\"From Xia Xuechun’s perspective, Lin Dahai was just protecting his new family. Lin Qing and Lin Shen were children from a loveless marriage. What’s wrong with him protecting his true love?\"","Qiao Chuchu stayed silent, then grabbed a random brick that appeared out of nowhere and threw it to the ground. \"Disgusting! Absolutely disgusting!!\"","The system chuckled. \"Don’t get so worked up, host. Relax. I think you’ll win in the end.\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped, \"Win with what? My remaining four lives?\"","The system shook its head. \"No, five.\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused. \"What?\"","The system presented her with a crystal-clear orb. \"This time, you performed exceptionally well. You saved a poor girl from being assaulted, and you risked your life to protect your companion with pure sincerity. The system council unanimously decided to reward you with an extra life. You’re back up to five lives!~\"","Her eyes widened in shock. \"Really?!\"","The system placed the orb into her body.","The number in front of Qiao Chuchu’s eyes changed from 4 to 5.","She covered her mouth in excitement. \"Oh my God, I’m a proper system pawn now. I actually feel happy that the system gave me an extra life!\"","The system deadpanned, \"If you don’t know how to speak, maybe just don’t.\""]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Who is the Werewolf That Stole a Kiss from Qiao Chuchu Among the Seven","paragraphs":["The system chimed in again: \"However~ since you’ve used the triple talents we gave you—【Crazy Racer + Sharpshooter + Stealth Hunter】—in a short period of time, your body will feel a bit weak for the next couple of days. Make sure to rest well!~\"","Qiao Chuchu’s joy lasted no more than three seconds: \"Why would I feel weak? My physical condition is pretty good.\"","The system explained: \"Let’s put it this way, after using the talents we provided, you’ll naturally feel weak for a while. Of course, if an emergency arises, you can still use your talents, but afterward, you’ll feel even more exhausted and need more time to recover. Think of it like a skill cooldown or a boss’s fatigue period. Does that make sense?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned in annoyance, unable to hold back her complaint: \"I’ve seen others with a system, and it’s not like this. Their abilities are unlimited, with no downtime or weakness.\"","The system retorted: \"That’s because they’re the main character with the protagonist’s luck and a system. You, on the other hand, were supposed to be a side character who died early, paired with a system. They had parents who died early, but their spirit remained unyielding. You had parents who died early, were raised by seven brothers, and then turned against them, driving them to darkness.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She scratched her head: \"But recently, I’ve been feeling strange. My brothers have been treating me exceptionally well.\"","The system dismissed it: \"They’ve always treated you well.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt an indescribable unease: \"No, this kind of good feels different. It’s like there’s something they’re hiding. And when I think about it, why would my death drive them to darkness?\"","She stared at the system curiously: \"Could it be that when I was trying to seduce them, they had already fallen for me but didn’t dare cross that line? So they held it in, and after I died, their mental worlds collapsed, leading them to regret and despair, eventually choosing Xia Xuechun as a substitute?\"","The system raised its voice, dripping with sarcasm: \"Oh, so you’re saying you’re their white moonlight, huh?~\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face turned red: \"I wouldn’t go that far, but I think my personality could easily make me a red rose.\"","The system: \"...Host, stop being so shameless. You wore sexy pajamas and crawled into their beds, and they kicked both you and the blankets out. If they liked you, they wouldn’t have been able to resist.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...So they were driven to darkness because of me.\"","The system: \"I think so. Although I don’t fully understand human emotions, I imagine when you sprang out of Pei Youchuan’s closet like a jack-in-the-box, scaring him so badly he had nightmares for days, even you wouldn’t like yourself if you were in his shoes, right?\"","She instantly dismissed her doubts: \"That’s why you’re as sharp as a devil, always seeing what I can’t.\"","The system laughed heartily: \"Anyway, I believe your brothers were driven to darkness because of your antics, not because they secretly loved you in some twisted, unspoken way. Don’t overthink it, just go back!~\"","Qiao Chuchu’s body swayed, and a wave of exhaustion swept over her.","Or rather, the system shoved her back into her already exhausted body.","She couldn’t even open her eyes, her mind blank and devoid of thought.","She was so tired, like she’d worked hard all day only to realize it was all for nothing.","Qiao Chuchu tried to open her eyes or move a finger.","But her body was still in rest mode, unresponsive.","Someone walked over and took her hand.","It was definitely a man’s hand.","His warm, broad palm enveloped hers, gently massaging each finger, then tenderly caressing her cheek.","His hands carried the pleasant scent of hand soap.","Qiao Chuchu wanted to open her eyes to see who it was.","But she couldn’t.","Her brain felt like it had shut down, sluggish and unresponsive.","She vaguely sensed that this person’s actions were overly intimate, but at the same time, she was overwhelmed by the thought, \"Screw it, I just want to sleep!\"","Qiao Chuchu struggled for a moment, but her body gradually sank deeper, and she was on the verge of falling asleep.","Suddenly, someone kissed the corner of her mouth.","?","Who!","Who dared take advantage of her while she was asleep!","Qiao Chuchu tried to open her eyes, but her body was still pulling her consciousness downward.","She clearly felt the man’s lips brush her forehead, cheek, nose, and the corner of her mouth.","Finally, his breath lingered near her lips, as if he was about to kiss her.","Qiao Chuchu’s mind screamed internally!","This was her first kiss! Don’t touch her!","His breath grew heavier for a moment, and the warm kiss ultimately landed on the corner of her mouth.","\"I’ve missed you.\"","The man’s whisper was so soft it was impossible to recognize the voice: \"Get better soon, Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu mustered all her strength, but all she managed was a slight frown before her head tilted to the side, and she fell into a deep sleep.","When she woke up again, she groggily opened her eyes and looked around.","The VIP room’s sofa was filled with her family.","Pei Youchuan and Pei Fengnong were leaning back on the sofa, asleep, while Pei Mu and Pei Ci sat close together on the other side.","Pei Buxian was nodding off in a chair, clutching a pillow.","Pei Yuan sat in a chair by the bed, quietly leaning against the wall in sleep.","Pei Che was dozing off at the table in front of Qiao Chuchu, his head resting on his fist. Suddenly, his head slipped, and he woke with a start, instinctively tucking the blanket around her.","Qiao Chuchu croaked out: \"Second Brother.\"","Pei Che looked at her in confusion, then gradually realized: \"You’re awake?!\"","The men in the room all jolted awake, turning their attention to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu looked around: \"Why are... all of you here?\"","Pei Buxian’s eyes reddened with joy as he squeezed past his brothers and knelt by her bed: \"You’ve been unconscious for a whole day. Ever since you saved Lin Qing, you’ve been asleep. It’s already the second day. I was so worried about you, so I stayed here waiting for you to wake up.\"","Pei Youchuan stood behind him, hands in his pockets, grumbling: \"Pei Buxian, don’t act like you’re the only one who cares about Qiao Chuchu. Are the rest of us dead or something?\"","Pei Buxian cheerfully grabbed Qiao Chuchu’s hand: \"You can pretend they’re all dead. I’m the only one alive!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan grabbed Pei Buxian and tossed him onto the sofa!","Pei Fengnong took the opportunity to step forward: \"How are you feeling?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt dizzy and groggy, but it was clearly from oversleeping, and the discomfort was gradually easing: \"I’m fine... just really tired.\"","【It’s just the side effects of using so many talents. It’s nothing serious.】","【But—】","She looked at her seven brothers: \"Have you all been here the whole time?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci answered in unison: \"We came as soon as we finished work and haven’t left since.\"","Her gaze was unfocused as she gently touched the corner of her mouth: \"Did any other man come in?\"","Pei Che frowned: \"Of course not. We’ve all been here the whole time, guarding you.\"","She nodded: 【Then it must have been a dream. I thought someone held my hand, kissed me several times, and said they missed me.】","Pei Che: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","They exchanged glances, then silently walked out of the room and into an empty one.","The moment the door closed, Pei Buxian exploded: \"We took turns keeping watch. Except for Pei Mu and Pei Ci, who were together, everyone had their own time slot. Who kissed Qiao Chuchu during their turn?!\""]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Pei Fengnong: Why Wasn't I Notified About This Year's Uniform Diamond Ring Distribution","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian, seething with anger, was the first to point the finger at Pei Mu and Pei Ci: \"Is it you two? You twisted twins!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci widened their eyes in disbelief, retorting in unison: \"You’re calling us twisted when you’re the one who’s twisted? Sounds like the pot calling the kettle black!\"","\"If it were me, I wouldn’t say a word!\" Pei Buxian turned to his brothers: \"Who was it? Confess now!\"","The men exchanged wary glances.","Pei Youchuan crossed his arms, unable to hide his irritation: \"It definitely wasn’t me!\"","Pei Fengnong declared with an air of righteousness: \"Not me either.\"","Pei Che shot a sharp look at Pei Yuan: \"It wasn’t me.\"","All eyes turned to the eldest brother, Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan scoffed dismissively.","He turned and walked into the restroom in the lounge: \"Even Qiao Chuchu herself can’t tell if it was a dream or reality, yet you’re all taking it so seriously.\"","He squeezed a generous amount of hand soap into his palm and meticulously scrubbed his fingers: \"It seems none of you have any brains.\"","Pei Buxian was stunned, starting to doubt himself: \"So it was just a dream Qiao Chuchu had?\"","\"Of course it was a dream,\" Pei Yuan dried his hands and leaned against the sink: \"If it wasn’t any of you, who else could it be? Me?\"","His expression was calm as still water: \"I’m the head of the Pei family. Are you all seriously going to suspect me?\"","Pei Buxian faltered, frowning and muttering: \"Well, I wouldn’t suspect you, big brother...\"","The other brothers exchanged glances.","They wouldn’t suspect their eldest brother either.","Pei Yuan smiled with satisfaction, walking up to Pei Buxian and patting his shoulder: \"You need to work on that temper of yours. You’re in your twenties and still acting like a child, flying off the handle at the slightest thing and even crying. Look at your brothers—none of them are as quick to anger as you. Use your brain when something happens.\"","Pei Buxian hugged his plush toy, looking like a scolded cat, his entire demeanor deflated: \"Fine.\"","Pei Yuan smirked and walked past his brothers.","Second brother Pei Che glanced at his retreating figure, his deep eyes swirling with complex thoughts: \"Big brother, where did Qiao Chuchu’s pink diamond go?\"","Pei Yuan paused, turning back calmly: \"I’ve put it away for safekeeping.\"","Pei Che’s expression instantly darkened as he stepped forward to confront him: \"That was my New Year’s gift to her. What do you mean you’ve ‘put it away’?\"","\"Can’t I?\" Pei Yuan blinked in confusion, asking earnestly: \"Qiao Chuchu has always been careless and forgetful. You worked hard for that money. What if she lost a pink diamond worth over a hundred million? Wouldn’t that upset you?\"","Pei Che’s lips curled into a sinister smile: \"But I heard you bought a four-billion-yuan pink diamond ring. Are you planning to give it to Qiao Chuchu?\"","Pei Yuan’s face darkened.","Pei Che sneered: \"Are you trying to compete with me, big brother? Is this some kind of rivalry?\"","\"Why would you use the word ‘compete’?\" Pei Yuan raised an eyebrow, looking baffled: \"We’re family. Qiao Chuchu is our sister whom we raised together. The gifts we give her are just to make her happy. There’s no ulterior motive.\"","Pei Che’s smile faded: \"Then why did you hide my ring?\"","\"I told you, I’m keeping it safe for you,\" Pei Yuan’s tone turned icy: \"I have no hidden agenda.\"","\"Right, the more someone insists they’re innocent, the more guilty they are,\" Pei Che extended his hand, his expression mocking: \"Give me back my ring.\"","Pei Yuan: \"I’ve had my assistant put it in my safe.\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","Pei Yuan smirked confidently: \"If you know the code to my safe, feel free to go get it, second brother.\"","Pei Che’s face turned ashen: \"Pei Yuan!!\"","Pei Yuan chuckled and walked away.","Pei Che was fuming, his breathing ragged: \"You’d better keep an eye on that new ring of yours! I might just lock it in my safe too!\"","Pei Yuan waved dismissively without looking back.","Pei Che clenched his fists, seething with anger.","The other brothers looked on in confusion.","Pei Buxian hugged his plush toy: \"I think I smell gunpowder in the air.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nodded dumbly: \"Agreed.\"","Pei Fengnong looked puzzled: \"Don’t we always give New Year’s gifts together? Why didn’t anyone say we were all giving rings this year?\"","Pei Youchuan’s face was a picture of confusion: \"? Fourth brother, is it possible that the rings weren’t a group gift but had a special meaning?\"","Pei Fengnong was clueless: \"Isn’t it just jewelry? What special meaning could it have?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...It’s a diamond ring. Do you know what it means to give someone a diamond ring?\"","Pei Fengnong: \"Yeah, it means Qiao Chuchu has another ring.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Huh?\"","Pei Mu: \"Huh??\"","Pei Ci: \"Huh???\"","Pei Buxian: \"Huh???\"","Pei Fengnong said earnestly: \"Qiao Chuchu doesn’t look good in jade, she only suits jewelry. Since we’re buying her something, it has to be a rare diamond. After all, if we’re giving her something, it should be the best, right?\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong continued sincerely: \"So we’ve decided to buy diamond rings this year, right?\"","Pei Youchuan sighed in exasperation, covering his eyes with his hand, looking as if he were in pain: \"Yes, buy diamond rings. Let’s all buy diamond rings.\"","He patted Pei Fengnong’s shoulder: \"As long as the eight of us have a good New Year, that’s all that matters.\"","With that, he walked away, still covering his eyes.","Pei Fengnong stood there, baffled.","Pei Buxian solemnly shoved his plush toy into Pei Fengnong’s arms: \"Fourth brother, you need this more than I do.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci patted his shoulder, speaking in unison: \"Fourth brother, next time big brother and second brother argue, stay out of it. I’m afraid you’ll just make things worse.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","Why did he feel like they were treating him like an idiot?","He walked out of the lounge, only to find all six brothers peeking through the small window of Qiao Chuchu’s hospital room.","Each of them was sneaking glances inside.","He walked up, still holding the plush toy: \"Is Qiao Chuchu changing clothes in there?\"","Pei Youchuan shot him a look of disdain: \"Are you crazy? If Qiao Chuchu were changing clothes, would we be peeking in? Of course there’s someone in there!\"","Pei Fengnong was startled. He squeezed past his brothers and pressed his face to the glass, looking inside.","Lin Shen, dressed in a black cashmere coat with a tailored suit underneath, clearly dressed to impress, was sitting by Qiao Chuchu’s bedside, his hands resting on his knees as he looked at her with concern: \"How are you feeling?\"","Qiao Chuchu leaned against the headboard, smiling shyly: \"I’m fine.\"","[Ugh, why does Lin Shen always show up when I’m not wearing makeup? At least let me brush my hair and put on some lipstick. Last time it was cake all over my face, and now I’m sick. I must look so haggard.]","Lin Shen was momentarily taken aback.","Qiao Chuchu did look quite pale.","Her reddish-brown hair was loosely tied into a side braid, and she was wearing a light blue hospital gown. Her fair complexion had a faint grayish tint, and even her lips were pale.","Yet, even so, she had a fragile kind of beauty.","Like snow trembling on a red plum blossom.","He smiled slowly: \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ve noticed that you’re beautiful in every moment. Even when you’re sick, you’re still a beauty.\""]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: If You Are Cheap, I Will Be Even Cheaper","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, feeling both flattered and surprised. \"Am I now the legendary delicate beauty?\" she wondered aloud.","Lin Shen took a moment to process her words, then nodded. \"Yes, you are.\"","A squeal escaped her throat, as if a chicken had taken up residence there. Her pale complexion instantly brightened. \"Oh, stop it! You're exaggerating!~\"","Outside the door, Pei Youchuan narrowed his eyes with a fierce glare. \"I took Qiao Chuchu on a luxury cruise for three days. Everyone else was dressed to the nines, with meticulous makeup and outfits. She wore baggy floral pants and a mismatched top, her hair pinned up with a pencil. She seemed utterly indifferent when she was with me, but the moment Lin Qing showed up, she started caring about her appearance.\"","Pei Fengnong spoke with a calm demeanor. \"But I think she looks quite good without makeup. For her, makeup is just the icing on the cake.\"","Pei Youchuan rolled his eyes hard. \"You don't get it. People always dress up for the ones they like. She used to wear short skirts every time she saw me, looking all dolled up. Now she just doesn’t care about me anymore!\"","Pei Ci smirked. \"Third Brother, isn’t that a good thing? Before, Qiao Chuchu was all over you, and you didn’t like it—it even gave you nightmares. Now that she’s not clinging to you, you’re unhappy?\"","Pei Youchuan shot back, \"What? No, I—\" He turned and found himself face-to-face with the amused expressions of his six brothers.","His face turned bright red, and he stammered, \"Of course, I don’t care! Whether she wears makeup or not doesn’t affect me. I’m not shallow!\"","Pei Ci chuckled. \"I think you’re just being stubborn. Qiao Chuchu doesn’t care about you anymore, and now you’re worried. You’re afraid she’ll slip away, and you won’t be able to win her back. You’re scared~\"","Pei Youchuan’s face turned as red as a tomato. He pointed outside and snapped, \"If you’re not being stubborn, then get out of here right now! Stop eavesdropping!\"","Pei Ci’s smile faltered, but he straightened up with confidence. \"The apple doesn’t fall far from the tree. If you’re stubborn, then I must be too. After all, you’re my older brother.\"","Pei Youchuan was speechless. \"????\"","Pei Buxian whispered in a low voice, \"You’re all so noisy.\" He had somehow squeezed to the front of the group and was glaring at the figures inside the room. \"I can’t hear what they’re saying anymore. Shut up!\"","The hallway fell silent.","The seven brothers continued to eavesdrop intently.","Lou Yuejue stood dumbfounded at the other end of the hallway, watching his brothers with their ears perked up. \"This is so bizarre,\" he said, turning to Lou Tingsi. \"Dad, is this what growing up is supposed to be like?\"","Lou Tingsi, holding a bouquet of flowers, couldn’t help but smile. \"This is what growing up looks like for the Pei family.\"","Inside the hospital room, Qiao Chuchu was nervously picking at her hands, unaware of Pei Buxian’s intense gaze from outside.","[This is so awkward. Every time I’m alone with Lin Shen, it feels awkward, especially after he confessed his feelings. It’s even more awkward now.]","[But he doesn’t know I used to like him, so he’s not awkward, and I shouldn’t be either.]","She took a deep breath and broke the silence. \"How’s Lin Qing doing?\"","At the mention of this, Lin Shen’s eyes momentarily darkened, but the shadow quickly disappeared. \"She’s still shaken, but I believe she’ll recover soon. My father denies any intention to harm her, and Lin Qing is figuring out how to handle the situation. She’s also preparing a gift for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu pointed to herself in surprise. \"A gift for me?\"","Lin Shen nodded, his tone as gentle as a spring breeze. \"You saved her life. We don’t know how to properly thank you, so she’s working on something special.\"","He placed his hand over Qiao Chuchu’s, his voice sincere. \"Thank you for saving my sister. If there’s ever a day when we need to save you, we won’t hesitate.\"","Lin Shen’s deep eyes enveloped her. \"For such a great kindness, all we can offer is our genuine hearts in return.\"","A warm feeling spread through Qiao Chuchu’s body, and she couldn’t help but smile. \"I’m honored to be friends with you.\"","Lin Shen’s smile deepened as he gently patted her head, his gaze lingering. \"But I don’t just want to be your friend.\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled. \"?\"","Pei Buxian, who was pressed against the window, was equally confused. \"What kind of nonsense is this oily guy spouting?!\" He shot a reproachful look at Pei Youchuan. \"What are you waiting for? Take off your sock and throw it at his face!\"","Pei Youchuan was baffled. \"Why me?!\"","Inside the room, Lin Shen pulled out a box of plump green grapes, his voice tinged with nervousness. \"These are grapes I had air-shipped. They were picked this morning and flown here. They’re very sweet, incredibly sweet.\"","He handed them to her with both hands. \"I know you love grapes, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly accepted them. \"Thank you, but I don’t eat grapes anymore.\"","Lin Shen’s eager expression froze. \"Why?\"","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly touched her face. \"I overate them one year and got sick, so I don’t like them anymore.\"","[It’s mainly because when Lin Shen left without a word back then, I was so disgusted with myself that I wanted to die. I ended up binge-eating all the things I used to love.]","[I ate three bunches of grapes in one day, and that night I got acute gastritis. Ever since then, I can’t stand the sight of green grapes.]","Lin Shen was stunned and quickly withdrew his hand. \"I’m sorry. I didn’t know you didn’t like them anymore.\"","He hastily picked up a brand-new Apple iPad. \"Here, take this.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. \"What is this?\"","\"It’s an iPad,\" Lin Shen said, looking at her expectantly. \"It’s the latest model, the 2022 Pro. I even got you the stylus. I don’t know what model you’re using now or how long you’ve had it, but I thought this would be a safe choice.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s mouth hung open, speechless.","[This is so awkward!]","[I have to reject him again!]","[I just bought a new iPad a couple of days ago, exactly like this one. What am I supposed to do now?!]","Lin Shen’s hopeful expression crumbled as he held the iPad, looking like a sad seal pup unable to give away its treasure. \"You don’t need the iPad either? Do you already have a new one?\"","The chicken in Qiao Chuchu’s throat seemed to have died, as she let out an awkward hum. \"Uh...\"","[Yes, because I decided to stay in this world, and my old iPad was starting to lag. I replaced it so I wouldn’t fall behind on work.]","[Who would’ve thought Lin Shen would give me one too?!]","She smiled apologetically. \"Why don’t you keep it for yourself? You draw, don’t you?\"","Lin Shen frowned, his eyes quickly clouding with sadness as he took back the gift. \"I don’t draw on iPads.\"","Then, as if remembering something, he shook his head. \"But don’t feel bad. It’s my fault for not knowing you well enough. I’ll think of something else to give you.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt uneasy. \"Really, you don’t have to.\"","\"No, I must. I must.\" Lin Shen hugged the iPad, repeating numbly, \"I must.\"","Outside in the hallway, Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow with a mischievous smile. \"Pei Buxian, it looks like you don’t need to make your third brother take off his sock. Qiao Chuchu rejected both of Lin Shen’s carefully prepared gifts—the fresh grapes and the work iPad. His face looks like he’s been struck by lightning.\"","Pei Buxian nodded, wiping away imaginary tears from the corner of his eye, his lips twitching into a smile. \"Yeah, it’s really tragic. How could this happen?\"","Lou Yuejue glanced at him sideways. \"...Are you smiling right now?\"","Pei Buxian tilted his head back, suppressing a laugh. \"No, I’m just putting on a brave face.\""]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Did Qiao Chuchu manage to appease Lin Shen","paragraphs":["In the hospital room, Qiao Chuchu noticed Lin Shen's troubled expression and quickly tried to reassure him: \"But aside from me, everyone in my family loves grapes. Don’t worry, they won’t go to waste, especially my second brother—he’s particularly fond of sweet fruits.\"","Lin Shen wasn’t comforted: \"It’s not about whether they’ll be wasted or not.\"","His long, curled lashes drooped listlessly as he forced a bitter smile: \"Three years ago, I was the person who knew you best in the world. But now, I don’t even know what your favorite food is.\"","Chuchu was momentarily stunned, then hurriedly replied, \"That’s not your fault, senior—\"","\"It is my fault,\" Lin Shen interrupted, raising his head. His beautiful eyes were bloodshot, filled with regret: \"I had a chance to win you over. If I had just taken one more step, we might have been together!\"","Qiao Chuchu had liked him once!","They had secretly harbored feelings for each other!","Lin Shen’s voice was thick with frustration: \"If I had just held on a little longer, just a little—I—\"","He suddenly stopped speaking.","Because Qiao Chuchu was holding the box of green grapes, looking at him with surprise.","Her gaze was filled with shock and unfamiliarity, as if she was staring at someone she couldn’t understand.","Lin Shen met her eyes and felt as though he’d been doused with cold water, instantly calming down.","He swallowed his resentment: \"I’m sorry.\"","He turned his head away, choking back tears: \"I’m really sorry.\"","Sorry for making her sad.","Sorry for making her endure a year of hardship before she could move on.","Sorry for not giving her a chance to explain.","He knew how lonely Qiao Chuchu had been, how her friends had disliked and avoided her, how she had no one to confide in, yet he had still chosen to leave without a word.","Overwhelming guilt consumed Lin Shen.","Trembling, he reached out and grasped Qiao Chuchu’s wrist, his tone both pleading and humble: \"I’ll buy you better gifts.\"","He hung his head low, trying to suppress his sobs: \"Please don’t reject me.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, her heart aching as she placed her hand over his: \"I’m sorry, Lin Shen, but I can’t return your feelings. I really don’t like you that way.\"","Lin Shen wasn’t surprised. He kept his head down, silently shedding tears.","Qiao Chuchu smiled softly, tentatively suggesting: \"But since we’re friends now, friends should share their preferences, right? I don’t like green grapes anymore; I prefer strawberries. What about you?\"","Lin Shen was taken aback, lifting his gaze to meet hers.","His handsome face bore the traces of recent tears, a large droplet slipping from his eye and dampening his perfectly pressed suit collar.","His slightly swollen lips parted gently: \"I... like cherries.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up: \"You’re still the same as you were three years ago!\"","Lin Shen nodded earnestly: \"Yeah, I’m a bit of a creature of habit. When I like something, I tend to stick with it. It’s hard for me to change.\"","She chuckled: \"Actually, you don’t need to buy me anything. Your paintings are worth a fortune! How about you paint me something instead?~\"","Lin Shen blinked: \"Paint?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded eagerly: \"How about a painting of me holding a tablet? In oil! I’ll treasure it forever!\"","Lin Shen was momentarily stunned, then replied without thinking: \"I’ve already painted you many times...\"","He had been painting her for the past three years.","But he had never thought to give her any of the pieces.","Qiao Chuchu was overjoyed, playfully hitting his shoulder: \"Why didn’t you show them to me, you big artist? Your paintings are worth millions!~ Once I’m out of the hospital, I’m coming to your studio to pick one. I’ll take whichever one I like best, okay?~\"","The sadness in Lin Shen’s puppy-like eyes was instantly replaced by sparkles: \"Sure!\"","He couldn’t help but smile: \"As long as you don’t mind!\"","Qiao Chuchu was thrilled: \"Why would I mind?~ I’ve always admired your work. I’ve been to so many of your exhibitions over the years!\"","[Though I always went secretly. Even if our relationship wasn’t great, art is innocent, and I’ll always admire Lin Shen’s talent and skill!]","Lin Shen blushed, lowering his head in embarrassment, his mood already shifting from gloom to sunshine.","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","Pei Che: \"...\"","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Lou Tingsi: \"? Did Qiao Chuchu just cheer Lin Shen up?\"","Lou Yuejue nodded: \"He’s so happy his smile’s reaching his ears. He’s not crying anymore.\"","Pei Buxian hissed impatiently: \"Pei Youchuan, what are you waiting for? Take off your shoes and unleash the toxic gas already!\"","Pei Youchuan snapped: \"I told you I’m wearing odorless socks! How long are you going to keep this joke going?!\"","Pei Yuan’s expression darkened as he pushed his brothers aside: \"Enough wasting time!\"","He pushed the door open and strode in!","Pei Buxian slipped and fell with a thud: \"Ouch!\"","Lou Yuejue lost his balance and tumbled onto Pei Buxian: \"Ah!\"","Lou Tingsi tried to grab his son but ended up being dragged down too!","The others fell like dominoes, piling up at the entrance like a human pyramid.","Only Pei Yuan and Pei Che remained standing.","The group awkwardly turned their gaze toward Qiao Chuchu.","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What are you all doing?\"","Pei Buxian smirked, propping his chin up as he lay on the floor: \"It’s too hot. We’re cooling off on the ground.\"","The others nodded solemnly.","Qiao Chuchu was silent.","She glanced out the window at the heavy snowfall.","\"You call this hot?\"","Just as the awkwardness reached its peak, Weisheng Yucan made her entrance, dressed in a cheongsam: \"Well, well, what’s going on here?\"","She wore a luxurious fur shawl, her curly hair cascading lazily over her shoulders. She looked at the men on the floor with a teasing smile: \"A bunch of handsome men lying around, waiting for Qiao Chuchu to pick one?\"","The men scrambled to their feet.","Qiao Chuchu beamed: \"Yucan? What brings you here?!\"","Weisheng Yucan smiled at her: \"Good morning, Qiao Chuchu. I heard you’d been kidnapped, so I came to check on you. I thought I’d bring some tonics to help you recover, but it seems I needn’t have bothered.\"","She glanced around the crowded room with amusement: \"With so many handsome men around, who needs bird’s nest? Just a taste of them would do wonders for your skin.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[I think she’s making a dirty joke, but I can’t prove it.]","Weisheng Yucan chuckled, striding over to Qiao Chuchu’s bedside in her ten-centimeter heels and handing her an invitation: \"It’s my fourth brother’s birthday the day after tomorrow. I’m here to personally invite you to be a guest of honor at the Wei Sheng Clan’s celebration. No need to bring a gift—just come as you are.\"","She then casually scanned the room: \"Bring all these handsome men along too. They can serve you tea and water, give my shallow friends something to gawk at.\"","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly smiled, accepting the invitation with both hands. She looked at the photo of the man on the card.","He looked almost identical to Weisheng Yucan, but colder, sharper.","Dressed in a black Tang suit with knotted buttons, he held a string of Buddhist prayer beads, his icy eyes exuding a murderous aura that clashed with the serenity of the beads.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Just when I think I can catch a break, new characters and events always pop up.]","Weisheng Biehe stood silently at the door, arms crossed, eyeing Qiao Chuchu.","The photo had been carefully chosen.","He wanted to make a strong first impression!","Weisheng Yucan glanced at her brother and asked with a smile: \"So, what do you think? My fourth brother’s quite handsome, isn’t he? Does he meet your standards?\"","Weisheng Biehe lifted his chin, confidently awaiting praise.","Qiao Chuchu nodded sincerely: \"Of course he’s handsome! He’s your brother, after all. His features are so similar to yours!\"","[He’s just a bit of an idiot—the only one in the Wei Sheng Family without a brain. A hopeless romantic who didn’t inherit any of Yucan’s smarts. A total fool.]","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\""]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: First Encounter with the Tiny Life of the Parting Crane","paragraphs":["Weisheng Biehe stood outside the hospital room, staring intently at her.","How dare she call him a complete idiot?","He was about to stride over when Yu Can walked up beside him, gently restraining his impulsive movements, and waved to everyone with a smile.","“Alright, it’s settled then. The manor will open at 6 PM the day after tomorrow, and the event will officially start at 7. Everyone, including Lin Shen and Lin Qing, should arrive around 6 so we can chat a bit beforehand. After the event, there will be an afterparty at a nightclub to help us bond.”","No one refused, and they all bid farewell to the Wei Sheng Clan with smiles.","Qiao Chuchu, after saying her goodbyes, lowered her head to look at the invitation, completely missing the displeased look in Weisheng Biehe’s eyes.","Weisheng Biehe walked out of the hospital ward, irritably shaking off Yu Can’s hand, his tone icy. “Since the day I was born, no one has ever called me an idiot.”","“That’s because you can’t hear what people are thinking. With your personality, how do you know no one’s cursing you behind your back?” Yu Can teased. “Qiao Chuchu’s words were actually quite polite. Who told you to be such a hopeless romantic?”","Biehe remained unmoved, his expression as cold as a winter storm, his voice firm. “I, Weisheng Biehe, am definitely not a hopeless romantic.”","Yu Can smiled meaningfully. “Oh, of course not.”","Weisheng Biehe: “...”","In his world, love was the most fragile thing.","His third sister had been married five times, each time to powerful figures who were neither above nor below their family’s status.","Yet, all five husbands had tried to kill her in staged accidents, only to be outsmarted and killed by her using the very schemes they had devised.","When she dated a bodyguard for fun, the man had tried to blackmail her with intimate videos, demanding a hundred million.","They spoke of love, but their hearts were full of schemes.","What a vile emotion.","Falling in love was a foolish thing, and he would never do it.","After all, he couldn’t cut open someone’s heart to see if their feelings were genuine.","So, when Qiao Chuchu said those words, she was clearly looking down on him!","Yu Can, noticing Weisheng Biehe’s dark expression, smirked. “Don’t worry, you’ll have a chance to prove yourself. At the banquet, I’ll make sure you have some alone time with Qiao Chuchu. Oh, and I’ve also arranged for Xia Xuechun to be there, to trigger your storyline.”","Weisheng Biehe’s mood grew heavier. “Sister, don’t worry. I’ll handle this perfectly.”","Yu Can didn’t respond, her eyes glinting with curiosity. “Oh, by the way, what’s your favorite color again?”","Weisheng Biehe: “? Black. Why are you asking?”","Yu Can picked up her phone and sent a message with a sly smile. “No reason. Life’s too boring. I like stirring up drama and adding fuel to the fire.”","Weisheng Biehe frowned, watching her silently.","He suspected his sister was playing a trick on him.","But he had no proof.","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu received a message from Yu Can: «Remember to wear a black evening gown!~»","-","A day later, on the day of the banquet.","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the car and onto the red carpet, shivering as the cold wind hit her. She quickly adjusted her dress and walked into the manor.","The birthday celebration was being held at the Wei Sheng Family estate.","Some of the guests were familiar faces, while others were foreigners, a clear indication that everyone invited to Weisheng Biehe’s birthday was either wealthy or influential.","She took a deep breath, feeling a bit nervous.","She was the only one representing the Pei Family.","Lin Shen, Lin Qing, Lou Tingsi, and Lou Yuejue hadn’t arrived yet. For some reason, it seemed like they had all coincidentally encountered important business partners right before leaving, forcing them to be an hour late.","She even wondered if those business partners had been sent to delay them on purpose.","Qiao Chuchu lifted her skirt and climbed the steps into the manor.","Yu Can stood by the floor-to-ceiling window, watching Qiao Chuchu with a smile.","She had come alone.","Perfect.","It seemed the people she had asked had done their job well.","Yu Can glanced toward the side entrance.","Xia Xuechun, flustered, parked her electric scooter and rushed in through the side door with Qi Xiaojia, frantically adjusting her clothes. “We’re late, we’re late!”","Yu Can’s gentle smile turned mocking.","Biehe, holding a string of prayer beads, walked up behind her, his voice cold. “Are they all here?”","Yu Can tilted her chin, signaling him to look. “Your ‘white moonlight’ has arrived.”","Weisheng Biehe’s expression cracked the moment he saw Xia Xuechun. “This is her?”","He looked as if he had been struck by lightning, his voice eerily calm. “This is the woman I supposedly loved with all my heart?”","Yu Can lazily sat on the sofa. “Don’t ask me. Go talk to Qiao Chuchu. She knows how you fell for Xia Xuechun.”","Weisheng Biehe turned to leave.","Yu Can called after him. “Wait.”","Biehe turned back, frowning.","Yu Can, dressed in a high-slit emerald green gown, crossed her legs and spoke leisurely. “She’s timid. Be gentle.”","Weisheng Biehe snorted, his phoenix eyes filled with mockery. “I don’t know the meaning of ‘gentle.’”","He strode out of the room and headed to the banquet hall on the first floor.","Xia Xuechun and Qi Xiaojia, having just changed into their server uniforms, were about to enter the banquet hall when they suddenly stopped in their tracks upon seeing Weisheng Biehe.","Weisheng Biehe stood gracefully on the stairs, dressed in a perfectly tailored suit, his wolf-tail hair falling naturally over his shoulders.","He had sharp eyebrows, fox-like eyes that exuded charm, and a faint beauty mark under the left corner of his mouth.","He was a complex mix of beauty and severity.","Xia Xuechun and Qi Xiaojia were mesmerized.","Weisheng Biehe lazily glanced at them, his gaze settling on Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun froze, suddenly nervous.","Weisheng Biehe spoke indifferently. “Xia Xuechun, right?”","Xia Xuechun: “!”","Such a cold man, yet his voice was a deep, resonant baritone!","She nodded. “Yes, sir. I’m Xia Xuechun.”","Weisheng Biehe let out a faint snort but said nothing more, stepping into the banquet hall.","Xia Xuechun stared blankly at his retreating figure.","Qi Xiaojia whispered excitedly, “Oh my god, Xuexue! Do you know who that is? That’s Weisheng Biehe, the fourth son of the Wei Sheng Clan! They say he’s a cold, ascetic monk who’s never had a girlfriend at 26, completely indifferent to women. He’s even taken a vow of celibacy! But he knows your name!~”","Xia Xuechun felt a strange, bubbling joy rise in her heart. “What do you think that means?”","“It means he’s noticed you!” Qi Xiaojia was practically bouncing. “What if he likes you? If he does, you’ll be climbing the social ladder in no time!”","Xia Xuechun blushed, shyly saying, “Don’t talk nonsense. Someone as amazing as him would never be interested in someone like me.”","But her eyes sparkled as she scanned the banquet hall, trying to catch another glimpse of Weisheng Biehe.","She wasn’t the only one looking for him.","A man wearing lip gloss glanced around and spotted Weisheng Biehe entering. “OMG! There he is! Weisheng Biehe, my idol!!”","The moment Weisheng Biehe entered the hall, he was surrounded by a crowd.","At 6’2”, he towered over the Mediterranean CEOs, his expression indifferent as he nodded occasionally in response to their flattery.","The man with lip gloss watched him, breathless. “Oh my god, I love his aloof, unapproachable vibe!”","He turned to his friend eagerly. “You put my note on Biehe’s table, right?”","His friend gave him a disgusted look. “I did. What you wrote was so cringy, it made me want to vomit.”","The man shrugged. “It’s how I express my passionate love for him. Besides, I only wrote the initial ‘Q.’ He won’t know who it’s from!”","His friend frowned. “Didn’t I tell you not to leave any clues? What if someone else’s name starts with ‘Q’? They’ll get blamed for it!”","The man paused. “I don’t think so. Besides me, who else here has a last name starting with ‘Q’?”","His friend rolled her eyes. “There are more names starting with ‘Q’ than just yours!”","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu, holding a champagne glass, wandered aimlessly around the venue.","Although there were familiar faces around, her relationships with them were merely casual acquaintances, so she was genuinely bored.","As she passed by a table, Qiao Chuchu accidentally knocked over a small, neatly folded piece of paper.","She quickly picked it up and placed it back where it belonged.","Weisheng Biehe's gaze swept across the room, eventually landing on Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu placed something on his table and then turned to leave.","Weisheng Biehe narrowed his eyes and raised a hand to signal those around him to be silent.","\"My apologies, I have something to attend to. Let's continue this later.\"","The executives fell silent, smiling as they made way for him.","Weisheng Biehe, twirling his prayer beads, walked straight to his table and picked up the note.","Did Qiao Chuchu really leave him a note?","The corners of his lips hinted at a smile.","This was rather intriguing."]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Qiao Chuchu Sent Me an Adult-Oriented Sensual Love Letter.","paragraphs":["The man in the distance saw Weisheng Biehe's movement and let out a low scream, \"Ah! He's opening the love note I left!\"","His best friend muttered, \"...I hope he doesn't get disgusted and throw up.\"","Weisheng Biehe glanced around to ensure no one was watching, then gently unfolded the note. A rainbow of colorful words appeared before his eyes—","\"Biehe, I love you. I love your cold, piercing eyes, your fingers as they twirl the prayer beads, your strong body beneath that suit, your perfect butt, and those long legs!\"","\"I want to kiss you—your mole at the corner of your mouth, the Adam's apple on your neck. I want to passionately make out with you in the bathroom, to see your cold eyes turn red with desire because of me, to hear you gasp my name, to make you love me so much it drives you crazy!\"","\"You won’t know who I am, but please know that I love you. I’ve always loved you! I’ll love you for ten thousand years!!!\"","\"Love, Q [Heart][Heart]\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"...?\"","His best friend, observing him, went pale: \"Oh no, he’s frozen. I bet Weisheng Biehe is already racking his brain, trying to figure out who this disgusting Q is.\"","Weisheng Biehe tucked the note into his pocket and started walking in a specific direction.","His best friend was stunned: \"Where is he going?!\"","The man bit his lower lip, starting to worry: \"No way, he doesn’t actually think it’s from another Q, does he? What do I do now?\"","The best friend began to panic: \"Let’s follow him and see if we can salvage this mess.\"","They trailed Weisheng Biehe as he walked straight to Qiao Chuchu, seemingly intending to speak directly to her. But after hesitating for a moment, he picked up a glass of champagne and pretended to sip casually.","The man looked at Qiao Chuchu’s profile: \"Who’s that? Does her name have a Q in it?\"","The best friend turned pale, her hand trembling as she covered her mouth: \"Oh no... Qiao...\"","The man: \"? Qiao?\"","The best friend’s face changed dramatically, and she slapped his arm hard: \"Qiao Chuchu! The eighth daughter of the Pei Family, the beloved Qiao Chuchu!\"","The man’s face instantly turned green!","The best friend felt like crying: \"Why did you have to leave just the initial? Your last name is Qi, hers is Qiao—you’re both Q, that damn Q!!\"","She jumped up to hit him: \"You being shameless is one thing, but now you’ve dragged Qiao Chuchu into this!\"","The man pouted, feeling aggrieved: \"What do we do now? Should I just confess?\"","The best friend paused, suddenly calming down: \"Wouldn’t we both be blacklisted by the Wei Sheng Family? And if we offend both the Qiao and Wei Sheng Families, will our parents still get any benefits from them? Can they still do business with the Qiao Family? Our moms would kill us!\"","The man froze, locking eyes with his best friend.","Both fell silent.","Then, they linked arms.","In perfect sync, they turned and walked away.","Weisheng Biehe, after rubbing the note between his fingers for a long time, finally made a decision.","Even though Qiao Chuchu called him an idiot in her heart, she had sent him such an impassioned note.","He had to clarify things.","He spoke up: \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned around, her gaze first landing on his chest, noting his height, before looking up at his face.","Weisheng Biehe reached into his pocket: \"Is this note from you...\"","He looked up, meeting Qiao Chuchu’s gaze, and suddenly found himself speechless.","Qiao Chuchu was wearing a vintage haute couture gown from 1996, a black mermaid dress that hugged her figure perfectly, with lace trim that seemed to envelop her in a soft, misty aura.","Her usually loose, reddish-brown hair was tied up in a bun, with a few strands framing her forehead.","Her dewy eyes sparkled with curiosity as she looked at him without hesitation.","She looked like the morning mist in a temple—a natural, ethereal beauty.","Weisheng Biehe suddenly felt as though something had kicked his heart, and his voice disappeared along with it.","Qiao Chuchu, after a moment of confusion, raised her eyebrows in delight: \"Are you Weisheng Biehe?\"","Weisheng Biehe nervously twisted his prayer beads, his other hand secretly clenching the note, his tone calm: \"Yes, it’s me.\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled brightly: \"Happy birthday, Mr. Weisheng!\"","Weisheng Biehe’s heart fluttered, and he quickly lowered his eyes: \"Thank you.\"","Qiao Chuchu shyly touched her head: \"I sent a small gift. I hope you’ll like it. When you see it, please don’t be disappointed.\"","Weisheng Biehe stiffly replied: \"I won’t.\"","He turned to leave, feeling as though he was walking on clouds, his steps uneven.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Why does this Biehe guy seem a bit limpy? Does he have a bad foot? Is he lame?]","Weisheng Biehe suddenly walked steadily!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Guess he’s not lame, just had a numb foot.]","Weisheng Biehe returned to the second floor, pressing himself against the door, his hands furiously twisting his prayer beads.","He was practically grinding sparks out of them!","Weisheng Huailing walked out of the inner room in a black suit, his silver hair styled into a mature slicked-back look. He was surprised to see him: \"What are you doing here?\"","Biehe snapped back to reality, standing straight, a bit flustered: \"This is my house. Why can’t I be here?\"","Huailing tilted his head, glancing at his prayer beads: \"Did you kill someone?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Huailing gestured: \"Why else would you be twisting those beads like you’re trying to perform a funeral rite?\"","Biehe choked, quickly hiding the beads.","Huailing found it strange but wasn’t curious about his private life and walked past him.","Weisheng Biehe stopped him: \"What are you doing?\"","Weisheng Huailing said seriously: \"I’m going to find Qiao Chuchu. Isn’t she here?\"","Weisheng Biehe quickly gestured: \"She’s not here.\"","Huailing: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe decisively closed the door: \"I’ll let you know when she arrives.\"","With that, he walked out, took out a spare key, and locked the door.","Weisheng Huailing, watching the lock turn: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan walked out, adjusting his watch, and patted his brother’s shoulder: \"What’s going on?\"","Weisheng Huailing turned around, signing: \"Fourth brother locked the door.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"? Why did he lock it?\"","Weisheng Lin and Weisheng Yucan walked out of the inner room, their faces darkening at the sight.","Weisheng Lin, known for his temper, snapped: \"What’s his problem? It’s his birthday, and he’s locking his siblings upstairs?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan pulled out his phone: \"I’ll call someone to unlock it.\"","Weisheng Huailing stopped his phone: \"Don’t!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was puzzled.","Huailing said seriously: \"I think he killed someone. Otherwise, why would he be so nervous?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Weisheng Yucan’s eyes sparkled, and she chuckled softly.","The three brothers looked at her: \"What are you laughing at?\"","She laughed heartily, giving Huailing a meaningful look: \"Let’s listen to little fifth brother. It’s Biehe’s birthday today, so he’s the boss.\"","Weisheng Huailing nodded vigorously: \"Exactly!\"","Yucan smiled sweetly: \"Little fifth brother is so thoughtful~\"","Huailing smiled warmly: \"I always respect my family’s needs.\"","Yucan’s smile deepened, murmuring to herself: \"Yes, as long as you don’t regret it later.\""]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Please Use the Restroom Properly","paragraphs":["Weisheng Biehe stood in the restroom, repeatedly reading the note in his hand, his gaze lingering on the latter half.","——「I want to passionately kiss you in the restroom, to see your cool eyes turn red with desire for me, to hear you gasp my name, to make you love me so much it drives you mad!」","His ears gradually turned red, and he calmly tucked the note away before stepping out.","Qiao Chuchu happened to arrive at the women's restroom entrance and bumped into him.","Weisheng Biehe: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a slight nod.","Weisheng Biehe's face remained expressionless, but his mind drifted back to the note.","——「I want to passionately kiss you in the restroom!」","「Passionately kiss!」","「Kiss!」","「Kiss!」","His breath hitched, and he tightly crumpled the note into a ball, his voice low and demanding: \"What are you doing here?\"","The question caught Qiao Chuchu off guard.","She glanced up at the sign.","【This is the women's restroom in the banquet hall, not Weisheng Biehe's study, right?】","She felt awkward: \"I came to use the restroom.\"","【What kind of ridiculous question is that? Of course, I came to use the restroom. I can't possibly be here to eat, can I?】","Weisheng Biehe stiffened, taking a few steps back: \"Oh, to use the restroom.\"","He lowered his eyes, his expression calm, but his ears were so red they looked like they might bleed: \"That's good, then go ahead.\"","Qiao Chuchu found the whole exchange baffling: \"...Thank you.\"","Biehe replied stiffly: \"You're welcome.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【What kind of absurd conversation is this??】","She pushed the door open and saw a man with a very feminine appearance standing in front of the vanity, touching up his makeup, while a strikingly masculine woman stood beside him with a stern expression.","As she entered, both of them looked up at her simultaneously.","The man covered his mouth with both hands: \"Oh my!~\"","The woman jumped in surprise: \"Holy crap!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She slammed the door shut in an instant!","Weisheng Biehe, still standing outside the door: \"...Why did you come out?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked as if she had been struck by lightning, her face filled with shock: \"There's a man in there.\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"? A man?\"","He reached for the door to go in.","Qiao Chuchu quickly stopped him: \"Don't! There's also a woman in there!\"","Weisheng Biehe was even more shocked: \"? A man and a woman in the same restroom?\"","Qiao Chuchu was also a bit confused: \"Yes, but they're using the restroom properly, not in any inappropriate way, you know what I mean?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"...\"","His hand unconsciously rubbed the pocket where the note was tucked away.","Qiao Chuchu felt awkward: \"Maybe we should just leave to avoid making things more uncomfortable for everyone.\"","She turned to leave.","Suddenly, Biehe grabbed her hand: \"Let's go to my room.\"","She turned back, startled.","Weisheng Biehe's hand was icy cold, sending a shiver through her, and she instinctively tried to pull away.","But Biehe held on tightly, his tea-colored eyes filled with an unreadable emotion: \"My room has a private bathroom.\"","Qiao Chuchu was horrified and immediately refused: \"No!\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu yanked her hand back as if she had seen a ghost: \"No, no, no, no, no!\"","She even wiped her hand where he had touched her: \"I'll hold it in for a bit longer, thank you for your kindness! Goodbye!\"","【Why do I feel so creeped out?!】","【After all, this is the same fourth brother who tried to imprison Xia Xuechun, and doesn't he have a cleanliness obsession?! Why is he inviting me to his private bathroom?!】","【Is he planning to kill me?!】","【My brothers, where are you? I'm so scared being alone here!】","Weisheng Biehe stood frozen, watching Qiao Chuchu's panicked retreat, then pulled out the note again.","Why didn't Qiao Chuchu's reaction match what was written on the note?","Suddenly, a heated argument erupted from inside the women's restroom: \"Qiao Chuchu must have found out! She knows it was us who gave Weisheng Biehe the note!\"","The man wailed like a ghost: \"Ahhh! What do we do now?! Qiao Chuchu will kill us, and Weisheng Biehe will kill us too!\"","The woman snapped: \"Stop crying! Qi Chao, you're such an idiot!!\"","Weisheng Biehe's eyelid twitched as he re-examined the signature on the note.","Q.","Qiao.","Qi.","Suddenly, it all clicked, and he laughed bitterly.","So, he had been deluding himself all along?!","He nearly ground his teeth to dust, crumpled the note, and tossed it into the trash before pushing open the women's restroom door!","The two inside gasped when they saw him!","Weisheng Biehe's voice was filled with murderous intent: \"Get out!\"","The two: \"...\"","Biehe slammed the door shut and stormed into the banquet hall, searching for Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu, like a frightened cat, nervously scanned the room, only to lock eyes with him.","Her face turned pale!","【Oh no! The yandere is looking at me! I need to get out of here!!】","Biehe narrowed his eyes and strode toward her!","Just then, a melodious piano tune filled the hall.","Weisheng Biehe turned toward the sound.","Xia Xuechun, dressed in a server's uniform, was sitting at the piano, playing \"Dream Wedding.\"","Xia Xuechun's eyes were closed, her expression one of pure bliss, a faint smile on her lips.","Weisheng Biehe paused, watching Xia Xuechun lost in the music, his face filled with disbelief.","What happened to the pianist? How could they let a server play the piano? And so poorly at that!","But he had no time to dwell on it. He needed to catch Qiao Chuchu.","Just as he turned, he saw Qiao Chuchu walking toward him.","Qiao Chuchu was on the verge of tears.","【Damn it, I was trying to avoid this yandere, but why is Weisheng Biehe's storyline starting now?】","【I can't just ignore it. If even one person from the Weisheng family falls, Sister Yucan could be in danger.】","【Protecting my favorite is non-negotiable! Even if it means facing a yandere, I have to step up!】","【This is a crucial turning point. Because Xia Xuechun played the piano at Weisheng Biehe's birthday party, he developed feelings for her, gradually got to know her, and fell for her heart of gold.】","【He can't hear this piano piece. If I can prevent him from falling for Xia Xuechun, his fate will take a major turn!】","She steeled herself and walked up to Weisheng Biehe: \"Mr. Biehe.\"","The anger in Weisheng Biehe's eyes faded, replaced by a hint of amusement as he raised an eyebrow: \"Yes?\"","Qiao Chuchu struggled to find the right words, fidgeting awkwardly: \"Could I... use the staff restroom in your house? I don't know my way around.\"","Weisheng Biehe's eyes lit up, his tone playful: \"Of course.\"","He stepped aside: \"After you.\"","Qiao Chuchu forced herself to move forward, muttering under her breath: \"He's not going to kill me, right?\"","Weisheng Biehe paused, leaning down closer to her: \"How did you know I was going to kill you?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","His expression softened, a faint smile tugging at his lips: \"What should I do? If I'm going to kill you, will you still come?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","【Oh my god, this guy really is a psycho. I don't even know if I should believe his answer or not!】","She glanced at Xia Xuechun, clenched her teeth, and closed her eyes: \"I'll go!\"","【If I don't take the plunge, who will?!】","Biehe was stunned for a moment, then burst into laughter: \"Hahaha!\"","The sound was so unexpected that everyone turned to look at them in surprise.","Weisheng Biehe, known for his aloof demeanor, was now laughing so hard he could barely stand straight. Ignoring the shocked stares, he grabbed Qiao Chuchu's hand: \"Then let's go, Miss Qiao.\""]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Could Weisheng Biehe Have Fallen in Love with Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Everyone: \"...\"","They stared blankly at the two figures walking away, exchanging bewildered glances.","Why did Weisheng Biehe smile?","Isn't he usually too lazy to smile?","Why is he holding a girl's hand?","Isn't he supposed to be the aloof, ascetic monk?!","Qi Xiaojia was entranced listening to Xia Xuechun's piano performance when she suddenly noticed Weisheng Biehe was no longer there.","Her expression immediately darkened: \"Where did he go?\"","Xia Xuechun finished her piano piece, smiling as she looked up, expecting applause.","But the room was dead silent.","Everyone was chatting with champagne glasses in hand, not even glancing her way.","Only a couple of idle women gave her a once-over, whispering: \"What was that mess? The rhythm was all over the place, and she didn't even manage the crescendos. Why would the Weisheng family let a waitress play the piano?\"","\"Probably the pianist got a stomachache, and they had to find a last-minute replacement. I've never heard such a terrible performance in my life. Let's go somewhere else to cleanse our ears.\"","Xia Xuechun lowered her head, her cheeks burning with embarrassment, and awkwardly walked over to Qi Xiaojia after stepping away from the piano.","Qi Xiaojia pouted like an angry pufferfish: \"How can they talk like that? You played beautifully! Weisheng Biehe even stopped to listen to you. I swear I saw emotion in his eyes!\"","Xia Xuechun lowered her lashes, muttering: \"I saw Weisheng Biehe leave with Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qi Xiaojia was even more furious: \"Damn it, that Qiao Chuchu is such a bitch! Why does she always have to get in our way and trip us up?\"","They had finally gotten a chance to perform on the piano, hoping to catch Weisheng Biehe's attention and leave a lasting impression.","Qi Xiaojia was so angry her stomach hurt, hands on her hips as she declared: \"Qiao Chuchu is the biggest obstacle on our road to riches!\"","Xia Xuechun hesitated for a moment, then mustered her courage: \"I think... I can still try.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"? Try? How?\"","Weisheng Biehe leaned against the wall of the second-floor corridor, waiting outside the guest room for Qiao Chuchu to come out.","His slender fingers lightly twirled his prayer beads, his head resting against the wall as he closed his eyes to relax.","Qiao Chuchu stood at the guest room door, hesitating to open it.","[By now, Xia Xuechun must have finished her piano performance, right? That means a large part of Weisheng Biehe's storyline has already been avoided.]","Weisheng Biehe slowly opened his eyes, walked to the door, adjusted his prayer beads, and waited for Qiao Chuchu to open it.","He watched as the doorknob turned slightly, but the door still didn't open.","Biehe: \"?\"","Why isn't she coming out?","Is she really afraid he'll kill her?","Qiao Chuchu leaned her head against the door, making a dull \"thud.\"","He pinpointed her position by the sound and placed his hand on the door where her head rested.","With only the door separating them, Weisheng Biehe stood tall, his beaded hand seemingly caressing her head as she leaned weakly against the door.","Qiao Chuchu sighed.","His eyes darkened as he held his breath, listening intently.","[A significant part of Weisheng Biehe's storyline revolves around him falling in love with Xia Xuechun.]","[Now that I've prevented the beginning of his love for Xia Xuechun, shouldn't their storyline be over?]","[If there's no storyline, can I keep my distance from him?]","Weisheng Biehe narrowed his eyes, displeased as he stared at the door.","Qiao Chuchu bit her lower lip, conflicted: [Because Weisheng Biehe is kind of terrifying.]","[In the story, after he falls in love with Xia Xuechun, he sends people to follow her. He secretly gives her things she likes, and if she talks to a guy, he gets angry and makes sure she never sees that guy again.]","[...The more I think about it, the scarier it gets.]","[But it's not surprising, considering the Weisheng family—all five members are horrifying in their own way.]","Even though Lou Tingsi is a pervert, and my brother becomes a bit twisted after his dark turn, Weisheng Biehe is on another level.","[From the moment he met Xia Xuechun, Weisheng Biehe has been meticulously luring her in.]","He literally custom-built a dungeon, chains, and a luxurious princess bed. His pursuit of Xia Xuechun can't even be called love. If he had an ugly face, it would be a straight-up horror movie. Weisheng Biehe's actions are only held together by his stunningly beautiful face.","Weisheng Biehe was slightly surprised.","His face is stunningly beautiful?","He smirked slightly, just as Qiao Chuchu broke down internally.","[If Lou Tingsi and my brother are beginner-level yanderes, Weisheng Biehe is the advanced version! Super advanced!]","She scratched her cheek: [I definitely need to avoid this minefield. I can't have any contact with a pure psychopath like Weisheng Biehe. According to the setting, Weisheng Biehe should only love Xia Xuechun. Since he hasn't fallen for her yet, he shouldn't interact with other women. By that logic, I'm actually preventing him from hurting other girls! Hehe!~]","Weisheng Biehe: \"...\"","His fingers on the door curled into a fist.","[Alright, after I go out, I'll thank him and then quickly distance myself. The farther away I stay, the better! That way, I can avoid his tragic fate of falling off a cliff, prevent him from dragging Yucan-jie into this, and keep myself safe.]","[That's the plan!!]","Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath and straightened her appearance.","Weisheng Biehe had already stepped back, his tea-colored eyes swirling with dark, ominous thoughts as he stared intently at the door.","\"Um...\" A soft female voice came from the staircase.","Weisheng Biehe turned to look.","Xia Xuechun was holding a small Yorkshire terrier, looking pitifully at him: \"Is this little dog yours?\"","The Yorkshire wagged its tail furiously and barked twice.","Weisheng Biehe's expression remained neutral, but his face gradually darkened.","Didn't he ask the butler to take his dog somewhere else to play? How did it end up in Xia Xuechun's hands?","Qiao Chuchu heard the voice and cracked the door open slightly to observe Weisheng Biehe.","[What's going on?]","[Is Xia Xuechun here?]","[Didn't I already prevent them from meeting?! Why is Xia Xuechun still here?!]","[Is this a forced plot point? Will Weisheng Biehe still fall for Xia Xuechun?!]","[Does that mean I still have to deal with him?]","Weisheng Biehe raised an eyebrow, his dark expression instantly brightening: \"That's my dog.\"","He crouched down and opened his arms: \"Liu Liu, come to Daddy.\"","Xia Xuechun quickly put the dog down, and Liu Liu happily scampered over on its short legs, leaping into Biehe's arms.","He gently patted the dog's head, a slight smile on his lips: \"Who's Daddy's good dog?\"","The dog barked once.","Biehe's smile deepened: \"Yes, you're Daddy's good dog.\"","He glanced at the slightly open guest room door, his smile confident and assured, then turned to Xia Xuechun: \"You're Xia Xuechun, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","[How does he know Xia Xuechun's name?]","[Isn't he supposed to be indifferent to everyone? Did he already have his eye on Xia Xuechun?]"]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Miss Qiao, Don't Misunderstand, I Intend to Save You Before Killing You","paragraphs":["Xia Xuechun blushed and nodded: \"Yes, my name is Xia Xuechun.\"","Biehe, holding a dog, walked toward her: \"Let's talk by the window.\"","Qiao Chuchu's breath hitched, her heart screaming: *Don't go, Weisheng Biehe! Even though you're a creep, this is the love that will break your heart! You'll end up dead at the bottom of a cliff, even if it's your own fault!*","Weisheng Biehe seemed to stumble but still followed Xia Xuechun to the window.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't hear their conversation anymore.","She peeked out cautiously.","At the end of the hallway, Weisheng Biehe, dressed in a well-tailored suit, held a small Yorkshire Terrier in his arms, chatting with Xia Xuechun, who was wearing a waitress uniform.","Xia Xuechun had her hair tied up in a high ponytail, her face free of makeup, and her eyes sparkled as she looked at him.","Weisheng Biehe had his back to Qiao Chuchu, so she couldn't see his expression, but she could sense his relaxed and comfortable demeanor.","Clearly, being with Xia Xuechun put him at ease.","Qiao Chuchu sneaked over to the stair railing, gripping it tightly as she craned her neck to watch them.","Weisheng Biehe asked, \"Where did you find my dog?\"","Xia Xuechun hesitated for a moment, then quickly smiled. \"I just happened to see it and thought it must have an owner, so I looked around for a while.\"","Weisheng Biehe's eyes darkened, his tone slightly mocking. \"Oh, really?\"","His dog was so small that he had set up a special area to walk it, ensuring it wouldn't run off and people could go about their business without worry.","Xia Xuechun was lying.","She had stolen the dog from that area.","Weisheng Biehe smirked sarcastically.","Qiao Chuchu gripped the railing tightly, her heart racing: *Oh no, oh no, oh no! Saving his precious dog is definitely going to make Weisheng Biehe develop feelings for her.*","She scolded herself: *How could I forget? If Weisheng Biehe can fall for Xia Xuechun, it means he's into her type!*","Qiao Chuchu pinched her chin: *Should I just let it go? Who can talk sense into someone so lovesick? The right answer is probably to respect, bless, and lock them together forever.*","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head again: *No, no, if Weisheng Biehe dies, Weisheng Huailing will go after revenge. Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan's protagonist aura will get Huailing killed, then Weisheng Wenzhan will die, and eventually, even Yu Can might die!*","She took a deep breath, trying to stay calm: *No matter what, the fate of these supporting characters is tied to mine. One wrong move, and the female lead's team could grow stronger, and I could end up dead.*","*I absolutely cannot give up my fate as a rich second-generation heiress!!!*","Weisheng Biehe suddenly smirked. \"Heh.\"","Xia Xuechun's eyes lit up. \"What are you laughing at?\"","\"Nothing,\" Weisheng Biehe said softly, stroking his dog. \"I just think she's cute.\"","Xia Xuechun paused, then laughed. \"Yes, your little dog is very cute. Is she a girl?\"","Weisheng Biehe kept his eyes on the dog. \"Yes, a very talkative girl.\"","Qiao Chuchu finally calmed down.","*But what should I do?*","*Weisheng Biehe already has feelings for Xia Xuechun. Should I try to seduce him?*","*No way, I wouldn't stand a chance. Back when I wore a silk camisole and tried to seduce my seven older brothers, none of them budged. I have no charm.*","*Should I tell Yu Can?*","*That won't work either. Weisheng Biehe seems like the stubborn type. The more you try to stop him, the more he'll resist.*","Qiao Chuchu leaned heavily against the railing, completely drained: *Ah~ Heaven, give me some guidance! How can I stop this self-destructive supporting character?!*","Suddenly, the stair railing made a loud *crack!*","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What was that?\"","The railing beneath her hand snapped!","Qiao Chuchu's body lurched forward: \"Ah!!\"","*Crap! I forgot the world is trying to kill me!*","Qiao Chuchu saw a sharp metal pipe pointing straight at her, standing firmly in place.","Her body fell—","*I'm going to die again!!*","She closed her eyes, but suddenly, a strong arm wrapped around her waist, spinning her around and pressing her against someone's chest.","She broke out in a cold sweat and looked up into Weisheng Biehe's light-colored eyes.","His arm held her tightly against the wall as he panted, staring at her.","Weisheng Biehe had appeared out of nowhere and saved her.","Qiao Chuchu gasped in relief, grabbing his arm gratefully. \"Th-thank you!\"","Weisheng Biehe visibly relaxed, letting out a long breath. He teased, \"Don't get the wrong idea, Miss Qiao. I saved you so I could kill you myself later.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe leaned down, whispering mischievously in her ear, \"Before I kill you, I won't let anyone else take your life.\"","Qiao Chuchu stayed silent, unable to hide her disgust. \"Are you out of your mind?\"","Weisheng Biehe tilted his head with a smile, not denying it.","Xia Xuechun ran over, still holding the dog. \"What happened? Are you okay, Mr. Biehe?\"","Suddenly, she slipped, and the Yorkshire Terrier flew out of her arms. \"Ah!\"","The dog let out a yelp!","Biehe was horrified. \"Liu Liu!\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately pushed Weisheng Biehe aside and leaped to catch the dog!","She landed smoothly but twisted her ankle, losing her balance!","Without hesitation, Qiao Chuchu spread her legs and executed a perfect split while holding the dog!","Weisheng Biehe: \"...\"","Xia Xuechun: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu, sitting in a split on the stairs, looked at the trembling dog in her arms and raised it triumphantly. \"Weisheng Biehe, look! I saved it!\"","Her eyes curved into crescents as she held the dog like a trophy. \"You saved me, and I saved your dog. We're even now. Don't you dare scare me with your creepy talk again!\"","Weisheng Biehe stood on the higher step, staring blankly at Qiao Chuchu, who was doing a split while holding his dog.","Qiao Chuchu beamed, gently shaking the dog. \"Yay!~\"","Weisheng Biehe was momentarily stunned.","Qiao Chuchu's dress had torn slightly from the forceful split, and her hair was a mess.","But her face was radiant, her eyes shining brightly as she smiled at him.","So sweet.","He couldn't help but smile, walking over to her and taking the trembling Liu Liu from her hands. \"You saved my Liu Liu, which is harder than me saving you. So, you're more impressive than I am.\"","Weisheng Biehe leaned down, his tone soft as if coaxing a child. \"Congratulations, you win.\"","Qiao Chuchu grinned. \"So, will you stop trying to scare me?\"","\"Never again,\" Weisheng Biehe said, raising his hand in mock respect, his tone playful. \"You are the boss.\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked. \"Aha~ I knew I never back down from a fight!~\"","She quickly pulled herself out of the split, but her heel suddenly snapped!","*Oh no, did my heel just break?*","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\""]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: The Furious Microorganism Huailing","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stood stiffly, trying to shift her weight onto her heels, but her ankle twisted slightly, almost causing her to stumble. She quickly straightened up.","【It really broke!】","【Ugh, I spent over ten thousand on these shoes, and they broke on the first day. I should’ve just worn knockoffs.】","Weisheng Biehe glanced down at the hem of her skirt.","The shoes were completely hidden, showing no signs of damage.","Afraid of making a fool of herself, Qiao Chuchu decided to make a quick exit: “I’ll head downstairs first.”","【I need to call my driver to bring me a new pair. If I twist my ankle, it’ll be so embarrassing.】","“Wait.” He knelt down, his hand adorned with Buddhist beads gently grasping Qiao Chuchu’s ankle. “Your heel is broken.”","He lifted her shoe slightly, tapping the thin, chopstick-like heel.","The heel wobbled precariously, on the verge of falling off.","He frowned. “This is too dangerous.”","Qiao Chuchu nervously pulled her foot back. “It’s fine. I’ll just hop down on one foot. I’m really good at hopping.”","Weisheng Biehe looked up at her, a hint of amusement in his eyes. “What if the other heel breaks too?”","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up. “Ah! Then it’ll just turn into flats!~”","Weisheng Biehe: “?”","She sat cross-legged, took off her shoe, and started trying to break the other heel. “Ha!!”","“Hoo!!!”","“Ula!!”","Qiao Chuchu used all her strength, but the heel remained unyielding.","Frustrated, she placed her hands on her hips and looked at Weisheng Biehe. “Do you have a hammer? Lend it to me so I can smash it.”","Weisheng Biehe stared at her as if she were a fool.","Suddenly, he burst out laughing.","Qiao Chuchu: “? What are you laughing at?”","Weisheng Biehe laughed so hard he could barely stand straight. “How do you always manage to be so funny?”","Qiao Chuchu sat cross-legged on the stairs, utterly baffled.","The butler, who had rushed over upon hearing the commotion, gasped in shock. “Oh my, oh my~ How did the railing fall off?”","He looked up at Weisheng Biehe. “Young Master, are you alright?”","Weisheng Biehe’s face was red from laughing as he waved his hand dismissively. “I’m fine, I’m fine.”","He stood up, slipped his arm under Qiao Chuchu, and effortlessly scooped her up into a princess carry!","The butler: “!”","Xia Xuechun: “!”","Qiao Chuchu: “!”","Weisheng Biehe smiled at Qiao Chuchu. “No need for a hammer. I’ll just buy you a new pair.”","Qiao Chuchu, still clutching her shoe, protested. “I can buy them myself. Put me down.”","“No.” Weisheng Biehe tilted his head, his tone firm and unyielding. “Your shoe broke because you saved my dog, Liu Liu. I owe you a new pair.”","With that, he turned and carried her upstairs. “Come on, Liu Liu. Let’s go see Dad.”","The Yorkshire Terrier trotted behind him on its short legs.","Xia Xuechun stood frozen on the stairs, her mind in disarray. “Mr. Biehe—”","Weisheng Biehe paused and glanced at her, his expression cold. “Thank you.”","Xia Xuechun furrowed her brows. “? For what?”","Weisheng Biehe looked down at Qiao Chuchu in his arms, his tone meaningful. “You did me a big favor, so I won’t pursue the matter of you stealing my dog.”","Xia Xuechun: “!”","Qiao Chuchu: “? She stole your dog?”","Weisheng Biehe gave a cryptic smile and carried Qiao Chuchu back to his room.","Xia Xuechun remained rooted to the spot, staring at his retreating figure.","The butler hurried over to her, clearly agitated. “Who allowed you upstairs? Temporary staff aren’t permitted on the second floor. Go back to the banquet hall immediately!”","Xia Xuechun clenched her jaw, holding back tears, and without a word, she ran downstairs, her eyes red.","Qi Xiaojia had been waiting for her and eagerly approached as soon as she saw her. “Xuechun, how did he treat you?”","Xia Xuechun swallowed her tears. “Let’s just get back to work. Don’t ask.”","Qi Xiaojia was stunned. “Why?”","Xia Xuechun’s eyes glistened with resentment, her voice trembling. “He carried Qiao Chuchu back to his room.”","Qi Xiaojia: “...What?!”","-","Weisheng Lin glanced at the time. “It’s been half an hour already. When are we finally going to get out of here? I’ve never craved freedom so much in my life.”","Yu Can had already opened her laptop and started working. “Trust Biehe’s abilities. This birthday party will go on just fine with or without us.”","Weisheng Lin sighed, bored. “That may be true, but today was supposed to be my first proper meeting with Qiao Chuchu. I wanted to chat with her a bit.”","He puffed out his chest and tilted his chin up, trying to look cool. “What if I tried to intimidate her? Use my aura to make her tremble in fear?”","Weisheng Wenzhan gave him a sidelong glance. “Your face alone is scary enough. No need to put in extra effort.”","Weisheng Lin: “?”","Weisheng Huailing stood by the window, still not seeing any sign of Qiao Chuchu.","He signed to Yu Can: 「Why hasn’t Qiao Chuchu arrived yet?」","Yu Can smirked: 「You could just message her on WeChat.」","Huailing frowned: 「But I dressed up so nicely today. If I warn her in advance, it’ll ruin the surprise.」","He was growing impatient: 「I’ll just walk around outside the window and see if Biehe’s up to no good in his room.」","He stepped out onto the balcony, effortlessly leaping onto the window ledge and walking along the exterior of the second floor as if it were flat ground.","Weisheng Lin and Weisheng Wenzhan watched from the balcony.","Yu Can, draped in a fur coat, also peeked out.","Weisheng Biehe brought Qiao Chuchu to his room, gently placing her on the sofa before kneeling down to remove her shoes.","Qiao Chuchu quickly pulled her foot back. “No! I can do it myself!”","Weisheng Biehe grabbed her ankle and firmly removed her shoe, inspecting her foot. “Does it hurt? Did you sprain it?”","Qiao Chuchu tensed up, feeling awkward. “No, it doesn’t hurt.”","【Why is someone so important kneeling to check on a nobody like me?】","Weisheng Biehe seemed to chuckle softly, glancing at her shoe size. “That’s good. I’ll call someone to bring you a new pair. Do you want the same style?”","She shook her head. “No need. I have plenty of unworn shoes at home, and my brother’s probably done with work by now. I’ll have him bring me a pair. I don’t want to trouble you.”","Weisheng Biehe smiled. “How could it be trouble?”","“BANG!!!!”","A loud knock on the glass startled them.","Qiao Chuchu flinched and turned toward the sound.","Weisheng Huailing stood outside the balcony, glaring at them.","His eyes were wide, veins bulging on his forehead, and his face was flushed red with anger.","Qiao Chuchu gasped. “Weisheng Huailing?”","Weisheng Biehe’s expression darkened.","Weisheng Huailing yanked at the balcony door.","It didn’t budge.","He kicked it with full force!","“CRASH!!!”","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard, covering her mouth in shock.","Weisheng Biehe quickly shielded her. “Don’t be afraid.”","Weisheng Huailing read his lips and slammed his hand against the bulletproof glass door.","「Open the door!」","His gestures were forceful: 「You liar!!!」","「Open the door!!!!」"]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: The Rule of the Wei Family is Competition, Not Concession","paragraphs":["Weisheng Yucan frowned, \"What did Huai Ling see? He's so angry.\"","She had just watched Huai Ling jump onto Weisheng Biehe's balcony. She didn't know what he had seen, but suddenly he became agitated, leaping up like a panther and kicking the door repeatedly!","Even from her position, she could hear the short, urgent cries coming from Huai Ling's throat.","Huai Ling was born deaf, but he wasn't mute. He had never heard sounds, so he couldn't speak. Only in moments of extreme urgency would he make such anxious noises.","Weisheng Lin sensed something was wrong and leaned over, \"What's going on? Why is Little Five so angry? It feels like he's about to break in.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan picked up his phone, \"I'll call someone to bring the keys right away.\"","Without hesitation, Yucan pulled out a soft pouch from her chest and took out a set of keys, \"Follow me.\"","Weisheng Lin was baffled, \"What? Third Sister, how do you have the keys?!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was also stunned and hung up the call.","Weisheng Yucan, in her high heels, clattered to the door, unlocking it as she spoke, \"I've been married to five men, and all five of them tried to burn me to death. Do you know why they didn't succeed?\"","She pushed the door open and put the keys away, \"Because I always keep a way out hidden on me.\"","The three of them rushed toward Weisheng Biehe's room.","At the same time, Huai Ling pried open the balcony door and entered the room, throwing a punch at Weisheng Biehe!","Biehe dodged quickly, and the two immediately started fighting!","Qiao Chuchu, sitting on the sofa, was completely bewildered. She quickly picked up the trembling Yorkshire Terrier on the floor to prevent it from being trampled by the two men.","[What’s going on?]","[Why are they suddenly fighting?!]","She felt as awkward as when she was a teenager visiting a classmate’s house and accidentally walked in on their parents tag-teaming them in a scolding!","Huai Ling slammed Biehe onto the desk, \"You're trying to take what's mine!!\"","Weisheng Biehe, choked by the grip on his neck, struggled to breathe!","Huai Ling gestured with one hand, his movements fierce and forceful, \"You knew she was mine, yet you still went after her! And you lied to me!\"","Weisheng Biehe gritted his teeth, his hand reaching for the inkstone on the desk, clearly intending to smash it into Huai Ling's head.","Huai Ling didn’t let go, continuing to choke him!","Qiao Chuchu’s legs went weak, and she quickly put the dog down, [Oh no, oh no! This is going to turn into murder!!!]","She rushed from behind and grabbed Huai Ling, yanking him back hard, \"What’s going on between you two? Can’t you talk it out? He’s your own brother!\"","Huai Ling stumbled back a couple of steps from her pull.","Biehe finally caught his breath, his flushed face slowly returning to normal. He grabbed the inkstone and hurled it at Huai Ling, \"Do you think I’m giving you face?!\"","Huai Ling caught it, and the two started fighting again!","Qiao Chuchu, desperate, stepped between them, turning to Biehe, \"Stop fighting!\"","Biehe paused.","She then turned to Huai Ling and signed, \"Please, stop fighting!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face was pale, one hand shielding Biehe, the other clutching Huai Ling’s arm, her hands trembling.","[This isn’t like the drama I watched where two people danced in the rain. These two are really trying to kill each other!]","[Watching this is giving me a heart attack. It’s like watching my favorite characters brawling right in front of me, and I don’t even know why.]","Huai Ling gradually calmed down, glancing at Qiao Chuchu’s trembling hand.","He glared fiercely at Biehe.","Biehe irritably tugged at his tie, his once-pristine suit now disheveled, his neck marked with dark red bruises, his eyes filled with murderous intent.","Yucan walked into the room and saw the scene, her temper flaring instantly, \"The guests are downstairs, and you two choose now to fight? Are you trying to embarrass me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu flinched and quickly stepped aside.","Yucan, in her emerald green slit dress, the voluminous skirt trailing behind her, strode over with her long, pale legs, exuding an intimidating aura.","Behind her followed Weisheng Wenzhan, impeccably dressed in a suit, his expression grim.","And a stranger.","The man glanced at Qiao Chuchu, his gaze sharp as a knife.","Qiao Chuchu quickly averted her eyes.","[Who is that? He looks handsome, but his eyes are terrifying. I don’t dare to look too closely.]","Weisheng Lin was puzzled, \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe, unwilling to back down, retorted to Yucan, \"Why are you yelling at me? You should ask your dear little brother what’s gotten into him! He was just trying to choke me to death!\"","Huai Ling shot him a glare and turned to Yucan, signing, \"He lied to me about Qiao Chuchu not being here, but not only is she here, she’s in his room!\"","Huai Ling grew more aggrieved as he signed, \"I trusted him! But he lied to me, and he even knelt down to put shoes on Qiao Chuchu!\"","Weisheng Yucan was taken aback and glanced at Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow, his gaze shifting to Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Lin looked surprised, his eyes also turning to Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Biehe wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth and also looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Surrounded by a group of impeccably dressed, high-status men, Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She was clearly the least imposing person in the room, and she didn’t even dare to lift her head.","She hadn’t seen what Huai Ling had signed.","But she could feel the heavy atmosphere, everyone’s eyes on her.","Her mind was in chaos, and she was so nervous she could almost dig her nails into her palms.","[Who understands? My heel broke, I almost died, I helped save the plot, and now I’m standing here while these big shots fight.]","[I’m so scared, I want to run, but I don’t have an excuse.]","She silently covered her eyes, [I’d better not look. The more you know around these powerful people, the worse it gets. I’ll just pretend I don’t know anything and let them communicate in sign language.]","Yucan was amused.","She couldn’t help but laugh, signing to Huai Ling, \"Does Qiao Chuchu have your name written on her? Why do you think she belongs to you?\"","Huai Ling: \"?\"","Weisheng Yucan reasoned, \"She’s a single woman, in the prime of her life. Doesn’t everyone have the right to pursue her?\"","Huai Ling was so angry he could barely speak, signing frantically, \"But Weisheng Biehe is my brother! He knows I like Qiao Chuchu, and he knows I want to marry her!\"","\"Should your brother just give in to you?\" Yucan’s expression suddenly turned fierce, \"I raised you. Is this how I taught you?!\"","Huai Ling was stunned.","Weisheng Yucan didn’t hold back, \"Didn’t I tell you that in the Weisheng family, no one yields to anyone? It’s all about taking what you want!\"","\"If you like something, and your brother likes it too, then you fight for it. Whoever wins gets it!\"","\"If you can’t get it, that’s your own fault. Why should your brother give it to you?!\"","Weisheng Yucan’s expression grew more disdainful, \"Where did you pick up this bad habit?!\"","Huai Ling’s chest heaved with anger, but his eyes gradually cleared.","It was obvious he was starting to understand.","Weisheng Yucan was disappointed in her younger brother.","The reason Huai Ling was so skilled in combat was that, as the youngest, he had always wanted whatever his siblings had since he was three or four years old, reaching out with his little hands to take it.","In other families, she couldn’t be sure, but in the Weisheng family, no one would give in just because you were a child.","So whenever Huai Ling wanted something they had, they wouldn’t give it to him. Instead, they would push him to the ground and let him cry as much as he wanted. If he couldn’t get it, that was his own fault.","After that, Huai Ling became determined to take things from them, his agility improving day by day. Even when they pushed him away, he stopped crying.","That was the family rule: only the strong could have the most, could have what they wanted.","The weak had to accept their fate.","But among the five of them, there were no weaklings. Each was a powerhouse in their own field.","That’s why she was so angry.","Yucan signed furiously, \"Did you see Biehe in bed with Qiao Chuchu?\"","Huai Ling’s pupils contracted, and he signed excitedly, \"Of course not!\"","Weisheng Yucan sneered, \"Then is this all the composure you have? Qiao Chuchu has seven older brothers. If you see her with them, are you going to die of jealousy?\"","Huai Ling: \"? Those are her brothers. How could I be angry with them? They have a pure sibling relationship, and they’ll become my brothers too in the future.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan’s eyes widened, and he chuckled, \"Heh~\"","Weisheng Yucan was also amused.","Huai Ling was confused, \"What are you laughing at?\""]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: A Bunch of People with Eight Hundred Schemes, Only Qiao Chuchu is Minus Nine Hundred","paragraphs":["Yu Can sighed and walked between Weisheng Wenzhan and Weisheng Lin: \"This is what you call sibling affection among the three of us.\"","She linked her arms through Weisheng Wenzhan and Weisheng Lin's.","Weisheng Lin pulled away in disgust: \"Hey, hey, hey! If you have something to say, say it, but don't touch me! You're wrinkling my clothes!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan didn't hesitate to pull his arm back, his tone gloomy: \"Don't use me as a test subject.\"","Yu Can wasn't angry. She walked over to Weisheng Biehe, ready to hug him.","Weisheng Biehe quickly dodged, coldly rejecting her: \"Don't touch me.\"","Yu Can turned to Weisheng Huailing and spread her hands: \"Do you understand now?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"I understand.\"","Yu Can smiled: \"And the conclusion?\"","Huailing replied indifferently: \"The five of us don't get along.\"","Yu Can: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin laughed incredulously: \"Huailing, not only are you deaf, but you're also blind. Isn't it obvious—\"","Yu Can covered her second brother's mouth, grinning mischievously as she whispered: \"Don't remind him. Don't you want to see the joke?\"","Weisheng Lin's expression of disgust suddenly turned intrigued. He pulled Yu Can's hand away and said seriously: \"It's obvious that they share a very pure bond!\"","Weisheng Huailing coldly read his lips, his expression blank: \"Are you done with the nonsense?\"","Weisheng Lin nodded repeatedly.","Huailing, annoyed, walked over to Qiao Chuchu and hoisted her over his shoulder!","Qiao Chuchu, who was still covering her eyes: \"Huh?!\"","Weisheng Biehe's expression changed, and he rushed forward to snatch her back!","Huailing dodged him and ran off with Qiao Chuchu on his shoulder!","Weisheng Biehe chased after him: \"Weisheng Huailing!!\"","Yu Can grabbed him: \"Why are you shouting? Don't you know your brother is deaf?\"","Biehe shook her off, his tone sharp: \"Why are you stopping me? Didn't you just say that the Wei Sheng Family takes whatever it wants by force?\"","Yu Can's face darkened: \"Your neck is covered in bruises. You need to find a makeup artist to cover them up, and you should change your clothes too. Otherwise, people will talk, and it'll be your reputation on the line.\"","Weisheng Biehe froze, then irritably touched his neck: \"Damn it, I actually lost to him!\"","Weisheng Lin laughed: \"Huailing is the top lone wolf in the industry, the pinnacle of combat prowess. Did you think he was just for show?\"","-","Huailing unceremoniously dumped Qiao Chuchu onto the bed!","The force was so strong that she bounced on the mattress!","Startled, she rolled off the bed and onto the floor, her face full of panic: \"What are you doing?!\"","Weisheng Huailing didn't say a word. He easily picked her up and threw her back onto the bed!","Qiao Chuchu: \"!!!\"","He straddled her waist, his face cold as he signed: \"Don't move, or I'll tie you up with my tie.\"","Qiao Chuchu inhaled sharply and froze.","[What's going on? Did I just stumble into some bizarre territory?]","Weisheng Huailing had originally styled his hair in a mature slicked-back look, but now two strands hung loosely over his forehead, giving him a wild, dangerous aura.","He roughly loosened his tie, his frustration palpable.","Qiao Chuchu breathed in shallow gasps.","[Damn, this is so intense.]","[But having that intensity directed at me is terrifying.]","Weisheng Huailing frowned, staring into her frightened eyes.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes were wide, her chest rising and falling rapidly, her brows slightly furrowed, every cell in her body radiating fear.","Huailing leaned down closer to her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"Eek!!\"","She shrank back on the bed, her heart pounding as his face drew nearer!","A flicker of interest passed through his beautiful eyes, and he suddenly moved lower.","Qiao Chuchu: \"!!!\"","His head slowly descended, passing her chest, her legs, and finally stopping at her calves.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't breathe, every cell in her body on high alert!","[What is he doing?!]","[Can I kick him?!]","Weisheng Huailing slowly sat up, kneeling on the bed, and took hold of her ankles.","Qiao Chuchu tried to pull her legs back in fear.","Huailing tightened his grip, his eyes warning her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","The room was dead silent.","Only the sound of her increasingly heavy breathing filled the air.","She felt a faint sense of relief.","Relief that Weisheng Huailing couldn't hear her nervous gasps.","His rough fingers brushed against the skin of her ankles as he looked up at her.","Qiao Chuchu lay on the bed, her hair now completely disheveled, her auburn locks spread out around her. She turned her face away, refusing to look at him, her hands gripping the white sheets tightly as she breathed unevenly.","Weisheng Huailing's eyes darkened, and he suddenly yanked her downward!","Qiao Chuchu slid down, her body now pinned against his knees!","Her face turned pale, and she quickly pulled the blanket over herself, her expression full of terror!","Seeing this, Weisheng Huailing's grim expression softened, and the corners of his mouth lifted into his signature adorable smile.","\"Don't be afraid,\" he signed. \"I'm here.\"","Qiao Chuchu's face turned green.","[It's precisely because you're here that I'm scared, dude!!]","[And why are you smiling all of a sudden?]","[Why are you smiling?]","[Why did you throw me on the bed, do all those ambiguous things, and make me think you were going to... you know!]","Qiao Chuchu grew more and more afraid, clutching the blanket and trembling.","[Am I the only normal person among these villains? I feel so lost, so confused, so scared.]","Weisheng Huailing smirked, patting her leg to get her attention. \"What were you doing with my fourth brother earlier?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him fearfully.","He stared at her coldly. \"Tell the truth. Don't lie.\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately signed the entire story.","Finally, she summarized: \"That's what happened. My shoes broke, and Mr. Biehe took me to his room, saying he'd buy me a new pair. Then you showed up.\"","She couldn't help but add in her mind: [And you showed up in the most terrifying way possible.]","Huailing's face darkened, and he got off the bed.","Qiao Chuchu scrambled off the bed too, rushing to the door and signing: \"It's just a pair of shoes. You shouldn't go to the trouble. I'll buy them myself!\"","She tried to open the door.","?","It wouldn't budge!","She glanced at the keypad next to the door, her jaw nearly dropping.","[This room has a password lock?!]","[What kind of security does the Wei Sheng Family have? Unbreakable glass, password-locked doors—how am I supposed to get out?]","She forced a laugh and turned back to Huailing, signing awkwardly: \"Such a high-tech door! What's the password?\"","Weisheng Huailing stood by the bed, staring at her gloomily without a word.","Qiao Chuchu leaned against the door, finally taking in the layout of Huailing's room.","His room was simple, with a gray-and-white color scheme, a modern minimalist style.","The room was spacious, with an en-suite bathroom, a walk-in closet, and a study—everything one could need.","It must have been over 1,500 square feet.","The room had no main light source, and there were few decorations. All the furniture was black.","Weisheng Huailing's clothes were black too.","It gave off a lifeless, eerie vibe, like a modern-day underworld.","Qiao Chuchu turned away, her heart sinking: [Who can understand? Everyone around me has eight hundred schemes up their sleeves. I'm out of my depth—I can't keep up with their twisted minds, their schemes, their glances, their thoughts. The only thing I can keep up with is my gut feeling that something's wrong.]","[I feel like playing a song.]","[How about \"Borrowing Five Hundred More Years from Heaven\"?]","Weisheng Huailing smirked slightly, ignoring Qiao Chuchu as he walked into the walk-in closet.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[What is he getting?]"]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: When Huailing is not angry, he is quite a gentleman.","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu's phone rang.","Her heart tightened as if she had grasped a lifeline, and she quickly opened her phone.","It was a group chat with Pei Mu and Pei Ci.","Pei Ci: \"Qiao Chuchu, where are you? Pei Mu and I are here. The others will be here soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt like crying.","[Finally, after waiting for so long, two of them have arrived. It's been so hard.]","Weisheng Huailing's hand, holding a box, paused, and he glanced toward the door.","Qiao Chuchu quickly scanned the walk-in closet and typed nervously: \"I'm on the second floor! In Weisheng Huailing's room! Come find me ASAP!!!!\"","She sent an urgent emoji.","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Pei Ci also sent an emoji.","Qiao Chuchu locked her phone, let out a sigh of relief, and watched as Huailing walked out of the closet carrying two shoe boxes.","She was stunned.","Weisheng Huailing walked up to her and knelt down on one knee.","Qiao Chuchu stepped back, but she was already against the door with nowhere to retreat.","Huailing opened the two shoe boxes, revealing a pair of exquisite black high heels inside.","She was caught off guard: \"Why do you have high heels in your room? Are they Yu Can's?\"","And they were brand new.","But as soon as she said it, she realized that Weisheng Huailing couldn't hear her.","He was focused on holding her ankle, helping her put on the high heels.","The shoes fit perfectly.","Qiao Chuchu instantly knew.","These weren't Yu Can's shoes. Yu Can was 1.7 meters tall, while she was only 1.6 meters. The sizes would have been different.","But why did he have two pairs of shoes in his room that were her size? Were they for a friend?","Huailing slipped the other shoe on her foot and compared the two, pointing to one of the velvet pointed-toe shoes.","\"This one looks better, right?\"","She took a closer look and nodded.","Huailing then took off the other shoe and began to put it on her.","He knelt on one knee, the other leg bent at a 90-degree angle, placing her foot on his thigh to elevate her ankle as he fastened the buckle.","Qiao Chuchu was startled: \"I can do it myself!\"","But Huailing couldn't hear her. He carefully tied the strap, put her foot down, switched knees, and repeated the process with the other foot.","Once both shoes were on, he looked up at her with a smile. \"Do you like them?\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly crouched down to help him up. \"I love them! Please get up, don't catch a cold.\"","She felt overwhelmed by his kindness.","[Now I'm starting to wonder if I'm some kind of treasure. All the side characters I've met so far have been so nice to me. It's like a big weirdo only treats me well.]","Weisheng Huailing smiled even more enigmatically, stood up straight, and glanced at the hem of her dress.","It had come undone a little.","He said, \"Your dress has a tear.\"","Qiao Chuchu noticed and was upset. \"Oh no, it must have happened when I did a split to save Liu Liu earlier. I tore the dress.\"","She sighed. \"Such an expensive dress, and the quality is worse than the cheap ones I used to wear.\"","Weisheng Huailing carefully read her lips and seemed to understand. He gently patted her shoulder. \"It's okay. I have dresses in my room that are your size.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She was confused. \"Why do you have women's shoes and dresses in your room?\"","Weisheng Huailing tilted his head and smiled. \"I bought them for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He took her hand and led her to a large wardrobe in the walk-in closet.","He opened it, revealing several evening gowns and casual outfits.","There were even shoes of various styles.","Qiao Chuchu was shocked. \"All of these are for me? Why?\"","Huailing smiled softly. \"In case you ever come to stay here, it's always good to be prepared.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She was baffled, thinking to herself: [Why would I stay at his place? I have my own home.]","Weisheng Huailing's eyes darkened, and his smile grew more mysterious. \"Pick a dress to change into.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, staring at the dresses, feeling indecisive.","[They're all so pretty. I didn't expect Weisheng Huailing to have such good taste. It's hard to choose.]","Huailing watched her fondly as she picked out a dress. \"It's okay. You can try them all on if you want.\"","Suddenly, the room was bathed in a soft yellow light.","Qiao Chuchu was startled and looked up at the flickering light, then turned to Huailing. \"What's this?\"","Huailing remained calm. \"Since I can't hear, my room lights up when someone knocks on the door.\"","With that, he turned to open the door.","As soon as the door opened, Pei Mu and Pei Ci's handsome faces appeared in front of Huailing.","The two brothers looked identical in height and features, like clones, making it hard to tell them apart.","However, there were subtle differences in their expressions.","Pei Ci was more aloof.","Pei Mu was more brooding.","They spoke in unison: \"Hello, Mr. Huailing.\"","Weisheng Huailing's eyes narrowed almost imperceptibly.","Pei Ci looked displeased, scanning the room, and raised his phone.","On the screen was a single sentence: \"Is my sister in there?\"","Huailing clasped his hands in front of him, smiling innocently, and stepped aside, pointing toward the walk-in closet.","Pei Ci and Pei Mu strode in. \"Qiao Chuchu, we're here. Where are you?\"","Qiao Chuchu hurried out of the closet, her voice cheerful. \"Finally, you're here.\"","Weisheng Huailing quietly moved to stand beside Qiao Chuchu, watching the brothers' lips.","Pei Ci glanced at Huailing warily. \"What are you doing?\"","Qiao Chuchu lifted the hem of her dress. \"My dress tore. Huailing has new dresses here, so I'm picking one out.\"","Pei Ci was taken aback and turned to Huailing. \"Why does he have dresses in your size? Do they even fit?\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at Huailing. \"They should. The shoes he gave me fit perfectly, and he had new shoes in my size too.\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Pei Mu looked at Huailing suspiciously, his eyes full of doubt.","Pei Ci felt something was off and spoke bluntly: \"Weisheng Huailing, why do you have shoes and dresses in my sister's size in your room? What else do you have in there? Adult toys?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Hey!\"","Pei Mu placed a hand on Pei Ci's shoulder and smiled warmly. \"What are you saying? This is Weisheng Huailing. He's just being friendly to our sister. After all, she did save Weisheng Yucan's life.\"","Pei Mu chuckled and turned to Huailing. \"Right?\"","Weisheng Huailing stood obediently beside Qiao Chuchu, pointing to his ears and shaking his head.","He couldn't hear, after all.","But then he signed something to Qiao Chuchu.","After seeing it, Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci sensed something was wrong and asked in unison: \"What did he say?\"","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly scratched her head. \"He said he doesn't know what you need and can't hear what you're saying, but he can assure you that if you need anything, he can provide it because he has... all the tools here.\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","The brothers looked at Huailing incredulously.","Wasn't he supposed to be deaf? He was talking about tools now!","Huailing tilted his head and smiled at them.","He really couldn't hear.","Hehe~"]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Someone Wants to Kill Me","paragraphs":["The room was dead silent.","Qiao Chuchu stood awkwardly in place, clearly sensing the tension in the air.","Fifth Brother was angry.","Sixth Brother was also angry.","Weisheng Huailing, on the other hand, didn’t seem angry at all. In fact, he looked like he was in an exceptionally good mood, his smile still widening by the second.","She nervously licked her lips. “Let’s go out. I won’t change the dress. I doubt anyone will notice anyway.”","Pei Ci and Pei Mu didn’t say a word, their faces dark as coal, glaring at Weisheng Huailing. “Qiao Chuchu, you go out first.”","Huailing smiled at Qiao Chuchu and nodded, signaling for her to relax.","But Qiao Chuchu couldn’t relax. She tried to mediate, “Brothers, this is Weisheng Biehe’s birthday party, and it’s the Wei Sheng Clan’s event. Please don’t cause trouble.”","Pei Mu smiled warmly, pulling her closer. “We know. Don’t worry, we’re not going to argue. We just want to have a little chat.”","Qiao Chuchu sighed helplessly and signed to Huailing, *“I’ll step out first. My brothers want to talk to you.”*","Huailing nodded obediently.","Qiao Chuchu was still worried. She signed again, *“My brothers have bad tempers, and they don’t seem to be in a good state of mind. If they say anything strange, please don’t take it to heart. If they bully you, just let me know.”*","Huailing smiled and signed back, *“Don’t worry, Chuchu. I understand that your brothers are vetting me. It’s normal for family members to assess new additions. I’ll make sure to give them a satisfactory answer.”*","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Vetting?","Pei Ci was on edge. “What did he just sign?”","She was equally confused. “Huailing said you’re vetting him. He thinks it’s normal for family members to assess new additions, and he’ll give you a satisfactory answer.”","Pei Mu: “?”","Pei Ci was furious. “What kind of satisfaction are we supposed to get from him? From him buying you clothes, preparing shoes for you, and obsessing over you like a creep?”","He pointed at Weisheng Huailing, his voice firm. “Listen up, Weisheng Huailing. Unless the seven of us brothers are dead, you’re not taking Qiao Chuchu away from us. End of discussion!”","Huailing blinked his watery eyes, picked up his phone, and typed something. A mechanical male voice played back, emotionless: “You don’t have to shout. I can’t hear you.”","Pei Ci: “...”","Pei Mu: “...”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","She quietly took a few steps back and closed the door behind her.","The Wei Sheng Family’s estate was massive, a two-story manor that felt like an endless shopping mall.","The faint sound of music from downstairs could still be heard.","But at that moment, the entire hallway was empty.","Qiao Chuchu, holding up her dress, walked toward the staircase when she suddenly caught a strong whiff of alcohol.","She frowned, glancing at the neighboring room, but after a brief pause, she continued toward the stairs.","Suddenly, her arm was yanked back!","Before she could even see who it was, a strange liquid was splashed onto her face!","A burning pain seared her eyes, and an indescribable smell flooded her nostrils!","Was it acid?","It was acid!!!!","She screamed in agony, her vision blurring as she saw a burly man raising a knife to slash her shoulder!","Qiao Chuchu collapsed to the ground, flailing her arms in a desperate attempt to shield herself. Her palm was slashed!","Something fell to the floor.","Qiao Chuchu gasped, trying to move her fingers.","Her right hand... no response.","She couldn’t feel her hand anymore!!","Overwhelming despair and fear engulfed her. She could hear her own voice growing weaker and weaker, her consciousness fading, her vision drifting upward.","She saw her own body lying on the ground, covered in blood, the crimson liquid soaking the luxurious carpet.","But the killer’s face was blurry. She couldn’t make out who it was. Yet, even though she was already dead, the man kept swinging the knife at her body, relentless.","The blade was already chipped.","The man was in a frenzy, showing no signs of stopping.","She couldn’t help but curse, “I’m already dead, and you’re still going at it? Are you trying to chop me up for dumplings?!”","Suddenly, her vision shifted, and the scene changed.","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","She slowly looked around.","She was back in the hallway.","Had she skipped the system’s process and been sent back directly?","No, that couldn’t be. No matter how urgent the situation, the system would always meet with her first.","Qiao Chuchu waited for a while, but there was no sign of any numbers changing.","So, what was that just now?","Had she died so many times before and been punished by the system so often that her mind had cracked, creating the illusion that she’d been killed?","She instinctively took a few steps forward, still holding her dress.","The faint smell of alcohol lingered in the air.","Qiao Chuchu’s nerves tightened like a bowstring, her eyes widening as she stared at the door ahead.","The smell was coming from there.","It was on her left.","The door, which had been tightly shut, was now slightly ajar.","Qiao Chuchu turned and ran, banging on Huailing’s door. “Open up! Open up!!!!”","Weisheng Huailing opened the door, and Pei Mu and Pei Ci looked at her in surprise. “What’s wrong?”","She glanced back at the other door.","The gap had widened. Whoever was inside had clearly noticed her.","She rushed into the room, tripping and falling to the floor, but she didn’t care about her posture. Overwhelmed by fear, she scrambled to Pei Ci and Pei Mu, clutching their legs—","“Someone’s trying to kill me!!!”","She gripped their pants tightly, her voice trembling with terror. “He has acid! He chopped me up! My hand’s gone, my eyes are blind, I—I—”","Pei Mu’s expression changed. He crouched down, cupping her face, wiping away her tears as he spoke calmly, “Calm down, Qiao Chuchu. Tell us again. Someone’s trying to kill you?”","She sobbed uncontrollably, gasping for air. “He’s out there! The fourth room on the left!”","Without a word, Pei Ci stormed out, muttering curses under his breath. “Damn it...”","Weisheng Huailing followed closely behind.","Qiao Chuchu managed to calm down slightly and added urgently, “That guy has acid!”","Pei Ci stopped Huailing, typing on his phone: *“Qiao Chuchu says the guy has acid.”*","Huailing smirked, pulling out a gun with a silencer and coldly loading it.","Pei Ci: “?”","Huailing then used his phone to summon a delivery robot from the second floor.","The robot slowly made its way to the door and entered the room Qiao Chuchu had pointed out.","Huailing followed, gun raised, aiming into the room.","He frowned.","Pei Ci also stepped forward, his expression changing.","No one was there.","Both of them turned to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu, who was practically clinging to Pei Mu, looked even more confused than they did. “No one?”","She cautiously walked over, pushed the door open, and found that it was just a storage room.","The smell of alcohol was gone, replaced by a strong, high-quality perfume.","She froze.","Pei Mu let out a long breath. “Qiao Chuchu, what’s wrong with you? You said someone was trying to kill you, even chopped you up. Where is this person?”","Pei Ci flicked her forehead. “Are you losing your mind too? Are you hallucinating now?”","Weisheng Huailing picked up his phone and checked the security cameras.","The second-floor cameras were all broken.","He remembered that the cameras had suddenly malfunctioned yesterday. Only the ones near the first-floor banquet hall had been repaired; the rest were still out of order.","He signed to Qiao Chuchu: *“Are you sure someone was trying to kill you?”*","Qiao Chuchu fidgeted with her hands, no longer certain. “I... I don’t know.”","She lowered her head, on the verge of tears. “Maybe it was just my imagination.”"]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Pei Mu and Pei Ci's Love Suicide","paragraphs":["The three men were stunned.","Hallucinations?","Pei Ci looked her up and down, clearly concerned about her mental state: \"Are you running a fever or something?\"","Pei Mu reached out and touched her forehead, confirming, \"No fever, she's actually quite cold.\"","Weisheng Huailing tilted his head, also puzzled.","Qiao Chuchu bit her lower lip, utterly confused.","[It felt so real. The killer first poured sulfuric acid on me, then hacked me to pieces with a cleaver. Even when the blade dulled, he didn’t stop. I was literally chopped to death.]","[But I didn’t lose any life points, and I didn’t see the system. Yet, I clearly saw the door being pried open a crack.]","[If it wasn’t for something sinister, why would someone peek through the door like that?!]","[But there’s no smell of alcohol in the room anymore.]","[Was it really just a hallucination?]","The more she thought about it, the more her head hurt, and she couldn’t make sense of it. \"I’m sorry, maybe it really was just a hallucination.\"","Huailing’s face darkened as he cupped her face, gesturing for her to look at him. 「You don’t need to apologize.」","He signed, 「But if you’re having hallucinations, it might not be a good thing. How about we see a doctor tomorrow?」","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, her confusion deepening. \"I need to see a doctor?\"","Pei Ci’s expression was grave. \"Of course you do. You’re starting to hallucinate. Tomorrow, we’re going to the psychiatric hospital.\"","Pei Mu nodded in agreement.","The three men stared at her intently.","After all, the way Qiao Chuchu had described her experience was so vivid, as if it had truly happened to her.","But she hadn’t used her chance to be reborn, and even she was unsure if it was a hallucination.","Maybe it really was just a hallucination?","But even if it was, it wasn’t a good sign.","Weisheng Huailing stepped forward and reached for Qiao Chuchu’s hand.","Qiao Chuchu instinctively pulled back. \"Don’t touch me!\"","Huailing was startled, his brows furrowing in confusion. 「Are you mad at me, Chuchu?」","She froze, then looked up at him, flustered, and waved her hands. 「No, I’m not.」","Qiao Chuchu was completely disoriented.","[I’m so scared. It felt so real, but reality tells me it was a hallucination. Have I really gone mad?]","[Am I so crazy that I can actually feel someone trying to kill me?]","[Is it paranoia? Or schizophrenia?]","Qiao Chuchu’s palms were drenched in cold sweat, her whole body as if she’d just been pulled out of water. She quickly grabbed her skirt and left. \"I’m sorry, I’m going downstairs.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci called out, \"Wait!\"","They immediately chased after her.","Huailing followed closely behind.","Qiao Chuchu hurried down the stairs, her skirt in hand, and dashed into the women’s restroom in the banquet hall. She stared at herself in the mirror.","Her hair was disheveled, her face pale, though her makeup was still impeccable.","But her eyes were wide open, her lips pressed into a frown, her entire expression filled with fear and anxiety.","Out of the corner of her eye, she spotted a man’s leather shoe appearing around the corner.","Her face turned pale, and she spun around!","The man lunged at her with a knife: \"Qiao Chuchu, you ruined me!!!\"","Without hesitation, she grabbed the man’s wrist and twisted it hard!","The knife fell from his hand, but he threw a bottle of sulfuric acid at her!","Qiao Chuchu screamed!","She couldn’t see again!!","A blade slashed into her chest, slamming her into the sink!","The man pulled the knife out of her chest and continued hacking at her: \"Die! Die! Die!!!\"","Pei Ci burst through the door: \"Chuchu!!\"","The man turned around, his eyes wild, and charged at Pei Ci with the knife: \"Ahhhhhh!\"","Weisheng Huailing fired a shot, hitting the man square in the forehead.","The man collapsed to the ground.","The three men rushed to Qiao Chuchu, who was lying under the sink.","Her face was unrecognizable, her body covered in horrifying wounds and blood.","Pei Ci’s body stiffened as he checked her pulse.","It was faint, but it was there.","But after just two weak beats under his fingers, Qiao Chuchu’s pulse stopped completely, as if someone had pressed a power button.","Pei Ci was in shock.","Pei Mu stared at Qiao Chuchu’s lifeless body, utterly devastated. He grabbed his hair, screaming, \"Why didn’t I believe her?! I thought it was just a hallucination!! I killed her!!!\"","Pei Ci trembled as he picked up Qiao Chuchu.","Her face was ruined.","It was impossible to even tell if it was her.","Pei Ci gently stroked her hair, his mind completely blank. \"Chuchu? Chuchu?\"","He looked at Pei Mu. \"Do you think she can come back?\"","Didn’t she still have a chance to be reborn?","Could she come back?","Pei Mu’s face was pale, holding Qiao Chuchu’s hand without answering.","Pei Ci’s mind was empty, but a thought began to surface.","\"Chuchu must still be scared, right?\"","His eyes were unfocused as he muttered, \"She was just killed by the murderer, and now the murderer is dead. In that world, he won’t let her go.\"","A strange light flickered in his dim eyes. \"I have to help her.\"","Pei Ci snatched the gun from Huailing’s hand, pressed it to his temple, and pulled the trigger.","\"Bang.\"","Pei Ci slumped against the sink, still holding Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Mu stared at the two lifeless bodies, his gaze calm as he scanned them. He picked up the gun and looked at Huailing. \"You can read lips, right? Please tell my brother that we’re going down to help Qiao Chuchu deal with the bad guys.\"","Pei Mu pulled the trigger, his body collapsing softly into Qiao Chuchu’s arms.","Aside from Qiao Chuchu’s disfigured face, the two men looked as if they were peacefully asleep.","Weisheng Huailing finally snapped out of it, slowly crouching down to look at Qiao Chuchu.","The sound...","He was struggling to breathe, clutching his chest, unsure of what this feeling was. His heart felt like it was being torn apart, and he desperately gripped Qiao Chuchu’s hand, tears streaming down his face.","-","Qiao Chuchu lay peacefully on the ground in the system world, motionless like a dead fish.","The system floated around her. \"I’ve never seen someone with the ability to foresee the future still die because of it. You’re the first idiot. How about giving me an autograph?\"","Her eyes were dull. \"You’re an idiot too. When you give someone the ability to foresee the future, you don’t even warn them. Didn’t you think she might think she’s going crazy?\"","The system sighed. \"How was I supposed to know you had this ability? It’s only now, after you died and came back, that I checked your body and found you’ve gained a new power. It’s probably because you’re already outside the original plot, and you’ve changed most of the story, triggering new developments. That’s why you can see your own future in emergencies.\"","Qiao Chuchu sat up. \"I’ve noticed that the last few times I died, it was because someone killed me.\"","She looked dazed. \"I’m so tired. It’s like I’ve become an ox, plowing five hundred acres a day, while my owner keeps whipping me.\"","The system: \"...Sorry, I laughed.\"","She glared at it. \"You’re laughing? This is all your fault! You’ve made me an outcast! I can’t go back to that world, and this world doesn’t want me. I’ve lost everyone, and I’m still being hunted!\"","The system shivered, chuckling nervously. \"Don’t be mad, I’ll give you something!~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","It produced an umbrella. \"This umbrella is a special item. It can only be used once. If sulfuric acid is thrown at it, the liquid will turn into water, protecting you. Take it.\"","Qiao Chuchu took it. \"That’s it? This is your idea of making it up to me?\"","She hit the system with the umbrella handle. \"I’ve worked so hard for you, completing so many tasks. You’ve made a fortune off me! And this is all the compensation I get?\"","The system: \"...Alright, alright. I’ll adjust your prediction mode. From now on, when you foresee the future, it won’t be immersive. You’ll experience it from a third-person perspective, so you won’t be as mentally overwhelmed.\"","It added softly, \"Also, just so you know, you can predict the future of any character who has a favorable impression of you, because their futures are also being rewritten. Some parts no longer align with the original plot.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes narrowed sharply. \"But what does that have to do with my compensation? Isn’t that something I should’ve had anyway?\"","The system: \"...You don’t seem scared at all. You’re quite sharp, aren’t you?\""]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: The Demon Twins and the Irritable Rabbit Affected by Side Effects","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu sneered, \"Don't give me money as compensation. You know I don't lack money. Bring me something useful.\"","The system reluctantly produced a pill: \"I'll give you a Strength Pill. If you take this, lifting 300 pounds will feel like lifting just one pound. But you have to take it now; it will last for eight hours.\"","\"However, the side effect is that you'll become irritable and your words might turn harsh,\" the system emphasized. \"The softer your personality, the worse your temper will be after taking it, like being drunk. You might regret it once you sober up.\"","Qiao Chuchu swallowed it without hesitation: \"Whatever. Beating that murderer is what matters. I don't want to be turned into mincemeat again.\"","She picked up an umbrella: \"I'm ready. Let's go.\"","The system nodded, then remembered something: \"Oh, by the way, after you died, Pei Mu and Pei Ci committed suicide beside your corpse. The supporting characters started dying not because of Xia Xuechun, but because of you. I thought you should know.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She staggered to the mirror and stood in front of it.","She had returned to the moment before the acid was thrown at her.","Qiao Chuchu looked at her reflection in surprise.","[Pei Mu and Pei Ci actually committed suicide?]","Pei Mu and Pei Ci hurried to the women's restroom entrance: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci exchanged glances, utterly confused.","Who had they committed suicide for?","Who was worth their lives?!","The three of them stood at the entrance of the women's restroom, wanting to go in.","But it was the women's restroom, so they could only wait.","Qiao Chuchu's thoughts echoed again: [Hmph, last time I foresaw the future and discovered a murderer wanted to kill me, throw acid at me, and chop me into pieces. I mistook it for a hallucination, but after actually dying once, I realized it was real. This time, I'll take back everything I've lost!!!]","The three of them turned pale and pushed the door open!","They saw a black figure charging at Qiao Chuchu, holding a bottle of liquid: \"Die!\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her umbrella!","The liquid splashed onto the umbrella, instantly turning into a puddle of water!","The man was shocked: \"What?! You carry an umbrella indoors?!\"","Qiao Chuchu raised the umbrella above her head and smirked: \"You think I play games for nothing? My favorite character is Gongsun Li!\"","The man: \"?\"","She threw the umbrella and charged at him: \"Watch me unleash my ultimate move and kill you in one hit!!!\"","The man grabbed a cleaver and swung it at Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu lifted him over her head and slammed him into the wall!","The man's internal organs felt like they were crashing together, his face twisted in pain: \"Ah!\"","He was stunned.","How was she so strong?!?!?!","Qiao Chuchu, her eyes bloodshot, roared and pounced on him: \"I'll avenge the two times I was doused in acid and chopped into mincemeat!!!!\"","She grabbed his collar and threw him against the wall again!","Weisheng Huailing rushed forward and kicked the man!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci followed closely: \"You dare try to kill my sister?!\"","Pei Mu grabbed a porcelain object and smashed it against the man's head!","The porcelain shattered!","Pei Ci went into boxing mode, delivering a series of punches!","The man howled in pain!","Qiao Chuchu stood to the side, unable to join in: \"Move! Let me do it! Let me!\"","The two of them pushed her aside: \"How can we let you do it? Let us handle it!\"","She was furious: \"I said I'll do it!!\"","She flipped the two men over her shoulders!","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu, carrying the two men, delivered a powerful side kick to the murderer's face: \"Die!!!!\"","With a loud \"bang,\" the murderer's eyes rolled back, and he collapsed, unconscious.","Qiao Chuchu, still carrying Pei Mu and Pei Ci, spat: \"Trash!\"","Weisheng Huailing's mouth hung open, his eyes shining with admiration: \"Chuchu!\"","He was excited: \"You're amazing! You're so strong, so powerful! So cool!\"","Weisheng Huailing gave her a thumbs-up: \"I admire you so much!\"","Qiao Chuchu lazily glanced at him: \"You don't need to tell me. I know I'm cool.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing blinked, a bit flustered: \"Are you mad at me?\"","He gave her puppy eyes: \"Is it because I didn't believe you earlier?\"","Qiao Chuchu replied irritably: \"No, I'm just annoyed.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"...Annoyed with me?\"","She couldn't explain her frustration: \"I'm annoyed with this life of fighting and killing because I'm always the one getting beaten or killed!\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"!\"","Chuchu looked so fierce!","Qiao Chuchu, still carrying her two brothers, was drenched in sweat: \"Can I go to the guest room to shower?\"","Weisheng Huailing nodded eagerly: \"Go to my room. I'll handle this guy.\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head: \"No, I'll go to the guest room. I know the way.\"","She glanced at the man.","[After two encounters, I finally saw his face clearly. It's the eldest son of Old Lady Zhang.]","[The same old lady who said I had no manners when my brother was hospitalized.]","[My brother rejected his investment opportunity, so he probably came to take revenge on me.]","[What a coward, coming after me for revenge?!]","She carried Pei Ci and Pei Mu away energetically: \"I'll be back after I shower.\"","[Weisheng Huailing can handle this. He's capable and skilled. He'll take care of it.]","Weisheng Huailing: \"...\"","This was the first time Qiao Chuchu had complimented him on something other than his looks.","Weisheng Huailing felt a warmth in his chest and couldn't help but press his hand against his rapidly beating heart, unsure of what this emotion was.","But his lips curved into a faint smile, and his eyes sparkled with a happiness he didn't even realize.","-","Qiao Chuchu threw Pei Mu and Pei Ci onto the bed!","The two of them, dressed in identical suits, bounced on the bed and huddled together, looking at her warily: \"What are you doing?\"","She undid her skirt and said indifferently: \"Taking a shower.\"","Her skirt slid to the floor.","The two brothers froze, their eyes widening.","Qiao Chuchu's skirt fell, revealing her black tank top and thick thermal pants rolled up to her calves.","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","She turned and entered the bathroom. Less than ten minutes later, she came out wearing a bathrobe, her face bare, her hair wet, and sat at the vanity.","The guest room in the Weisheng household was fully equipped.","She picked up the hairdryer and, through the mirror, looked at the two men still sitting on the bed: \"Dry my hair. I need to do my makeup. I'm running out of time.\"","Pei Ci: \"? You want me to dry your hair?\"","Qiao Chuchu retorted: \"You two don't want to?\"","They exchanged glances, but before they could speak, Qiao Chuchu started drying her hair herself: \"Then leave. I don't need you.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored their stares and coldly dried her hair: [The system must be messing with me. There's no way these two would commit suicide for me after I died. They usually can't stand me. How could they die for me? Ridiculous.]","Suddenly, the hairdryer was snatched from her hand.","Pei Ci stood behind her, his face stern as he dried her hair.","Pei Mu turned her chair around and picked up the makeup samples on the table to apply her makeup.","Qiao Chuchu frowned in confusion, annoyed: \"I don't need you two. Get out.\"","Pei Ci's eyes darkened, and he turned off the hairdryer: \"Is that how you talk to your brothers?\"","Pei Mu, while wiping her face, gave her a sinister smile: \"Has Chuchu forgotten the punishment game that only the three of us share?\""]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: What Happened on the Day of the Breakup","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu, clad in a bathrobe, leaned back against the chair.","Pei Mu held her face in one hand, his smile not quite reaching his eyes.","Pei Ci came up from behind, placing his hands on her shoulders.","Pei Ci's low, magnetic voice echoed in her ear: \"It's been seven years since we last had a proper conversation. Surely, you haven't forgotten the little secret that belongs only to the three of us, have you, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't answer, her gaze shifting to the mirror.","Pei Mu's pale hand gently cupped her face, while Pei Ci leaned in from behind, resting his head on her shoulder.","She was sandwiched between the two of them.","The twins shared identical faces, even the placement of their moles was perfectly mirrored.","They were tall, standing at six-foot-three, though not as burly as Pei Youchuan. Instead, they were lean and elegant, with an air of effortless confidence.","Their features bore some resemblance to Pei Che, but unlike Pei Che's aloof, untouchable demeanor, they exuded a rebellious arrogance, tempered only by the sharp lines of their tailored suits.","They were like heaven-sent replicas.","She stared, entranced.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci also looked at her through the mirror.","Pei Ci bent down, his face pressing against hers from behind: \"What are you thinking about?\"","Pei Mu leaned in from the side, his face brushing against her other cheek.","Qiao Chuchu murmured, dazed: \"I'm thinking that you two are a pair of impeccably dressed wolves in sheep's clothing.\"","The two of them blinked in surprise, but instead of getting angry, they laughed.","Pei Mu studied her features carefully, a hint of nostalgia in his voice: \"Time flies. You've grown up so much, from a naive little girl to a full-grown woman.\"","Pei Ci's eyes swept over her: \"Your skin is so fair, so clean, so tender.\"","\"Why are you commenting on that?\" Qiao Chuchu crossed her legs, her tone sharp: \"Are you two planning to take a bite out of me?\"","They smirked mischievously, speaking in unison: \"Maybe we are.\"","She tilted her head back in irritation, resting against the chair, exposing her pale neck: \"You two are like a pair of annoying flies when you're together. Get out, I'm tired.\"","Pei Ci and Pei Mu's eyes darkened, but they didn't move.","Pei Mu bit his lip hesitantly, his gaze lingering on her neck: \"Were you scared earlier?\"","She closed her eyes: \"Of what?\"","\"When that man was chasing you.\" Pei Mu reached out, lightly tapping her neck: \"Were you scared? Did you think of us? Did you hate us?\"","Qiao Chuchu paused, then laughed: \"You've never been hunted down before, have you, Sixth Brother?\"","Pei Mu frowned.","She glanced at him sideways: \"I only had a minute to survive. In that moment, all I could think about was fear. My body reacted on pure instinct.\"","[When the sulfuric acid splashed on my face, it wasn't just fear—it was despair.]","[Because I knew I was disfigured.]","[Not just disfigured, but blinded, with my hands chopped off. My body was like meat on a butcher's block, dying in the ugliest way possible. Even the memory makes me sick.]","But—","She looked at the two of them in the mirror: \"What would you do if you saw my corpse?\"","[Would you really die with me, like the system said? Or was the system just lying to me?]","Pei Mu and Pei Ci didn't look at the mirror, their eyes still fixed on her neck.","Qiao Chuchu waited for a minute, but no answer came. She smiled bitterly: \"You two can leave now.\"","[I really am a fool. I believed everything the system said. Our relationship is so strained—why would they follow me in death?]","Pei Ci: \"I would.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"What?\"","Pei Ci was lost in thought, his fingers lightly tapping her neck, then her cheek, unconsciously leaning closer to her.","Qiao Chuchu turned her face to his.","His lips nearly brushed against hers.","Pei Ci froze.","Qiao Chuchu's irritation was momentarily replaced by curiosity, her expression reverting to its former innocence: \"Why?\"","Pei Ci's gaze lifted, locking onto her eyes: \"Because you believe in ghosts and spirits. If you were really killed, as a ghost, you'd need someone to help you.\"","She laughed incredulously: \"The existence of ghosts is unknown.\"","\"I know.\" Pei Ci said: \"But your death is certain.\"","Qiao Chuchu's breath hitched, even more confused: \"But you and Sixth Brother clearly hate me—\"","\"Can't we hate you and still care about you?\" Pei Mu chuckled from the side: \"Besides, maybe we've all been influenced by you.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him, puzzled.","Pei Mu took her hand, his tone meaningful: \"Like what you said that day at the karaoke.\"","Qiao Chuchu racked her brain but came up empty: \"I can't remember. Care to give me a hint?\"","Pei Mu smiled gently, changing the subject: \"We're running out of time. Let me do your makeup.\"","Pei Ci picked up the hairdryer, standing behind her to blow-dry her hair, clearly unwilling to say more.","Qiao Chuchu looked at the two of them in the mirror and sighed.","[The rift between us is so deep. If they have any secrets, they definitely won't share them with me. Better not to ask.]","Pei Mu and Pei Ci went about their tasks, showing no reaction.","But their minds drifted back to that New Year's Eve when they had completely fallen out with Qiao Chuchu.","That night, she wore a beautiful short dress, tears streaming down her face as she clung to Pei Yuan's arm: \"Big Brother, I don't want you to get married. I don't want you to fall in love with someone else. If one day all of you get married, leaving me all alone, how am I supposed to handle that?\"","Pei Yuan's face was stern, but he patiently explained: \"I've told you before, I won't get married.\"","She pleaded desperately: \"Then be with me, okay? I'll do anything, I'll agree to anything. Please, Big Brother, please!\"","Pei Yuan: \"...You're too young, Chuchu. You're not mature enough. You don't understand what love is. You're confusing familial affection with romantic love. When you grow up, you'll regret this.\"","He gritted his teeth, restraining himself: \"We can't ruin you just because you don't understand.\"","Qiao Chuchu screamed: \"I won't! I really won't regret it! I love you all!\"","Pei Che grabbed her and pulled her aside: \"Qiao Chuchu, can you control yourself? Do you even know what you're saying?!\"","Qiao Chuchu, tears streaming down her face, broke free from Pei Che's grip: \"I just don't want to be your sister anymore, that's why I'm saying this. I'm almost an adult! Once I'm an adult, we can be together, and no one will dare say anything about the Pei family!\"","Pei Che was stunned: \"You think we're worried about what outsiders will say? Do you realize what kind of chaos you're trying to bring to this family? Picking one of us would be bad enough, but you want all seven! You're still so young—do you have any idea what the consequences would be?!\"","She argued fiercely, her face flushed: \"I want all seven! Not one less!\"","Pei Fengnong couldn't take it anymore and slammed his cup on the ground!","\"Qiao Chuchu, do you have to ruin New Year's like this?!\"","He roared: \"Then I'll just go get married!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed a cup and hurled it at his head: \"If you dare get married, I'll hang myself at your wedding!!!\"","Pei Fengnong was left with a bleeding gash on his forehead, blood trickling down his face as he pressed his lips together in silence.","Pei Youchuan, shocked, yelled at Qiao Chuchu: \"Have you lost your mind?! Are you acting out again? How dare you hit your own brother?!\"","Qiao Chuchu stood her ground against all seven of them, her tone unyielding: \"I'm not acting out. I'm being rational. I'm just trying to talk to you!\"","\"Are you even men?!\"","Her tears fell like rain, her face a mix of pain and defiance: \"I'm like this, and none of you feel anything? Not even a little attraction? Not even a hint of desire?!\"","Pei Buxian sat curled up on the couch, clutching a pillow, his eyes red as he watched Qiao Chuchu.","He buried half his face in the pillow, silent.","Pei Mu looked around, exhaustion written all over his face: \"Qiao Chuchu, if you keep this up, let's not spend New Year's together anymore.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to him.","He avoided her gaze, staring at the ground, his voice heavy with weariness: \"I don't want to spend every New Year's arguing with you. It's too exhausting.\"","Pei Ci stood beside him, looking at Qiao Chuchu but saying nothing.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly let out a cold laugh: \"You think I enjoy spending New Year's with a bunch of cowards like you?\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Qiao Chuchu's Birthday Wish for Her Coming-of-Age Ceremony Is——","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu jumped onto the table, grabbed the eight-person family portrait hanging on the wall, and smashed it onto the ground with all her might!","The sound of shattering glass made everyone shudder!","Qiao Chuchu leaped down from the table, pulled out a lighter, and set fire to her own image in the photo.","Her smiling face in the photo gradually cracked and burned into a large hole.","Just as the flames were about to reach the others, Qiao Chuchu stomped out the fire and glanced at them indifferently: \"I am no longer a member of the Pei Family.\"","She walked past them: \"Congratulations, you've won.\"","They stared at the family portrait with the missing piece, their faces pale and silent.","The air was filled with intermittent sobs.","Pei Mu suddenly felt a wave of regret, a dense, suffocating sensation crawling up his back like invisible little demons, pressing down on him until he could barely breathe.","A few years later, on the day Qiao Chuchu came of age, someone suddenly told them—","\"Did you know? Your sister went all out for her birthday, hiring seven handsome guys to accompany her at a KTV.\"","Pei Mu and his brothers rushed over, only to find Qiao Chuchu alone, eating fruit, while the seven men sat awkwardly on the sofa, maintaining a distance of five seats between themselves and her, looking embarrassed as they glanced over.","The room was dimly lit, with only the glow from the KTV screen and Qiao Chuchu's birthday candles illuminating the space.","He couldn't help but notice that the other six brothers breathed a sigh of relief.","Qiao Chuchu smiled like a succubus, playfully glancing at her watch: \"Ten minutes, huh?~\"","Her tone was childishly mischievous: \"I only spread the news for ten minutes, and you all came. You really do care about me, don't you?~\"","In the dimly lit private room, Qiao Chuchu looked at them as if they were prey in her bowl: \"Brothers, just keep holding back. One day, you won't be able to resist crossing that line. And by then, maybe I won't like you anymore, and you'll regret not seizing this opportunity.\"","She picked up the burning candle, blew it out gently, and smiled with confidence.","\"For this birthday wish, I'll wish that you'll regret it someday.\"","Pei Mu snapped out of his memories and put down the lipstick he was applying to her: \"Done.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at herself in the mirror.","She looked exquisite.","The makeup was lighter than what a professional would do, but it highlighted all her best features.","Her hair had also been neatly styled by Pei Ci, looking no different from when she arrived.","She couldn't help but marvel: *Wow, they're amazing!*","*They must have learned how to do my makeup and hair back then. Even after all these years without practice, they're still so skilled.*","*They're truly brilliant—never losing their touch!*","Qiao Chuchu went to the bathroom to change back into her dress, then casually picked up her phone and sent them both red packets: \"Here, a tip.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci's lips twitched, their brows furrowing in annoyance.","Pei Ci tugged at her hair: \"Get lost.\"","Pei Mu reached for her eyelashes, threatening half-heartedly: \"I'll rip off your false lashes.\"","Qiao Chuchu smoothly dodged between them, picking up the trash on the table: \"Thanks for your help. I'll clean up the room now.\"","After all, it was someone else's guest room. Even though they had lent it to her, she felt obligated to tidy up.","She also made a mental note to ask Little Xie to replace the sample cosmetics she had used.","Pei Mu looked displeased: \"We're here. You don't need to clean up. Go on, we'll handle it.\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled faintly, a slightly eerie look in her eyes: \"No need.\"","Pei Ci raised an eyebrow fiercely: \"You dare say no?!\"","She stood up: \"You two don't get to decide.\"","She picked them both up and tossed them out the door, slamming it shut with a loud \"Bang!\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Wait, since when did she have such strength?","Carrying them around like they were kids!","The two exchanged bewildered glances, their faces filled with absurdity, before suddenly bursting into laughter.","A sense of indescribable relief washed over them, and they spoke in unison: \"It's so good to be alive with Qiao Chuchu.\"","As long as they were alive, anything was possible.","They opened the door and walked back in: \"Let's clean up together, Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned around, puzzled.","They grinned mischievously at her, speaking in unison: \"Without us, a pampered young lady like you who never does housework would be exhausted.\"","Pei Ci teased: \"In other words, without us, what would you do? You wouldn't survive.\"","Qiao Chuchu retorted sharply: \"I think it's you two who wouldn't survive without me. Stop flattering yourselves.\"","Their smiles deepened, but they didn't deny it, grabbing the mop from her and starting to clean.","In less than five minutes, the three of them had the guest room spotless.","Just then, Weisheng Huailing knocked on the door.","He came in cheerfully to report to Qiao Chuchu, gesturing happily: *\"I've taken care of it. I've also investigated that person's identity, but he's still unconscious. I've got security watching him. You can deal with him after the banquet.\"*","Qiao Chuchu smiled gratefully: *\"Thank you.\"*","Huailing shook his head, noticing something different about her: *\"Did you take a shower?\"*","Qiao Chuchu nodded: *\"Yes, I couldn't stand the sweat anymore. Don't worry, I'll replace the cosmetics I used, and I've already cleaned the room. If you're concerned, you can disinfect it again.\"*","Huailing frowned: *\"Why would you say that? Do you think I'd mind? You don't need to return the cosmetics. They're there for guests anyway.\"*","He glanced cautiously at Pei Mu and Pei Ci standing beside her: *\"When you showered, were your brothers here too?\"*","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback: *\"They weren't watching me shower.\"*","Huailing: *\"I know that.\"*","He looked at the brothers, his gaze sharpening: *\"But the guest room isn't very big. They should have stepped out while you were showering.\"*","Pei Ci: \"? What's he gesturing about?\"","Qiao Chuchu scratched her head: \"He said you two should have stepped out while I was showering since the room is small.\"","Pei Ci and Pei Mu exchanged glances, smirking, and picked up their phones, speaking in unison: \"Huailing, let's add each other as friends, huh?\"","Huailing pouted, reluctantly scanning the QR codes.","The twins exchanged a knowing smile, quickly adding Huailing to a group chat.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Huailing's phone buzzed.","He opened it.","Pei Ci: *\"Qiao Chuchu came to our family when she was three. I even used to tuck her in at night!\"*","Pei Mu: *\"When she was little, she would throw a tantrum unless we slept on either side of her.\"*","Weisheng Huailing's face turned green as he typed furiously: *\"But that was when she was a child. Now that she's grown up, you should keep your distance.\"*","Pei Ci: *\"Why should we?\"*","Pei Mu: *\"Why should we?\"*","Huailing: *\"? You're her brothers! Even I stay far away when my sister showers!\"*","Pei Mu and Pei Ci: *\"Yours is a blood sister.\"*","Weisheng Huailing: *\"?\"*","The two replied in unison: *\"Ours isn't.\"*","Weisheng Huailing was thunderstruck!","His eyes widened as he stared at the two across from him.","Qiao Chuchu sensed the tension and tried to peek at Pei Mu and Pei Ci's phones: \"What are you talking about? Why does he look so upset? Did you two bully him again?\"","These two were always up to no good when they were together.","Pei Mu smiled and put away his phone: \"No idea. Maybe he ate something bad.\"","Pei Ci also put away his phone, grabbing Qiao Chuchu's hand: \"Let's go. The others are about to arrive.\"","Qiao Chuchu was dragged away by the brothers.","Huailing remained frozen in place, belatedly recalling what Yu Can had told him earlier.","The Pei brothers were not allies he could blend into.","They were all enemies!!"]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Qiao Chuchu: Tired of This Life of Fighting and Killing, Because It's Always Me Who Gets Beaten or Killed","paragraphs":["Pei Ci had his hands in his pockets, feeling an indescribable sense of joy. \"Qiao Chuchu, it's been a while since the three of us have spent time together so peacefully. Why don't we do this more often?\"","Pei Mu spoke softly, \"Yeah, even though you embarrassed us in front of the clients, I still think the three of us are best together.\"","Qiao Chuchu replied coldly, \"No.\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","They spoke in unison, \"Why not? You used to love clinging to us.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at them indifferently, \"That was in the past. Back then, I had some inappropriate thoughts about the two of you. Now, I don’t.\"","The two frowned, displeased. \"Then how did you see us back then?\"","She answered expressionlessly, \"Like two handsome guys who looked delicious.\"","Their faces turned red, and they spoke in unison again, \"And now?\"","Qiao Chuchu remained impassive, \"Like two dead fish lying belly-up at a fish stall.\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Ci: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu lifted her skirt and walked toward the banquet hall.","[Back then, I had to pretend to like them for the mission. Now that the mission is over, I can be my true self. No feelings mean no feelings.]","Pei Mu: \"...\"","Pei Ci: \"...\"","Weisheng Huailing, who had been storming over, brightened upon hearing this and stood between the two of them.","His previously green complexion had returned to a healthy glow, and he even began to look delighted.","So, Qiao Chuchu had no feelings for them after all!","Hehehe!~","Pei Mu and Pei Ci, seeing his smug grin, suddenly felt a surge of anger.","How dare Qiao Chuchu speak to them like that?","She never used to act this way, nor was she this strong. Now, she seemed entirely different.","Qiao Chuchu irritably rubbed her neck. [The system was right. After taking that strength pill, I really do feel irritable. Everything annoys me now.]","She glanced around. [But this banquet is just the beginning. Xia Xuechun is still here following the plot. After Weisheng Biehe meets Xia Xuechun, it'll be Pei Mu and Pei Ci's turn.]","[However... should I interfere with this part of the plot? Xia Xuechun has already gotten close to my seven brothers while working part-time here. Later, when she gets harassed, Pei Mu and Pei Ci will step in to defend her.]","[After defending her, they'll take her out the next day to cheer her up.]","[The three of them will be so happy together.]","Huailing, hearing this, felt even more pleased and gave the twins a fake smile.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci looked as if they had swallowed a fly.","Even if Xia Xuechun got harassed, they definitely wouldn’t intervene.","At most, they’d call security.","And take her out for fun?","Ridiculous!","Pei Ci and Pei Mu's phones buzzed.","They both picked up their phones and saw a message from Pei Buxian in the group chat: 「We’ve arrived.」","A few female guests pretended to casually walk toward the entrance, whispering, \"Hurry, hurry! The handsome guys from the Pei Family are here!\"","\"The handsome father and son from the Lou Family are here too!\"","\"Lin Qing and Lin Shen, the siblings, are also here! This banquet is truly a gathering of the elite. Only the Wei Sheng Family could invite so many prominent families. Such prestige!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked out and saw a vast estate with a long red carpet. Pei Yuan stood in the center, flanked by his brothers, all striding toward the estate with their long legs.","Weisheng Yucan, holding her skirt, walked out of the banquet hall with her brothers and watched the group approaching on the red carpet.","The bright lights illuminated their late arrival.","Weisheng Yucan tightened her fur coat and smiled. \"Our esteemed guests from the Wei Sheng Family have arrived. Tell the kitchen to start serving dinner.\"","Pei Yuan glanced over and noticed Qiao Chuchu standing on the stairs, lost in thought. His eyes lit up.","Qiao Chuchu lazily leaned on the railing, exuding an air of indifference that was particularly captivating.","\"Is it just me?\" Pei Youchuan's lips curled slightly. \"Does Qiao Chuchu seem a bit different?\"","Pei Che glanced over and narrowed his eyes. \"She does seem a little off.\"","Pei Buxian, holding his West Highland Terrier, said curiously, \"She seems a bit fierce.\"","Pei Fengnong said seriously, \"That can’t be. Qiao Chuchu isn’t the type to be fierce.\"","Lin Shen's gaze was fixed on Qiao Chuchu. \"No, she’s definitely in a bad mood.\"","Lin Qing was surprised. \"She can be in a bad mood? I thought she was always cheerful.\"","Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue looked over simultaneously.","Lou Yuejue was intrigued. \"Dad, I wonder what it’s like when big sister is in a bad mood.\"","Lou Tingsi shook his head with a smile. \"She probably won’t be too fierce.\"","Suddenly, their phones buzzed.","Lou Yuejue picked up his phone and saw a message from Pei Ci in the group: 「Just a heads up, Qiao Chuchu is in a really bad mood right now. She’s fierce and irritable, probably because of some system medication. Don’t treat her as usual.」","Lou Yuejue put his phone away and reminded everyone, \"Pei Ci said that big sister took some medicine, so she’s really fierce right now. We shouldn’t treat her as usual.\"","Pei Youchuan chuckled. \"How fierce can Qiao Chuchu be? She’s still the one I can toss around in my wok.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood on the stairs and heard a low cry from a corner: \"Don’t touch me!\"","A man sneered, \"It’s fine, just a little fun. I’ll give you ten thousand for it, okay?\"","Xia Xuechun let out a whimper, \"Let go—ah!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s temper flared, and she walked toward the source of the noise.","Weisheng Biehe noticed her, his cold expression softening. \"Miss Qiao.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at her calmly.","Weisheng Yucan also smiled warmly. \"Chuchu.\"","Weisheng Lin snorted, \"Wow, you’re all so enthusiastic about her.\"","But Qiao Chuchu walked right past them.","They were stunned.","She reached the back of the stairs. \"What’s going on here?\"","Xia Xuechun was being held in the man’s arms, terrified. Seeing Qiao Chuchu, her fear subsided slightly. \"Save me!\"","The man, his face pressed close to Xia Xuechun’s, was fumbling with her buttons. He froze when he saw Qiao Chuchu and hurriedly said, \"Mind your own business! We’re doing this willingly!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his collar, dragged him to the door, and threw him out!","The man tumbled down the stairs outside!","Everyone stared at Qiao Chuchu in shock.","She stood in the cold wind, looking down at the man with disdain. \"What if I do mind my own business? If you’ve got the guts, come fight me.\"","The man’s head spun as he looked around at the crowd. Humiliated and furious, he charged at Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu grabbed his belt, lifted him effortlessly over her head, and flung him like a javelin!","The man landed face-first on the ground with a thud. \"Ah!\"","The guests gasped, covering their mouths. \"Holy cow!!!\"","Weisheng Lin’s eyes widened in shock and delight. \"Holy crap! Qiao Chuchu is a freaking Hercules!!\"","He burst into laughter, looking happily at his family. \"Why didn’t anyone tell me she had this kind of strength? Hahaha!~\""]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Competing for favor is sometimes not about striving to be pampered, but about striving to pamper her.","paragraphs":["The members of the Wei Sheng Family exchanged glances.","Not only was Weisheng Lin unaware of Qiao Chuchu's capabilities, but even the Pei Family had no idea she possessed such strength!","If they had known, they wouldn't have been left with their jaws on the floor!","Pei Buxian rubbed his eyes in disbelief, muttering, \"Am I seeing things? Did Qiao Chuchu just turn into a shot-putter?\"","Pei Youchuan stood there, mouth half-open, utterly stunned. \"Throwing a full-grown man is way harder than tossing a shot put.\"","Pei Fengnong glanced at the man rolling on the ground and sneered, \"Serves him right.\"","The man cursed as he got up, yelling at Qiao Chuchu, \"You broke my arm! What are you going to do about it?!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan shot a sharp look at the bodyguards.","Several bodyguards stepped forward, grabbed the man by both arms, and dragged him out of the room.","The man struggled and shouted, \"Don't make me leave! She's the one who hit me! I didn't do anything wrong! Let me go! Let me go!\"","His voice faded into the distance, disappearing around the corner.","Weisheng Wenzhan walked straight up to Qiao Chuchu, his voice low. \"I apologize. I didn't expect him to have such poor tolerance and manners. A little champagne and he lost control. Are you alright?\"","She nodded gratefully. \"I'm fine, thank you.\"","Weisheng Yucan smiled charmingly and complimented, \"Chuchu, you were so strong today! Have you been secretly hitting the gym?\"","Weisheng Biehe raised an eyebrow teasingly. \"Why didn't you show this kind of strength earlier?\"","Huai Ling happily signed, 「Chuchu, you're amazing!」","Pei Yuan walked over to Qiao Chuchu, turning her around to inspect her. \"Are you hurt?\"","She was about to shake her head when Pei Che pulled her to the other side. \"Let me see.\"","Weisheng Lin, who had been about to greet her with his hand raised: \"?\"","Wait, does Qiao Chuchu have this many people around her?","He hadn't even said a word, and she was already being pulled away.","Pei Fengnong grabbed Qiao Chuchu's arm. \"That man looked like he weighed at least 220 pounds. Are you sure you're not hurt?\"","Pei Youchuan stood on her other side, teasing her. \"Wow, Qiao Chuchu, you just tossed a 220-pound man like it was nothing. What kind of magic potion did you drink? Share some with your big brother!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci pushed the two of them aside, each taking one of Qiao Chuchu's arms. They spoke in unison, \"Can you two stop crowding her? You're grown men; learn to be independent instead of clinging to your little sister, okay?\"","Pei Buxian walked up to them, expressionless, holding his West Highland Terrier.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci looked at him, confused.","Pei Buxian shoved the dog into Pei Ci's arms!","Pei Ci: \"! What are you doing?!\"","Pei Buxian coldly pulled Qiao Chuchu away. \"I'm trading.\"","Pei Ci's mouth twitched as he held the dog, disgusted. \"You're trading this mangy dog for Qiao Chuchu?\"","Pei Buxian's face darkened. \"Our Westie is not mangy! I gave her a bath before we came, and she's even wearing a diaper!\"","Pei Ci noticed the diaper and immediately handed the dog to Pei Mu. \"Ew!\"","Pei Mu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian stood next to Qiao Chuchu, scrutinizing her. \"You didn't look like this when we left. Did you change your makeup?\"","Lou Yuejue stood below Qiao Chuchu, looking up at her with a smile. \"Sister, let's sit together later.\"","Lou Tingsi stood beside Lou Yuejue, grinning like a sly fox. \"Yes, let's sit together, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at the crowd surrounding her, feeling more and more irritated.","【I just want some peace and quiet.】","【Ever since I was almost killed earlier, I haven't had a moment of peace. On top of that, I've experienced the pain of dying twice—once in a vision and once for real. I'm so tired.】","Everyone suddenly tensed up.","The Wei Sheng Family members turned to Weisheng Huailing.","Weisheng Biehe's expression darkened as he signed, 「Weren't you with her? How could she have been killed? What were you doing? How could you let this happen?」","Weisheng Huailing: \"...\"","Meanwhile, the Pei, Lin, and Lou families all glared at Pei Mu and Pei Ci.","What happened?!","How could two people not keep an eye on one person?!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci hung their heads in shame.","Huai Ling signed, 「Qiao Chuchu was attacked in the women's restroom. We heard the noise and went in to help, only to find out she had already died once.」","Weisheng Yucan was furious. 「But you didn't protect her the first time, did you? Do you think her death was meaningless? How could something like this happen on our turf? You've made me lose face!」","Huai Ling didn't argue, just hung his head in silence, knowing he had failed.","He had no excuses.","Weisheng Wenzhan's expression was grim. 「Take us to see the person who hurt her.」","Weisheng Huailing nodded.","On the other side, Pei Yuan also spoke directly to his younger brothers. \"Take us to see the culprit.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci mumbled, \"Weisheng Huailing locked him up. Let's go find him.\"","Everyone turned their attention to Weisheng Huailing.","Huai Ling noticed their gazes and understood. He gestured for them to follow.","「This way.」","Lin Qing took Qiao Chuchu by the waist, gently coaxing her. \"Chuchu, why don't you head into the banquet hall first? We have some things to take care of.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave her a tired look and nodded.","She looked even more drained than when she had arrived.","Lin Shen took off his coat and draped it over her shoulders.","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in surprise.","Lin Shen took a step back, his handsome face showing restrained concern. \"Don't catch a cold.\"","The others' expressions shifted slightly.","Pei Buxian immediately took off his own coat, draped it over Qiao Chuchu, and handed Lin Shen's coat back. \"Chuchu, don't catch a cold.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Fengnong stepped forward, took off Pei Buxian's coat, draped his own over Qiao Chuchu, and returned Pei Buxian's coat. \"Wear mine. Don't catch a cold.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Pei Youchuan shoved Pei Fengnong's coat back into his hands and took off his own to drape over Qiao Chuchu. \"Don't wear your fourth brother's coat. He's too frail. Wear mine. Don't catch a cold.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\"","The guests: \"????? Is the eighth daughter of the Pei Family really this popular?\"","Pei Che and Pei Yuan glanced at the stunned guests on either side and sighed, pinching the bridges of their noses.","Couldn't they have fought somewhere less public?","Weisheng Huailing, tense, quickly joined the fray!","He took off his coat, returned Pei Youchuan's, and draped his own over Qiao Chuchu. 「Chuchu, don't catch a cold.」","Pei Buxian glared at Weisheng Huailing. \"What does our sister's health have to do with you?\"","He tossed Huai Ling's coat back and draped his own over Qiao Chuchu again. \"Don't wear someone else's coat. Don't catch a cold!\"","Pei Fengnong stepped forward, grabbed the coat, shoved it back into Pei Buxian's hands, and draped his own over Qiao Chuchu. \"Wear mine.\"","\"Are we going in circles now?!\" Pei Youchuan tossed Pei Fengnong's coat aside and draped his own over Qiao Chuchu. \"Don't catch a cold!!!\"","Weisheng Yucan had had enough. She yanked Pei Youchuan's coat off and draped her own fur shawl over Qiao Chuchu. \"There, is this good enough? I'm a woman. My coat is on her. Can we stop now?\""]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Qiao Chuchu: Perhaps I Can Turn Xia Xuechun to My Side","paragraphs":["Everyone froze, and the farce finally came to an end.","Weisheng Yucan cast a disdainful glance at each of them: \"You can even fight over this? Is this the main point right now?\"","Lin Qing couldn't help but laugh, crossing her arms as she teased from the side: \"Exactly. And with all this changing of clothes, even if you didn’t catch a cold before, you’re going to now. Who’s going to hand Qiao Chuchu water then? Are you all going to line up and fight over who gets to do it?\"","Lou Yuejue thought for a moment, then smiled smugly: \"By the time my sister gets her hands on one, it’ll be snatched away, and the water will be cold. She won’t even get to take her medicine.\"","He turned to his father: \"Our family is different, though.\"","Lou Tingsi smiled gently at his son and handed a pair of hand warmers to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu accepted them in surprise: \"Thank you.\"","Lou Tingsi smiled warmly: \"You’re welcome.\"","Lou Yuejue lifted his chin, full of pride: \"We, father and son, came prepared.\"","Everyone else: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","For some reason, she felt her headache growing worse.","Her face pale, she walked into the banquet hall: \"I’m going to get some hot water. Do as you please.\"","【Do whatever you want, just don’t come looking for me. I want some peace and quiet.】","Huai Ling watched Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure, then turned to Weisheng Lin in confusion: \"Who’s 'Jing Jing'?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"It’s me.\"","Weisheng Huai Ling: \"?\"","Xia Xuechun stood in the corner, her expression dim as she watched their backs.","Who remembered that the man had come to bully her, that this whole mess had started because of her?","Yet, it was Qiao Chuchu, who had driven the man away, who ended up being showered with attention.","Meanwhile, she didn’t even have a single person to care for her.","Qi Xiaojia, who had just finished her work, hurried over to Xia Xuechun’s side. Seeing the employers nearby, she didn’t dare make a scene and quickly pulled Xia Xuechun to a secluded spot: \"Xuechun, are you okay? Are you hurt?\"","Xia Xuechun was sullen, the scene from earlier still vivid in her mind. She answered irrelevantly: \"Xiaojia, I’ve been having dreams lately. In them, Qiao Chuchu dies, and all the people who love her start loving me instead. It feels so real.\"","Qi Xiaojia frowned: \"Could it be that you’re just too envious of her?\"","\"I don’t know,\" Xia Xuechun said, feeling as though a heavy stone was pressing on her chest. \"Every day when I wake up, it takes me a while to come back to reality. In my dreams, I have everything I want, but in reality, I have nothing.\"","Qi Xiaojia fell silent, looking at her as though she were a mental patient: \"Then from now on, let’s stay away from anything involving Qiao Chuchu. You’re starting to act strange.\"","Xia Xuechun looked at her in confusion: \"Am I the one who’s not normal?\"","Qi Xiaojia nodded gravely: \"Yes, so starting today, let’s both focus on finding jobs. Even though it’s tough out there, we’ll manage.\"","Xia Xuechun bit her lip, still unwilling to accept it: \"But Qiao Chuchu makes at least 200,000 a month. Are we just supposed to settle for a mediocre life?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"? Why are you comparing yourself to Qiao Chuchu? We’re in different fields.\"","Xia Xuechun argued: \"But Qiao Chuchu bought her degrees! How is she better than us? If I tried drawing comics, I’m sure I’d do better than her!\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"...I’ve always been a fan of Qiao Chuchu’s comics. I’ve read every one of them. Her art is exquisite, her pacing is tight, and she never misses a deadline. It’s no wonder her comics are so popular. The adaptation into a drama was a hit too. If you want to compete with her, you’ll need at least a year or two more of practice.\"","Xia Xuechun grew angrier the more she listened: \"Are you siding with Qiao Chuchu now?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"? I’m just being honest. She’s definitely annoying, but her work ethic is solid. We can’t compare to her!\"","\"What can’t you compare to me about?\" Qiao Chuchu walked up behind them, having overheard the last part, and raised an eyebrow in suspicion.","Qi Xiaojia looked at her awkwardly: \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu was a bit surprised.","Did this girl get a personality transplant?","Since when does she call me \"Miss Qiao\"?","She teased: \"Oh? What’s with the sudden politeness today?\"","Qi Xiaojia awkwardly scratched the back of her head: \"I’ve learned my lesson, heh.\"","She had caused Aunt Wang to lose her job, and Aunt Wang had been giving her trouble ever since. With her parents’ medical bills piling up, she no longer had the energy to fight with Qiao Chuchu.","Now, she only dared to talk smack behind her back.","Qi Xiaojia glanced at Xia Xuechun, worried she might cause trouble, and shielded her: \"Do you need something? I can go get it for you.\"","\"No need,\" Qiao Chuchu said succinctly. \"I was actually going to offer you two a job.\"","Qi Xiaojia was shocked: \"A job?!\"","Xia Xuechun was skeptical: \"A job?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded.","After the sulfuric acid incident, she realized that she might face even more hardships in the future.","Even though she survived, she had lost one of her lives. Who knows what other crazy attacks she might face?","After some thought, she decided the best way to protect herself was to win Xia Xuechun over and make her an ally.","Xia Xuechun was unemployed, relying on odd jobs to make ends meet.","Of course, if it weren’t for this, Xia Xuechun wouldn’t have met Ji Yanchuan and the others, so this setup made sense.","But if she could secure Xia Xuechun in a stable position, Xia Xuechun wouldn’t keep triggering plotlines, and Qiao Chuchu could coast to the end of the story.","She didn’t really want to do this, but it seemed like the only way to avoid running around dealing with plotlines.","After all, Xia Xuechun had the protagonist’s halo. Killing her was out of the question.","Qiao Chuchu spoke to them kindly: \"I had someone look into your backgrounds. Honestly, among all the highly qualified candidates, you two don’t stand out much. So, I can guarantee that the offer I’m making is the highest you’ll get from any company.\"","After all, her family owned many businesses, so she could easily find a suitable position for them. She could even supplement their salaries from her own savings as a kind of insurance fee. Once the story reached its conclusion, she wouldn’t have to worry about them anymore.","Qi Xiaojia was visibly tempted, fidgeting with her hands: \"How much are we talking?\"","Qiao Chuchu spoke calmly: \"The probation period salary is 80% of the full salary, so 40,000. After probation, it’s 50,000. The year-end bonus is at least 500,000. The contract is for two years. After that, depending on your performance, you can stay or leave. Does that work for you?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"!!!!\"","What?!","40,000 during probation?!","Her last job only offered 10,000 after probation!","She was so excited she almost jumped, turning to Xia Xuechun in delight: \"This is amazing, Xuechun! This salary is higher than any job I’ve ever had!\"","It was like manna from heaven!","Qi Xiaojia double-checked: \"Can I have a lawyer look over the contract?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded: \"Of course. You can sign after you’re sure it’s safe.\"","Qi Xiaojia let out a low squeal, overjoyed: \"This is perfect! Xuechun, let’s take it!\"","But Xia Xuechun let out a cold laugh: \"Qiao Chuchu, you make 200,000 a month, and you’re offering us 50,000? Are you treating us like beggars?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\""]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Meeting the Dragon King","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu thought she had misheard, and retorted in shock: \"What does this have to do with my monthly income? Your abilities aren't great, and your resumes aren't impressive either. There are plenty of people more talented than you two. The amount I'm offering is already giving you face, don't you think?\"","Qi Xiaojia quickly tried to appease her, smoothing her arm: \"You're absolutely giving us face, Miss Qiao. Please don't be angry. Let me talk some sense into my friend.\"","She tugged at Xia Xuechun's sleeve, lowering her voice and speaking earnestly: \"Xuechun, let's just agree to it. Pride is important, but a good job is even more important. We can't afford to turn down money, especially since we've already signed the contract.\"","Xia Xuechun remained unmoved, instead giving Qi Xiaojia a cold look: \"Qi Xiaojia, do you have no self-respect? No dignity? No dreams?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\"","Xia Xuechun sneered at Qiao Chuchu: \"Qiao Chuchu earns 200,000 a month, but she's only offering us 50,000. Isn't she clearly looking down on us? She should be paying us 100,000 a month!\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but laugh: \"100,000 a month for the two of you? Am I hiring a pair of geniuses or something?!\"","She really had some nerve.","Like those insatiable, entitled relatives who are never satisfied no matter how much you give them.","Qi Xiaojia was also exasperated with Xia Xuechun: \"Why can't you see your own worth? Other companies aren't offering anywhere near this much. The job I interviewed for the other day only offered me 8,000!\"","\"So what?\" Xia Xuechun lifted her chin, declaring confidently: \"If I say I'm worth it, then I am.\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","Qiao Chuchu raised her hand.","Qiao Chuchu started clapping loudly: \"Xia Xuechun, you truly are a magnificent idiot.\"","She turned and walked away.","Xia Xuechun called after her: \"Wait, Qiao Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned back, only to see a liquid being flung toward her!","What on earth?!","She dodged instinctively, glaring at Xia Xuechun in alarm.","Xia Xuechun held an empty champagne glass, her head held high like a proud rooster: \"Don't you dare insult me.\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, her temper flaring: \"I insulted you, huh? Fine!\"","She grabbed a champagne glass from a nearby waiter and hurled it at Xia Xuechun!","One glass wasn't enough—she went for three!","And after three, she grabbed another!","Xia Xuechun was too stunned to react, just standing there drenched.","Qiao Chuchu left her looking like a drowned rat, tossing the empty glass to the wide-eyed waiter before storming off.","A deep, elderly voice rang out behind her—","\"Who dares bully my grandson's savior?!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned in surprise to see a group of latecomers entering through the main door.","At the center was an elderly man in a Zhongshan suit, walking steadily into the banquet hall.","Flanking him were two men in suits and two elegantly dressed women.","One of the women held the hand of a cute little boy, who waved at Xia Xuechun.","Xia Xuechun was completely stunned: \"It's him?\"","Qi Xiaojia whispered curiously: \"Who are they?\"","Xia Xuechun explained, still in shock: \"That's the little boy I saved on the street the other day. He was almost hit by a car, and I pulled him to safety. I had no idea his grandfather was such an important figure.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, looking at the white-haired old man.","The old man's sharp gaze met hers.","Suddenly, a series of strange images flashed through her mind.","—The old man slapping her face, calling her uncivilized.","—The boy's mother sneering at her, saying that despite her privileged upbringing, she wasn't as strong as Xia Xuechun.","—The old man pointing at her nose, calling her a bully and a worthless burden.","—Xia Xuechun standing in the middle of the group, holding the little boy, smirking triumphantly at her.","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of it, her heart racing.","This family was taking on the role of Lou Tingsi!","This was a new plot twist!","She watched as the white-haired old man approached her, calmly glancing at Xia Xuechun: \"Miss Xia, are you alright?\"","Xia Xuechun took the handkerchief offered by one of the women, looking pitiful as she shook her head: \"I'm fine. I'm used to it. She bullies me all the time.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Old man, I suggest you mind your own business. She was the one who tried to splash me first. I was just defending myself.\"","The old man's face darkened: \"You dare tell me to mind my own business? How dare you speak to your elder like that?!\"","He raised his hand to strike her!","Qiao Chuchu caught his wrist, twisted it, and shoved him back forcefully!","The old man stumbled, steadied by his sons, and stared at Qiao Chuchu in shock: \"You have no manners! How dare you attack your elder?!\"","Qiao Chuchu clasped her hands behind her back, smiling calmly: \"No matter how much of a troublemaker I am, even my brother has never slapped me.\"","Her smile vanished, replaced by a cold tone: \"Who the hell do you think you are?\"","The old man's son stepped forward angrily: \"Apologize to my father!\"","Qiao Chuchu flung him aside!","The man flew three meters, skidding another two on the ground!","Guests streamed out of the banquet hall, gasping: \"Holy cow, Miss Qiao is fighting again!\"","\"That's kind of awesome. Isn't she a painter? She can fight too?!\"","One of the women screamed in distress: \"Honey!\"","She glared at Qiao Chuchu: \"What's wrong with you?! How can you be so crude?!\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped closer, meeting her gaze: \"Do you want me to toss you out too?\"","The woman froze, her face turning pale.","The white-haired old man, furious, lunged at Qiao Chuchu with a kick!","She dodged behind him in an instant, stepping on the back of his knee!","The old man fell to his knees!","She smoothly stepped in front of him, bending down with a playful smirk: \"No need to bow!\"","The old man's face turned green with rage, but he couldn't get up, trembling in pain.","Qiao Chuchu looked down at him, her tone cheerful: \"Osteoporosis and still so bold. You must have a lot of lives to spare, old man. How many loops have you lived through to make it this far?\"","The old man's son rushed to help him up, snarling at Qiao Chuchu: \"Do you know who you're messing with? Do you know who we are?!\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head curiously: \"Who are you?\"","The son declared indignantly: \"We're the Dragon Family! My father is the Dragon King!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Wow! That name is tougher than your entire family's lives combined!\"","The son: \"?\"","The daughter-in-law: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu was even more amused.","She'd heard of the Dragon Family. The old man was called the Dragon King, and when the novel featuring him became popular, many young people in the industry had joked about his name.","The Dragon Family wasn't particularly powerful—just nouveau riche.","Qiao Chuchu, feeling victorious, looked down at the kneeling old man and said smugly: \"If the Dragon King is kneeling before me, then I must be the Dragon King's great-aunt~\"","The old man's face turned ashen: \"What did you say?! Who are you from?!\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled brightly, performing a mock ancient bow: \"In reply to the Dragon King, this humble maiden is the eighth daughter of the Pei Family, Qiao Chuchu~\"","The old man: \"?!\"","The son: \"?\"","The daughter-in-law: \"?\""]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: I Would Like to Discuss the Issue of Chu Chu Qiao's Belonging","paragraphs":["Mr. Zhang felt dizzy and disoriented. When he opened his eyes and tried to touch his head, he realized his arms were bound tightly with rope.","Panicked, he struggled to move his arms, wanting to cry out, but his throat was so sore that he couldn’t make a sound.","Slowly, his memory returned, and he recalled what had happened.","His business had collapsed due to a broken capital chain, and the Pei Family had been sabotaging him at every turn. No one was willing to lend him money to keep his company afloat, and now he faced not only bankruptcy but also massive debts.","All of this was because his mother had offended Qiao Chuchu.","Filled with anger over the past few days, he had hired someone to sabotage the Wei Sheng Family's surveillance system. Yesterday, after getting drunk, he disguised himself as a staff member, armed with sulfuric acid and a knife, intending to kill the Eighth Miss of the Pei Family and drag someone down with him—if he was going to die, he’d take someone with him.","But before he could harm the Eighth Miss, she had fought back.","The Eighth Miss of the Pei Family was like a force of nature, tossing him around as if he were a ragdoll.","He thought he was going to be beaten to death, but somehow, he had survived.","Mr. Zhang glanced around the room.","If that was the case, maybe he could still escape!","After all, the room seemed empty!","Suddenly, a flame flickered to life in the room.","Mr. Zhang was shocked to see that the room was now filled with people, sitting or standing, their cold eyes fixed on him in the dim light.","Mr. Zhang screamed, “Ah!”","Had there always been people in this room?!","Weisheng Yucan, holding a lighter, lazily said, “What are you screaming for?”","She lit a cigarette, casually turned on the lights, and leaned against the wall. “We didn’t want to disturb your sleep, so we kept the lights off. We thought we’d talk to you once you woke up.”","Mr. Zhang looked around in terror.","How... how were all these industry titans here?!","Pei Yuan stood by his bed, his dark eyes gleaming with venomous intent. “When you were begging me for help, you were willing to give your life. But when I refused, you decided to kill my sister instead, didn’t you?”","He toyed with a small knife in his hand, his voice dripping with menace. “If you wanted revenge, why not come after me? Did you think my sister was an easy target?”","Mr. Zhang’s face turned pale, and he stammered, “I... I had no other choice!”","His voice trembled, tinged with self-pity. “You said you’d help me, but then you withdrew the funds just because my mother said something offensive. I was desperate for money to solve my urgent problems!”","“That’s your mother’s fault! What does that have to do with my sister?!” Pei Yuan slammed the knife into the bed, his voice low and furious. “And even if I withdrew the funds, why come after my sister instead of me? You thought she was weak, didn’t you?!”","Mr. Zhang’s eyes reddened with indignation. “But your sister is so sensitive! My mother only said she was raised without a mother!”","Pei Yuan’s voice rose sharply. “She and I share the same mother! Insulting her is insulting me!!!”","Mr. Zhang froze, his entire body trembling with fear. He muttered weakly, “But... but you two aren’t... biologically related.”","Pei Yuan, with his striking features and noble demeanor, usually carried himself like a gentleman.","But now, his eyes were bloodshot, radiating murderous intent. He leaned over the bed, his voice filled with unhinged rage. “Since I took over the company and gained wealth, I’ve spared no expense for her. Her skincare is custom-made for her skin type, her bags and shoes are the finest and most luxurious.","Pei Yuan’s voice dropped to a whisper, like a vengeful spirit from hell. “I’ve bought her the best education, the most expensive diamonds without hesitation. I cherish her as if she were my own life. And yet, you dared to bring harm to her?!”","Mr. Zhang flinched, his voice cracking as he defended himself. “What else could I do? I had no way out! If I’m going to die, I’ll take someone with me!”","Pei Yuan’s eyes darkened, and he sneered. “It seems you’re incapable of reflecting on your own mistakes.”","Mr. Zhang’s eyes widened in terror. “What are you going to—”","Weisheng Yucan flicked the lights off with a sharp “Click!”","Three minutes later, Pei Yuan emerged from the room, his expression grim.","He had washed his hands, the scent of soap lingering on his skin. His pale hands were red from the cold water, and he meticulously dried them with a handkerchief before lighting a cigarette. He exhaled a cloud of smoke, his frustration evident.","Weisheng Yucan walked out of the room with a smile. “Patriarch Pei Yuan, your decisiveness is truly admirable. It’s no wonder you’re the backbone of the Pei Family. Such resolve is exactly what a leader needs.”","Pei Yuan tapped the ash into the ashtray, his tone indifferent. “I should thank you for giving me the opportunity.”","Weisheng Yucan’s smile widened. “I initially wanted Huai Ling to handle this, but since Qiao Chuchu is your sister, it’s only right that you deal with it personally.”","Huai Ling stepped out of the room. “Let’s move to another room. I’ll have my people handle this.”","Yucan gestured to Pei Yuan. “Shall we discuss Qiao Chuchu’s situation with the other families?”","Pei Yuan’s eyes darkened as he followed Weisheng Yucan to the second-floor parlor.","Weisheng Yucan assured them, “You can rest easy. This place is completely secure, both inside and out.”","She motioned for Pei Yuan to sit in a single chair beside her. “Take a seat.”","Pei Yuan sat down, glancing at his brothers.","Pei Che sat across from him, calm and composed.","The other brothers remained expressionless, revealing nothing.","Lou Tingsi stood nearby, smiling like an outsider.","Lin Qing and Lin Shen sat on the other side, eyeing Weisheng Yucan suspiciously.","Members of the Wei Sheng Family gradually filled the room and took their seats.","Weisheng Yucan began, “Now that everyone is here, I’ll get straight to the point.”","She looked at Pei Yuan. “We’d like to have Qiao Chuchu stay with us for a while.”","Pei Yuan: “?”","Pei Che: “?”","Pei Youchuan laughed. “What did you just say?!”","Pei Fengnong: “...”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci scowled in unison. “Miss Yucan, have you eaten something strange? Why are you talking nonsense?”","Pei Buxian, holding his dog, looked sullen.","Weisheng Yucan crossed her legs, exuding confidence. “To be honest, among our families, ours is the most exceptional. We have top-notch security, a luxurious estate, and I’ll ensure Qiao Chuchu lacks for nothing. She won’t suffer under our care.”","Pei Che sneered. “Your ‘top-notch security’ allowed my sister to lose her life here today.”","Weisheng Yucan’s smile faltered. “That was a one-time incident. It won’t happen again.”","“Who can guarantee that?” Pei Yuan retorted. “And why do you want to take her in the first place?”","Weisheng Yucan replied matter-of-factly, “Because we can hear her thoughts too. We know the world is trying to erase Qiao Chuchu. Naturally, we want to keep her in the safest place possible.”","Lin Qing interjected, “If that’s the case, our family is safe too. We’ve never faced any dangers.”","Lou Tingsi chuckled darkly. “I beg to differ. Our family has the best security. I dare say no one here can match our level of protection.”","Pei Youchuan scoffed. “That’s because you’re being hunted! You’ve beefed up your security because of your own dangers. Qiao Chuchu is already in enough trouble without adding your problems to the mix.”","Lou Tingsi shrugged. “The most dangerous place is the safest. I’ve protected my son effortlessly. Do you think I can’t protect Qiao Chuchu?”","Lou Yuejue chimed in eagerly, “My dad is really sharp! Let’s bring sister here!”"]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: When There Are Many Wolves and Only One Rabbit, How to Divide","paragraphs":["Pei Mu and Pei Ci slammed the table and stood up: \"Qiao Chuchu is part of our family. Why should she go with you? And on what grounds are you trying to take her away?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan replied calmly and unhurriedly, \"Simply because your relationship with her is strained.\"","The Pei family was taken aback.","Wenzhan crossed his legs and spoke to them with composure: \"Have you resolved the rift between you? The Wei Sheng Family has no such issues with Qiao Chuchu. If she comes to our family, she will only enjoy happiness, not hardship.\"","\"What do you mean by that?\" Pei Fengnong raised an eyebrow, irritated. \"Are you saying we’ve made Qiao Chuchu suffer?!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked at him as if amused: \"Sending your own sister to live in another house for years, without providing her any living expenses during that time—do you really think Qiao Chuchu hasn’t suffered?\"","Pei Fengnong retorted angrily, \"We just didn’t give her money! Her clothes, shoes, food, accessories, nanny, and even the driver were all paid for by us. The house itself was bought by us for her!\"","Weisheng Biehe twirled his prayer beads and interjected leisurely, \"Owning a gold mine and having control over it are two different things.\"","Everyone turned to look at him.","He mocked, \"No matter how many gold mines you give her, it’s not as good as letting her manage them herself.\"","Pei Youchuan laughed, \"How we give Qiao Chuchu her allowance is our private matter. You have no right to judge us!\"","Weisheng Biehe looked completely at ease: \"If Qiao Chuchu stays with me, I’ll give her plenty of money to manage as she pleases. If she wants to start a company, she can. If she wants to do anything else, I’ll support her unconditionally.\"","Pei Youchuan clenched his teeth, his expression turning fierce: \"And what identity will you use to support her?\"","The others glared at Biehe with caution.","Biehe, unfazed by their wary looks, replied calmly, \"As a supporting character who can hear her thoughts.\"","\"No way!!\" Pei Buxian couldn’t hold back any longer. He stood up, furious. \"Do you think our family lacks companies?! Qiao Chuchu doesn’t want to be a boss. She wants to focus on her art and build her own career. That’s why we haven’t started a company for her!\"","He puffed up like an angry blowfish: \"The rift between us has built up over time, and we’ll resolve it ourselves. Qiao Chuchu is part of our family. No matter what, it’s not her place to stay with you!\"","Lin Shen frowned and stood up to mediate: \"Can we stop arguing? Qiao Chuchu is a wonderful girl. Whenever it’s our turn in the story, she always comes to us willingly. None of our families need to monopolize her. She’s someone who values relationships deeply!\"","He pointed at Lin Qing: \"When my sister went through her part of the story, Qiao Chuchu risked her life to save her. She even died once for my sister, and she died again to save Xi Gaodi and Lou Yuejue. She could have ignored it, but she didn’t, because she’s someone who values relationships. She’s willing to help us. If she knew we could hear her thoughts and were fighting over her, how do you think she’d feel?!\"","The banquet hall fell silent.","Everyone lowered their eyes, momentarily speechless.","Weisheng Yucan suddenly chuckled: \"Heh.\"","Lin Shen looked at Yucan in confusion.","Yucan crossed her fair legs and spoke with composure: \"Isn’t it precisely because she’s so wonderful that we want to monopolize her?\"","Lin Shen was stunned.","The others grew wary.","Weisheng Yucan leaned back in her chair, her eyes curved like crescents, and she flashed a mocking smirk: \"After all, there’s nothing the Wei Sheng Family can’t obtain.\"","Pei Yuan’s face darkened as he scolded, \"If it weren’t for my sister, you’d be dead by now. And now you want to take her away?!\"","\"I know,\" Weisheng Yucan said indifferently. \"If she hadn’t helped me, I would have died. So, is it wrong for me to want to keep her by my side to repay her?\"","A hint of ferocity flashed in her eyes: \"And haven’t you noticed? This world is doing everything it can to erase her. The Wei Sheng Family has always had strict security, yet a man carrying sulfuric acid suddenly broke in without our guards noticing. Isn’t that fate giving him a chance to kill Qiao Chuchu?\"","Yucan’s tone grew heavier: \"If she dies one day, we won’t be able to bring her back! Do you understand what that means?!\"","Pei Buxian, sitting across from her, slammed the table and roared, \"I can protect her!!!\"","Weisheng Yucan shot back, \"With what? With your love that you don’t dare confess?!\"","Pei Buxian froze, his face turning pale. He looked at Weisheng Yucan in disbelief: \"How do you know...\"","Weisheng Yucan sneered, \"Love is the cheapest thing in the world. What’s the use of loving her if you can’t protect her?\"","Pei Che spoke in a deep voice, \"No, you’re wrong. Whether we can protect her is a matter of our individual abilities, not our feelings.\"","Yucan frowned.","Pei Che stood up, looking down at her: \"Qiao Chuchu protected you because she likes you. If she didn’t care for you, you’d be dead by now.\"","Yucan: \"?!\"","Pei Che put his hands in his pockets: \"Aside from us brothers, isn’t everyone else a supporting character Qiao Chuchu likes?\"","He glanced at Lin Qing: \"Lin Qing counts, right?\"","Lin Qing beamed, \"Of course! Qiao Chuchu liked me from the moment she saw me. She even stood up for me against Ji Yanchuan!~\"","He then looked at Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue: \"Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue are also characters she admires deeply, even if they’re antagonists.\"","Lou Yuejue grinned innocently, \"Even though she calls me a little freak, she takes good care of me!~\"","Lou Tingsi nodded without comment.","Pei Che turned back to Weisheng Yucan: \"Then there’s you, Weisheng Yucan. If she didn’t like you, do you think you’d even have a chance to stand here?\"","Yucan’s expression darkened. She stubbed out her cigarette and remained silent.","Pei Che spoke with certainty: \"Although I wasn’t around when you were with Qiao Chuchu, and I haven’t heard much about her thoughts on you, I know her well enough to believe she helped you unconditionally because she likes your character, not because she stood to gain anything from it.\"","Pei Che stared at Weisheng Yucan: \"You can think our love is worthless, but since you’ve received Qiao Chuchu’s help, are you saying her feelings for you are worthless too?\"","Weisheng Yucan was stunned into silence.","Weisheng Wenzhan’s eyes darkened.","Weisheng Biehe silently twisted his prayer beads, his expression somber.","Weisheng Lin tugged at his tie anxiously and sighed.","Only Huai Ling looked around in confusion, signing, *\"What are you all talking about?\"*","He turned to Weisheng Lin for help: *\"I can’t hear, and I didn’t catch everyone’s lip movements. Can someone explain it to me in detail?\"*","Pei Che’s expression was stern: \"Weisheng Yucan, the affairs of the Pei Family are not for you to meddle in, nor are they for you to mock. We will protect her with our lives, just as we have done before.\"","Yucan pursed her lips and slowly stood up, her eyes filled with remorse: \"You’re right. I have no right to judge your family. Of course, Qiao Chuchu protected me because she likes me. I... I used to think feelings were worthless, but after what you’ve said, I realize she helped me unconditionally. I was too shallow.\"","She admitted her mistake: \"I’m sorry.\""]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: You Can't Split the Rabbit, But You Can Live Together with the Rabbit as a Group, Right","paragraphs":["Weisheng Wenzhan observed coldly: \"Pei Che, here's what I think. Qiao Chuchu's life is too dangerous. With just you guys protecting her, things are bound to go wrong. Why don't we all live together? It would be more convenient for everyone.\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","The rest of the Pei Family: \"???\"","The Lin Family's eyes lit up!","The Lou Family father and son thought for a moment, then turned to the Pei Family with hopeful eyes!","Lou Yuejue's eyes sparkled: \"That could work! Why don't we all buy a huge estate together?\"","Pei Youchuan didn't hesitate: \"Absolutely not! Stop dreaming!\"","Lin Qing smirked mischievously: \"Taking Qiao Chuchu out of the equation is impossible, but if we all live together, I think it could work.\"","Weisheng Yucan also smiled: \"Or we could buy an estate for Qiao Chuchu and all move in. That wouldn't be a problem either.\"","Weisheng Biehe nodded in agreement: \"Yes, Qiao Chuchu saved our lives. Buying her an estate is only natural. The estate would be spacious, and it wouldn't feel crowded even if we all moved in. Like our family's estate—it's huge, but only a few rooms are actually used. It can feel quite lonely.\"","Weisheng Lin was surprised: \"Fourth Brother, you usually just stay in your room when you get home. I’ve called you out multiple times, and you never come out. I’ve even wondered if you’d died in there. How can you feel lonely like that?\"","Weisheng Biehe shot him a look: \"Do you have to talk? Can’t you stay silent?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan curled his lips into a smile: \"Then it's settled. I think it's a great idea.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci immediately vetoed: \"No way!\"","Lin Qing laughed: \"Then let’s just fight for her! Whoever wins gets to take Qiao Chuchu home for a few days. If you want to follow, just bring your luggage and move in. Our houses are big enough anyway.\"","Lin Shen lowered his voice: \"Isn’t that a bit inappropriate? Wouldn’t Qiao Chuchu feel disrespected?\"","Lin Qing rolled her eyes: \"Brother, look around you. Everyone here is a rival. They’re either obsessive or domineering. And you?\"","Lin Shen looked at himself: \"What about me?\"","Lin Qing whispered disdainfully: \"You’ve got this 'perfect husband' vibe. You’re the type who’s nurturing and uncompetitive. You have no edge! If you don’t step up, you’re out of the game!\"","Lin Shen suddenly became alert and looked at the others seriously: \"I also think it’s better if we all compete fairly. We can’t let Qiao Chuchu stay only with the Pei Family.\"","Pei Buxian widened his eyes: \"Isn’t there a chance that Qiao Chuchu was raised by us?\"","Lou Tingsi chimed in, clearly enjoying the chaos: \"No worries, we can take care of her in her later years. You had the first twenty-odd years, and we’ll take the next few decades.\"","He grinned: \"How about that? Fair, right?\"","The Pei Family: \"?\"","Suddenly, they felt an uneasy sense that their little rabbit was being eyed by a pack of wolves.","Weisheng Huailing was still utterly confused: 「Why is no one explaining this to me?! What are you all even talking about?!」","Suddenly, there was a knock at the door.","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"Come in.\"","The butler timidly opened the door, holding a delicate pose with his fingers and looking slightly awkward: \"Um... Miss Qiao is downstairs arguing with someone.\"","Pei Yuan immediately became alert: \"Which family?\"","\"The Dragon Family,\" the butler replied. \"The entire Dragon Family.\"","Pei Yuan frowned and looked around.","Everyone exchanged sly glances, their minds clearly racing, and then suddenly they all bolted!","Pei Yuan and Pei Che ordered their youngest brother: \"Pei Buxian, run ahead!\"","Pei Buxian sprinted off with his dog: \"Got it!\"","Lin Qing dragged Lin Shen downstairs: \"Go, go, go! This is our chance to earn some points!!\"","Weisheng Yucan smacked Weisheng Huailing on the back of the head: 「Go downstairs! Qiao Chuchu is being bullied!」","Weisheng Huailing, now on high alert, took off running, gesturing frustratedly: “I didn’t understand a single thing! I shouldn’t have come up here!”","Lou Yuejue was the fastest, sprinting ahead: \"I’m a kid, so I don’t have to worry about my image. I can be the first to help Sister Chuchu!\"","Lou Tingsi watched with amusement, clapping: \"Son, we were the first characters introduced, but we’ve had no plot development so far. Our family’s story depends on you now!\"","Lou Yuejue beamed: \"Don’t worry, Dad, I’ve got this!\"","He dashed to the first floor just in time to see a little boy lunging at Qiao Chuchu, biting her: \"You bad person!!!\"","Lou Yuejue reacted quickly, pushing the boy to the ground: \"What are you doing?!\"","The boy, caught off guard, fell on his bottom and burst into tears.","Qiao Chuchu was surprised: \"Yuejue?\"","Lou Yuejue calmly turned to her: \"Sister, don’t be afraid. I’ll protect you!\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback and quickly said: \"That’s not necessary.\"","【The Dragon Family is just a group of NPCs designed to give the female lead trouble. They’re completely unreasonable. Lou Yuejue interacting with them will only lead to trouble.】","Lou Yuejue’s eyes darkened: \"Sister, don’t underestimate me because of my age. I’ve seen my fair share of big scenes.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【Big scenes? What kind of big scenes? Like gunfights and battles?】","Lou Yuejue snorted, shielding her as he addressed the boy’s mother: \"If you have something to say, say it properly. What’s with letting your kid bite people? Do you think just because it’s a child, they don’t need a rabies shot?\"","The woman glared: \"What are you talking about?! How can you be so rude?!\"","Lou Yuejue smirked: \"Auntie, be careful with your words. People who know who I am wouldn’t dare call me rude. My dad’s around here somewhere, and if I’m unhappy, he’s unhappy.\"","He gave the crying boy a menacing look: \"And if my dad’s unhappy, your whole family will be unhappy.\"","Xia Xuechun couldn’t take it anymore: \"How can you talk like that, little boy?\"","Lou Yuejue sneered at her: \"If you say one more word to me, you’ll lose your job. Now, get lost.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"!\"","Weisheng Biehe quickly walked over to Qiao Chuchu: \"What’s all this noise? Can’t we just have a peaceful birthday celebration?\"","Old Master Dragon King stood up immediately to complain about Qiao Chuchu: \"Biehe, you have no idea how outrageous this girl is! She made me, an old man, kneel before her!\"","Weisheng Biehe calmly twisted his prayer beads: \"Oh, then you should leave.\"","The old man was stunned: \"Why should we leave? She’s the one in the wrong!\"","\"But Qiao Chuchu saved my sister’s life,\" Weisheng Biehe glanced at Qiao Chuchu. \"My sister adores her, so if you’re yelling at her, you’re yelling at all five of us siblings.\"","He coldly looked at the old man: \"So, even if she’s wrong, I’ll still protect her. Either you leave, or you apologize. Choose.\""]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: The Way to Be Cherished by a Big Shot","paragraphs":["The banquet hall entrance was crowded with people.","Holding champagne glasses, they watched the spectacle with amusement, surprised by Qiao Chuchu’s presence. “Is the eighth daughter of the Pei Family really Weisheng Yucan’s savior?”","“Did she wait around just to save Weisheng Yucan? Otherwise, how could such good fortune fall into her lap?”","A noblewoman holding a champagne glass scoffed, “They say small fame comes from promotion, but great fame comes from destiny. In my opinion, connections work the same way. Qiao Chuchu is just the daughter of a painter. Her mother, Qiao Qiao, befriended Miss Pei of the Pei Family. After her mother passed away, Qiao Chuchu was left as an orphan, but Miss Pei took her in without hesitation. Even though formal adoption procedures couldn’t be completed, Miss Pei doted on Qiao Chuchu unconditionally. Over a decade ago, when Miss Pei passed away, her seven sons took over, and now they’ve even allied with the Weisheng Clan. How lucky!”","A woman standing nearby with her arms crossed glanced haughtily at the speaker and lowered her voice. “You don’t understand. When Miss Pei was young, her family neglected her, even refusing to pay for her education. It was Qiao Chuchu’s mother who sold her paintings to fund Miss Pei’s schooling. Qiao’s mother also had a tragic background. These two sisters, left to fend for themselves since their teens, were as close as real sisters. Without Qiao Chuchu’s mother, Miss Pei wouldn’t have risen to prominence. Naturally, her sons owe Qiao Chuchu a debt of gratitude. It’s only right.”","Another woman concluded, “In any case, we should all be cautious. Qiao Chuchu is clearly about to rise with the wind. We mustn’t offend her like some families have.”","The woman with the champagne glass smirked, covering her lips. “Isn’t it the Dragon Family who offended Qiao Chuchu? The old patriarch even calls himself the Dragon King. Let’s see if their fate is as tough as their name.”","Someone chuckled softly, “I think they’re just turtles.”","The guests burst into laughter. “Hahahahahahahahahahaha!”","The Dragon King’s face turned red with anger as he glared at Qiao Chuchu, his eyes filled with hatred and resentment.","The other members of the Dragon Family stared at their toes, unsure whether to apologize.","A little boy, sniffling, clung to his mother and whimpered, “Mom, do we have to apologize?”","He pointed at Lou Yuejue. “This big brother pushed me first. Why should we apologize?”","Lou Yuejue slapped his hand away. “You were the one trying to bite people! Just because you’ve taken human form doesn’t mean you can throw a tantrum! The human world has rules!”","The boy’s eyes widened, and he burst into tears again!","The sharp, ear-piercing cries made the guests frown in discomfort.","Weisheng Biehe wrinkled his brow in disgust and glared at the woman. “Who allowed you to bring a child in?”","The woman, trying to soothe her son, apologized to Weisheng Biehe. “It’s this child who provoked my son. My son is usually very well-behaved. This isn’t his fault.”","Weisheng Biehe coldly glanced at the butler.","The butler understood immediately and forced a polite smile. “Whether he’s crying or not isn’t the issue, madam. The invitation clearly stated that children under ten are not allowed. Did you not read the requirements before attending our Wei Sheng Clan’s party? If so, we may not extend future invitations to you.”","The woman’s face paled as she turned to the Dragon King. “Father, I didn’t see the invitation.”","The old man, hands clasped behind his back, looked grim. “I only checked the date and location. I didn’t notice the rules.”","The butler promptly stepped aside to usher them out. “Then I’m afraid the child must leave. Our young master doesn’t want crying children at his birthday celebration.”","The Dragon King’s eyebrows shot up in defiance. “Since when has the Wei Sheng Clan become so high and mighty? Back when I used to have tea with your grandfather, there were no such rules! And now you’re making us apologize to some little girl in front of everyone!”","Weisheng Biehe’s expression darkened. “You refuse to apologize?”","The old man raised his chin stubbornly. “What if I do? I’m your grandfather’s old friend! Do you dare throw me out??”","Weisheng Biehe sneered. “My grandfather passed away ten years ago. Your influence expired long ago.”","The Dragon King’s head spun, and he clutched his chest as if having a heart attack. “You—”","Weisheng Biehe signaled the bodyguards with a glance. “Throw him out. Just make sure he doesn’t die on our doorstep.”","The bodyguards swarmed in!","Weisheng Yucan squeezed through the crowd and called out to the Dragon King. “Old Dragon King, if you must die, please do so further away from our house. Our freshly paved asphalt driveway is new, and I’d rather not have it tainted by your death. Otherwise, I’d have to repave it and perform some exorcism rituals. What a hassle!”","The Dragon King’s face turned green as he was carried away. “You—you—”","The Dragon Family stood helplessly, while the little boy wailed in terror.","Weisheng Lin appeared like a ghost in front of the boy. “Stop crying, kid.”","The boy: “?”","Weisheng Lin raised a fruit knife expressionlessly. “Cry again, and I’ll give you a shot.”","The boy: “?”","Is that a shot?!","His mother, terrified, scooped him up and fled.","Xia Xuechun, witnessing the Dragon Family’s humiliation, couldn’t stand it any longer and spoke up. “This is too much! You’re abusing your power!”","Weisheng Yucan noticed her and smiled brightly. “Oh, right. You can leave too. Your friend Qi Xiaojia can stay, but you have to go.”","Xia Xuechun was baffled. “? I don’t understand, ma’am. You’re a woman too. How can you be so cruel, bullying an entire family like this? They came specifically to wish your brother a happy birthday!”","“Birthday wishes?” Yucan blinked and looked around. “Where are these wishes?”","Xia Xuechun faltered.","Yucan smirked at her. “All I see is them bullying my savior. I don’t see any birthday wishes for my brother.”","Xia Xuechun pointed angrily at Qiao Chuchu. “But Qiao Chuchu spilled champagne on me first! I’m the Dragon Family’s savior. Isn’t it natural for them to side with me?”","“Then isn’t it natural for me to side with Qiao Chuchu?” Yucan fluttered her beautiful eyes, her tone teasing, like a haughty serpent queen. “When we all want to protect those we care about, it comes down to the strength of the protectors. Unfortunately, the people protecting you are nothing but insects in my eyes.”","Weisheng Yucan leaned down, smiling at the stubborn Xia Xuechun. “Have you ever killed an insect, Miss Xia?”","She lowered her voice. “Did you care about the insect’s feelings when you killed it?”","Xia Xuechun: “?”","Weisheng Yucan’s smile hid a knife. “If you didn’t care then, why should I care now?”","Xia Xuechun’s face turned pale, her throat clogged as if glued shut. She couldn’t utter a word.","Weisheng Yucan took Qiao Chuchu’s hand. “Sorry for the delay, everyone. Let the banquet begin!”","She tilted her head at Qiao Chuchu. “Come on, Chuchu. You’re the guest of honor tonight. Sit with our family, okay?”","Qiao Chuchu, flattered, nodded. “Okay.”","The guests applauded and cheered as if nothing had happened. “Happy birthday, Weisheng Biehe!”","“Happy birthday, Weisheng Biehe!~”","Weisheng Biehe quickly stepped to Qiao Chuchu’s side.","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in surprise.","He stood calmly beside her, as if he were her escort, receiving the guests’ admiring glances.","Qiao Chuchu found herself sandwiched between two powerful figures.","One was the host of the birthday party.","The other was the current head of the Wei Sheng Clan.","She felt like a prized pet, pressed tightly between them, basking in the attention of many who sought to curry favor.","[...So nervous. Is this what it feels like to be valued by the elite?!]","Her frustration eased slightly: [Why does this feel so satisfying? Hahahahahaha!]"]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Louyue Jue: This is the Product of My Longing for You, Sister","paragraphs":["Weisheng Yucan and Biehe exchanged a glance, their eyes flickering toward Qiao Chuchu, their lips curling into faint smiles as they continued to guide her through the venue.","Pei Youchuan followed behind, arms crossed, muttering in annoyance, \"Look how happy she is. We’ve always protected her, but she’s never been this happy with us!\"","Pei Yuan watched as Qiao Chuchu stepped onto the stage, his brows furrowed with worry. \"As long as she’s happy,\" he said softly. The thought of Qiao Chuchu having once died under a shower of sulfuric acid and a flurry of knives made his palms sweat and his breath tighten. \"Nothing matters more than her happiness today.\"","Pei Youchuan paused, recalling what Qiao Chuchu had just been through, and fell silent.","The Pei family stood below the stage, their eyes fixed on Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu stood beside Weisheng Biehe, handing him a pair of scissors.","Biehe cut the string of a numbered balloon, watching it rise into the air before a new one descended.","Qiao Chuchu smiled warmly. \"Happy birthday, Mr. Biehe!\"","Weisheng Biehe’s lips twitched into a subtle smile, his tea-colored eyes filled with her reflection.","Pei Buxian, witnessing the picturesque scene of the two, suddenly burst into tears, covering his mouth as he sobbed, \"Wuwuwu...\"","His six brothers shot him disapproving looks. \"Why are you crying?\"","Pei Buxian, tears streaming down his face, choked out, \"I can’t imagine how I’d feel if one day Qiao Chuchu fell in love with someone else, standing on a stage in a wedding dress with another man.\"","The six brothers rolled their eyes in unison. \"Are you stupid? That day will never come.\"","Pei Buxian sniffled, looking at them. \"But she’s never liked us. What if she falls for someone? What if she threatens to die unless she can marry them?\"","The brothers: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu noticed the seven of them and happily walked over, lifting her skirt. \"Brothers!\"","The seven looked up at her.","Bathed in the stage lights, her earlier anxiety had vanished, replaced by a radiant smile as she ran toward them. \"You have no idea how much I’ve been looking forward to seeing you!\"","Pei Yuan gazed at Qiao Chuchu as she ran toward him, his eyes glinting like shards of gold. \"That day will never come,\" he declared confidently, reaching out to her. \"I’m the head of the Pei family. She won’t marry anyone. I mean what I say.\"","Qiao Chuchu jumped off the stage, landing securely in his arms.","He held her waist tightly, patted her back gently, and then handed her over to Pei Che.","Pei Che examined her carefully. \"Are you okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu exhaled deeply. \"I wasn’t doing so well earlier, but seeing you all has made me feel much better.\"","Pei Youchuan pushed forward, masking his concern with a teasing grin. \"Qiao Chuchu, you can’t do without us, can you?\"","She shrugged playfully. \"Of course not. Without you backing me up at such a big event, I’d be lost.\"","Qiao Chuchu winked mysteriously. \"Having you around makes me feel at ease, like I’m at home.\"","Then her expression faltered, and she covered her mouth.","[Oh no, did I say too much? Will they think I’m being clingy? Will they think I’ve developed feelings for them and push me away?]","Pei Fengnong chuckled, patting her head with a look of fondness. \"You’re always like this at big events—so nervous. That’s why one of us always has to accompany you.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nudged Pei Fengnong aside, standing on either side of her. \"We’re different. There are two of us.\"","Pei Buxian, still teary-eyed, shoved a dog into Qiao Chuchu’s arms. \"And I have a dog.\"","Qiao Chuchu cradled the West Highland Terrier, her heart melting as she lifted it up, staring into its dark little eyes. \"I don’t need all of you. Just leave me the dog. Dogs are always loyal and loving!\"","The seven frowned in unison. \"Who said it’s just the dog?\"","Qiao Chuchu paused, thinking for a moment. \"Oh, right. A cat would work too.\"","The seven: \"?\"","Lin Qing pushed through the group, slinging an arm around Qiao Chuchu’s shoulders. \"Chuchu, how are you feeling? Are you okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled. \"Much better~ How about you? Did you resolve the issues with your family?\"","Lin Qing laughed carelessly. \"My dad refuses to admit that the people he sent were there to kill me. But I found a gun in his bodyguard’s possession. He claims it was for my protection.\"","Qiao Chuchu grew wary. \"Did you believe him?\"","Lin Qing sneered. \"Not a chance.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"What about your dad? What’s he doing now?\"","Lin Qing grinned. \"He’s quite free now. He’s a vegetable.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","That’s... free?","Lin Qing beamed. \"What can I say? He never took care of his health. He had a brain hemorrhage during our argument and fell into a coma.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"What about your dad’s illegitimate child?\"","Lin Qing’s eyes curved into crescents. \"His mother took him abroad. I told her the story of my dad’s ‘white moonlight’ who loved skydiving. For some reason, when I mentioned that she only came back from skydiving nine out of ten times, she started trembling and said she’d leave the country immediately, never to return.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s lips twitched.","[Isn’t that just a straight-up threat?! Lin Qing, you’re truly the queen of manipulation!]","Lin Qing smirked, wrapping an arm around Qiao Chuchu’s waist. \"So I owe you thanks this time. I’ve prepared a gift for you, and you’ll receive it soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked in surprise. \"What kind of gift? Skydiving?\"","Lin Qing burst out laughing, playfully swatting her bottom. \"You’re never allowed to skydive. You’ll find out what the gift is soon enough.\"","With that, she walked away confidently.","Lou Yuejue, as if taking the baton in a relay, hurried over to Qiao Chuchu. \"Sister!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up. \"Yuejue, thank you for standing up for me earlier.\"","Lou Yuejue stood with his hands behind his back, looking up at her proudly. \"My dad said it’s only right to protect the person you like. I like you, so I’ll protect you!\"","Qiao Chuchu crouched down, amused. \"Really? You like me?\"","[Does that mean the character I’ve been rooting for likes me too?!]","[I’m so happy!~]","Lou Yuejue’s cheeks flushed slightly as he nodded solemnly. \"Yes.\"","He pulled a piece of paper from his pocket and handed it to her with both hands, speaking earnestly. \"I want to exchange something with you.\"","Qiao Chuchu took the paper and unfolded it. \"Huh? Is this... me?\"","It was a beautiful sketch, even more stunning than she was in real life, adorned with delicate roses.","Lou Yuejue’s name was written on it.","He pointed at the drawing. \"I’ve been learning art recently. My teacher asked us to draw the person we most want to see, so I drew you.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in astonishment as she stared at Lou Yuejue.","[This is so romantic!]","The seven Pei brothers crowded around, equally stunned by Lou Yuejue.","Lou Yuejue, dressed in a crisp suit, his short hair slightly curled, his delicate face tinged with pink, tilted his chin up and formally invited her, \"I want to exchange the drawing I made while thinking of you for one you make while thinking of me. Can you think only of me? Then I’ll keep yours, and you’ll keep mine. Is that okay?\""]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Weisheng Lin: Is Qiao Chuchu a Great Prophet","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu pursed her lips, her heart melting.","【Oh~ So sweet.】","【The unintentional clinginess and sincerity of children are the most adorable!!】","She readily agreed, \"Of course!\"","Lou Yuejue's eyes lit up, \"Then it's settled!\"","Qiao Chuchu hooked her pinky with his, \"It's settled!~\"","The Pei Family members' faces turned green as they glanced at Lou Tingsi, who was standing nearby with a smile, their expressions full of accusation.","How is your son so smooth?","Did you teach him?","Lou Tingsi, with his hands in his pockets, smiled wryly and shrugged, \"I didn't know he had that sketch. If I had known earlier, I would've confiscated it.\"","Lou Yuejue looked back at his father with a challenging grin.","Yes, he knew his father would confiscate it, so he kept it a secret.","Hehe.","Lou Tingsi: \"...\"","As Qiao Chuchu and Lou Yuejue hooked their fingers, a sudden vision flashed before her eyes.","She tried to grasp it, but the image suddenly forced itself into her view!","— Lou Tingsi lying on a hospital bed, the heart monitor flatlining.","— Lou Yuejue clutching his father's hand, crying hysterically.","The scene shifted, and the lively Lou Yuejue was suddenly lying dead in the mud, his eyes wide open.","— Pei Buxian, dead in a car crash, half of his face crushed.","— A mixed-race man with chocolate-colored skin, dressed in a suit, sitting calmly in a Bentley, rolling down the window and saying, \"Miss Qiao, you said there's a traitor by my side? Care to get in the car and talk?\"","— In a sleet-filled sky, under a gloomy atmosphere, Xia Xuechun stood within the protective circle of the Dragon Family, boldly declaring, \"It was Lou Yuejue who brought a knife to attack me, it's not my fault! And your brother's death wasn't my doing either, he just wasn't a good driver!!\"","She abruptly pulled her hand away, jolting out of the prophetic vision!","Lou Yuejue looked at her strangely, \"Sister? What's wrong?\"","Qiao Chuchu gasped for breath, a thin layer of sweat forming on her forehead as she stared at Lou Yuejue and Pei Buxian in horror.","The people around her looked at her with confusion.","Even the Wei Sheng Family members noticed her odd behavior, turning their heads in her direction.","After a long moment, Qiao Chuchu finally looked at Lou Tingsi.","【There's a traitor by Lou Tingsi's side!!!】","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu clenched her fists: 【My prophetic ability is warning me again.】","【Not only is there a traitor by Lou Tingsi's side, but it's also a spy planted by the Dragon Family. The Dragon Family is aligned with Xia Xuechun's faction. Originally, Lou Yuejue was the one supporting Xia Xuechun, but since their relationship soured, the script created the Dragon Family to replace Lou Yuejue's role.】","【But the Dragon Family lacks resources, so they will kill the Lou Family, take over their business, and absorb their assets, becoming a new force to protect Xia Xuechun.】","【Lou Tingsi will die at the hands of his own people, Lou Yuejue will lose his mind seeking revenge against the Dragon Family, and Pei Buxian will die in a car accident while trying to help Lou Yuejue!】","【Lou Yuejue will also die with his eyes wide open, lying in the mud!】","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Lou Yuejue: \"??\"","Pei Buxian: \"???\"","Pei Buxian was utterly bewildered.","Why is my life and death tied up in the Lou Family's drama?!","Weisheng Yucan exchanged glances with her brothers.","Weisheng Wenzhan narrowed his eyes, \"Did Qiao Chuchu just gain a prophetic ability?\"","Yucan whispered her analysis, \"Probably because she's altered the plot too much, and the storyline has twisted in a way that's different from before, so now she can predict the future.\"","Weisheng Lin shuddered, \"Damn, a prophet? Is she the chosen one or something?\"","Weisheng Huailing was cautious: 「Does that mean our death endings could also change?」","Weisheng Biehe, twirling his prayer beads, silently watched Qiao Chuchu.","Lin Qing turned to Lin Shen, \"Does that mean our storyline will change too? So even if I hide, it won't make a difference?\"","Lin Shen nodded gravely.","The group subtly glanced at Qiao Chuchu, each harboring their own thoughts.","If that's the case...","We need to keep her close!","Being her neighbor isn't enough; we need to live with her to know our fate in real-time and stay safe!","Lou Tingsi, his face pale: \"...\"","Right now, he didn't care about anything else—only who the traitor among his trusted aides was!","He had three confidants!","The butler hurried over to Weisheng Lin and whispered, \"Young Master Lin, the Ying Family's... has arrived.\"","Weisheng Lin nodded and looked at his family, \"Ying Chen is here. Everyone, straighten your faces. Don't let him notice anything suspicious.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the banquet hall doors were pushed open by a waiter.","A mixed-race man with chocolate-colored skin, dressed in a sharp suit, strode in confidently with a row of bodyguards behind him, \"Weisheng Biehe!\"","Everyone turned in shock toward the source of the voice.","The man exuded an air of arrogance, as if no one else in the room mattered, and walked briskly toward Weisheng Biehe.","Weisheng Biehe quickly approached him, a rare smile breaking through his usual stoic expression, \"Brother Ying, didn't you say you weren't coming? What brings you here?\"","The man clapped his shoulder, his tone breezy, \"Just finished some business and flew over. I couldn't miss your birthday celebration.\"","He handed over a gift box, \"I picked out a vintage glass-type jade tea set for you, auctioned it myself. Don't look down on it.\"","Biehe accepted it with a smile, \"How could I? Your jade pieces are always the best.\"","The man grinned happily and turned to Yucan, \"Sister Yucan, Brother Wenzhan, long time no see.\"","Weisheng Yucan put on a warm smile and walked over to him, \"Perfect timing. Let me introduce you to a new friend of mine.\"","She called out to Qiao Chuchu, \"Chuchu!\"","Chuchu snapped out of her daze and quickly walked over, \"Sister Yucan.\"","Weisheng Yucan affectionately wrapped an arm around her shoulders and said to Ying Chen, \"This is my savior, the eighth sister of the Pei Family, Qiao Chuchu. From now on, she's part of the Wei Sheng Family, one of us.\"","She gestured to Qiao Chuchu, \"Chuchu, this is your Brother Ying Chen, a big shot from overseas. Call him 'Brother.'\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, \"Hello, Brother—\"","As she looked up and met Ying Chen's gaze, her eyes widened in shock.","【Holy crap! This guy looks exactly like the man from my prophetic vision!】","【The one who looks handsome but has a traitor by his side, who will eventually be betrayed and then become a stepping stone for the Dragon Family to take over his business!!!】","Weisheng Yucan: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","The others who could hear her thoughts: \"?\"","They all turned their eyes to Ying Chen.","Ying Chen's smile didn't falter; instead, it grew into something almost eerie as he extended his hand to Qiao Chuchu, \"Sister, how could you keep such a cute sister from me for so long?\"","Qiao Chuchu, belatedly realizing, shook his hand.","His large hand enveloped hers, the calluses on his palm suggesting frequent use of firearms, \"Hello, little sister. I'm Ying Chen. 'Ying' as in victory, 'Chen' as in dust.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, \"Hello, Brother Ying Chen.\"","She tried to pull her hand back.","Huh?","It wouldn't budge.","Qiao Chuchu looked up in surprise to find Ying Chen's gaze locked onto her like a tiger's, his grip unyielding as his tone grew darker.","\"Nice to meet you. I look forward to getting to know you better, little sister.\""]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Since it's Lou Tingsi's plot, it means Lou Tingsi's time has come.","paragraphs":["The entire birthday banquet was tasteless for Qiao Chuchu.","Lou Tingsi also had a dark expression throughout, the usual fake smile absent from his face as he absentmindedly poked at the food on his plate.","The people at the dining table could sense the low atmosphere between the two, and their gazes kept shifting back and forth between them.","The more Qiao Chuchu thought about it, the angrier she became.","[I never expected the Dragon Family to make such a bold move to replace the Lou Family. The script is really something. I brought Lou Yuejue and Lou Tingsi back, and it immediately rushed to give Xia Xuechun a new family background.]","[Giving her a new background is one thing, but at least make it equal in strength so we can compete and clash. Instead, they’re sacrificing the Lou Family to strengthen the Dragon Family. It’s like a small fish trying to eat a big fish, using underhanded tactics to devour the Lou Family. It’s infuriating!]","She angrily cut into her steak.","[Fine! If everyone wants to play dirty, then we’ll all play dirty. After all, the people on my side are all morally bankrupt villains. Why should we be afraid of them?!]","[But how can I let Lou Tingsi know that there’s a traitor by his side?]","Qiao Chuchu slowly chewed the steak she had just put in her mouth, raising her eyes to look at Lou Tingsi across the table.","Lou Tingsi was cutting his steak with an elegant posture, his features as beautiful as a painting.","Suddenly, he raised his eyes and met her gaze.","Qiao Chuchu was startled.","Lou Tingsi’s eyes were beautiful, with the upward curve of peach blossom eyes, always warm and smiling.","But now, his eyes were sharp and cold, though the corners of his lips were curved as he nodded at her with a smile that didn’t reach his eyes.","She quickly averted her gaze, only to bump into Ying Chen’s intrigued eyes.","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Ying Chen rested his chin on his hand, twirling a dinner knife in his fingers, staring at her expressionlessly.","She felt strange and lowered her eyes to her food, glancing at Ying Chen out of the corner of her eye.","He was still watching her.","Like Pei Youchuan, his skin was a chocolate tone, popular in Western countries, clearly the result of deliberate tanning.","Ying Chen looked like a mixed-race individual, with deep-set features, a high nose bridge, and thin, well-defined lips. But the most striking feature was his eyes.","Unlike the men around her, Ying Chen’s eyes had a drooping outer corner and were a mysterious shade of green.","When you met his gaze, it gave off a vague sense of being both harmless and dangerous.","Like a black leopard raised in captivity—aggressive yet unpredictable, unsure whether it would bare its claws or gently touch you.","At that moment, Ying Chen was propping his chin with one hand, twirling a sharp dinner knife in the other, staring unblinkingly at her.","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[Why is this Mr. Ying Chen staring at me so much?]","The expressions of the people at the table shifted slightly, their eyes darting toward Ying Chen.","Ying Chen’s gaze swept casually around the table before settling back on Qiao Chuchu, unabashedly continuing to stare.","Pei Yuan’s expression darkened: “Mr. Ying, is there something on my sister’s face?”","Qiao Chuchu was startled, looking at Pei Yuan with delight.","[Big brother, you get it! You noticed he’s been staring at me too, didn’t you?!]","Ying Chen glanced at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan stared back coldly, as if looking at an intruder in his territory.","Ying Chen shrugged indifferently, speaking in French: “I was just thinking about what kind of gift to give this new sister of ours. After all, it’s our first meeting, and as an older brother, I should give her a present. It just took me a while to decide.”","Pei Yuan’s expression grew even more resistant, replying in French: “My sister doesn’t need any gifts. The fact that we’ve met is already a blessing. You don’t need to trouble yourself. But if you keep staring like that, she might get scared.”","Ying Chen’s eyes darkened as he turned to Weisheng Yucan, continuing in French: “Where did you pick up such a treasure? She seems quite likable. I’ve only been looking at her for a while, and already there’s someone stepping up to protect her.”","Yucan smiled faintly, also replying in French: “Haven’t you noticed something special about her?”","In other words, could Ying Chen hear Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts?","Ying Chen glanced at Qiao Chuchu: “She’s quite cute.”","His tone was indifferent, as if he felt nothing more: “That’s all.”","Weisheng Yucan paused, her smile deepening: “Being cute is already rare enough, isn’t it?”","Ying Chen chuckled: “Yes, of course.”","Qiao Chuchu was completely lost, her eyes darting around the table.","[What’s going on? We’re all at the same table, still in China, yet they’re speaking French instead of Chinese?]","[Am I the only one who doesn’t understand French?]","Everyone at the table continued cutting their steaks, their eyes flicking toward Qiao Chuchu, unable to suppress a smirk.","Yes, she was the only one who didn’t understand French.","Weisheng Wenzhan, sitting next to Pei Che, whispered: “Didn’t your family hire a tutor to teach Qiao Chuchu French?”","Foreign language lessons were a basic requirement in their circles. Lou Yuejue probably understood several languages by the age of ten.","Pei Che’s face darkened as he whispered back: “When she was little, Qiao Chuchu would cry every time she had a foreign language class. She’d cry through the entire lesson and couldn’t remember a single word. My mom was afraid she’d cry her eyes out, so she canceled all her language classes. We had a nanny communicate with her in English at home, so she only knows English and Chinese, and her English is mediocre at best.”","Weisheng Wenzhan: “...”","Weisheng Biehe: “...”","Weisheng Lin couldn’t help but laugh: “As the saying goes, when God closes a door, he closes a door.”","Weisheng Huailing disagreed: 「Don’t say that. Qiao Chuchu has a talent—she can draw!」","Weisheng Wenzhan thought of the male protagonist she had drawn, who looked exactly like him, and his face instantly darkened.","When dinner ended, everyone prepared to leave.","After some hesitation, Qiao Chuchu walked over to Lou Tingsi.","The Weisheng family watched her back intently.","Huailing wanted to go talk to Qiao Chuchu.","But Pei Che held him back: “You heard Qiao Chuchu’s thoughts. This is Lou Tingsi’s scene. We’ve already agreed that whoever’s turn it is gets to be with Qiao Chuchu alone. So, it’s Lou Tingsi’s time now. Don’t disturb him.”","Huailing frowned, looking at his siblings.","Weisheng Yucan was surprised: “I didn’t expect you all to be so harmonious. Does that mean you won’t interfere when it’s our turn to take the stage?”","Pei Yuan nodded firmly: “Right, we won’t. We’ll even help behind the scenes.”","“Alright, then the Weisheng family will do the same,” Yucan said, patting Huailing’s shoulder and signing: 「Be patient. This is Lou Tingsi’s scene. They agreed that whoever’s turn it is gets to be with Qiao Chuchu alone. You can talk to her after she’s done with this part of the story.」","Huailing furrowed his brows, typing a message on his phone that was read aloud: “I can be patient, but Lou Tingsi won’t fall for Qiao Chuchu, right?”","The Weisheng family: “...”","The Pei family: “...”","The Lin family: “...”","Pei Buxian suddenly flared up: “Why do you have to say such unsettling things?! How am I supposed to let go now?!”","Pei Youchuan was also annoyed: “Yeah, why do you have to bring that up? How are we supposed to sleep tonight?!”","Weisheng Huailing: “???”","So it’s my fault now?!"]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Qiao Chuchu: Lou Tingsi, have you been busy lately I want to see when you will die.","paragraphs":["Ying Chen stood in the corner, his gaze lingering thoughtfully as he observed the interactions between the Wei Sheng Family, the Pei Family, and the Lin Family.","His eyes then shifted to Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure. His emerald-green eyes swirled with unreadable emotions, locking her firmly in the center of his vision.","Qiao Chuchu came to a stop behind Lou Tingsi and greeted him politely, “Mr. Lou.”","Lou Tingsi turned to look at her, a hint of pleasant surprise in his expression. “Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Chuchu forced a smile and got straight to the point. “Have you been busy lately?”","[I want to see when you’ll die.]","Lou Tingsi’s mouth twitched, and his smile deepened. “I have a business deal with a client tomorrow. I’m flying to France early this morning.”","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, her tone stretching awkwardly. “Oh~ tomorrow~”","[That’s it, then. There’s no time to find the traitor. One wrong move, and tomorrow could be Lou Tingsi’s death anniversary!]","Lou Yuejue’s face turned pale as he looked at his father with fear.","Lou Tingsi patted his son’s shoulder reassuringly. “Is there something you need, Miss Qiao?”","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip, hesitating as she lowered her head.","[Lou Tingsi is leaving early this morning. The prophecy didn’t specifically tell me who the traitor is, so I can’t be sure. Without evidence, I can’t just make accusations. But if I go with him, I’ll be able to foresee the real traitor and pull Lou Tingsi back from the brink of death when the time comes.]","[That way, Lou Yuejue won’t die, my seventh brother won’t die, and no one will die!]","She clenched her teeth and blurted out, “Can I go abroad with you?”","Lou Yuejue’s eyes lit up as he looked at his father with excitement.","Lou Tingsi was visibly surprised, and the smile that didn’t quite reach his eyes finally gained a touch of sincerity. “Why?”","Aren’t you afraid you might die in France and never come back?","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip again, her heart pounding with fear. “I just want to go and have some fun.”","[Stop asking why, big brother. The truth is, I want to save you. If you die, Lou Yuejue probably won’t survive either. He’s too young to lose his family.]","[Besides, I’ve already changed your future. If you die now, all my efforts would’ve been for nothing. I can’t let all that sunk cost go to waste!]","Lou Yuejue looked at Qiao Chuchu with joy, his eyes filled with little hearts!","Big sister is going to protect his dad!","Big sister is so kind!","Lou Tingsi’s lips curled into a mysterious smile.","He hadn’t planned on letting Qiao Chuchu come along.","Because he already had a plan.","But Qiao Chuchu looked so sincere, like a pitiful little child, as if she wouldn’t rest easy unless she went with him.","He agreed readily. “If your brother agrees, I’ll let you come.”","Qiao Chuchu slapped her thigh. “Deal!”","She lifted her skirt and ran over to Pei Yuan, excitedly saying something to him.","Three minutes later, she came running back, still holding her skirt. “My brother agreed!”","Lou Tingsi glanced at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan and the other brothers were frowning deeply, clearly uneasy as they silently mouthed, “Take care of her. Don’t let her go anywhere dangerous.”","Lou Tingsi’s expression darkened slightly, but he smiled at Qiao Chuchu. “Alright, if your brother agreed, then I’ll allow it.”","Qiao Chuchu beamed. “Then what are we waiting for? Let’s go!”","She hurried off, her skirt swishing as she left.","Lou Tingsi watched her retreating figure with interest, then followed her with his son in tow.","From the corner, Ying Chen stared intently at Qiao Chuchu until she disappeared from sight. Only then did he let out a cold laugh.","Didn’t they say there was a traitor by his side too?","Why didn’t she even glance at him?","After midnight, Qiao Chuchu boarded Lou Tingsi’s private jet on schedule.","Although Lou Yuejue had wanted to come along, Lou Tingsi had firmly refused. So, on the plane, it was just her, Lou Tingsi, and one of his friends who had hitched a ride.","Qiao Chuchu felt at ease.","[It’s not just me and Lou Tingsi alone. This isn’t awkward at all. Perfect!]","Lou Tingsi stood behind her, shaking his head helplessly.","Qiao Chuchu looked around the private jet. “Your private jet is pretty spacious.”","Lou Tingsi followed her gaze. “It’s probably not as big as yours, though. Your family has eight people, after all.”","Qiao Chuchu shook her head. “Not really. Our private jet is about the same size as yours. It’s just that the eight of us never travel on the same plane. We’re afraid of an accident wiping us all out. If we all died, there’d be no one left to inherit the family fortune.”","Lou Tingsi was taken aback but then chuckled. “I understand. My son and I don’t travel on the same plane either.”","Lou Tingsi’s friend tugged at his sleeve and whispered, “Is she your girlfriend?”","Lou Tingsi frowned. “Of course not.”","The friend grew curious. “Are you planning to pursue her, then?”","Lou Tingsi’s brow furrowed. “No, she’s just a friend.”","The friend was stunned, his eyes widening in disbelief. “You’re not afraid of women? You can actually have female friends?!”","“It’s a business connection,” Lou Tingsi said, clearly annoyed. “Don’t make a big deal out of it.”","The friend gave him a teasing once-over. “I don’t think so. You’re usually just polite to women, but it’s all surface-level.”","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow. “So, you’re saying I’m not just being polite with her?”","The friend scoffed. “Come on, you’re even carrying her bag! Or did you just snatch it from her when you saw her?”","Lou Tingsi: “?”","Lou Tingsi looked down and realized he was indeed holding Qiao Chuchu’s handbag.","......","He awkwardly placed the bag on the seat. “It’s just common courtesy.”","The friend smirked, his tone dripping with sarcasm. “Oh yeah, common courtesy, sure~ yoyoyoyo~!”","Lou Tingsi: “......”","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure.","Qiao Chuchu had already chosen her seat. “I’ll sit here!”","He nodded with a smile and pointed to the front cabin. “There’s a fruit bar over there. Go pick some fruit to eat. I had it prepared especially for you.”","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up at the suggestion. “Great!”","She happily dashed into the cabin, pulling the curtain shut behind her.","[It’s been seven years since I’ve been on a private jet! This is so exciting!]","Lou Tingsi was momentarily stunned, then smiled as he watched her joyful figure.","The friend, seeing this, opened his mouth to say something but decided against it, opting to tease instead. “You’re a grown man with a ten-year-old son. Don’t you have any... worldly desires?”","“I do, and I’m quite passionate,” Lou Tingsi replied casually, taking a sip of the champagne the flight attendant handed him. “I just usually suppress them.”","The friend: “?”","Qiao Chuchu, who was about to enter the cabin with her fruit: “?”","[Are they really talking about something so private? Maybe I shouldn’t go in.]","Lou Tingsi paused mid-sip, awkwardly glancing in Qiao Chuchu’s direction: “......”","Five minutes later, Qiao Chuchu hesitantly emerged, deliberately avoiding eye contact with Lou Tingsi as she took her seat without looking back.","Lou Tingsi: “......”","He suddenly felt a surge of irritation and shot his friend a glare. “There’s a bed in there. Aren’t you going to sleep?”","The friend blinked. “I’m not tired. Why would I sleep?”","Lou Tingsi’s gaze darkened, his tone threatening. “No, you’re tired.”","The friend: “......”","The friend sighed and stood up. “What if you need the bed later? Are you going to kick me out to make room for you two?”","Lou Tingsi’s face darkened, and he kicked at his friend. “Get out!”","The friend dodged nimbly. “Fine, fine, I’m leaving. Do whatever you want. It’s your plane, after all. You’re the boss.”","Now, the cabin was empty except for the two of them.","Lou Tingsi hesitated for a moment, then walked over to Qiao Chuchu. “Eating strawberries?”","Qiao Chuchu, who was holding half a strawberry, froze mid-chew, looking like a guilty hamster caught in the act. “Yes.”","[I hope he thinks I didn’t hear that conversation. Otherwise, this is so awkward.]"]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: Schrödinger's \"Gynophobia\"","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi’s face darkened, and he glared fiercely toward the private room where his friend was sitting. The atmosphere around him instantly turned heavy.","Qiao Chuchu noticed it immediately.","【? He’s upset? Is it because I’ve been keeping my distance since we got on the plane, and he thinks I’m just using him for a free trip abroad?】","【That can’t be it. When have I ever taken advantage of anyone other than my brother? I absolutely can’t let him misunderstand me!】","She put on a friendly smile and handed him some fruit. “Want to share?”","Lou Tingsi paused, glancing at the empty seat beside her.","After a moment of hesitation, he sat down, subtly keeping some distance between them.","It was clear that Lou Tingsi didn’t like being too close to her, but for some reason, he still chose to sit next to her.","It was like... he didn’t want physical proximity, but emotionally, he wanted to stay connected. A strange contradiction.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t miss this small detail: 【Oh right, I almost forgot. Lou Tingsi is fundamentally uncomfortable around women.】","【Lou Tingsi doesn’t like excessive physical contact or closeness with women. I should avoid making him uncomfortable.】","Lou Tingsi glanced at Qiao Chuchu’s profile out of the corner of his eye, and his gloomy expression gradually softened.","Qiao Chuchu handed him the fruit plate. “Take from this side. I haven’t touched it.”","Lou Tingsi looked at the neatly arranged fruit plate, the corner of his mouth twitching almost imperceptibly.","Qiao Chuchu had a great quality—she was exactly as she appeared, straightforward and uncomplicated.","She also knew her boundaries, was polite, and avoided stepping on her friends’ sensitivities.","He picked up a strawberry, his tone light. “I have a business meeting tomorrow. After that, I’ll take you out.”","Qiao Chuchu tensed up immediately. “Can I come to the meeting? I’ve never seen that kind of business before. It might give me some inspiration for my manga, like making my male lead have a dangerous profession or something!~”","She was thrilled inside.","【This excuse is so clever. Using my manga as a cover, no one will suspect a thing.】","【But there’s a traitor around Lou Tingsi. If I’m there, I can help him identify them.】","Lou Tingsi chuckled and forcefully stuffed a strawberry the size of a baby’s fist into her mouth. “No.”","Qiao Chuchu’s mouth was full of strawberry, and she instinctively opened her mouth to hold it. “Mmmph?!”","Why not?","Lou Tingsi’s eyes darkened, and almost involuntarily, he reached out and used his finger to push the strawberry further into her mouth.","Qiao Chuchu frowned, turning her head away. “Mmmph! Mmmph!”","Stop feeding me, I can’t eat anymore!","But he held her chin, gently pushing the rest of the strawberry in, forcing it into her mouth.","“Dangerous,” he said calmly, watching her puffed-up cheeks with a deep gaze. “Very dangerous.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","【You’re the dangerous one here. I didn’t even want to eat it, and you’re forcing it on me. If that strawberry were any bigger, I’d choke to death.】","Lou Tingsi’s Adam’s apple bobbed, and he turned away to take a sip of champagne.","Qiao Chuchu reluctantly chewed the strawberry, complaining, “I’m just saying, you should be careful. If there’s a traitor around you, it could be fatal. Your job is high-risk!”","He smirked. “Yeah, sure, sure.”","Qiao Chuchu felt he was being dismissive. “I’m serious. I did a tarot reading, and it said you’re in danger. Your aura is dark.”","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow, teasing her. “But isn’t ‘dark aura’ a Chinese fortune-telling thing? Does tarot also talk about dark auras?”","Qiao Chuchu froze for a moment. “...I’m good at blending Eastern and Western methods.”","Lou Tingsi teased further. “But I didn’t see you bring any tarot cards.”","Her mouth twitched, and she stubbornly replied, “I used an app. It’s just as accurate, okay?”","Lou Tingsi laughed even more. “Sure, of course. Whatever you say, Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","【Why does it feel like he’s humoring a child?!】","【But honestly, even I don’t believe there’s a traitor around him. How can I expect him to?】","Qiao Chuchu grew more anxious. 【Sigh, I don’t know if he’ll take my warning seriously. If he dies, the Dragon Family will grow stronger.】","【But the Dragon Family’s rise isn’t the main issue. The real problem is the chain reaction it would cause. If Lou Tingsi dies, Lou Yuejue dies, and my seventh brother dies too. Two of my favorite characters and one of my family members gone at once? That’s like killing me.】","【But...】","Qiao Chuchu sighed in relief and looked out the window.","【I think Lou Tingsi is easier to handle. If I’m patient, I can definitely resolve this politely.】","【After all, Lou Tingsi is uncomfortable around women, so he’ll naturally avoid too much physical interaction. It might even be more comfortable than being around my brother.】","Just as she was thinking this, Lou Tingsi suddenly leaned toward her.","Qiao Chuchu jumped. “!”","Lou Tingsi fastened her seatbelt. “The plane’s about to take off. Don’t move around.”","She came back to her senses, feeling a bit embarrassed. “Thanks. I was distracted.”","Lou Tingsi smiled faintly. “It’s fine.”","She hesitated but decided to try again. “Mr. Lou, can I please come with you to the meeting?”","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow at her.","She raised her hand. “I promise I won’t cause any trouble. I’m a sharpshooter, and I can drive fast. If someone tries to chase us, I can definitely get us out of there.”","She was getting anxious.","【If he doesn’t take me, I won’t be able to figure out who the traitor is!】","【And if Lou Tingsi leaves alive but comes back unconscious and dies in the hospital, I can’t accept that kind of twist.】","She sighed and pleaded, “Please, just take me with you, okay?”","Lou Tingsi looked at her with a sly smile, like a cunning fox. “No.”","Qiao Chuchu pouted pitifully. “What if I beg you?”","Lou Tingsi paused, intrigued. He leaned closer, resting his chin on his hand. “How are you going to beg me?”","His voice softened, his lips curving into a smile as he moved closer to her.","Qiao Chuchu earnestly held up the fruit plate. “I’ll give you some fruit.”","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow, unimpressed. “You know I bought this fruit, right, Miss Qiao?”","Qiao Chuchu froze for a moment, then pulled out a hundred-yuan bill. “Then I’ll buy it from you!”","Lou Tingsi: “?”","Qiao Chuchu energetically pushed the fruit plate toward him. “Here, have some fruit!”","She picked up a strawberry and held it to his lips. “This one’s super sweet!”","Lou Tingsi was momentarily stunned, but then his gaze turned dangerous. He slowly ate the strawberry, his eyes never leaving hers.","He licked his lips, his expression growing more intense.","Qiao Chuchu looked at him expectantly. “Sweet, right?”","Lou Tingsi nodded.","She grinned like a fool. “So, can I come with you now?”","Lou Tingsi smiled. “No.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","She opened her mouth to protest, but Lou Tingsi suddenly shoved another strawberry into her mouth!","She was caught off guard, her eyes widening as she felt him deliberately pushing the strawberry in.","She leaned back in shock!","But Lou Tingsi held the back of her head, not letting her escape. He leaned in, his voice calm but firm. “I believe your tarot reading, but I won’t let you go to the meeting. I promised your brother I wouldn’t take you to dangerous places, and for my own sake, I won’t let you go either.”","He leaned closer, his warm breath brushing her ear as he tucked the hundred-yuan bill into her hand. “Miss Qiao, if you behave, I’ll behave too. So wait for me to finish my meeting, and I’ll take you out. Don’t push me, okay?”"]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Looks Weak and Inexperienced","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu sat stiffly in her seat, glancing at Lou Tingsi.","His beautiful eyes carried an unreadable emotion, his gaze lingering ambiguously on her lips.","Qiao Chuchu was both startled and suspicious.","[What’s he doing? Surely he’s not thinking of kissing me, right?]","His eyes darkened, his Adam’s apple bobbing as he shifted his gaze to her wet, glistening eyes.","Qiao Chuchu instinctively covered her mouth.","[If he dares to kiss me, I’ll push him off this plane!!]","Lou Tingsi: “?”","He chuckled softly, then turned away and sat back properly.","Qiao Chuchu’s face flushed red. She straightened up and obediently ate the strawberry.","[Is this the advantage of an older man? Even though he’s a real father figure, he doesn’t give off that “dad” vibe. Every move he makes is kind of sexy?]","She stole a glance at Lou Tingsi.","Lou Tingsi leaned back comfortably, eyes closed, resting.","Being this close, she noticed that his skin, despite being a man who always carried a gun, was surprisingly smooth and tender.","His nose was delicate and slightly upturned.","Qiao Chuchu sighed inwardly: [Ah, God really does favor the beautiful. No matter what, good-looking people are just perfect in every way.]","Lou Tingsi’s lips curved slightly, still resting with his eyes closed.","He was already carrying the faint scent of Qiao Chuchu’s perfume.","It was a subtle, not overpowering fragrance.","Familiar.","“What perfume are you wearing?” he asked, eyes still closed.","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment. “Chanel’s Gabrielle Essence.”","It was one of the perfumes from the bouquet Lou Yuejue had given her recently.","She added, “It was a gift from Lou Yuejue. I like it so much that I’ve been wearing it exclusively lately. I didn’t expect your little brother to have such good taste.”","Lou Tingsi’s lips curled into a smile.","Actually, it was he who had chosen that particular bottle of Gabrielle.","It was the only one he had picked.","He slowly opened his eyes, his smile meaningful. “Thank you for the compliment.”","Qiao Chuchu waved her hand, smiling. “You’re welcome.”","She sighed inwardly: [It’s just that you’re so stubborn. If only you’d listen to me, I wouldn’t have to come up with another plan to deal with the traitor.]","Lou Tingsi’s brows furrowed almost imperceptibly. “Miss Qiao, about the traitor situation you mentioned earlier—I’ve already come up with a plan.”","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, her interest piqued. “What plan?”","Lou Tingsi: “During the transaction, I’ll tell my three most trusted subordinates three different locations, claiming that’s where I’ll be hiding.”","“Whoever comes to kill me is the traitor.”","Lou Tingsi’s dark eyes carried a stormy, murderous intent, but his voice remained gentle. “What do you think?”","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment, then nodded. “That seems like the simplest way. But what if all three of them come for you at the same time?”","Lou Tingsi chuckled, turning to look ahead. “That won’t happen. During business, they’ll be stationed in three different directions for support. They won’t know what the others are doing. Only the one with ambition will make a move.”","“So don’t worry.”","His tone was calm and confident. “I’ll definitely find out who the traitor is.”","Qiao Chuchu looked at his confident profile and nodded firmly, clenching her fist.","[Great!]","[Someone like Lou Tingsi deserves to make money!]","[But I never expected him to be so easily swayed. He looks so cunning, yet he’s so quick to trust. I just casually mentioned that his forehead looked dark, and he believed me completely. Turns out he’s all brawn and no brains, hahahahahahahaha!]","Lou Tingsi: “...?”","By the time the plane landed at the private airport in Country F, it was already 4 a.m. in China.","But in Country F, it was 10 p.m.","Lou Tingsi leaned down and gently patted Qiao Chuchu’s shoulder. “Miss Qiao, we’ve landed.”","Qiao Chuchu didn’t even furrow her brows, sound asleep in her seat.","Her sleep quality was top-notch.","A flight attendant smiled and asked, “Should I wake the guest?”","Lou Tingsi waved his hand, unbuttoning his suit jacket. “No need. I’ll carry her. I don’t want her to wake up and then have trouble falling back asleep.”","The flight attendant’s eyes lit up, suppressing a smile as she stepped back, discreetly observing the two.","Lou Tingsi carefully unbuckled Qiao Chuchu’s seatbelt, draped a plane blanket over her, and even wrapped another blanket around her head, as if afraid she might catch a chill. He made sure every part of her was covered before gently lifting her into his arms.","Hmm?","Lou Tingsi was slightly surprised.","Qiao Chuchu always seemed so energetic, bouncing around all day, but she was surprisingly light.","He carried her through the aisle.","A friend of his, yawning, emerged from the other side and froze at the sight. “Holy crap?!”","Lou Tingsi shot him a warning glance and carried Qiao Chuchu off the plane.","Four people and a group of subordinates had been waiting for a while. They quickly approached as Lou Tingsi descended.","A tall woman in the center, her expression relaxed and smiling, stepped forward faster than the other three. “Boss!”","Her gaze shifted downward, landing on Qiao Chuchu. Her smile instantly stiffened.","A bespectacled man walked up calmly, also surprised at the sight of Qiao Chuchu, but he wisely lowered his voice. “Boss? Who’s this?”","A tall, muscular man glanced at Qiao Chuchu and smirked. “The boss’s girlfriend, obviously. What else could she be? His daughter?”","A man who looked to be in his sixties chuckled, turning to the bespectacled man. “Exactly, Zhu Changming. When have you ever seen the boss bring another woman to meet us, let alone carry her in his arms?”","Zhu Changming lowered his head, embarrassed. “Uncle Wang, you’re teasing me again. I just wanted to hear the boss confirm it himself.”","The woman beside them, however, remained silent, her expression dark as she glared at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu groggily opened her eyes, looking around.","Lou Tingsi leaned down gently. “Awake?”","Still half-asleep, she slid off Lou Tingsi, her legs a bit unsteady. “When did we land?”","“Just now,” Lou Tingsi said, draping the blanket over her. “You just woke up. Don’t catch a cold. Let’s get in the car.”","Qiao Chuchu yawned, still dazed, as she looked at the four people in front of her.","A tall woman with a classic Western figure—curvy hips and thick thighs—was glaring at her coldly.","A broad-shouldered, dark-skinned man was eyeing her up and down with a smirk.","An elderly man in a traditional Chinese suit gave her a kind nod.","And... a bespectacled man who looked rather handsome was smiling at her.","Qiao Chuchu became a bit more alert, her gaze lingering on the bespectacled man.","[This man... I feel like I’ve seen him somewhere before, but I can’t remember where.]","[Is one of these four the traitor? They all seem pretty decent.]","Qiao Chuchu noticed the woman who had been glaring at her.","The woman crossed her arms, scrutinizing her, and let out what sounded like a disdainful snort before rolling her eyes openly.","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[I don’t know if the other three men are traitors, but I’m pretty sure this woman isn’t. She clearly has feelings for Lou Tingsi and sees me as a rival.]","[But did Lou Tingsi just carry me out?]","Qiao Chuchu finally realized: [Oh no! Did he try to wake me up and I didn’t budge? Did I sleep like a log again? That’s so embarrassing!]","She glanced at the woman.","[Does she think I’m the type to burp milk, fart milk, and cry for hugs?]","[Ah! My reputation is ruined! This is so humiliating!]","Lou Tingsi: “...”"]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Lou Tingsi: How Fun Qiao Chuchu Is","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi looked at the woman and said in a deep voice, \"Song Yu.\"","The woman instinctively straightened her posture. \"Yes.\"","Lou Tingsi turned to Qiao Chuchu. \"This is Qiao Chuchu, the younger sister of my friend. You can address her as Miss Qiao. Take care of her; she doesn't speak French.\"","Song Yu frowned slightly and walked over to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu felt as if a mountain had been thrust in her face and glanced down at Song Yu's shoes.","Flat-soled combat boots.","【Holy cow! This girl must be at least six feet tall!!!】","Song Yu extended her hand. \"Hello, I'm Song Yu.\"","Qiao Chuchu cautiously shook her hand. \"Hello, Qiao Chuchu.\"","Song Yu stepped aside and gestured. \"After you.\"","Qiao Chuchu nervously brushed past her, taking several deep breaths.","Lou Tingsi noticed her subtle movements and chuckled softly. \"Song Yu, she's the one who saved my son's life. You must treat her with the utmost respect.\"","Song Yu glanced at Qiao Chuchu with a hint of surprise, her previously defiant expression softening slightly. \"Understood.\"","She walked directly to Qiao Chuchu's side.","Qiao Chuchu glanced back uneasily at Lou Tingsi.","Lou Tingsi was speaking to the three other men. Noticing Qiao Chuchu's gaze, he waved at her and mouthed, \"Don't be afraid of her. She listens to me.\"","Qiao Chuchu stood beside Song Yu like a little bean, nodding and straightening her back as she walked forward with confidence.","Lou Tingsi couldn't help but laugh. \"Look how nervous she is. It's quite amusing.\"","The three men turned to look at Qiao Chuchu, all wearing mischievous grins. \"Boss, it seems you've found someone special.\"","Lou Tingsi was taken aback and frowned. \"Nonsense. Don't spread rumors. I just find her interesting, that's all.\"","Zhu Changming smirked slyly. \"Oh, just interesting, huh? But Boss, you've never been fond of women. I've never heard you say someone was interesting before.\"","Lou Tingsi clicked his tongue and glared at them reproachfully. \"Is everything prepared?\"","They nodded. \"Yes, the handover is in one hour!\"","Lou Tingsi gave a nod and motioned for Zhu Changming to follow him. \"Come here.\"","Zhu Changming scurried over. \"Brother!~\"","Lou Tingsi glanced at the other two. \"There might be a traitor among us. Song Yu, Uncle Wang, and Da Qiang are all suspects. Qiao Chuchu is my honored guest. Make sure your trusted men keep her safe.\"","Zhu Changming was shocked. \"A traitor? How are you so sure? Did they reveal themselves?\"","\"That's not your concern,\" Lou Tingsi said firmly. \"Just know that Qiao Chuchu must not be harmed. I'll also inform the three of them about my hiding spot. Stay close to me. Whoever comes to kill me is the traitor. Got it?\"","Zhu Changming nodded nervously. \"Understood!\"","He also looked a bit heartbroken, lowering his head sadly. \"But I never thought there would be a traitor among us. It seems we have no choice but to act.\"","Lou Tingsi patted his shoulder reassuringly. \"Changming, I've known you since you were five. I took you in when I was fifteen, and I've always treated you like my own brother. I know this is hard for you, but in our line of work, we can't afford to be soft-hearted.\"","To him, there were only three trusted confidants.","Zhu Changming was the exception.","He was like a son to him, a brother he had raised from childhood.","Zhu Changming kept his head low, his voice filled with disappointment. \"Yes, rest assured, I'll make sure my men take good care of Miss Qiao.\"","Meanwhile, hidden in the shadows of the airport, Ying Chen sat in his car, chewing gum lazily as he picked up a pair of binoculars and locked onto Qiao Chuchu's vehicle.","He had flown here early just to keep an eye on Qiao Chuchu.","This woman seemed to have the ability to predict the future, but she didn't realize her thoughts were leaking out.","Based on his observations, those close to her could hear her inner thoughts and believed them completely.","Qiao Chuchu had predicted that Lou Tingsi had a traitor in his ranks.","She had also predicted that Ying Chen had a traitor in his.","But now, Qiao Chuchu had come to help Lou Tingsi, completely ignoring Ying Chen as if he were just a passerby.","Clearly, Qiao Chuchu didn't care about him.","But he couldn't afford not to care about his own survival!","Ying Chen irritably unbuttoned his collar, his eyes fixed on Qiao Chuchu's car. \"Keep a close eye on her. Don't lose her. I want her alive.\"","The subordinate in the passenger seat nodded and picked up the walkie-talkie. \"All units, follow Qiao Chuchu closely. If we're going to kidnap her, make sure she's alive.\"","---","Qiao Chuchu sat uneasily in the back seat of the car, watching as Lou Tingsi and Zhu Changming got into another vehicle.","As their car drove further away, her anxiety grew. \"Is Mr. Lou going to negotiate the deal now?\"","Song Yu stood outside the car without answering. Someone whispered something to her, and she abruptly closed the car door.","Qiao Chuchu was startled and got out of the car. \"Song Yu, aren't you coming?\"","\"I need to go with the boss for the deal. Someone else will take care of you,\" Song Yu said coldly, taking a pistol from one of her subordinates. \"The boss wants you to go home and rest. Tomorrow morning, we'll take you shopping and sightseeing.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned and stepped closer. \"Um... Can I go with you? I'm worried about your boss's safety.\"","Song Yu paused while adjusting her wrist guard and glanced down at her with a mocking expression. \"No.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...I know you don't trust me much, but I can use a gun, drive, and even sneak around. I have skills. Lend me your pistol, and I can show you.\"","Song Yu let out a cold laugh. \"How fascinating. A delicate princess who needs to be carried to bed actually knows how to use a gun? Is it a water gun?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","The strong women around Song Yu burst into laughter.","Song Yu sneered as she brushed past Qiao Chuchu. \"Escort Miss Qiao into the car. Make sure she's not hurt. Let her eat and buy whatever she wants. Under no circumstances should she feel slighted. That's the boss's explicit order.\"","Several subordinates who had run over nodded. \"Understood.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, watching helplessly as Song Yu got into another Jeep and disappeared from view.","A bespectacled, well-mannered man walked up to her with a smile. \"Miss Qiao, hello. I'm one of Zhu Changming's men. You can call me Jack. Please get in the car, and I'll take you to the boss's home.\"","Reluctantly, she complied and got into the car, clearly in low spirits.","Jack held a tablet and said, \"The trip will take about an hour and a half. You can sleep, watch a movie, or listen to music. Is there anything I can do for you?\"","Qiao Chuchu was growing increasingly agitated.","She clenched her fists. The effects of the strength-enhancing pill should still be active.","The system's items usually disappeared at 8 a.m. the next day.","It was currently 4 a.m. in China.","She had four more hours before the pill's effects wore off.","She glanced at her phone. Her Chinese mobile data didn't work abroad. \"I need Wi-Fi.\"","Jack quickly connected her.","Her WeChat notifications started pinging nonstop.","Pei Yuan: 「Have you landed yet?」","Pei Che: 「Where are you?」","Pei Youchuan: 「Bye, call me on video when you land.」","Pei Fengnong: 「Send a message when you land.」","Pei Mu and Pei Ci: 「Call us on video in this group as soon as you land!」","Pei Buxian: 「Have you landed yet have you landed yet have you landed yet have you landed yet have you landed yet have you landed yet have you landed yet?」","Weisheng Huailing: 「Have you landed, sister? Can you give me a video call, sister?」","Weisheng Biehe: 「Give me a call.」","Weisheng Wenzhan: 「Where are you now?」","Weisheng Yucan: 「Don't be blinded by just one man. Don't give up the whole forest for one tree.」","Lin Qing: 「Stay safe! Have a great trip~~~~~」","Lin Shen: 「I can't sleep. Can you send me a voice message after you land?」","Lou Yuejue: 「I miss you and Dad, sister. I'll be waiting at home for you to come back.」","A friend request: 「Hello, I'm Ying Chen. Please accept my request.」","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She was starting to forget what the words \"have you landed\" even meant.","And what was with Weisheng Yucan's random comment? Did she send it to the wrong person?"]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Win Dust: Did You See That Qiao Chuchu Can Also Drift","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu responded to the messages one by one, but as soon as she finished, video calls started pouring in one after another.","Even Weisheng Biehe and Weisheng Wenzhan took the initiative to call her and chat for a bit.","Pei Buxian, on the other hand, angrily demanded to know who she was video chatting with.","By the time she finished all the video calls, forty minutes had already passed.","Ying Chen's friend request was accepted, but Ying Chen didn’t say anything, and she couldn’t be bothered to speak either.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","So tired.","She closed her phone and rested her eyes: \"Jack, the four confidants around Mr. Lou—have they always been in France and never returned to China, right?\"","Jack, calmly looking at his tablet, replied, \"I can’t speak for the others, but Mr. Zhu Changming has always lived abroad. He got separated from his parents at the age of five and was taken in by the boss as his younger brother. He’s been by the boss’s side ever since. Because Mr. Zhu’s health is poor and he’s often sick, the boss gave him the name ‘Changming,’ hoping he’d live a long life.\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her eyes, feeling puzzled.","If she had never met Zhu Changming before, why did he seem familiar to her?","She glanced at Jack.","Jack was holding the tablet, and on the screen was footage of Lou Tingsi and the others preparing for a deal at an abandoned factory.","Lou Tingsi, Song Yu, Uncle Wang, and Da Qiang were all visible in the surveillance footage.","She asked, confused, \"Are you monitoring them?\"","Jack’s eyes widened in alarm at first, then he chuckled helplessly: \"Don’t misunderstand me. I’m in a support role. I’m Mr. Zhu’s man. Besides the boss, only Mr. Zhu and I have the authority to track everyone’s locations.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded in realization.","Wait a minute!","She recalled the prophetic vision she had seen.","In one scene, Xia Xuechun was surrounded by the Dragon Family, confidently arguing with her.","At the edge of the Dragon Family group, there was a bespectacled, clean-cut man who seemed to be Zhu Changming!","A chill ran down her spine, and she glanced at Jack out of the corner of her eye.","Jack’s hand was in his pocket, as if he was about to pull out a gun.","She grabbed his wrist tightly: \"Do you know what my hidden talent is?\"","Jack was taken aback, narrowing his eyes sarcastically: \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, putting on a pitiful puppy-dog expression: \"My hidden talent is that, even though I look like a weakling, I can actually crush your wrist.\"","She squeezed hard!","Jack let out a sudden scream: \"Ah!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu yanked the gun from his hand, shot the man in the passenger seat, and then pressed the gun to the driver’s head: \"Pull over!\"","The driver immediately stopped the car by the side of the road!","Ying Chen, who had been tailing the car, put down his binoculars: \"Stop the car!\"","His car came to a halt.","Ying Chen raised the binoculars again, squinting at Qiao Chuchu’s car, a hint of worry in his voice: \"The car stopped so abruptly. Could she have been killed?\"","A minute later, the car door opened, and Jack fell out unconscious.","Ying Chen: \"?\"","The man in the passenger seat was also dragged out by the driver.","Ying Chen: \"??\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the car, holding the gun to the driver’s head, forcing him to crouch by the roadside, then drove off on her own.","Ying Chen: \"???\"","Ying Chen uncertainly lowered the binoculars, then raised them again to focus on Qiao Chuchu’s car: \"Am I seeing things?\"","The bodyguard in the passenger seat stared in shock at the two unconscious men on the ground: \"No, Boss, you’re not seeing things. She really knows how to use a gun, but it seems she left them alive.\"","Ying Chen processed this for a moment, his emerald-green eyes gradually lighting up with a crazed delight: \"Ha! So this woman has another side to her!!\"","The bodyguard asked, puzzled, \"Should we make our move now?\"","\"Don’t,\" Ying Chen leaned back comfortably, his eyes filled with intrigue. \"She’s probably figured out who the real traitor is. Let’s follow her. I want to see how she plans to play this out.\"","Qiao Chuchu opened the tablet, located the factory where Lou Tingsi was conducting the deal, copied the coordinates into the navigation system, and sped off toward the factory.","Her car zoomed past Ying Chen’s.","Ying Chen burst into laughter, slapping the seat: \"Did you see that? She even knows how to drift! Follow her!\"","Qiao Chuchu set the tablet aside and glanced at the screen.","?","In the footage, Song Yu and the other three were already engaged in a firefight.","Song Yu was in an open area with little cover, clearly at a disadvantage.","Meanwhile, Lou Tingsi’s side was still calm.","He held a tablet, and the three men on the screen were still patrolling, seemingly unaware of the attack.","Zhu Changming stood like a ghost behind Lou Tingsi, motionless, as if waiting for the right moment.","Qiao Chuchu picked up her phone, about to call Lou Tingsi.","But she hesitated.","This might alert the enemy.","Instead, she decided to call Lou Yuejue.","Lou Yuejue, who was just about to go to sleep, was delighted to receive the video call: \"Sister?\"","Qiao Chuchu got straight to the point: \"Yuejue, there’s a traitor by your father’s side—Zhu Changming! He’s behind your father, watching him. I can’t call your father directly; you need to call him and subtly warn him. Don’t let Zhu Changming catch on! Understand?!\"","She had initially thought of telling her eldest brother to handle it, as he was the most capable in her family. But that might raise suspicions.","Lou Yuejue, however, was different. As Lou Tingsi’s son, it would be perfectly normal for him to call his father.","Lou Yuejue sat up in bed: \"Don’t worry, Sister. My dad and I have a code. I’ll tell him I had a nightmare and need comfort. He won’t suspect a thing.\"","Qiao Chuchu hung up and glanced back at the tablet.","Song Yu’s group had already lost most of their men, while the other two were still relatively safe.","Qiao Chuchu floored the accelerator, speeding toward Song Yu’s location.","-","Song Yu was hiding behind cover, her gun out of bullets!","Her two remaining subordinates were trapped beside her: \"Sister Yu, we’re out of ammo!\"","Song Yu clenched her teeth, filled with resentment: \"Looks like today’s the day we die.\"","Her subordinate’s face turned pale: \"Someone must’ve betrayed us! The buyer stood us up, and then these people showed up to ambush us!\"","Song Yu grabbed the walkie-talkie, calling for help: \"Uncle Wang! Da Qiang, where are you?!\"","No response.","But the enemy’s footsteps were getting closer.","Song Yu closed her eyes, resigned to her fate: \"They’re probably done for too. We’re really going to die here.\"","Suddenly, a car blared its horn, piercing through the air: \"Beep beep beep!!!\"","The armed men turned in shock and fired at the car.","The car plowed through them without hesitation, stopping right in front of Song Yu!","Song Yu looked up in shock as the window rolled down, revealing Qiao Chuchu’s harmless face.","From inside the bulletproof Jeep, she yelled furiously: \"What are you waiting for?! Get in if you don’t want to die!!!\""]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: A Bit Cocky, But So Handsome","paragraphs":["Song Yu didn’t have time to think. She scrambled into the car, practically rolling in!","She slammed the door shut and stared at Qiao Chuchu in shock. “Why is it you?!”","Qiao Chuchu floored the accelerator, breaking through the encirclement with Song Yu and her two subordinates in tow. “Of course it’s me. Who else did you think would come to save you?!”","“That’s not what I meant,” Song Yu said, gripping the car seat and leaning forward to look at Qiao Chuchu’s profile. “I mean, how do you even know how to drive? And so skillfully at that!”","What’s more, she had the guts to charge in alone to rescue them!","Qiao Chuchu scoffed, rolling her eyes dramatically. “I already told you I could. You’re the one who didn’t believe me!”","Song Yu was still in disbelief, staring at Qiao Chuchu’s soft, baby-faced profile. “But you look less intimidating than my dog! How could I have believed you? I’d need some next-level insight to see through your gentle exterior and recognize your badass soul!”","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow. “Are you complimenting me or insulting me?”","Song Yu climbed into the passenger seat and buckled her seatbelt, urgency in her voice. “I’m complimenting you! You saved my life—why would I insult you?!”","Qiao Chuchu smirked and glanced at Song Yu. “There are three guns in the storage compartment. And a few sniper rifles in the trunk.”","Song Yu froze for a moment, then quickly opened the compartment.","Sure enough, there were three guns inside!","She handed one to each of her subordinates and asked in amazement, “How did you know these were here?”","Qiao Chuchu swerved around the pursuers, heading straight for the gate. “I took them from those traitors.”","Song Yu stared at her, stunned.","Qiao Chuchu executed a sharp drift, dodging an oncoming car with such ease that the tail of their vehicle nearly flew off. Her voice, however, was as calm as if she were discussing dinner. “Fear usually comes from a lack of firepower. I’d never let myself be in that position.”","She glanced at Song Yu nonchalantly. “Relax, we’re not going to die.”","For some reason, she was absolutely confident about it.","Probably because the energy booster had made her fearless.","Song Yu’s eyes lit up, and without a second thought, she planted a big kiss on Qiao Chuchu’s cheek!","Qiao Chuchu: “?!”","Song Yu wrapped her arms around Qiao Chuchu, showering her with praise. “You’re amazing! Seriously, you’re freaking incredible!!!”","Her two subordinates in the back were utterly dumbfounded. “Am I seeing things?”","The other subordinate was equally stunned. “No, you’re not. This is the first time Boss Song has ever kissed anyone.”","The subordinate started to look nervous. “And it’s also the first time she’s smiled this brightly at someone!”","Qiao Chuchu: “???”","Song Yu grinned at her, teeth gleaming. “I’m sorry for all the prejudices I had against you before. I sincerely apologize.”","...","Qiao Chuchu shuddered, goosebumps rising all over her body. “If you really want to apologize, maybe stop smiling at me like that. It’s creeping me out.”","Song Yu: “?”","Ying Chen, watching through binoculars as Qiao Chuchu’s car approached, gave an order. “She’s coming. Get ready to follow her.”","The bodyguard in the passenger seat nodded, then noticed something else. “Boss, there’s a car heading straight for us!”","Ying Chen glanced to the side and saw a vehicle charging toward them.","He smirked dismissively. “Finish this quickly.”","The bodyguard raised his gun, ready to act.","Suddenly, Qiao Chuchu’s car drifted sideways, cutting off the oncoming vehicle!","The driver of the other car swerved in panic, crashing hard into a wall!","Qiao Chuchu smoothly turned the wheel and drove away, her car brushing past Ying Chen’s.","The bodyguard’s jaw dropped. “Boss, you said to finish this quickly, and Qiao Chuchu just did it for us?!”","Ying Chen didn’t respond, his gaze fixed on Qiao Chuchu with a mix of surprise and intrigue.","Qiao Chuchu’s side of the car was illuminated by the headlights of the enemies ahead.","In the light, her curly hair was half-tucked behind her ear, the other half cascading lazily over her shoulder. She wore a sleek black wool jacket, her upper body exuding sharpness and confidence. She cast a brief, indifferent glance at his car before coolly looking away.","Damn, she’s kind of... cool?"]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: How Can I Believe You're Harmless When You're So Fierce","paragraphs":["Ying Chen's emerald-green eyes gradually widened, as if he had encountered something entirely new, sparking a sense of novelty that even he hadn't noticed.","Suddenly, his phone rang.","Ying Chen opened it to see a message from Weisheng Huailing.","Huailing: \"Brother Ying Chen, just wanted to let you know, I really like Qiao Chuchu, whom you met today. Please treat her as my girlfriend from now on.\"","Huailing sent a photo of himself with Qiao Chuchu.","In the photo, Qiao Chuchu playfully winked at the camera, while Huailing stood behind her, holding his phone, smiling sweetly at the lens.","Weisheng Huailing: \"We make a great pair, but Weisheng Biehe seems to have a thing for Qiao Chuchu. I hope you’ll support us and not side with Weisheng Biehe.\"","Ying Chen snorted, unimpressed.","Weisheng Huailing wasn’t the type to need anyone’s support. He was famously independent, a bit of an oddball. Why would he need Ying Chen’s backing?","This was clearly a hint for Ying Chen not to set his sights on Qiao Chuchu.","It was like a male animal marking its territory.","He typed back: \"Keep bragging, and I’ll screenshot this and send it to Qiao Chuchu.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"??????????\"","Ying Chen’s emerald-green eyes shifted thoughtfully.","Weisheng Huailing liked Qiao Chuchu, and Weisheng Biehe was also interested in her.","Given what he knew about the Weisheng family, they were drawn to things that were genuine and uncomplicated.","Like dogs, cats, or other simple-hearted creatures.","So, if the fourth and fifth sons of the Weisheng family liked Qiao Chuchu, could it be that Weisheng Wenzhan and Weisheng Lin also had feelings for her?","He zoomed in on Qiao Chuchu’s photo.","Was she some kind of popular figure?","Ying Chen locked his phone and said, \"Have someone clean up the mess around Qiao Chuchu. Make sure no one catches up to her and hurts her.\"","The bodyguard in the passenger seat nodded. \"Understood.\"","---","Qiao Chuchu drove toward Lou Tingsi’s location.","Song Yu was utterly baffled: \"How did you even manage to come to my aid? And how did you know I was here? Did the boss tell you everything?\"","Qiao Chuchu countered with a question: \"Do you know there’s a traitor among you?\"","Song Yu was stunned: \"Who?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Zhu Changming.\"","Song Yu was shocked: \"Zhu Changming?! He’s been by the boss’s side since he was five, practically raised by the boss. To the boss, he’s like a younger brother. Are you sure you’re not mistaken?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"I’m not mistaken. I noticed something off about Zhu Changming’s men on the way here. One of his subordinates, Jack, even tried to kill me, but I knocked him out and left him on the ground.\"","Song Yu fell silent, leaning back in his seat, taking a long time to process this.","\"The boss will be devastated,\" Song Yu finally managed to say. \"He’ll be heartbroken.\"","Qiao Chuchu shrugged: \"Want to know how to cheer your boss up? If we capture Zhu Changming and let the boss personally make him suffer, make him cry in regret, beg for mercy on his knees, only to realize it’s too late, and die in despair—your boss should be pretty happy then!\"","Song Yu: \"...Are you sure you’re not in the same line of work as us?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Nope, I’m a manga artist.\"","Song Yu was shocked: \"A manga artist who can drive like a pro and shoot a gun? You’re more skilled than I am! Are you sure you’re not some big shot?!\"","\"Nope,\" Qiao Chuchu tilted her head and smiled sweetly. \"I really am just a manga artist. Trust me.\"","Song Yu stared at her, watching her effortlessly shake off their pursuers, and couldn’t help but twitch his lips.","How was he supposed to believe that?"]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Lou Tingsi: How Did Qiao Chuchu Come to Save Me","paragraphs":["Inside the factory, Lou Tingsi was walking down the corridor, video-calling Lou Yuejue: \"What's wrong, son?\"","Zhu Changming walked up to him and stood by his side, not entering the frame, but keeping his eyes fixed on Lou Tingsi's face, carefully observing his micro-expressions.","Lou Yuejue's voice, unusually trembling with tears, came through: \"Dad, I had a nightmare. I dreamed someone was trying to kill me with a huge lock. I'm scared.\"","Lou Tingsi's smile stiffened slightly, and he glanced at Zhu Changming out of the corner of his eye. \"It's okay, nightmares aren't real. Ask Lucas to stay with you. Don't be afraid. I'll come home as soon as I finish this business deal.\"","Lou Yuejue sniffled and nodded. \"Dad, please be careful. I'll wait for you to come home.\"","Lou Tingsi hung up the call, let out a barely audible sigh, put away his phone, and stepped inside.","Zhu Changming followed him like a shadow.","Suddenly, Lou Tingsi felt something cold press against the back of his head.","Zhu Changming's low voice echoed in his ear: \"Put your hands up, brother.\"","Lou Tingsi froze for a moment, then calmly looked ahead.","A few people in the room visibly tensed, reaching for their guns to protect him, but others aimed their weapons at them, forcing them to stop. No one dared to make a move.","There were over twenty people in the room.","Only four of them were loyal to him.","Lou Tingsi smirked and slowly raised his hands.","Zhu Changming kicked him hard in the back of the knee!","Lou Tingsi fell to his knees, grunting in pain.","Zhu Changming pressed the gun against the back of Lou Tingsi's head, his expression dark and menacing. \"I was planning to make your death quick and painless, but since you figured it out, I need to ask—how did you know there was a traitor among us?\"","Lou Tingsi lowered his gaze, and an image of Qiao Chuchu flashed through his mind.","He curled his lips into a meaningful smile. \"Maybe because I have a guardian angel.\"","\"Stop playing games!\" Zhu Changming kicked him again. \"How the hell did you know?!\"","Zhu Changming grew more agitated. \"I hid it so well. I never gave any hints. My plan was to kill you, take your place, and pin your death on your enemies. You should've died without ever knowing there was a traitor.\"","A hint of bitterness flickered in Lou Tingsi's eyes, and he let out a self-deprecating laugh.","If it weren't for Qiao Chuchu foreseeing his future, he would have never suspected that the person closest to him would betray him.","Zhu Changming, seeing Lou Tingsi's silence, sneered. \"Lou Tingsi, aren't you going to ask me why I betrayed you?\"","Lou Tingsi remained on his knees, his face as calm as a statue. \"No.\"","He wasn't sad or angry, just eerily composed. \"Betrayal is instinct. Loyalty is a choice. Since you didn't choose me, I don't care why.\"","Lou Tingsi glanced subtly toward the building across from them, where his snipers and backup teams were already moving in.","He wasn't going to die today.","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu parked her car outside the factory.","Song Yu quickly got out of the car. \"Stay here.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"Why?\"","Song Yu's expression was cold and stern. \"The boss specifically told me to take care of you. I'm already grateful you came to help me, but now, let me and my men handle this.\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at the two people flanking Song Yu. \"But you only have two people with you.\"","\"That's enough,\" Song Yu warned. \"You can't go in. If anything happens to you, the boss will kill me.\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored her and darted into the factory!","Song Yu shouted, \"Qiao Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu ran inside, then turned back and put a finger to her lips. \"Shh! I'm the only one who can sneak in without getting hurt. You guys can't.\"","Song Yu was stunned. \"What do you mean, only you can? Are you some kind of legendary ninja or something?!\"","Qiao Chuchu grinned proudly. \"Exactly. Follow me, and have your two men provide sniper support. I promise I'll get us in safely.\"","Song Yu scoffed. \"You're kidding, right? If you can get us in that easily, I'll change my name to yours!\"","Five minutes later.","Song Yu and Qiao Chuchu were crouched in a corner of the factory, with Zhu Changming's unconscious men lying at their feet.","Song Yu was completely dumbfounded.","She had followed Qiao Chuchu out of concern, ready to step in if things went south, but Qiao Chuchu moved like a ghost, navigating the factory as if she owned the place. They had effortlessly made their way to the room where Lou Tingsi was being held.","Song Yu's last shred of doubt died in that moment.","Qiao Chuchu might look soft and harmless, like a marshmallow, but that was just a facade.","Inside that marshmallow exterior was a core of shrapnel and C4 explosives!","Song Yu felt a chill run down her spine.","The real rookie here wasn't Qiao Chuchu.","It was her!","And she had the audacity to look down on her!","Song Yu closed her eyes in resignation and leaned closer to Qiao Chuchu. \"From today on, I'll go by Qiao Yu. Just tell me what to do. I'm at your service.\"","Qiao Chuchu whispered, \"Shh, not now.\"","She peeked inside the room through the broken door. Lou Tingsi was kneeling, facing the door, his head bowed, his expression unreadable.","Zhu Changming pressed the gun to Lou Tingsi's temple. \"You know, my real surname is Long. I'm a son of the Dragon Family. It was your father who killed my parents and made me an orphan!\"","Lou Tingsi calmly refuted, \"My father didn't kill your parents. There were robbers that day. Your parents were killed by them. My father and I found you and took you in because we felt sorry for you.\"","\"But it was your family's guns that killed them! You weapons dealers are all the same! You're all scum!\" Zhu Changming shouted. \"It's your fault my parents died! It's your fault!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu's heart tightened.","[What the hell? This guy's logic is ridiculous! If his parents had been killed by a kitchen knife, would he blame the knife seller? Would he burn down every knife factory in the world?!]","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Did he just hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts??","Before he could process it, Zhu Changming punched him hard. \"If I hadn't reunited with my grandfather, I would've never known you were the son of a murderer! I trusted you like a brother! Do you know how much that hurts?!\"","Qiao Chuchu's lips twitched in anger, and she clenched her fists.","[This bastard! Betrayal is one thing, but dressing it up like some righteous crusade? Disgusting!!]","[What right does he have to play the victim? Lou Tingsi's the one who should be upset!]","Lou Tingsi broke out in a cold sweat, his eyes darting toward the broken door.","He was sure now—Qiao Chuchu was here!","Zhu Changming, noticing Lou Tingsi's distraction, punched him again.","\"Are you even listening to me?!\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn't take it anymore. She turned to Song Yu. \"I'm going in. When I grab Lou Tingsi, tell your men to shoot.\"","Song Yu: \"Wait—\"","But Qiao Chuchu was already on her feet, pushing the door open. \"Stop hitting him!\"","Lou Tingsi looked up, stunned, his breath catching in his throat.","Qiao Chuchu pinched her thigh hard, forcing tears to well up in her eyes as she stood in the doorway.","Lou Tingsi's calm facade shattered as he stared at her in disbelief. \"What are you doing here?!\""]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: Lou Tingsi: I Have a Guardian Angel","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu took a deep breath and feigned nervousness, saying, \"Zhu Changming's men brought me here. Their car is parked outside.\"","Zhu Changming glanced at the surveillance feed and indeed saw his men's car.","He tugged at the corner of his mouth in irritation and said to Qiao Chuchu, \"I told Jack to kill you, but instead, he brought you here. Has he lost his damn mind?!\"","Zhu Changming picked up his phone to make a call. \"I'm going to give Jack a piece of my mind and ask him what the hell he's doing!\"","Qiao Chuchu's expression suddenly changed.","She couldn’t let him make that call—it would expose everything!","She needed to divert his attention!","A flash of inspiration struck her: \"I'm pregnant!!\"","Zhu Changming: \"?\"","Song Yu: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Tears welled up in her eyes as she lifted her chin defiantly. \"It's Lou Tingsi's child.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"????????\"","Song Yu's jaw dropped!","Was the boss's woman really showing up on the battlefield while pregnant?!","That only made her more admirable!","Zhu Changming paused mid-dial, stunned. \"You? Pregnant with Lou Tingsi's child?\"","He locked his phone, successfully distracted. \"But Lou Tingsi is afraid of women, isn’t he? He’s never been able to get past that mental barrier. How could he be with you?\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted her chin up, her expression stubborn. \"I set him up and drugged him because I love him. He promised to give me a proper place by his side and marry me. But I never expected him to end up like this.\"","Tears streamed down her face as her gaze shifted past Zhu Changming and landed on Lou Tingsi. \"I know he’s done for this time. He won’t make it out alive.\"","Her voice broke as she continued, \"But I don’t want him to die alone.\"","Lou Tingsi’s calm mind exploded, as if a grenade had been dropped, obliterating all coherent thought.","Qiao Chuchu walked step by step toward him. \"I know why Lou Tingsi is afraid of women. When he was young, his mother abandoned him. His father chased her down, and when she had nowhere to run, she chose to jump into a river with his younger brother, leaving Lou Tingsi behind without a second glance.\"","\"I know that as a child, Lou Tingsi held onto hope, hoping his mother would take him with her, even if it meant death.\"","\"But she didn’t.\"","She crouched in front of Lou Tingsi and gently cupped his face in her hands.","Lou Tingsi stared at her in shock, his beautiful eyes wide with astonishment, reflecting Qiao Chuchu’s image.","Qiao Chuchu gazed at him firmly, her voice soft but resolute. \"Lou Tingsi, I want you to know that even if your mother didn’t take you with her, there’s someone in this world who loves you. I’m willing to be with you, no matter where we go, because I—\"","She choked up, her voice trembling as she lowered her head. \"Because I can lift a 300-pound man with one hand!!!!\"","In one swift motion, she grabbed Lou Tingsi and dived behind the couch!","Lou Tingsi: \"?!\"","Zhu Changming, who had been watching the scene unfold, suddenly turned pale. Just as he was about to fire, a bullet with incredible force shot through his arm!","Zhu Changming collapsed to the ground!","He couldn’t even feel the pain, staring in shock at his severed right arm. \"There’s a sniper opposite us! Take cover!!!\"","But it was too late. Several of his men fell one after another, dead on the spot.","Zhu Changming was shaken.","Who was the sniper on the other side?","Their aim was too precise!","From the building across the street, Ying Chen peered out from behind his sniper scope, a proud smile on his face. \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ve repaid your favor three times over. You’re welcome~\"","Song Yu and Lou Tingsi’s men stormed into the room. \"Drop your weapons!!\"","Qiao Chuchu and Lou Tingsi remained hidden behind the couch. Lou Tingsi, regaining his composure, pinned her down and took her gun, his voice brimming with anticipation. \"Was what you said earlier true?!\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, confused. \"What part?\"","Lou Tingsi smirked but didn’t answer. Instead, he wiped away the tears at the corners of her eyes. \"Thank you for saving me. Leave the rest to me. Stay here and wait for me, okay?\"","She frowned, peeking out from behind the couch, only to see Lou Tingsi loading his gun as he walked, firing shot after shot at the traitors.","Every bullet hit its mark, piercing their hearts.","One by one, the traitors fell.","Finally, only Zhu Changming remained.","Zhu Changming had been forced to his knees by Song Yu.","His face was flushed, whether from pain or frustration, as he screamed hoarsely, \"Lou Tingsi, you never trusted me for a second!!\"","Lou Tingsi pressed the barrel of his gun to Zhu Changming’s forehead, his voice calm. \"I always trusted you, Changming.\"","Zhu Changming’s eyes widened in disbelief. \"Then why did you always keep your guard up around me?!\"","Lou Tingsi’s expression remained impassive, though a hint of self-mockery tinged his voice. \"Because too many people have betrayed me. I’ve learned to be cautious with everyone.\"","Zhu Changming fell silent for a moment before letting out a bitter laugh. \"Even now, you won’t tell me how you found out about me, will you?\"","Lou Tingsi glanced in Qiao Chuchu’s direction. \"I already gave you the answer earlier.\"","He smiled gently and pulled the trigger.","\"I really do have a guardian angel.\"","Zhu Changming’s eyes widened in disbelief before his body stiffened and collapsed to the ground, a bloody hole in his forehead.","Lou Tingsi crouched down, reached out, and closed Zhu Changming’s eyes. He then took out a disinfectant wipe and meticulously cleaned each of his fingers before placing the wipe over Zhu Changming’s face.","\"Send his ashes to the Long family. Use his death photo as the memorial portrait.\"","Song Yu nodded. \"Understood!\"","Lou Tingsi suppressed the lingering melancholy in his heart and walked over to Qiao Chuchu with a smile. \"I’m done here.\"","Qiao Chuchu slowly peeked out from behind the couch, still in disbelief. \"You just killed him like that?\"","He raised an eyebrow, teasing her. \"What, do you think I’m too cruel?\"","Qiao Chuchu glared at him. \"No! You should’ve questioned him properly to see if he was hiding anything from you. Now that he’s dead, how are you supposed to find out?!\"","Song Yu, seeing her frustration, stepped forward to intervene. \"Sister-in-law, don’t get too upset. It’s not good for your health, especially since you’re pregnant.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Lou Tingsi froze for a moment before bursting into laughter. \"HAHAHAHAHAHA!\"","Qiao Chuchu was utterly confused. \"Who’s pregnant?! I’m not pregnant! I only said that to distract him earlier!!\"","Song Yu was at a loss, unsure who to believe, and looked to Lou Tingsi for guidance.","Lou Tingsi suppressed a smile and glanced at Qiao Chuchu with amusement. \"Don’t say such things. Miss Qiao is single and has nothing to do with me. Let’s not tarnish her reputation.\"","\"But...\"","He leaned down and ruffled her hair. \"Getting angry really isn’t good for your health, so let’s not be mad anymore, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu puffed out her cheeks, looking like an adorable little pufferfish. \"It’s all because you didn’t listen to me. If you had, you wouldn’t have had to go through all this!\"","\"You’re right, it’s my fault,\" Lou Tingsi said soothingly. \"Let’s not be angry anymore. This place is too dangerous. Let’s go home, and you can scold me all you want, okay? My savior?\"","Qiao Chuchu’s anger subsided a little, and she looked up at him. \"Fine, you’re lucky you’re being reasonable. Let’s go home and talk this through properly. No loose ends!\"","\"Deal!\" Lou Tingsi stepped aside, gesturing for her to go ahead. \"After you~\"","Qiao Chuchu strode forward confidently.","Lou Tingsi walked beside her, a smile playing on his lips.","From the building across the street, Ying Chen put down his binoculars with a scowl. \"Right now, find a way to capture Qiao Chuchu and bring her back to me!\"","His subordinates responded immediately. \"Yes, sir!!\""]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: The Nightmare That Lasted Over a Decade Suddenly Changed","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu got into the car, and as soon as she relaxed, she felt as if her eyelids were weighed down with lead. An indescribable fatigue spread throughout her body.","It seemed that the exhaustion from using her abilities had returned.","She drifted off into a deep sleep.","Lou Tingsi glanced sideways at Qiao Chuchu.","She was leaning against the car seat, her posture not particularly comfortable, yet she was sleeping soundly.","Lou Tingsi slowly shifted closer to her.","Qiao Chuchu’s head tilted and rested on his shoulder. She nestled comfortably against him and continued to sleep deeply.","He raised his hand to wipe the dust off her face, his voice tinged with guilt. \"I’m sorry. I didn’t know he was a spy. If I had known, I would never have let his people take you away.\"","The more Lou Tingsi thought about it, the more his chest tightened. He turned to Song Yu in the passenger seat. \"Was she hurt?\"","Song Yu tried hard not to pay attention to the two of them and shook his head. \"No, don’t worry. Miss Qiao is amazing. When she barged in to rescue us, it even shocked me. She’s incredibly capable. I only survived because of her. Without her, I’d already be dead.\"","Lou Tingsi was surprised, a hint of delight in his tone. \"Really?\"","\"Absolutely,\" Song Yu replied, letting out an almost imperceptible sigh. \"Boss, she’s beautiful, capable, and brave. If the two of you end up together, I’d definitely support it.\"","He added with a touch of bitterness, \"But I’d only support you and her. Other girls? I don’t think they’d be right for you.\"","Lou Tingsi glanced at Qiao Chuchu, who was still resting on his shoulder, and frowned in confusion. \"Why do you think we’d end up together?\"","\"Because you like her,\" Song Yu said, looking at him through the rearview mirror with envy. \"You’ve never been this close to any other girl.\"","Lou Tingsi was momentarily stunned, only now realizing that he didn’t mind being so close to Qiao Chuchu.","Still, he shook his head. \"I don’t like her. I just think she smells nice and has a beautiful smile.\"","Song Yu couldn’t help but laugh. \"I smell nice too, but I’ve never heard you compliment me.\"","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow. \"You have a scent?\"","Song Yu was taken aback. \"Boss, I shower every morning. It’s just that you always keep a distance from me, so you’ve never noticed.\"","Lou Tingsi frowned, feeling baffled. \"Why should I care about your scent?\"","\"Then why do you care about Qiao Chuchu’s?\" Song Yu chuckled, as if he had seen through him. \"How did you feel when you saw her coming to rescue you?\"","Lou Tingsi fell silent.","The feeling was... happiness, worry, and anger.","But happiness outweighed the worry.","He took Qiao Chuchu’s hand in his, his large palm enveloping her smaller one. \"After we get back, give her the Lamborghini I ordered.\"","Song Yu was shocked and looked at Lou Tingsi through the rearview mirror. \"That car? The one you waited years for and spent 20 million on? You haven’t even driven it yet.\"","\"Exactly because it’s such a good car, that’s why I’m giving it to her. It’s too late to order another one now; it’d take years to get it,\" Lou Tingsi said nonchalantly, gently brushing the hair away from Qiao Chuchu’s face. \"The car is black and red, and she’s a skilled driver. She’ll definitely love that sports car.\"","Song Yu nodded, casting an envious glance at Qiao Chuchu, and didn’t say anything more.","When they arrived home, Lou Tingsi carried Qiao Chuchu inside and took her to his room.","This time, no matter how much she was jostled, Qiao Chuchu didn’t wake up.","She must have been completely exhausted.","Lou Tingsi sat in the armchair beside the bed, taking care of Zhu Changming’s affairs while keeping an eye on her.","Once everything was settled, he too began to feel drowsy and fell asleep in the chair.","He had a dream.","In the dream, his mother was hiding in a closet with another man when his furious father discovered them.","His father dragged him and his brother out to have their blood drawn for a paternity test. Before the results came back, both of them were locked in the basement.","A few days later, his beautiful mother hurriedly opened the basement door, tears streaming down her face as she held out her arms to his younger brother. \"Come here, my darling!\"","His brother ran to her.","He also ran toward her. \"Mom, take me with you. I’m grown up now, a strong man. I can protect you both!\"","He was filled with hope, determined to leave with her.","But his mother looked at him with disgust. \"Lou Tingsi, you’re just like your father, a despicable bastard who deserves to go to hell. I should have strangled you the moment you were born!\"","She picked up his brother, cradling him like the most precious thing in her life, and whispered to him, \"We won’t be like your brother, and we won’t be close to him. He’s no good. Mommy’s taking you away now, and we’ll never see him again.\"","With that, she closed the basement door, locked it, and left without looking back.","A day later, the door opened again, and his father came in with the paternity test results, taking him in the car to chase after his mother.","Cornered, his mother held his brother tightly, crying bitterly. \"If it weren’t for my family forcing me to marry you, I would never have done it!\"","His father roared in anger, \"Didn’t I love you, Yan Ting? I spent my whole life trying to please you, and you repaid me by cheating on me for years! You even made me raise your childhood sweetheart’s son! What the hell did you take me for?!\"","His father shouted, \"But I’ll forgive you one more time. Give me that bastard child, and I’ll pretend none of this ever happened!\"","His mother stood in the wind, clutching his crying brother, her expression resolute. Without a word, she turned and jumped into the river.","He rushed forward in shock, but his father held him back, preventing him from saving them.","The wind was cold that day, and the river must have been freezing. Ripples spread across the water’s surface, but soon it became still again.","He broke free from his father and leaped into the river. The water was murky, but he could faintly make out two figures clinging tightly to each other.","Then, a sharp pain shot through his calf, and his body began to sink.","The figures grew farther away, and he closed his eyes, resigned to his fate.","Suddenly, an arm wrapped tightly around his waist, pulling him close with a familiar fragrance.","He opened his eyes in shock and met Qiao Chuchu’s determined gaze. \"Don’t be afraid, Lou Tingsi. I won’t let you die.\"","She held him tightly. \"I’m here for you.\"","Lou Tingsi, still in the armchair, furrowed his brow, his forehead drenched in cold sweat. A low, pained whimper escaped his throat.","Qiao Chuchu gently patted his shoulder. \"Lou Tingsi? Lou Tingsi?\"","Lou Tingsi suddenly woke up, his eyes landing on Qiao Chuchu. Without thinking, he lunged forward and hugged her tightly!","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard, toppling backward onto the floor. \"What’s wrong with you?\"","Lou Tingsi tightened his arms around her, holding her close as he caught his breath. Gradually, he calmed down.","It was just a nightmare.","He hadn’t dreamed about his childhood in a very long time.","In the past, he would always wake up from the dream with a cramp in his calf. But this time, he had dreamed of Qiao Chuchu coming to save him.","And now—","He was still holding her?","He quickly stood up, pulling her to her feet, then took a step back. \"I’m sorry, Miss Qiao. I had a bad dream.\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head, looking at him with concern. \"Are you okay? And why were you sleeping here?\"","Lou Tingsi was momentarily speechless, unsure how to explain himself.","He had just wanted to keep an eye on her, feeling a sense of peace when he saw her.","But he hadn’t expected to fall asleep."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Win Dust: Borrowing Qiao Chuchu for a Few Days","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi smiled apologetically: \"I might just be too tired, it's nothing.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned with concern: \"Are you having nightmares because of Zhu Changming's betrayal? You still haven't gotten over it, have you? I'm not sleepy anymore, so why don't I accompany you outside for some fresh air?\"","She glanced at the time: \"It's exactly 5 a.m. now, and I can't sleep anyway. It'll be dawn soon.\"","Lou Tingsi was momentarily stunned, a glimmer of secret delight flashing in his eyes: \"Sure, I actually have something I want to show you.\"","He picked up a small blanket from the sofa and draped it over her: \"Follow me.\"","Qiao Chuchu walked beside him, stealing glances at him from the corner of her eye.","[Ah, how pitiful, betrayed by the younger brother he raised with his own hands.]","[If I were him, I'd probably cry myself to death. It would take at least a week to recover from such a blow. So, it's better to keep him company and help distract him.]","Lou Tingsi lowered his lashes, a slow smile spreading across his lips. This time, the warmth in his smile wasn't superficial but carried a deep, lingering tenderness.","He led Qiao Chuchu through a long corridor, straight to the underground parking lot.","Not far away, a sleek and understated black-and-red Lamborghini was parked.","He pointed at the car: \"What do you think of that car?\"","Qiao Chuchu squinted for a closer look, her eyes widening in awe: \"It's so cool! So gorgeous! Is that your car?! Can I go touch it?!\"","Lou Tingsi beamed, the knot in his heart instantly unraveling: \"This isn't my car.\"","He took out the car keys he carried with him and handed them to Qiao Chuchu: \"From today onward, this car is yours— Huh? Where did she go?\"","Lou Tingsi looked around in confusion.","The brightly lit underground parking lot was empty.","Qiao Chuchu, who had been chattering beside him just moments ago, had vanished into thin air!","He took a few steps forward: \"Miss Qiao? Qiao Chuchu?\"","No response.","Lou Tingsi began to feel uneasy and quickly dialed Qiao Chuchu's WeChat number.","A cheerful melody echoed through the parking lot—","\"You love me~ I love you~ Mixue Ice Cream and Tea, sweet as honey~\"","Following the sound, he found Qiao Chuchu's phone lying on the ground, displaying his profile picture and name.","Beside her phone was another device.","He hurriedly picked it up and unlocked the screen.","A video was waiting to be played.","In the footage, Ying Chen sat arrogantly on a leather sofa, raising a glass to the camera: \"Lou Tingsi, this is Ying Chen. By the time you see this video, Qiao Chuchu has already been taken away by my men. I overheard her thoughts suggesting there's a traitor among my people. So, as long as I use her to find the traitor, I'll return her to you. Don't waste your energy looking for her. I'll inform her family. That's all, goodbye.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","??????","??????????","Qiao Chuchu was taken right under his nose by Ying Chen?!","He immediately called Song Yu: \"Song Yu, Qiao Chuchu is missing. Gather people and start searching!\"","-","Qiao Chuchu was roughly thrown into the back of a stretch Lincoln.","She face-planted onto the leather seats, struggling to catch her breath: \"Who the hell is it?! Who's covering my mouth and not letting me speak?!\"","Fuming, she pushed herself up: [If it weren't for my strength pill wearing off, if I weren't still in my post-skill fatigue period, would I have been captured?!]","She angrily looked up and met Ying Chen's gaze.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned: \"Ying Chen?!\"","Ying Chen's handsome face held a smirk as he looked down at her, a glass of whiskey in his hand. He spoke with amusement: \"Qiao Chuchu, I stayed up all night waiting to catch you. And what do you do? You take a nap and then go check out a sports car with Lou Tingsi. Did the car meet your expectations?\"","He swirled the whiskey in his glass, his tone laced with meaning: \"I should also remind you that Weisheng Huailing is a very jealous man. If you keep flirting around like this, he might just kill someone.\"","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes in disbelief.","[What on earth?]","[Why is it that even though everything is in Chinese, I can't understand a word when it's all put together?!]","She spoke gently: \"Are you out of your mind? What kind of nonsense are you spouting? Why did you kidnap me without even a heads-up? Do you have any manners?!\"","Ying Chen crossed his legs, looking at her with confidence: \"There's something I need your help with, and only you can do it. If you help me with this, I'll let you go and give you 100 million.\"","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","She slowly sat up straight.","Smoothed her hair.","Straightened her back and crossed her legs.","With a serious expression, she looked at Ying Chen, lowering her voice to create a sultry, magnetic tone: \"Oh? And what might Mr. Ying need my assistance with?\"","Ying Chen raised an eyebrow, savoring the words: \"Mr. Ying?\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled and nodded: \"Yes, Mr. Ying.\"","Ying Chen chuckled, setting down his glass and folding his hands on his lap: \"I thought you weren't interested in money, given your family's wealth. A hundred million is just a small goal for you, isn't it?\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled: \"That's my brother's small goal, not mine. I can't achieve small goals.\"","Ying Chen narrowed his eyes: \"Your brother's is yours, isn't it?\"","Qiao Chuchu continued smiling: \"No, theirs is theirs, and mine is mine.\"","Then her smile faded, and she became serious: \"What exactly do you need me to do for this 100-million-yuan project?\"","Ying Chen opened his mouth to speak, but Qiao Chuchu quickly added with a flattering smile: \"Just to be clear, I won't sell my body.\"","Ying Chen didn't hesitate: \"Don't worry, your body isn't worth selling.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Ying Chen leaned closer: \"Here's the thing. There's a traitor among my people, but I can't figure out who it is. For some reason, I feel like you can help me.\"","Qiao Chuchu hummed, narrowing her eyes in confusion.","[Why does he think I can help?]","[Did I accidentally say my thoughts out loud when I saw him?]","[Ugh, his storyline is as tricky as Lou Tingsi's, but at least Lou Tingsi's gave me some hints. Ying Chen's betrayal doesn't have any clues.]","[The plot only vaguely hinted that Ying Chen would die from betrayal, but I don't know the specifics.]","[...This is tough. Maybe I should just let it go. Sure, he dies tragically, but what does that have to do with me? I don't have any feelings for him.]","[From my experience, these things are exhausting and dangerous. I only have four lives left—better play it safe and save them for my own people. If I just make Ying Chen stay alert, maybe he can solve this problem himself.]","[That's what I'll do!]","Just as Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth to speak, Ying Chen cut her off: \"I'll raise the offer to 300 million.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Ying Chen looked at her with certainty: \"Help me find the traitor. Any problems?\"","Qiao Chuchu's mind buzzed, instantly dazzled by the overwhelming fortune: \"No problems!!\"","Ying Chen smirked, giving her an innocent smile: \"Good. You have two choices: either act as my newly hired personal assistant or pretend to be my recently met girlfriend. Which one will it be?\""]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: The Consequences of Snatching Qiao Chuchu Are—","paragraphs":["\"Assistant!\" Qiao Chuchu held her chest, looking at Ying Chen with utmost sincerity. \"You gave me 300 million to help you, and if I don’t do some work, I won’t feel right about it!\"","Ying Chen chuckled, looking down at her like a spider luring a butterfly into its web. He spoke slowly and deliberately, \"Miss Qiao, if you’re going to act, you have to commit fully. If you choose to be my assistant, you’ll have to do all the work. So, I suggest you choose to be my girlfriend instead. I can play the role of a doting boyfriend, and you can stick to me all day, doing nothing—plus, it’ll make it easier for you to keep an eye on any spies.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t hesitate. \"But if I pretend to date you, won’t my reputation be ruined?\"","Ying Chen’s face darkened, and he looked at her in disbelief. \"What? Are you saying dating me would be beneath you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s mouth twitched, and she quickly fanned him with her hand. \"Boss Ying, that’s not what I meant! I just mean that my public image is that of a cheerful, single, and carefree person.\"","Ying Chen remained unmoved. \"So, my image is that of a dark, scheming, lonely, ugly old man, is it?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Ying Chen’s expression turned even more grim as he narrowed his eyes and scrutinized her. \"Do you look down on me or something?\"","Qiao Chuchu was visibly shocked. \"Why would I look down on you for no reason? I don’t even know who you are!\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","She didn’t know who he was, yet she drove to save him when he was under attack?","A sudden surge of anger rose within him, and he snapped, \"Qiao Chuchu, I’ve decided. Since I’ve paid you, from now on, you’re going to be my fake girlfriend.\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth to protest.","Ying Chen raised a hand to silence her. \"Don’t say anything to upset me, or I won’t give you your bonus.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s tense expression immediately relaxed. \"?\"","[This guy is kind of adorably fierce.]","[I thought he wasn’t going to pay me, but there’s a bonus on top of the 300 million?]","Ying Chen moved back to his original spot, putting some distance between them, and ignored her with a stern face.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at his profile, feeling restless.","[The offer is tempting, but the problem is I don’t know his backstory!]","[I’ve read the novel over and over, but I’ve never come across the name Ying Chen.]","[He’s a character that just popped out of nowhere, like a mystery box. I don’t even know if he’s a villain or a hero.]","[Wait, if he knows the Wei Sheng Clan, then he’s definitely a major villain. If he’s a villain, he’s probably on my side, so I can relax.]","[After all, once a character appears, they’ll have their own storyline. I should treat all characters equally.]","Qiao Chuchu pinched her chin, deep in thought, and hesitantly glanced at Ying Chen.","Ying Chen’s face was still dark as he stared out the window in silence.","She subtly shifted closer to him.","[The last two times I foresaw the future, it was because I touched someone. Let’s see if I can predict Ying Chen’s future too.]","Ying Chen raised an eyebrow, watching Qiao Chuchu sneak closer to him out of the corner of his eye. She pretended to be casual as she reached out and lightly touched the hem of his sleeve.","A flood of memories suddenly rushed into her mind!","In that moment, it was as if she had seen Ying Chen’s entire life!","Qiao Chuchu quickly pulled her hand back.","[Oh my god, he’s practically a prince who grew up with the Wei Sheng Clan!]","[Like Lou Tingsi, he’s a top-tier arms dealer, but unlike Lou Tingsi, he was born with a silver spoon in his mouth. He’s the sole heir to his family’s fortune and has been successful from a young age!]","[And the most surprising thing is, he secretly makes needle-felted crafts!]","[Ying Chen spends his weekends making adorable little cats and dogs! His study is filled with a cabinet full of cute needle-felted animals! He even donates to animal shelters and helps stray animals!]","Ying Chen: \"???\"","She could see all that?!","Ahhh, this is so cute! Such a contrasting cuteness!","Qiao Chuchu looked out the window, trying to suppress her excitement. [How can someone who’s all about weapons and power secretly make needle-felted crafts? This character is so endearing! He could totally be a male lead template! So adorable!]","Ying Chen: \"???\"","He made needle-felted crafts because he enjoyed creating cute things by hand, not because he was cute!","If she called him cute again, he’d throw her out of the car!","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip, feeling a little thrilled. [Even though I didn’t see how he dies, at least I know he’s just a clean-cut heir to a family business. I’ll take this job!]","[I’ve been struggling to finalize the personality for my new male lead. I was thinking of basing him on my eldest brother, but it wasn’t enough. I’ll combine Ying Chen and my brother’s traits!]","She secretly pumped herself up. [Don’t worry, little needle-felting prince, I’ll make sure I’m worth the 300 million plus the bonus.]","Ying Chen: \"...\"","The moment she called him \"little needle-felting prince,\" she lost any chance of getting that bonus.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly patted her pockets and realized something. \"Oh, by the way, where’s my phone?\"","Ying Chen frowned. \"My men threw it away.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s smile vanished. \"Excuse me, I need to get out of this car.\"","Ying Chen: \"? I gave it to Lou Tingsi.\"","She was furious. \"It doesn’t matter who you gave it to! I need to let my family know, and you can’t just take me away without explaining things to Lou Tingsi!\"","Ying Chen frowned, about to speak, when his phone suddenly rang.","It was a video call from Weisheng Yucan.","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu and answered the call.","Pei Buxian’s face filled the screen as he shouted at the camera, \"What did you do to my sister?!\"","Ying Chen: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled. \"Seventh Brother?\"","Pei Buxian was pushed aside as Pei Mu and Pei Ci crowded into the frame, glaring at the screen. \"Ying Chen, we’re warning you—we’re on a plane right now, and you better not lay a finger on our sister, you hear me?!\"","Pei Fengnong shoved them aside and said sternly, \"Ying Chen, I suggest you send Qiao Chuchu back right now.\"","Pei Youchuan popped into view. \"Qiao Chuchu! Qiao Chuchu, if you’re still alive, say something!\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly leaned into the frame and waved. \"I’m here!\"","Pei Che pushed Pei Youchuan aside and asked anxiously, \"Are you okay?!\"","Pei Yuan stood next to Pei Che, carefully examining Qiao Chuchu with concern. \"Are you hurt?\"","Weisheng Yucan stood behind the brothers, looking utterly exasperated.","The seven of them had suddenly barged into her company, claiming that Qiao Chuchu had been taken by Ying Chen, her phone was missing, and they couldn’t reach her.","She had no choice but to use her phone to call Ying Chen.","But she was even more annoyed with Ying Chen. \"Ying Chen, you’re really something. Isn’t it the middle of the night there? What are you causing trouble for?!\"","Ying Chen remained silent, his face dark, when suddenly a loudspeaker blared from outside the car. \"Ying Chen, stop the car right now, or I’ll force you to stop!\"","Ying Chen and Qiao Chuchu looked out the back window.","Lou Tingsi was sitting in a car, with several identical SUVs following in formation behind him.","Lou Tingsi himself was in the passenger seat, holding a loudspeaker and sternly warning Ying Chen, \"Stop the car! Or I’ll make you stop!\"","Ying Chen was stunned and looked at Qiao Chuchu incredulously. \"What exactly is your identity? I only took you, but it feels like I’ve stirred up a hornet’s nest!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\""]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: Winning the World by Not Adhering to Male Virtues","paragraphs":["Ying Chen sat in Lou Tingsi's living room with a dark expression.","Qiao Chuchu sat beside him, awkwardly fidgeting with her fingers.","Lou Tingsi sat across from them, slamming a gun on the table with a thud, his voice low and commanding: \"Miss Qiao, come sit over here.\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched as she stood up.","Ying Chen suddenly grabbed her wrist, forcefully pulling her back into her seat: \"You don't need to go.\"","He also pulled out a gun and slapped it on the table: \"I have one too.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[What is this? A weapons showcase?]","She glanced at the other end of the table.","A phone was placed there, currently on a video call.","On the other side of the video sat several of the Pei Brothers, with some even out of frame because the screen couldn't fit them all.","Weisheng Yucan had completely disappeared.","She probably found these people boring and left.","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly stood up: \"Um... I'm a bit tired, so maybe I should leave first.\"","Ying Chen: \"Stay.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"Don't go, wait until we're done talking.\"","Both spoke at the same time, then glared at each other, letting out a displeased snort.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She fidgeted uncomfortably, looking at Lou Tingsi across the table.","Lou Tingsi tapped his fingers lightly on the table, his usual fox-like smile on his face, but his eyes were filled with anger: \"Ying Chen, we're old friends, aren't we? You snatched her away without a word. Who taught you those manners?\"","Ying Chen leaned back in his chair, his tone mocking: \"Oh? Is Qiao Chuchu yours?\"","He grinned provocatively: \"Does she have your name carved on her? Is she listed as your spouse on the household register? Did she explicitly say she wants to stay by your side?\"","Lou Tingsi's smile turned cold.","Qiao Chuchu stared at Ying Chen in disbelief.","What kind of nonsense was he spouting?","Ying Chen spread his hands toward Lou Tingsi: \"If there's nothing like that, then we'll just have to compete for her based on our own abilities, won't we?\"","He smirked playfully, taunting: \"Lou Tingsi, my men brought her to me right under your nose, even in your own home. Is that my fault? Shouldn't you reflect on yourself a bit?\"","Lou Tingsi's face darkened like the bottom of a pot, his jaw clenched: \"It's my fault.\"","Ying Chen shrugged smugly: \"Good that you know.\"","Lou Tingsi sneered: \"You hired a bunch of professionals to disable my home's security measures. You came prepared from the start. It's my problem that you managed to steal her right under my nose, but you shouldn't have kidnapped Miss Qiao. She's a person, not an object.\"","Ying Chen laughed carelessly: \"If I didn't take her, would you have let her go?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Ying Chen twirled the gun in his hand, glancing at the seven people on the video call: \"To the Pei Brothers, I'd like to make a complaint. I clearly saw Lou Tingsi being overly familiar with Qiao Chuchu, even patting her head. He even sleeps in the same room as her. I think he's a pervert, so I stepped in to protect Miss Qiao.\"","The seven Pei Brothers immediately became alert, turning their gazes toward Lou Tingsi.","Weisheng Yucan, who had been preparing something, perked up her ears and scurried behind the seven to watch the drama: \"Ying Chen, why didn't you mention this earlier?\"","Lou Tingsi took a deep breath, calmly looking at Ying Chen.","Ying Chen twirled the gun, smirking at Lou Tingsi: \"We're all men here. Who doesn't know these little tricks?\"","Qiao Chuchu decisively raised her hand, speaking seriously: \"I need to interrupt. Lou Tingsi did sleep in the same room as me, but he fell asleep on the couch. Nothing happened between us! He even had a nightmare.\"","Pei Che, on the other end of the call, frowned: \"How do you know he had a nightmare?\"","\"Because he woke me up,\" Qiao Chuchu explained earnestly: \"So I woke him up.\"","Pei Che narrowed his eyes suspiciously: \"And then? What did you two do after you woke him up?\"","Qiao Chuchu choked, feeling like this was getting hard to explain.","[If I say Lou Tingsi reflexively hugged me, it’ll definitely cause a huge misunderstanding, right?]","She forced a dry laugh: \"Then he woke up, and that was it.\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","The other Pei Brothers: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi awkwardly rubbed his forehead.","Ying Chen looked at Qiao Chuchu with a knowing expression, his gaze playful: \"You two experienced the suspension bridge effect. Your heart rates spiked, and you mistook it for attraction. Lou Tingsi is a normal man. After you risked your life to save him, it's impossible for him not to feel something.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned in disgust: \"So you're saying if I saved you, you'd like me too?\"","Ying Chen froze, suddenly remembering the moment Qiao Chuchu swerved her car to help him.","That fleeting glance in the driver's seat.","It really felt like... love at first sight.","His long lashes fluttered as he opened his mouth to retort but found no words. He simply fell silent.","Qiao Chuchu huffed: \"No comeback, huh? There aren't that many love-at-first-sight moments in this world. Cut off those romantic nerves of yours and stop overthinking everything.\"","Ying Chen was speechless, glaring at her in annoyance: \"Are you saying you've completely cut off your own romantic nerves?\"","\"Yes, I burned them all,\" Qiao Chuchu declared proudly, tilting her chin up: \"I'm so detached now that even if ten muscular hunks danced in front of me, I wouldn't bat an eye.\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan hissed, narrowing his eyes: \"So you used to watch muscular men often?\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed: \"Once or twice a month, I guess. I'm a comic artist, after all. How can I draw sexy guys without observing some? I need to feed my readers!\"","The atmosphere suddenly turned cold.","Qiao Chuchu felt something was off and looked up to meet a sea of sharp gazes.","Ying Chen side-eyed her.","Lou Tingsi stared at her in disbelief.","On the video call, all seven Pei Brothers squeezed into the frame, frowning at her.","Pei Yuan smiled eerily: \"It seems I should investigate how much you spend on male models.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","She stood up in a panic: \"Weren't you all going to chat? I won't interfere anymore. I feel like my body is getting a bit cold, so I'll go to bed now.\"","Ying Chen yanked her back down: \"Don't go. So what if you like looking at handsome guys? It's normal. Who doesn't appreciate beauty?\"","Qiao Chuchu plopped back into her chair, staring at him suspiciously.","Ying Chen's emerald-green eyes glinted with mischief: \"I like cute, beautiful things too. When I see something I like, I want to possess it. So I understand your fascination with beauty.\"","\"If you have needs, they should be satisfied.\"","He grabbed her wrist and gently placed her hand on his chest.","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","Ying Chen smirked playfully, slowly guiding her hand down his chest, his gaze predatory: \"But from now on, you don't need to look at those inferior products. Once you've seen me, you'll know what true quality is.\"","\"And no one else has seen me.\"","Ying Chen leaned closer: \"If you want to look at me, you'll be the first and only one. For certain reasons, you're the only one who has this privilege with me.\"","Ying Chen stared at Qiao Chuchu like a snake, gripping her hand as he guided it down his abs, past his belt..."]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Fear Stems from Insufficient Firepower, But Coincidentally, I Am a Weapons Dealer","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was so shocked that her eyes widened, and she tried to pull her hand back: \"Ying Chen, are you crazy—\"","Lou Tingsi suddenly lunged forward and yanked her hand back!","Then, with a swift motion, he grabbed a chair and moved Qiao Chuchu, chair and all, to the side!","Qiao Chuchu, now huddled on the chair: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi was furious: \"Ying Chen, don’t you have any sense of shame?!\"","Ying Chen leaned lazily against the chair, his smile mischievous: \"Of course I do, and I wasn’t planning to go any further. You just didn’t give me a moment to pause. I was just teasing her.\"","He grinned, his eyes curving with amusement as he looked at Qiao Chuchu: \"Look at her, she’s so scared her face is all red.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face turned as red as a tomato, her brain struggling to keep up.","[This Ying Chen has no sense of propriety!!!]","[In my eyes, he’s just a contrasting cuteness CEO! After all, he secretly loves poking at wool felt crafts!!!]","[Who wants to touch his abs?! Even if his abs are drop-dead gorgeous, he can’t just grab my hand and make me touch them!!]","[Psychos! They’re all psychos!]","Ying Chen: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?\"","The person on the video call: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi suddenly burst out laughing: \"Pfft!!\"","Pei Ci, who had been looking grim, couldn’t help but sneer: \"The world is full of oddities. Some people seem disgusting on the surface, but it turns out they’re secretly into fluffy little toys. How very girly of them.\"","Pei Mu smirked sinisterly: \"Someone like that probably doesn’t have much masculinity to speak of. No wonder he’s showing off—the more he flaunts, the less he actually has.\"","The others nodded in agreement.","Ying Chen’s face darkened: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu felt mentally exhausted: [I've realized my sensitivity to perverts has decreased. After all, there aren’t many normal people around me, so I'm not even surprised by Ying Chen's antics anymore.]","Everyone: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu lowered her head, conflicted: [Although I really want to beat Ying Chen up, he offered me 300 million plus a bonus to help him find a spy. For 300 million, I think touching him isn’t that big of a deal.]","Ying Chen: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"...?\"","Pei Yuan: \"????\"","300 million?","For just 300 million, she’s willing to endure such humiliation?!","Pei Yuan felt an indescribable weariness: \"Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up at the phone screen.","Pei Yuan felt as though he had aged ten years, staring at her in disbelief: \"Haven’t I taken good care of you? I practically fed you diamonds. Why do you still act like you’re afraid of being broke?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What are you talking about? You’ve got it all wrong!\"","She clutched her chest in surprise: \"I really am afraid of being broke!\"","Pei Yuan: \"?\"","The others: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu pouted, looking like a wronged child, her voice trembling: \"And for some reason, I feel like you’ve all become so strange. It’s like you’re treating me like a monkey, each of you trying to snatch me up and keep me as a pet!\"","She stood up, her voice choked with emotion: \"I’ve lived this long, and I’ve never had so many people around me. I used to be disliked by everyone, but now it’s like I’m some kind of universal favorite. Your concern is too much for me to handle! Do you know how much pressure I’m under?!\"","Everyone was stunned, watching the distressed Qiao Chuchu with guilt etched on their faces.","Pei Yuan on the video call spoke up anxiously: \"Chuchu, that’s not what I meant—\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head back, as if holding back tears: \"I don’t want to hear it. I need some peace and quiet. Goodbye.\"","She turned and walked away, her steps quick and light, as if she had oiled her feet to make a swift escape!","[Hahahahahahahahaha I’m so clever, this excuse is perfect for slipping away!]","[A bunch of psychos having a meeting—I’m not sticking around for that nonsense hahaha!]","[I’m outta here! Time to scroll through Douyin and Bilibili!~~~]","The others, who had just started to feel guilty and concerned: \"...?\"","Pei Yuan, who was about to spiral into self-doubt: \"...?\"","Ying Chen laughed and called out: \"Qiao Chuchu, you—\"","Qiao Chuchu suddenly stopped in her tracks, leaning against the wall.","Her posture suggested she might be feeling unwell.","Everyone raised an eyebrow, watching her with interest.","Oh, what now? Planning to pretend she’s sick to make another escape?","Qiao Chuchu stood with her back to them, her hand pressed against the wall, her face pale.","She was seeing visions.","She and another girl were running away, a car chasing them from behind.","Somehow, the girl in front of her suddenly turned around and shoved her hard!","She fell to the ground, looking up in panic to see Xia Xuechun’s resolute expression.","Xia Xuechun ran off into the darkness without a second glance.","Qiao Chuchu tried to get up, but a man grabbed her tightly.","His evil whispers and foul breath washed over her as the cold wind blew. She was forced into the trunk of his car, her body too weak to struggle no matter how hard she tried.","The scene shifted. She was lying on an operating table, watching helplessly as the man injected an unknown substance into her arm.","Her body was limp, like soft tofu. The man, whose face she couldn’t see, picked up a chainsaw and aimed it at her neck, slicing through.","Qiao Chuchu jolted awake from the vision, collapsing to her knees!","Lou Tingsi and Ying Chen’s expressions changed instantly as they rushed to her side: \"What’s wrong?!\"","Her brothers frowned at the screen, and Yu Can stepped closer to the camera, watching Qiao Chuchu, who had curled into a small ball.","Qiao Chuchu was ice-cold, clutching her throat, trembling violently from sheer terror, her mind blank!","[I was dismembered by a psychopath!]","[I got dismembered again!!!]","[For some reason, Xia Xuechun and I were both captured! But that bitch Xia Xuechun betrayed me!!!!]","[We were running together, and I thought we could help each other. In that kind of situation, we shouldn’t have turned on each other! If we worked together, we could’ve escaped that psychopath!]","[But she pushed me toward him, letting me get caught while she ran away!]","[Before dismembering me, he injected me with something that made me too weak to fight back!]","Qiao Chuchu’s face was drained of color, her panic growing.","[Is this something I’m going to experience?]","Where is that psychopath? When is he coming for me? How can I protect myself?!","Lou Tingsi’s expression softened as he watched Qiao Chuchu shiver. He gently wrapped an arm around her shoulders: \"Qiao Chuchu, don’t be afraid. I’m here. You don’t need to be scared, okay?\"","Ying Chen frowned, shoving Lou Tingsi aside impatiently: \"Enough with the nonsense.\"","He scooped Qiao Chuchu up in his arms and roughly handed her a gun: \"Take this.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at the warm gun in her hand, tears welling up as she looked at Ying Chen.","Ying Chen’s brow furrowed as he spoke to her seriously: \"The greatest fear comes from a lack of firepower. But as long as I’m here, your gun will never run out of bullets.\"","Tears of fear streamed down Qiao Chuchu’s face as she tilted her head in confusion: \"I don’t think... I ever said what I was afraid of.\"","\"I don’t know what you’re afraid of,\" Ying Chen said firmly. \"But nothing gives you more security than holding a gun. If that’s not enough, you should also carry a few grenades and a submachine gun.\"","\"Luckily, I’m an arms dealer,\" Ying Chen added with a proud smirk. \"And luckily, I have grenades and submachine guns.\""]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: Qiao Chuchu's Wishes Come True","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu tightened her grip on the gun and suddenly felt a sense of calm wash over her.","[Yes, the greatest fear stems from a lack of firepower and control. As long as I have this gun, I can protect myself.]","Seeing that she had calmed down, Ying Chen smirked and said, \"You must be tired of listening to our arguments. Why don't you go scroll through TikTok or Bilibili for a bit? Hmm?\"","Qiao Chuchu's limbs were still weak, and the sensation of the chainsaw cutting her throat lingered on her neck. She weakly nodded and said, \"Alright, I'll go by myself.\"","She tried to get up, but Ying Chen tightened his arm around her, preventing her from moving.","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in confusion.","But Ying Chen didn't look at her. Instead, he barked at Lou Tingsi, \"Lead the way! What are you standing there for?\"","Lou Tingsi, who had been watching eagerly, glared at him in annoyance. \"I would have carried her even without you.\"","Ying Chen smirked arrogantly. \"Well, whoever gets there first wins!\"","Lou Tingsi's expression darkened. He picked up his phone, which was still on a video call, and led Ying Chen to his room.","Qiao Chuchu was gently placed on the bed.","Ying Chen clumsily tucked her in with the blanket.","Lou Tingsi took the opportunity to step forward and wiped the sweat from Qiao Chuchu's forehead. He whispered softly, \"Even though this is my room, the sheets have been freshly changed, so you can rest assured. I'll have Song Yu come in to keep you company. All of her subordinates are women, and she admires you deeply. She'll take care of you wholeheartedly.\"","Qiao Chuchu was so grateful that she didn't know what to say.","She was still terrified. The experience had felt so real, replaying vividly in her mind. She had been the victim.","Faced with Lou Tingsi's tenderness, she couldn't help but feel her nose sting, and tears began to fall once more.","Seeing her cry, Lou Tingsi frowned and gently cupped her face, wiping away her tears.","As he wiped them, he comforted her, \"Don't cry. It's okay, we're not crying anymore.\"","She nodded tearfully, stammering, \"I'm sorry, I'm being a bit neurotic. I just... suddenly felt unwell.\"","[I can't tell them that I foresaw my own future. Everything about the system must be kept secret. They don't know why I'm crying, but they're willing to be understanding. They're such good people.]","[Such incredibly good people!]","Lou Tingsi was momentarily stunned, then smiled helplessly. He leaned in close and kissed her forehead.","It was as if she were his most precious treasure.","The kiss was gentle and reverent.","Ying Chen exclaimed, \"Hey! What are you doing?!\"","Lou Tingsi calmly held back the restless Ying Chen and asked patiently, \"Is there anything else you need? Do you want some strawberries?\"","Qiao Chuchu, still clutching the gun, shook her head tearfully. \"I miss my brother.\"","The person on the other end of the phone was stunned.","She bit her lower lip hard, overwhelmed by an indescribable sense of grievance, and repeated, \"I really miss my brother!\"","[But I... I don't dare trouble them with my fears. I feel like I don't have the right to bother them anymore.]","[But I miss them so much. I want them by my side. Even if they don't do anything, just having them near me would make me feel safe.]","Weisheng Yucan clutched her chest, her heart melting at the sound of Qiao Chuchu's sobbing.","It was too heartbreaking.","She couldn't help but glance at the seven men, only to be surprised.","The seven men of the Pei Family, led by Pei Yuan, all had red eyes, tears welling up in them.","Suddenly, they stood up.","Yucan asked in surprise, \"Where are you going?\"","Pei Yuan blinked back his tears and said, \"We're going abroad.\"","With that, he picked up his phone and called Little Xie, walking out of the office with his brothers. \"Little Xie, pack our things and book seven tickets to France. The earliest flight available, right now.\"","Weisheng Yucan was momentarily stunned, then suddenly thought of something. She picked up her phone and opened her family group chat.","\"Are you all busy?\"","She waited for three minutes, but no one responded.","Weisheng Yucan took a deep breath and, suppressing her impatience, typed directly, \"There's an opportunity to win Qiao Chuchu's favor. Anyone interested?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Lin: \"?\"","Weisheng Yucan was both amused and exasperated.","They wouldn't respond unless Qiao Chuchu was mentioned, huh?","She gritted her teeth and typed, \"Qiao Chuchu had a premonition that she was going to be dismembered. She's so scared that she's been crying nonstop. If you want to go, head to France and find Lou Tingsi. The seven Pei Family members are already on their way, and Ying Chen and Lou Tingsi are there too. Don't say I didn't warn you!\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","Yucan frowned, \"Why are you still typing question marks? Wasn't I clear enough? If you can't understand, go back to elementary school and learn Chinese!\"","Weisheng Lin, ever the instigator, chimed in, \"It's not that you weren't clear. They're just wondering why Ying Chen is there. What's his relationship with Qiao Chuchu?\"","Yucan sneered, \"Apparently, Ying Chen spent 300 million to hire Qiao Chuchu to find a mole for him. So, it's an employer-employee relationship. But just now, this employer carried Qiao Chuchu back to bed and even whispered sweet nothings to her. He's more handsome than you all and knows how to be considerate. If it were me, I'd already be in love with him~\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"???????? @Weisheng Biehe, you idiot! You let a wolf into the house! Who told you to invite him to the birthday party?! Damn it!!!\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"????\"","Weisheng Lin: \"Hurry up and book tickets to go watch the drama! Hahahahahahahahaha!\"","-","Xia Xuechun stood with her luggage next to the second son of the Long Family.","She looked up at the sky in France, amazed. \"So this is what it's like abroad! It's my first time leaving the country!\"","The Long Family's son smiled warmly at her and said gently, \"From now on, I'm your brother. Whenever I travel for work or leisure, I'll take you with me, okay?\"","Xia Xuechun beamed and playfully nudged his arm, teasing, \"Second Brother, you're so good to me. But won't Second Sister-in-law get jealous?\"","The man's smile stiffened, and he sneered, \"That crazy woman... She used to tell me to take care of you, but now that I actually am, she's throwing a fit. No matter what I say, she can't accept you. Don't worry about her. I've booked the best hotel for you. Rest well, and once I finish work, I'll take you out to have some fun.\"","Xia Xuechun smiled happily, clinging to his arm like a child. \"Second Brother, you're so good to me. You're like a real brother to me!\"","The man pinched her cheek affectionately. \"Because I like you, little sister.\"","Xia Xuechun's eyes curved into a smile, but suddenly, she felt several cold gazes piercing through her.","She looked up in confusion and met the sharp eyes of the seven Pei Family brothers.","They stood across from her, dressed in impeccably tailored suits, their presence imposing.","Pei Yuan stood in the center, looking at her with a mocking smile. \"Having an affair, are we?\"","Xia Xuechun's face turned pale, and she hid behind the man, shrinking back without a word.","Why were the seven of them in France too?!","The man quickly shielded her and said sternly, \"Mr. Pei, please show some respect. This is my sister.\"","Pei Youchuan laughed carelessly. \"Yeah, you call her 'sister' during the day, and she calls you 'brother' at night. We all know how it goes.\"","The man's face turned red.","Xia Xuechun bit her lip and timidly peeked out to explain, \"We're innocent!\"","Pei Che snorted and glanced at Pei Youchuan. \"Third Brother, that was out of line. Don't insult their pure relationship.\"","Pei Che stepped forward, stopping in front of the Long Family's second son, and glared at him with a dark expression. \"I don't care if you're here on a honeymoon or whatever, but from now on, when you see the Pei Family, you better steer clear.\"","The man's eyes widened in shock. \"What?\"","Pei Che smirked coldly. \"You know how our circle works. We need to help each other out. Offending too many people can push you into a corner. You've already crossed the Wei Sheng Family. Do you really want to mess with the Pei Family too?\"","The man was speechless. Pei Che looked at him with undisguised menace. \"If you don't want to suffer, make sure you and Xia Xuechun avoid us from now on. Understood?\"","The man opened his mouth but couldn't get a single word out.","Pei Che's eyes were filled with murderous intent as he asked, \"Understood?\"","The man's face turned as red as a beet, and he lowered his head in humiliation, gritting his teeth. \"Understood.\"","Pei Che sneered, his gaze like a knife as it swept over Xia Xuechun. He turned to his brothers and said, \"Our girl is waiting for us. Let's go, or she'll get impatient.\""]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: When There Are More and More Handsome Men Who Dote on Others, Is It a Good Thing or a Bad Thing","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu faintly caught a familiar scent.","It was the fragrance of lavender fabric softener.","She groggily opened her eyes, and the first thing she saw was Pei Buxian’s face leaning close to hers.","His platinum-blonde hair was soft and unstyled, with his bangs naturally falling, making him look like an innocent puppy, staring intently at her.","Thinking she was dreaming, Qiao Chuchu reached out and poked him: “Seventh Brother?”","Pei Buxian took the opportunity to grab her hand and press it against his cheek, gently nuzzling into her palm.","Feeling his warmth, Qiao Chuchu finally realized this wasn’t a dream.","She tried to pull her hand back, but Pei Buxian held on tightly, interlocking their fingers with a firm, almost domineering grip.","She blinked in confusion: “Why are you here?”","“You said you missed me,” he replied casually, though his gaze was intense. “So I came.”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned and opened her mouth to speak, but Pei Mu and Pei Ci pulled Pei Buxian aside, muttering irritably, “Don’t act like you’re the only one who came.”","They both rushed to Qiao Chuchu’s side, their eyes sparkling as they looked at her: “Aren’t you surprised to see us?!”","Qiao Chuchu’s gaze shifted between them, and she covered her mouth in disbelief: “You two came too?”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci nodded in unison: “You said you wanted to see us, so we booked tickets right away!”","Pei Ci poked the corner of her swollen eye: “You missed us so much you cried yourself to sleep.”","Pei Mu smirked mischievously: “How about a big hug to show our love?”","They sandwiched her between them, squeezing her tightly like a cookie in a sandwich!","Qiao Chuchu: “!”","Pei Fengnong grabbed them by the collars and sternly warned: “Stop fooling around!”","He tossed them aside like unruly kittens!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci, now dangling like scruffed cats, protested: “Who’s fooling around? We’re just showing concern for Qiao Chuchu!”","Ignoring them, Pei Fengnong sat by Qiao Chuchu’s bedside and asked bluntly: “I saw you crying during the video call. Are you still upset?”","He was tense, not wanting to miss any subtle change in her expression: “If you’re still sad...”","He tentatively wrapped his arms around her: “You can cry on my shoulder.”","Qiao Chuchu buried her face in his chest, about to relax, when Pei Fengnong was suddenly pulled aside.","Pei Youchuan’s broad frame enveloped her as he pulled her into a tight embrace!","Qiao Chuchu’s face collided with his firm chest: “...”","Pei Youchuan held her firmly, glaring at Pei Fengnong, who looked annoyed: “That’s enough. What do you know about being gentle with someone?”","Qiao Chuchu looked up at Pei Youchuan, confused.","Her face was pale, her eyes swollen like walnuts, and she looked utterly exhausted.","He frowned, gently pinching her cheek: “Are you an idiot? If you wanted me by your side, you could’ve just called me. Did you think I wouldn’t come?”","Qiao Chuchu, her cheek still pinched, mumbled: “But you’re all so busy. You specifically told me not to disturb your work.”","“That was in the past,” Pei Youchuan grumbled, rubbing her cheeks up and down: “You can always call me when you’re sad.”","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in surprise: “Really?”","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, his tone gruff: “No, I actually hate you. But do you know what I hate even more?”","She blinked: “What?”","“I hate it when you cry,” Pei Youchuan said, pulling her into his chest again: “You look so ugly when you cry.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Pei Che pulled Pei Youchuan aside and sat down in front of Qiao Chuchu: “Let me check your blood pressure.”","Qiao Chuchu stared blankly as Pei Che took out an electric blood pressure monitor.","[What’s going on? They’re all taking turns without letting me speak!]","Ignoring her confusion, Pei Che confirmed her blood pressure was normal and said calmly: “You don’t need to stress over things. We’ll handle them for you.”","She withdrew her hand, puzzled: “But I never said why I was upset.”","[Why do they act like they already know what’s bothering me?]","[It’s like nothing escapes their notice.]","The others exchanged uneasy glances, avoiding her gaze for fear of revealing too much.","Only Pei Che kept his eyes on Qiao Chuchu.","Her eyes were like a misty morning, filled with a mix of confusion and curiosity, silently asking for an explanation.","He leaned down, meeting her gaze.","Qiao Chuchu instinctively leaned back.","But Pei Che cupped the back of her head, forcing her to meet his intense stare: “What’s there to say? You were crying, weren’t you?”","Qiao Chuchu was stunned.","Pei Che moved closer, his tone cold and unyielding: “You were crying like the world was ending on the phone. Of course, we had to come and take care of you.”","Qiao Chuchu: “...”","[Ugh, I can’t stand it when Second Brother gets all dark and brooding like this.]","She closed her eyes.","[I can’t even look at him when he’s like this.]","Pei Che snorted, watching her tightly shut eyes.","Qiao Chuchu felt the tension in the air, and suddenly, her eyelids felt warm.","It was as if something had lightly brushed against them—a fingertip or perhaps a kiss.","She opened her eyes in shock, meeting Pei Che’s deep gaze.","His expression was neutral, but the atmosphere around him had shifted from tense to relaxed, a faint smile playing on his lips as he stood up and made way for Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan leaned over to tuck her blanket in and asked gently: “Should I bring your meal here so you can eat in bed?”","Qiao Chuchu quickly shook her head: “No, no, no! This is Lou Tingsi’s room. I can’t eat here.”","Lou Tingsi chuckled from the side: “It’s fine. I don’t mind.”","“But I do!” Qiao Chuchu insisted, looking at Pei Yuan: “Big Brother, don’t worry. I’m feeling much better just seeing all of you!”","She secretly gripped the edge of the blanket, feeling a little happy.","[My family is so wonderful!]","[Even though there’s some distance between us, I can tell they still see me as family. They’re always willing to help me, but I don’t really need their help. Just seeing them is enough to make me feel brave, even if there’s a serial killer waiting for me outside.]","[Because I have my family!]","Tears welled up in her eyes, and she blinked them away, smiling brightly at Pei Yuan: “Thank you for coming, Big Brother. Really, thank you.”","Pei Yuan was momentarily stunned, then pulled her into a tight embrace.","She buried her face in his chest, surprised: “Big Brother?”","Pei Yuan held her tighter and tighter: “Don’t thank us.”","His handsome face was clouded with worry: “Protecting you is my duty. No matter what’s happened between us, you can always rely on me in this regard.”","He stroked her hair: “I’m your big brother. Always will be.”","Qiao Chuchu’s nose tingled, and she felt like crying again. She nodded: “Yeah!”","[I know.]","She hugged Pei Yuan tightly, her gaze growing determined.","[I’ll protect my family, my friends, and myself! I’ll live well!]","Qiao Chuchu perked up, full of energy, and hopped out of bed: “Alright, I’m recharged! I’ll go freshen up. You all wait for me in the living room!”","Pei Yuan watched her head to the bathroom, murmuring to himself: “So she still relies on me.”","A proud smile crept onto his face: “Just one word from me, and she’s back to her usual self.”","Pei Youchuan: “? Big Brother, sometimes you really overestimate yourself.”","Pei Buxian glared at Pei Yuan, his voice low: “No way. Little Eight was happy because of me.”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci stepped forward to argue: “It couldn’t have been you! It was us twins. We hold a special place in her heart, you know?”","Pei Fengnong sneered: “Ha! If she cheered up because of you two, that would be a joke.”","Pei Che pinched the bridge of his nose, annoyed: “Stop arguing. Let’s head to the living room. We have things to discuss.”","Lou Tingsi nodded: “This way.”","The men filed out of the room.","Song Yu, who had been quietly hiding in the corner, unnoticed: “...”","She hugged her assault rifle, feeling as lost as a monkey abandoned in the desert.","No wonder Miss Qiao looks at our boss like he’s just another guy.","She’s surrounded by so many handsome men!","Miss Qiao really lives the good life, huh?"]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: If You Can't Protect the Ones You Care About, It's Time to Pack Up and Prepare for Burial","paragraphs":["Ying Chen was the first to sit down on the sofa, leaning back lazily. \"Let me introduce myself. I'm Ying Chen, the third son of the Ying family. I'm twenty-eight, single, and like Lou Tingsi, I'm a weapons dealer, though we operate in different regions. That's about it.\"","Everyone glanced at him indifferently and nodded, acknowledging his introduction.","Pei Yuan got straight to the point. \"While on the plane, I looked into the chainsaw murder case.\"","He placed his phone on the table. \"There's a serial killer in Country F who remains at large. His method involves dismembering victims with a chainsaw, and all his victims are young women between the ages of eighteen and twenty-five.\"","\"This criminal has a strong sense of counter-surveillance. To this day, no clues have surfaced. The police have been chasing him for years, but there haven't been any new victims in a while. Perhaps due to advancements in technology, he's lying low, but there's no guarantee he won't strike again.\"","Pei Yuan crossed his hands on the table and spoke calmly, \"So I have reason to suspect that the person who will kill Qiao Chuchu in the future is this very individual. If we find this killer, the problem of Qiao Chuchu being murdered will be resolved.\"","Pei Che propped himself on the table, his expression haughty as he scanned the room. \"In Qiao Chuchu's prophecy, she was running away with Xia Xuechun. Xia Xuechun pushed her down, leading to her capture and subsequent murder. Coincidentally, Xia Xuechun is currently in Country F, alone with the second son of the Dragon Family. In other words, the plot is already in motion, trying to encircle Qiao Chuchu.\"","Lou Tingsi frowned. \"Wait, doesn't the second son of the Dragon Family have a wife? His son is already five or six years old. Why would he take Xia Xuechun abroad? Doesn't he know how to avoid suspicion?\"","\"An affair, obviously,\" Ying Chen chimed in, crossing his legs. \"Haven't you seen this kind of thing before?\"","Lou Tingsi fell silent, his expression darkening. \"Disgusting.\"","Pei Yuan tapped the table, signaling everyone to focus on him. \"We need to do two things. First, find this killer. Second, protect Qiao Chuchu while keeping her happy and stress-free.\"","The room fell into collective silence as everyone pondered how to proceed.","Pei Buxian was the first to step forward. \"I can stay with her.\"","Everyone looked at him in surprise.","Pei Buxian lifted his chin proudly. \"I'm only a year older than Qiao Chuchu. There's no generation gap between us. She likes being with me, and I can make her strawberry cake.\"","He volunteered eagerly, \"I can make any kind of dessert. Qiao Chuchu loves sweets.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci retorted in unison, \"Second brother also loves sweets. Why don't you ever make desserts for him?\"","Pei Che: \"?\"","Pei Buxian: \"?\"","Pei Ci scoffed, \"Besides, eating too many sweets gets boring. Nowadays, young women are into cutting sugar. Qiao Chuchu won't give you the time of day.\"","Pei Buxian's eyes widened, and he snapped back, \"She would never ignore me! She loves my cooking! Pei Ci, shut your mouth!!\"","Pei Mu pointed at Pei Buxian, laughing, \"With your temper and shouting, aren't you afraid of scaring our little sister to death?\"","Pei Buxian's veins bulged as he roared, \"I'm not angry! I only get mad at you two because you're annoying!!! I would never get this mad at Qiao Chuchu!!!!\"","Pei Ci smirked arrogantly, \"Someone as emotionally unstable as you? We definitely can't vote for you.\"","Pei Mu spread his hands, \"Yeah, not voting for you has nothing to do with personal feelings. You're just not qualified.\"","Pei Buxian: \"...\"","Pei Ci grinned and leaned close to Pei Mu, whispering conspiratorially, \"But Pei Mu and I are different. We're twins with a special bond. When we were kids, we used to sleep with Qiao Chuchu and play games together.\"","Pei Mu smiled, his eyes curving, \"So, to help her relive her childhood, the three of us will stay in a closed room, playing fun games that will make her laugh and roll on the floor. When she's tired, she'll fall asleep on the sofa, entering a happy space with us, forgetting all her worries.\"","Ying Chen narrowed his eyes suspiciously and glanced at Lou Tingsi. \"Doesn't this sound a bit... risqué?\"","Lou Tingsi sneered, crossing his arms. \"Pass!\"","Pei Buxian snorted, \"Overruled.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci frowned, \"Why?! Do you have no taste?!\"","Pei Youchuan shot them a disgusted look, \"A closed room, two creepy twins, and an innocent girl—who wouldn't think the worst?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci protested, \"Who are you calling creepy twins?! We wouldn't do anything! You're insulting our character!\"","Pei Youchuan sneered, \"As your older brother, I know exactly what kind of people you are.\"","He tossed his hair, revealing his sharp jawline, and said proudly, \"I, on the other hand, can take Qiao Chuchu to an amusement park. We'll ride roller coasters, Ferris wheels, eat cotton candy, and watch fireworks. I'll make sure she has a blast all day.\"","Pei Fengnong glared at him in disgust, \"The world is trying to kill Qiao Chuchu, and you want to take her on a roller coaster? Are you trying to speed up her death or make it more gruesome?\"","Pei Youchuan paused, frowning, \"Then what do you suggest, fourth brother?\"","Pei Fengnong hesitated, his face reddening as he awkwardly scratched the back of his head, \"Well...\"","He spoke haltingly, \"I'd take her to see the ocean. We'd drive along the coast, enjoy the beautiful scenery, and let her find inspiration for her paintings.\"","As he spoke, his eyes sparkled with excitement, \"She'd definitely be happy and... grateful that I brought her there.\"","His voice grew softer, so much so that Pei Youchuan leaned in but still couldn't hear him, \"What did you say at the end?\"","Pei Fengnong's face turned crimson, and he pushed Pei Youchuan away, \"What did I say?!\"","Pei Youchuan stumbled back, looking at him in surprise, \"What's wrong? I just asked because I didn't hear you. Why are you so nervous?\"","Pei Fengnong's face was now beet red, and he glared at him, \"Ask, ask, ask! Why are you so nosy?!\"","Pei Che couldn't take it anymore and barked, \"Enough! Are we the only seven people here? Can't you stop arguing in front of outsiders?!\"","The younger brothers fell silent, glaring at each other before looking away.","Pei Yuan stood up, casting a cold glance at his brothers. \"Until we find the killer, we can all go together. Why do we need to be alone with her? What's the benefit of that?\"","The brothers fell silent, unable to respond.","Ying Chen, amused as if watching a drama, chuckled, \"There are plenty of benefits to being alone. I like being alone. You can have private conversations, maybe even make some subtle moves.\"","Everyone: \"????\"","He grinned shamelessly, \"Besides, why are you all so tense? None of us are small fries. If Qiao Chuchu gets taken under our watch, what's the point of us being here?\"","He poured himself a glass of wine and said playfully, \"If you can't even protect someone you care about, you might as well pack up and prepare for your funeral.\""]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Winning Dust: Still Think Qiao Chuchu is the Queen Bee, One Kick Can Stir Up a Hive","paragraphs":["Everyone furrowed their brows, feeling that there was some logic to the situation and gradually calmed down.","The butler walked over to Lou Tingsi and whispered something to him.","Lou Tingsi was taken aback: \"Why are they here? Have they come in?\"","Weisheng Lin's lively voice rang out: \"We're not late, are we?\"","Weisheng Lin, wearing a black wool coat, strode in with large steps, followed by Weisheng Biehe, who was twirling prayer beads, and Weisheng Huailing, dressed in a white coat.","And then... Weisheng Wenzhan, wearing frameless glasses, walked in with steady steps.","The four brothers seemed as if they had crossed over from another world, bringing with them the biting cold wind from outside, their presence subtly lowering the atmosphere in the room.","The Pei brothers' expressions changed.","Lou Tingsi also seemed displeased.","Ying Chen, however, was surprised: \"For just Qiao Chuchu, even you all came?\"","He muttered in shock: \"Is Qiao Chuchu some kind of queen bee? Kick her, and a whole swarm comes out.\"","Weisheng Huailing happily stepped past Weisheng Lin and came to the center of the room, looking around: \"Where's Chuchu?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci were annoyed the moment they saw him: \"Why are you here again?\"","Weisheng Huailing smiled brightly, unbothered, and took out his exquisite briefcase.","He placed it on the table and opened it.","What greeted everyone's eyes was a custom silver-white pistol.","Two gleaming butterfly knives and a claw knife.","And a small electric saw.","Everyone fell silent, their eyes on Weisheng Huailing.","Huailing folded his hands, pushed the briefcase forward, and typed on his phone, which then played a voice message: \"These are my weapons.\"","He smiled gently, like a snow-white, clingy fox, and pressed the phone's voice button again.","A mechanical male voice said: \"And this is my sincerity in protecting Qiao Chuchu.\"","Weisheng Biehe, twirling his prayer beads, walked over and stood beside Weisheng Huailing. \"Leave this to Huailing. He's a professional and can handle it cleanly.\"","Pei Fengnong asked irritably: \"How did you know something happened to Qiao Chuchu?\"","\"My sister told me,\" Weisheng Biehe replied cheerfully, his tone soft. \"She said someone wanted to tear Qiao Chuchu to pieces, so we all came.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"...\"","Pei Yuan, standing to the side, grew wary.","Only when these people gathered together did he realize that, unknowingly, Qiao Chuchu had so many people around her.","He looked around cautiously: \"Isn't it a bit much for all of you to come?\"","Weisheng Lin raised his hand, speaking casually: \"Don't worry, my elder brother and I are just here to watch the show.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan had already taken a seat on the sofa, his long legs crossed, his deep eyes behind the frameless glasses scanning the crowd: \"Hmm, don't mind me.\"","The moment Pei Youchuan saw him, he couldn't help but sneer: \"Really, we shouldn't mind you?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked at him, smiled, and didn't respond.","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","He really couldn't stand being around the Weisheng family for even a moment!","These people were full of schemes!","He was allergic to scheming!","At that moment, Qiao Chuchu came running over cheerfully: \"I'm ready! Let's have lunch!\"","She ran into the reception room, but her smile vanished instantly: \"Huh?\"","The spacious reception room was filled with men in black coats, white shirts, and ties.","They had different appearances and auras, but all turned to look at her in unison.","Qiao Chuchu fell silent.","She rubbed her eyes.","And opened them again.","?","Wasn't she seeing things?","Lou Tingsi's reception room was in cool tones, and three men were sitting on the black horizontal sofa.","Ying Chen sat in the middle, holding a wine glass, looking up at her.","Weisheng Wenzhan, wearing frameless glasses, rested his chin on his hand, eyeing her with interest.","Weisheng Lin, on the other side, had no expression at first, but when he saw her, he couldn't help but suppress a smile, lowering his head.","Weisheng Biehe sat on a single sofa to the side, his pale fingers idly twirling prayer beads, glancing at her.","Qiao Chuchu remained silent, her gaze shifting to the black conference table on the other side.","Pei Yuan stood in the center, frowning at her, his face full of bitterness.","Pei Che shot a dark look at the Weisheng family and let out a cold snort.","Pei Youchuan seemed irritated, taking several deep breaths as if holding something back.","Pei Fengnong looked at her with a righteous expression, a hint of anxiety in his eyes.","Pei Buxian's chest heaved violently, clearly on the verge of anger, his back teeth clenched tightly.","Lou Tingsi stood helplessly to the side, sighing at her.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci glared at Weisheng Huailing out of the corners of their eyes.","Weisheng Huailing was the only one in white amidst all the black, energetically making a heart gesture at her: \"Sister!\"","Qiao Chuchu slammed the reception room door shut with a \"Bang!\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","The others: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu stood at the door in horror, her hand still gripping the doorknob.","Song Yu stood behind her, puzzled: \"What's wrong? Are there ghosts inside?\"","Qiao Chuchu took a few steps back in fear, her mind blank, muttering: \"I think it's scarier than ghosts...\"","Song Yu's expression turned serious: \"Is someone trying to hurt you? Let me take a look.\"","Song Yu pushed the door open!","And slammed it shut again!","Song Yu's voice trembled: \"W-why are there so many, so many handsome men in there?!\"","Qiao Chuchu murmured in terror: \"They're not just handsome men.\"","[This is a gathering of villainous big shots!]","[Only Lin Qing and Yu Can are missing!]","[Lin Shen, strictly speaking, is more of a naive sweetheart and wouldn't even make the cut here!]","[But why are there so many?! How did this happen?!]","[I don't know why, but I'm running away!! I don't care why, I'm running away!!!!]","Qiao Chuchu turned and bolted!","Before Song Yu could react, the reception room door opened!","Weisheng Huailing rushed out, chasing after Qiao Chuchu: \"Chuchu, don't go!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci followed closely: \"Qiao Chuchu! Come with us! Don't be afraid, we'll take you to play games!\"","Pei Buxian: \"Qiao Chuchu, come with me, I'm your brother! I'll make you a cake!\"","Pei Youchuan shouted angrily: \"Why are you running, Qiao Chuchu? Stop! Let's go to the amusement park!\"","Pei Fengnong silently chased after her.","Weisheng Biehe shouted: \"Weisheng Huailing, cut her off!\"","Weisheng Lin: \"? Why do you keep forgetting your brother is deaf?\"","Biehe paused, closing his eyes in frustration, and then ran after them.","Lou Tingsi followed closely: \"Miss Qiao, don't run! We won't eat you, Miss Qiao!\"","Weisheng Lin, seeing the size of the pursuing group, couldn't help but exclaim and pulled out his phone: \"Qiao Chuchu, run faster, run longer, let me record this! Don't let them catch you!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan stood at the back, exchanging glances with Pei Yuan and Pei Che.","Pei Yuan's face was as dark as coal.","Pei Che also looked displeased.","Wenzhan couldn't help but smile, adjusting his glasses: \"Who do you think will catch her?\"","Pei Yuan didn't hesitate: \"Definitely my brother.\"","Wenzhan smirked: \"My brother isn't bad either.\"","Pei Che didn't bother to respond, stepping forward to chase: \"Qiao Chuchu, stop running! With us here, who dares to harm you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu ran ahead, looking back to see them chasing after her in a group!","And they were getting closer!","She let out a sharp scream: \"Stay away from me!!!\""]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: I Have Trypophobia, Can't Stand Seeing So Many Handsome Guys","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu was finally dragged back by Weisheng Huailing, Pei Buxian, and Pei Ci.","She sat in the middle of a rectangular dining table, her face ashen, surrounded by people on both sides.","Being encircled by so many influential figures, she had lost her appetite and spoke weakly, \"Why are all of you here?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, sitting comfortably across from her, adjusted his glasses and said, \"Because you cried.\"","Qiao Chuchu was on the verge of tears again. \"I’m not crying now, so you can all leave. There are too many of you, and I feel like I’m suffocating.\"","Weisheng Biehe raised an eyebrow, intrigued. \"Miss Qiao doesn’t want to be with us?\"","She nodded emphatically. \"I have a fear of crowds, and you’re all too handsome in one place. It’s overwhelming.\"","[Mainly because there are so many weirdos here, I’m trembling! Even my brother standing here makes me nervous! None of them seem like good people!]","Lou Tingsi smirked, clearly amused. \"I received an invitation to an art exhibition earlier. I was planning to go alone, but since we all happen to be free now, why don’t we go together?\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately sat up straight. \"An art exhibition? That sounds great! It’s been a while since I’ve been to one!\"","[It’s a big space, not crowded, and they can spread out. They won’t be stuck in the same room with me like this!]","[This is perfect, perfect!]","Weisheng Huailing frowned slightly, casting a reproachful glance at the others.","His eyes seemed to say, \"It’s because of all of you that Qiao Chuchu feels pressured.\"","Weisheng Lin, sneaking a glance, made a mocking hand gesture: \"Don’t flatter yourself. You’re also on the list of people she’s avoiding.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","Pei Yuan stood up. \"Since Qiao Chuchu wants to go, let’s head out.\"","Qiao Chuchu beamed. \"Really? Can we?\"","Pei Yuan nodded without hesitation. \"Your happiness is what matters most.\"","She cheered, \"Yay! Let’s go!\"","And so, the group drove to the art exhibition.","Lou Tingsi explained, \"This exhibition is being held at the estate of the artist Meng Yashu. He built a special venue just for this event, so it’s not open to everyone. The attendees are all top figures in their respective fields, and Meng Yashu himself will be there.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded excitedly. \"I’ve heard of Meng Yashu, but I’ve never seen his work. Seeing him in person on my first visit is so exciting!\"","Seeing her so happy, the others brightened, their lips curling into faint smiles.","Lou Tingsi chuckled warmly. \"Well, as long as you’re happy.\"","Qiao Chuchu ran ahead, her steps light and cheerful as she entered the exhibition.","Lou Tingsi handed the invitation to a staff member. \"We’re all together.\"","The staff member nodded and pressed their Bluetooth earpiece. \"Mr. Meng, Mr. Lou has arrived.\"","A man in an oatmeal-colored cardigan strode over, his face lighting up with delight. \"Mr. Lou, I thought you weren’t coming!\"","Lou Tingsi embraced him with a smile. \"I just finished up some work and rushed over with my friends. How could I miss it?\"","Lou Tingsi introduced the men. \"This is Meng Yashu, an exceptional artist.\"","He then turned to Meng Yashu. \"Yashu, these are the seven gentlemen from the Pei family of Lan City, the four gentlemen from the Weisheng family, and Mr. Ying Chen from M Country.\"","Meng Yashu was visibly stunned. \"Goodness, these are all big names!\"","He shook hands with each of them, overwhelmed. \"It’s truly an honor to have you all here, especially with your busy schedules!\"","Pei Yuan smiled faintly. \"We’re mainly here because my sister enjoys art. We’re just accompanying her.\"","Meng Yashu nodded in understanding, then turned to Qiao Chuchu. His smile faltered.","Qiao Chuchu smiled and nodded at him.","Meng Yashu’s smile faded completely as he stared at her intently, as if he had seen something unusual.","The men’s expressions darkened.","What was he looking at?","Qiao Chuchu also felt uneasy under his gaze.","[What’s with this guy staring at me like that?]","Lou Tingsi quickly stepped in front of Qiao Chuchu, his smile sharp. \"Mr. Meng, you’re not staring at a pretty girl because you’re shallow and ill-mannered, are you?\"","Meng Yashu snapped out of it and laughed apologetically. \"Oh, I’m so sorry. Miss Qiao has such a radiant presence, I couldn’t help but stare a little longer.\"","Meng Yashu gestured for them to enter. \"Please, come in!\"","The group masked their displeasure and walked forward.","Qiao Chuchu decided not to follow. \"Brother, I’m going to look around elsewhere.\"","Pei Yuan nodded, his eyes wary as they flicked toward Meng Yashu.","Meng Yashu didn’t look at Qiao Chuchu again but instead gave Pei Yuan a sincere smile. \"Please.\"","Pei Yuan suppressed his suspicions and walked in.","Meng Yashu lingered at the back, glancing at Qiao Chuchu’s retreating figure.","His gaze was intense, almost burning, as he took one last, longing look before turning away.","Qiao Chuchu stopped in front of a painting, tilting her head to study it.","The theme of the exhibition was \"Obsession.\"","But the paintings depicted young girls in various poses, surrounded by flowers.","She walked slowly, her brow furrowing the further she went.","Meanwhile, Xia Xuechun yawned boredly, completely lost as to the point of the exhibition.","To her, it was just a bunch of boring people looking at boring paintings.","But she had to pretend to be interested since she was here with Long Ge.","Now she felt that the most exhausting thing in the world was pretending to be sophisticated.","Xia Xuechun pouted, glancing down at her newly purchased Chanel outfit. Her mood improved slightly, but as she looked up, she bumped into Qiao Chuchu, who was walking toward her.","Xia Xuechun: \"!\"","She instinctively raised her Chanel bag to cover her face and quickly hid!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Did I just see Xia Xuechun?","The thought was fleeting, and Qiao Chuchu didn’t dwell on it. She stopped and looked up at the painting hanging in the center of the exhibition.","A young girl lay in a bed of flowers, cradling a delicate white blossom in her palm. Her cheek rested against the petals, her eyes closed in a blissful, intoxicated smile.","The composition and lighting were impeccable, showcasing Meng Yashu’s unique style. The skill was undeniable, as expected of a master.","But...","The painting made her uncomfortable.","Weisheng Wenzhan walked up beside her and said calmly, \"This is Meng Yashu’s most celebrated work. The girl in the painting is his first love.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned.","She didn’t like the painting, and her tone turned critical. \"So, he really loved his first love, huh?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan’s voice was even. \"He says he did, but I don’t think he did.\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback. She glanced around to make sure no one was listening, then said, \"You think so too?!\"","[I didn’t expect my ‘big son’ to agree with me! No wonder he looks so much like my son!]","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu eagerly pressed him. \"Tell me, what don’t you like about it?\"","[Let’s gossip together, big son!]","Weisheng Wenzhan sighed, pinching the bridge of his nose. \"Let me make this clear, Miss Qiao. I’m not an expert, so this is just my personal opinion.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded eagerly. \"Go on!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan gestured for her to come closer. \"Lean in.\"","She stood on her tiptoes, craning her neck to hear him.","Wenzhan looked down and accidentally met Qiao Chuchu’s sparkling eyes.","For a moment, he was stunned.","Somehow, the irritation of being called \"big son\" vanished.","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu, who was wobbling on her tiptoes, and firmly placed a hand on her shoulder to steady her. \"You don’t need to stand on your toes.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked, but before she could respond, Wenzhan leaned down toward her.","His cool, refreshing scent brushed past her nose as his deep voice murmured in her ear, \"I’ve met too many hypocrites in my life. Based on my experience, those who loudly proclaim their love often don’t truly love.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan’s gaze lingered on Qiao Chuchu’s face. \"Meng Yashu became famous because of his love for his deceased first love. But while he claims to love her, he married someone else.\"","He glanced back at the painting on the wall. \"Meng Yashu says this painting is a tribute to his lost love, but I think there’s no love in it—only desire.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan lowered his lashes, his eyes fixed on Qiao Chuchu’s delicate face. He inhaled her subtle fragrance and continued at a measured pace, \"Desire, greed, all kinds of intertwined cravings.\"","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip lightly, her brow furrowed.","Weisheng Wenzhan’s gaze dropped to her rosy lips. \"That’s my take. What do you think, Miss Qiao?\"","Qiao Chuchu bit her lip, hesitating before she spoke. \"I feel like the person in the painting is... dead.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\""]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Jumping on Pei Yuan's Face to Unleash Ultimate Power","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu gestured for Weisheng Wenzhan to look at the hand of the woman in the painting: \"When a normal person lies down, no matter how they pose, their wrist can't possibly bend like this.\"","She then asked, \"May I borrow your hand for a moment?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan raised his hand, and she took it, mimicking the posture of the woman in the painting: \"You see, a normal person's hand can't twist any further than this. If I try to bend it more, it would hurt, right?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, listening intently.","Qiao Chuchu continued, \"Suppose you were the painter, and you were painting someone you love. Would you twist their hand like this? What's more, with the wrist bent so unnaturally, the model is still smiling. Just looking at it makes me feel pain—how could she possibly smile?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's expression gradually grew more profound. \"Then why hasn't anyone raised this issue before?\"","Qiao Chuchu let go of his hand and countered with a question of her own: \"Do you know why I stopped painting and switched to drawing comics instead?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked at her, puzzled.","She smiled wryly. \"Because no one dared to tell me the truth. No matter what I painted, they all said it was good, and they all rushed to buy it. After all, I'm the eighth young lady of the Pei family. The Pei family's eighth young lady can do no wrong.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, gazing at the figure in the painting. \"I find his paintings unsettling, with their twisted hands, but I won't say anything. I don't want to cause trouble, nor do I care to interfere with someone else's aesthetic. As long as everyone keeps up appearances, that's fine. But from now on, I'll avoid this painter. I won't come back.\"","She glanced around the room. \"All of these are young girls and flowers. The girls' bodies are buried under the flowers, with only their faces and parts of their bodies visible. At first glance, it looks beautiful, but there's something off about the twisted limbs.\"","\"This is supposed to be realistic oil painting,\" she said, growing more and more horrified. \"He uses live models, yet he paints these girls as distorted artworks and hangs them on the wall. What kind of mindset must he have while painting them?\"","Qiao Chuchu shuddered at the thought. \"I'm going to find my eldest brother. It's about time we left.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, his eyes fixed on the paintings on the wall.","The girls were buried in flowers, with only their arms, thighs, and faces visible.","He looked at the other paintings.","One girl lay on her side on the ground, her eyes closed peacefully, surrounded by rose thorns.","Roses coiled around her pale neck, wrists, ankles, and waist.","She lay on a wooden floor, her dark hair strewn with rose petals.","Bright red, delicate rose petals.","Weisheng Wenzhan scanned the surrounding paintings, a chill creeping up his spine like a tightly wound machine, each gear locking into place, tightening his nerves.","He understood!","He understood!!","Weisheng Wenzhan strode over to Qiao Chuchu and warned her in a low voice, \"Go wait for us by the cake. I'll go find your eldest brother!\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused but nodded. \"Alright.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan looked around the exhibition and spotted the Pei brothers on the second floor.","He climbed the steps and went straight to them, saying bluntly, \"I know who the killer is.\"","Pei Yuan: \"What?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced around and lowered his voice. \"The person who will kill Qiao Chuchu in the future is Meng Yashu. The flowers symbolize the dismembered bodies of the girls. He killed those girls and then used live models as a cover, openly painting them.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was absolutely certain. \"The way these models appear in the paintings is exactly how the corpses looked!\"","The Pei brothers paled, all of them shocked.","Pei Buxian was stunned. \"Why would you think that?\"","\"Qiao Chuchu mentioned it,\" Weisheng Wenzhan said. \"She said the paintings made her uncomfortable, with their twisted bones and deformed poses, yet the models were still smiling. It made her feel like they were dead.\"","Lou Tingsi frowned. \"But Meng Yashu is a weak, sickly man. He's always frail—he doesn't seem capable of killing anyone.\"","Ying Chen looked around in surprise, growing more and more horrified. \"Wenzhan, aren't you overthinking this? Could it be a misunderstanding?\"","Pei Yuan remained silent, slowly digesting Weisheng Wenzhan's words.","A cheerful voice rang out from nearby. \"Welcome, everyone, to my exhibition!\"","He turned toward the source of the sound.","A crowd had gathered without anyone noticing.","Meng Yashu stood in front of a massive painting, his face wearing a warm, spring-like smile as he spoke in English. \"I know everyone is curious about this painting I've covered. Actually, it's a work in progress.\"","He looked at the enormous painting on the wall, still shrouded in white cloth, its true appearance hidden.","\"This painting has taken me three years to create. I've worked on it meticulously, but I never painted the face because I felt I hadn't found the perfect touch.\"","Meng Yashu's expression softened, as if he were gazing at a lover. \"But now I've found it. I know how to complete it.\"","He looked as if a long-cherished wish had been fulfilled, savoring the moment. \"So now, I hope you'll all join me in appreciating this unfinished work and anticipate its completion.\"","With a flourish, he pulled off the white cloth!","As the cloth fell, the crowd gasped in awe.","The painting depicted a girl with a pair of stunning feathered wings, like an angel descending from heaven.","The girl had no facial features, yet she looked incredibly lifelike, her curly hair blown by the wind, her arms crossed in front of her chest, her hands twisted unnaturally to form a heart shape over her chest.","The girl's hands looked as though they had been forcibly bent, her wrists and fingers adorned with delicate pink rose garlands.","This was the only painting where the torso wasn't obscured by flowers; instead, small flowers were used as accents.","It was breathtakingly beautiful.","The crowd erupted in admiration. \"Wow! How stunning!\"","\"What a gorgeous painting! It's touched my soul!\"","Meng Yashu basked in the praise, his eyes filled with love as he gazed at the painting. \"For three years, I've prayed to the heavens for inspiration for this painting. And when it finally came to me, I knew it was a divine sign.\"","Meng Yashu's gaze swept through the crowd and landed on Pei Yuan's face. \"Gentlemen of the Pei family, what do you think?\"","His smile stretched wide as he asked joyfully, \"Isn't this painting perfect?\"","Pei Youchuan's eye twitched, his anger flaring. \"You son of a—\"","Pei Yuan stopped his brother and calmly walked up to the painting.","The Pei family's eyes were like venom, glaring fiercely at Meng Yashu.","In contrast, Pei Yuan's gaze was gentle.","He carefully examined every detail of the painting, the flowers entwined around the figure, and the more he looked, the more his eyes sparkled with amusement. He turned to Meng Yashu. \"It's perfect.\"","Meng Yashu's eyes lit up with anticipation. \"Then, if I finish it, would you consider buying it?\"","\"Of course,\" Pei Yuan replied softly. \"Provided that you complete it.\"","Meng Yashu stared intently at Pei Yuan. \"I will definitely finish it.\"","He smiled, his eyes narrowing into slits. \"When the time comes, I hope you'll honor me with your presence.\"","Pei Yuan said nothing more and turned to leave, his smile fading bit by bit until he stood before Weisheng Wenzhan. \"Send Weisheng Huailing to investigate.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's voice was icy. \"I already sent him. He's probably infiltrated by now.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, his phone rang.","Weisheng Wenzhan opened his phone, and his expression darkened at the photo. \"I was right.\"","He showed the phone to the others. \"Meng Yashu is the killer.\""]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: The Perfect Work of Art","paragraphs":["The picture sent by Weisheng Huailing was of a wall covered in photos.","Several of the photos matched the paintings.","Ying Chen widened his eyes in shock: \"So, in that painting earlier, he had already decided on the victim's pose but hadn't chosen who the victim would be, which is why he left the face blank?\"","Lou Tingsi furrowed his brow and muttered softly, \"That's why he said it was divine guidance, because Qiao Chuchu appeared before him.\"","Weisheng Biehe's eyes filled with killing intent as he tightened his grip on his prayer beads. \"Hmph, interesting.\"","Weisheng Lin frowned. \"I always knew some people were disgusting, but I didn't expect it to be this bad. Seems like my perspective was too narrow.\"","Pei Yuan took Weisheng Wenzhan's phone and zoomed in on the photo.","In the center of the photo-covered wall was an empty spot.","It seemed to be waiting for its owner.","Pei Yuan: \"...\"","The rest of the Pei family members' expressions darkened as they looked to Pei Yuan for guidance. \"Big brother?\"","Pei Yuan stared at the empty spot on the photo, his expression calm. \"Hand him the brush.\"","Everyone was stunned.","Pei Yuan locked the phone, hiding his murderous intent beneath a calm exterior. \"We'll personally hand him the brush and let him finish the painting.\"","After a moment of thought, the group of handsome men, each with their own striking features, turned their gazes toward Meng Yashu in unison.","Meng Yashu felt the sharp gazes on him and turned around in confusion.","A row of tall, strikingly handsome men were staring intently at him.","Pei Yuan stood in the center, giving him a gentle smile.","Meng Yashu subtly furrowed his brow, feeling a creeping sense of unease, and nodded politely.","They nodded back in unison, their eyes scanning him up and down with a meaningful look before turning to leave.","Meng Yashu: \"...\"","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu, who was at the tea station, swallowed a piece of cake in one bite and looked around boredly.","A woman with a camera suddenly snapped a photo of her!","\"Click!\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled and tilted her head in confusion. \"Are you taking my picture?\"","The woman lowered her camera and extended her hand with a confident smile. In English, she said, \"Sorry, I can't help but capture beautiful things. I'm Rayla, a photographer and Meng Yashu's wife.\"","Qiao Chuchu politely shook her hand. \"Qiao Chu.\"","Rayla's eyes widened in delight. \"So, you're the eighth sister of the Pei family? I've heard everyone call you Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised that her reputation had reached F-country. She nodded and replied in English, \"My full name is Qiao Chu. Chuchu is my nickname.\"","Rayla nodded in understanding, her admiration clear. \"Has my husband met you?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded. \"Yes, we've met.\"","\"Then he must really like you!\" Rayla exclaimed, her eyes sparkling. \"You're stunning, like a perfect piece of art!\"","Qiao Chuchu was flattered and a little happy. \"This is the first time I've received such high praise. Many people say I'm just average-looking.\"","Rayla waved her hand dismissively. \"Oh, they have no taste. You have such a vibrant spirit. That's why, out of all these people, you were the first one I noticed. I've also seen your paintings—they're full of imagination and vibrant colors, like a beautiful fantasy world.\"","Just as Qiao Chuchu was about to respond, Pei Yuan's voice came from the other side. \"Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu happily ran over to him. \"Big brother!~\"","Pei Yuan walked up to her and calmly informed her, \"There's been a last-minute issue. We won't be able to leave until tonight.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt as if a bucket of cold water had been poured over her. She was utterly disappointed. \"What? That late? I don't want to stay here any longer.\"","Pei Yuan sighed. \"Your brothers have some business matters to attend to. We can't leave until after dark.\"","She pouted, clearly unhappy. \"Then I'll just leave by myself.\"","\"No,\" Pei Yuan's expression darkened. \"I won't let you go alone. I've already told the driver, and he won't take you by yourself.\"","She frowned. \"Then I'll take a taxi!\"","Pei Yuan: \"You don't speak French, haven't exchanged any money, and your phone is still on a Chinese SIM card. How are you going to take a taxi?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[Damn it! I didn't think of that!]","Pei Yuan chuckled lightly and gently squeezed her hand, coaxing her in a soft voice. \"Just stay with us until tonight, and I'll buy you a bag, okay?\"","She was still upset. \"I don't want a bag. I have so many bags I can't even use them all. I just want to leave now. This place makes me uncomfortable.\"","\"Big brother knows you're uncomfortable,\" Pei Yuan said, leaning closer and speaking gently. \"I'm not comfortable here either, but this is something we have to do.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned and looked at the others. \"So, none of you are leaving either?\"","Weisheng Biehe twirled his prayer beads and said unhurriedly, \"We're all attending the same business meeting.\"","Lou Tingsi nodded.","Ying Chen smiled without saying a word.","Qiao Chuchu sighed, her spirits drooping like a rabbit's ears. \"Fine.\"","She said weakly, \"I'll wait for you, then.\"","Pei Yuan relaxed and patted her head. \"When we're done, I'll have the brand representatives come to the house so you can pick something out. Or you can browse now and let me know what you want. I'll buy it for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu sat down on the couch, still pouting. \"I don't want anything. Just go do your thing.\"","[Even though I don't want to stay here, there's no other choice. I can't let anything interfere with their work.]","Pei Yuan smiled warmly. \"Then we'll get going?\"","She nodded.","Pei Youchuan smirked, teasing her. \"Qiao Chuchu, aren't you going to say goodbye to your brothers?\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes. \"Third brother, I'm not a child anymore, am I?\"","[Why do you always tease me like this?!]","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, his tone playful and arrogant. \"But we're still older than you~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu forced a fake smile and waved. \"Goodbye, brothers~~\"","They smiled affectionately before finally turning to leave.","From a distance, Xia Xuechun watched Qiao Chuchu from her seat on the couch.","Her eyes were fixed on Qiao Chuchu and the departing men, as if she were staring at an obsession.","Suddenly, a woman's voice came from behind her. \"Jealous?\"","Xia Xuechun turned around in surprise.","Rayla stood behind the couch, smiling at her. In broken Mandarin, she asked, \"I've noticed you've been watching that young lady for a while. Are you envious of all those handsome men surrounding her?\"","Xia Xuechun was taken aback and laughed awkwardly. \"Not at all. I was just observing.\"","Rayla leaned against the couch, giving her a meaningful smile. \"Would you like to be a model for a painting? I think you'd be perfect for the role of that girl. Would you like to know more?\"","Xia Xuechun: \"? Me, a model?\"","-","Gradually, the sky darkened.","The number of people at the art exhibition didn't decrease; in fact, it grew. It seemed less like an art show and more like a networking event.","Qiao Chuchu had fallen asleep on the couch.","Meng Yashu stood not far away, staring at her sleeping figure. His gaze traveled from her head to her feet, as if he wanted to etch Qiao Chuchu into his memory. With a pleased expression, he left the exhibition and returned to his studio.","He swung his keys and opened the old, creaky door to the basement.","At first glance, it looked like a cluttered storage room filled with junk.","But once inside, he pushed aside an old cabinet to reveal a brand-new, high-tech security door.","He unlocked it with his fingerprint and stepped inside, humming SHE's \"Superstar\" as he walked into the luxurious underground space.","\"You're my electricity~ You're my light~ You're my only myth~ I only love you~ You're my superstar~\"","Meng Yashu approached the fridge, still humming as he picked out some medications, as if selecting precious jewels. He muttered to himself, \"There are too many people around her. I'll have to be careful. It'll take at least three days to make my move.\"","Pei Yuan: \"Three days? The exhibition will be over by then. Who's going to come see your paintings?\"","Meng Yashu froze, turning around in shock.","Pei Yuan stood behind him, looking down at him with a cold gaze.","Not just him—Pei Che, Pei Youchuan, Pei Fengnong, Pei Mu, Pei Ci, and Pei Buxian were all there as well.","They stood in a row beside Pei Yuan, smiling eerily as they stared at him.","Meng Yashu: \"?!\""]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Where Are You Going, Take My Soul Away","paragraphs":["Meng Yashu's eyes widened in sheer absurdity as he turned to look elsewhere, filled with panic.","Weisheng Wenzhan adjusted his frameless glasses, the cold light reflecting off them as he looked down on him. \"Hello, Mr. Meng.\"","Weisheng Biehe twirled a string of prayer beads between his fingers, his lips curling into a sly smirk. \"What a pity, Mr. Meng.\"","Weisheng Lin yawned lazily. \"I was so f***ing bored I almost fell asleep waiting for you! I thought you weren't coming at all!\"","Meng Yashu took a sharp breath, then stared in disbelief at Lou Tingsi.","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow with a sweet smile. \"Why the look, Mr. Meng? Aren't you welcoming us?\"","Ying Chen grinned maniacally. \"Mr. Meng, we're all a bunch of freaks here. You gotta smile, just like us. Come on, smile~\"","Everyone relaxed their eyes and formed a chilling grin.","Meng Yashu couldn't believe it. \"How did you get in here?! How is this possible?!!\"","Someone gently poked his shoulder.","He jumped in fright, looking for the source.","Weisheng Huailing in his white wool coat, smiled innocently at him, signing in silence: 「I let them in!」 He then gave himself a thumbs up: 「I'm super professional!!」","Meng Yashu couldn't understand, but his fear made his legs go weak as he pushed him away and ran. \"Guards! Guards! Help! Help!!!\"","Huailing yanked him back in one swift motion, kicking him away.","He rolled to the feet of Pei Yuan, scrambling to get up, only to be stepped upon by Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan grinned maliciously. \"Don't move, okay~\"","Meng Yashu's face turned pale. \"Let me go! What do you want from me?!?\"","Pei Yuan slowly crouched down, looking him in the eye. \"When you asked if I wanted to buy that painting, what were you thinking?\"","Meng Yashu's eyes were already reddened, his teeth clenched as he stared back.","Pei Yuan calmly asked, \"Were you thinking, 'I will kill your sister, while you obliviously buy this painting from me. It will hang there, watching over your home,' right?\"","Meng Yashu was sweating profusely, his eyes shifting guiltily. \"No, it's not like that! You're all wronging me, I'm just an ordinary artist!\"","Pei Yuan chuckled faintly, taking his time to respond. \"No worries, I'm not looking for an answer here.\"","He stood up, looking down at him with disdain. \"You know, in Pei Clan, there are only us siblings left. It's been quite a while since a moron like you directly got on my nerves.\"","Meng Yashu looked at them in terror, trembling as his voice rose. \"I swear I didn't have any designs on your sister! I—uh!!\"","He was dragged away by someone who had stepped out from the shadows.","Pei Yuan wasn't staring anymore, shifting his eyes to the pictures on the wall.","The wall was covered from top to bottom with pictures, but there was a blatant empty space in the middle.","This missing piece would never be filled up.","His mood felt a bit better as he hummed the same tune Meng Yashu had sung earlier.","\"'Where are you going, taking my soul away with you~'\" Pei Yuan sang sweetly to himself: \"It's spellbound by you, like this serving no purpose~\"","His phone buzzed.","It was a message from Qiao Chuchu: \"Everything ready?\"","Qiao Chuchu sent a pathetic puppy emoji.","He quirked a smile and replied: \"Ten minutes, get ready.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Great! It's all just desserts here. I'm so bored, we should grab something to eat after this!\"","Pei Yuan: \"Sure, whatever you want.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Yes! You're the best, big brother!\"","Pei Yuan chuckled. \"I like that. Keep it coming.\"","Qiao Chuchu responded quickly: \"You're the best you're the best you're the best you're the best!\"","She also sent a sweet emoji.","\"I'll wait for you to get back!~\""]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: Qiao Chuchu: It's okay, I won't let Rila succeed","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu lounged on the sofa at the art exhibition, scrolling through videos, waiting for Pei Yuan and the others to come back for her.","Rayla stood behind her, glancing up at the camera directly facing Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu, seeing it was her, relaxed: \"Mrs. Rayla?\"","Rayla smiled and sat beside her, speaking in English: \"I sincerely invite you to be my model at my home in three days.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Model?","A contorted model?","She became wary: \"Why me?\"","\"You're too beautiful,\" Rayla said, carefully studying her. \"I want to take your photograph and have my husband paint you. Together, we'll create a perfect piece of art, but don't tell your family.\"","\"Just come by yourself,\" Rayla added, winking playfully. \"When the work is finished, I'll have your photo published in a magazine, giving your family a pleasant surprise.\"","Qiao Chuchu's smile gradually froze: \"A surprise?","Strangers inviting you to do something without informing your family, even privately inviting you—it's either they want to harm you or they want to kill you.","Especially given this couple's method of portraying their models, they are definitely not good people.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at the cameras in the exhibition hall, smirking: \"Actually, I can do it now. My brothers are also here, and they happen to be occupied. It's the perfect time for me to be your model.\"","Rayla's smile faltered for a moment: \"No, there's not enough time.\"","Qiao Chuchu raised an eyebrow: \"Is that so?\"","It wasn't that there wasn't enough time; it was because all the heavyweights from various circles were at this exhibition. This couple wouldn't dare to act right now.","If something happened to her, her brothers would immediately call the police. As the organizers of the exhibition, Rayla and Meng Yashu would naturally become suspects, and the police would search their home.","For safety, they had invited her privately.","Seeing Qiao Chuchu remained silent, Rayla gently persuaded her: \"Don't worry. I've already found another model, someone your age, and you two will do it together.\"","Rayla walked out and brought someone back to show Qiao Chuchu: \"This is her.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up when she saw the person, stretching out her words: \"Oh~~ so the other model you found is Xia Xuechun!\"","Xia Xuechun stood beside Rayla, looking somewhat lost.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at Xia Xuechun's branded outfit: \"Looks like you've rebranded yourself.\"","Xia Xuechun looked embarrassed, shooting a resentful glare at Rayla.","She hadn't prepared to meet Qiao Chuchu yet, so she had been avoiding her.","She had planned to make a dazzling debut!","She had thought Rayla was introducing her to someone else, but it turned out to be Qiao Chuchu!","If she had known, she wouldn't have come!","In anger, she glared back at Qiao Chuchu, ready to face her ridicule.","But—","Qiao Chuchu suddenly burst out laughing, leaning forward on the sofa: \"Hahahahahahahaha!\"","Xia Xuechun and Rayla were stunned.","Rayla, puzzled, asked in Chinese: \"What’s she laughing at?\"","Xia Xuechun's face turned red: \"She’s definitely laughing at me. She’s always looking down on me.\"","Qiao Chuchu's laughter became even more uncontrollable, finding the whole situation increasingly hilarious.","Xia Xuechun, the distorted artworks, Meng Yashu's strange gaze, and Rayla, Meng Yashu's wife.","It all started to connect.","So this couple was the murderer!","She had repeatedly guessed that the culprit might be a strong man who would sneak up on her from behind and bundle her away.","But it turned out that the real killer was a gentle, refined artist, trying to lure her into a trap step by step.","Thinking about it, how did she end up being dismembered in another timeline?","If someone invited her to be a model and told her not to inform her family, she just came along without telling them?","Was she stupid? Did she forget all those cautionary tales of strangers abducting people?","However... she shouldn't blame herself too much. Maybe she had clearly refused but was captured at another time.","Rayla, seeing Qiao Chuchu not speaking, placed her hand on her shoulder: \"Are you alright?\"","With her touch, Qiao Chuchu saw a flash—","—She walked into Lou Tingsi's garden and saw bloodstains on the ground.","Her pace quickened, her unease growing. Following the trail of blood, she found a man lying on the lawn.","The man wore a white shirt and a suit, six to seven gunshot wounds in his abdomen. His slender, pale fingers clutched tightly to a gift box.","The man had already lost his breath. The scene stopped at his neck; there was no head, so she didn't know who it was.","Qiao Chuchu's smile suddenly vanished, her mind completely unraveled: \"Did you kill my brother?\"","Rayla didn't catch it: \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu, like a furious leopard, pounced on her, grabbing her collar and demanding sharply: \"What do you want from me?!\"","The guests were startled and quickly separated them!","Xia Xuechun shielded the shaken Rayla: \"Qiao Chuchu, are you crazy? If you're sick, go see a doctor! Why are you acting like this?!\"","Rayla, protected by the guests, remained calm but alert, watching Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu, restrained by security, was like a raging beast, unable to calm down!","This woman had killed her brother!","Pei Yuan and the others returned, their faces changing in alarm as they rushed to Qiao Chuchu, pushing the security away: \"What happened, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu remained silent.","Her eyes, bloodshot with murderous intent, glared at Rayla.","Pei Yuan turned to Rayla, demanding: \"What’s going on?!\"","Xia Xuechun defended Rayla: \"We didn't do anything to her. Qiao Chuchu just suddenly went crazy! She almost hurt Mrs. Rayla!\"","Pei Yuan frowned, turning back to Qiao Chuchu: \"Chuchu, what happened? Did she say anything to you?\"","Others also surrounded Qiao Chuchu with concern.","Huai Ling kept signing: \"Did she bully you? Where did she bully you?\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored them.","She just stared fiercely at Rayla, her anger burning like fire, her hatred unable to be unleashed!","Suddenly, a voice echoed in her mind: \"Host, it's me.\"","\"I’ve detected changes in your predicted future to avoid confusion. Let me explain. Your fate of being dismembered has been averted due to certain reasons; you won’t be dismembered.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes darkened as she responded to the system: \"Is it because I’ve discovered the killer, so I avoided being killed?\"","The system replied: \"No, it's because the killer who wanted to kill you is dead.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","The system continued: \"Every time you avoid a killing fate, I’ll notify you. Plus, you saw a new prophecy earlier.","\"That prophecy hinted you won’t be dismembered.\"","\"In exchange, one of your brothers will die.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes turned dark: \"Who?\"","The system: \"I don’t know—you didn’t see the dead person’s face, and neither did I. Probably he bought a gift for you and was waiting in the garden to give it to you when he was killed. So, think about which brother would buy you a gift.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"I have seven brothers; all of them buy me gifts. Gifts are the most common things in my life.\"","The system: \"... Regardless, you can’t tell them you can foresee the future, but you can hint at them to protect themselves.\"","She came back to her senses, looking at Pei Yuan and the others who were watching her with concern.","Pei Yuan looked at her with worry.","Her gaze was somewhat distant, as if falling apart, blankly staring at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan, puzzled, frowned.","She, however, smiled.","\"It's okay.\" Qiao Chuchu laughed even more happily, speaking to the system: \"I won’t let Rayla succeed.\""]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: Try Touching My Brother Again","paragraphs":["The system did not say anything more and disconnected the connection with Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu looked at Rayla.","Rayla coldly stared back at her.","The atmosphere between the two plunged into an icy silence, and the heavy tension gradually spread throughout the art exhibition.","Suddenly, a piercing scream sounded outside.","The person who screamed was panicking and speaking in English: \"Ah! Mr. Meng, Mr. Meng committed suicide!!\"","Rayla's face changed dramatically, and she rushed toward the source of the scream.","Others also followed suit, one by one.","Qiao Chuchu calmly stood where she was, unmoving.","Pei Yuan found her behavior a bit strange: \"Aren't you going to take a look?\"","She proceeded slowly, stepping out of the exhibition and arriving at the doorway of the studio where Meng Yashu's body lay.","Meng Yashu had taken his own life with a gun, and there was also a suicide note beside him.","Rayla was sobbing heartbrokenly.","Qiao Chuchu felt something was off: [A murderer who didn't manage to kill me before committing suicide? Could someone have killed him and made it appear like a suicide?]","The men behind her changed expressions, their eyes wide with surprise as they stared at her back.","She had actually deduced the murderer? How smart could she be?","One guest suggested to Rayla: \"We should call the police; there might be something fishy here.\"","Rayla shook her head tearfully: \"No! Don't call the police!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at Rayla, puzzled.","Rayla hugged Meng Yashu's body tightly and sobbed: \"My husband must have sacrificed himself for the sake of art. This is his paradise. I can't let the police come into our home and rummage around; it will ruin everything he held dear.\"","She looked at everyone with tears in her eyes: \"Please don't call the police; leave my husband a piece of pure land—a sacred place!\"","\"But I've already called them,\" a male voice interjected.","Rayla's face changed, and she looked toward the source of the voice.","Pei Buxian, holding his phone, stepped out from behind Qiao Chuchu: \"The police are already on their way.\"","Rayla was stunned, her eyes wide, her crying expression turning eerie and terrifying: \"What right do you have to call the police?\"","Pei Buxian pocketed his phone, his expression calm and unruffled: \"What should we do in such situations? Of course, we call the police. Will the police harm you? Or is there something in your home that you don’t want the police to see?\"","Rayla held her breath, then suddenly lunged!","Qiao Chuchu reacted quickly, pushing Rayla away!","Rayla fell onto Meng Yashu's body, then lunged toward Pei Buxian again!","Qiao Chuchu pushed her away once more: \"Try attacking my brother again, and you'll see what happens!\"","Pei Buxian looked at Qiao Chuchu in astonishment, his mouth half-open, utterly dumbfounded.","The other men also stared at her back, wide-eyed.","She was so petite, yet so resolutely standing in front of Pei Buxian.","Rayla sat on the ground, her blonde hair shielding her face, her sapphire-blue eyes filled with madness, as if she wanted to devour Qiao Chuchu whole.","Qiao Chuchu smirked.","What a coincidence.","She wanted to do the same.","She tightly gripped Pei Buxian's wrist, making him wince from the pressure, his brows furrowing in discomfort.","Chuchu turned her head to comfort him: \"Don't be afraid; you did the right thing.\"","Pei Buxian was taken aback, a small, pleased smile tugging at his lips as he subtly grabbed Qiao Chuchu's hand. He glanced at his brothers out of the corner of his eye.","They were all focused on Qiao Chuchu, not noticing his intimate gesture.","He took a step forward, slightly turning to shield his hand, his fingers forcefully and possessively intertwining with Qiao Chuchu's, their fingers locking together.","Pei Buxian felt like a thief who had stolen a precious jewel, his translucent eyes filled with secret glee, his lips tightly pressed down to hide his smile. \"Chuchu, I'm a little scared.\"","Qiao Chuchu quietly squeezed his hand in reassurance.","Pei Buxian pressed his lips together and, secretly, sweetly smiled.","Xia Xuechun glanced at Rayla, who was sitting on the ground, and indignantly said, \"Qiao Chuchu, that’s too much. You suddenly went crazy and hurt the madame earlier, and now you’ve hit her again. She’s just lost her husband!\"","\"Shut your mouth,\" Qiao Chuchu said, not wanting to waste her energy arguing with her at this moment. \"If you say another word, I’ll beat you too.\"","After all, this woman had betrayed her in the timeline where she was murdered.","Xia Xuechun: \"?!\"","Long Yunxiao, the second son of the Long family, stepped forward protectively beside Xia Xuechun: \"Miss Qiao, how can you speak like that? Aren’t you going too far?\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him.","Dressed in a gentle ivory wool coat, her eyes were calm but carried an unyielding, menacing edge, like an unknown, horrifying abyss.","Long Yunxiao felt a chill run down his spine, unable to utter a word.","Soon after, the police arrived.","As per regulation, no one was allowed to leave until the police had finished questioning and investigating.","The police's investigation revealed a shocking discovery: Meng Yashu's home had a hidden basement, which led to the unraveling of a long-unsolved serial murder case.","Meng Yashu was the murderer, and he had a habit of recording his crimes. The tapes contained gruesome footage of him personally torturing victims with a chainsaw.","What was most sickening was that when the police disassembled Meng Yashu's paintings, they found an additional painting hidden beneath.","The visible painting depicted a girl surrounded by flowers.","Beneath it lay a painting of the girl's lifeless body.","The guests' faces turned pale, their skin crawling with unease.","Many felt lucky, saying, \"Thank goodness the Pei family called the police. This is a family of murderers!\"","Qiao Chuchu sat on the sofa, watching Rayla being questioned by the police.","Rayla cried profusely to the female police officer: \"I truly had no idea he had done these things behind my back. He didn’t like me interfering with his art, I...\"","She clutched her chest, her heartbroken grief evident: \"It’s terrifying. I’ve lived with such a man for twenty years. We were supposed to create the perfect masterpiece together, but instead, he betrayed me like this!\"","In the end, Rayla was taken away by the police for further investigation.","But on the way back to Lou Tingsi’s house, Qiao Chuchu stared blankly out the window for most of the journey.","She sat in the back of a long Lincoln, with only her seven brothers, Ying Chen, and Weisheng Huailing present.","The others from the Weisheng family and Lou Tingsi were in another car.","Pei Yuan had been sitting beside Qiao Chuchu since they boarded the car, cautiously asking, \"Are you freaked out?\"","Qiao Chuchu had been acting strangely from earlier—lifeless, quiet, not saying a word.","Weisheng Huailing picked up his phone and typed a message to Pei Yuan:「Did we leave her alone earlier, and she’s upset about it?」","Pei Yuan furrowed his brows.","Indeed, he had been too rash.","He was so consumed by anger that all he could think about was dealing with Meng Yashu.","The others also wanted to see how things would unfold for Meng Yashu. Pei Yuan had assumed that Meng Yashu wouldn’t be so foolish as to try to kill Qiao Chuchu at his own exhibition, so he hadn’t left anyone to stay with her.","She must have been scared.","Pei Yuan gave Pei Youchuan a look.","Among the brothers, Pei Youchuan was the most skilled at cheering up Qiao Chuchu.","Pei Youchuan sat beside Qiao Chuchu and said, \"Chuchu, think about it. Our family called the police, the truth about the serial murders has come to light, the girls who were taken can finally rest in peace, and other girls no longer have to live in fear. Meng Yashu, that scoundrel, is dead. We’ve avenged those girls. This is a good thing; you shouldn’t be sad.\"","Qiao Chuchu remained expressionless: \"Rayla will be released by the police; there won’t be any evidence connecting her to the basement.\"","Everyone was taken aback.","Pei Youchuan chuckled nonchalantly: \"What does Rayla have to do with this? The murderer isn’t her.\"","Qiao Chuchu stared straight out the window: \"She wasn’t the murderer, but she was an accomplice.\"","Everyone's expressions changed to one of shock.","Accomplice?","Qiao Chuchu calmly explained: \"She’s a highly acclaimed photographer, and being a woman, she lured unsuspecting girls away from their families under the pretense of shooting. The reason this couple’s crimes went undetected for so long is because they were careful.\"","\"Now that Meng Yashu’s secret hideout has been destroyed and she insisted not to call the police, she will want revenge.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s gaze dimmed, staring at the scenery passing by outside the window.","[Enraged, she will come to kill one of my brothers, shooting him in the abdomen outside Lou Tingsi’s garden, leaving him to die there.]","The Pei family members were shocked, their eyes wide.","Ying Chen and Weisheng Huailing immediately focused their attention on Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian was completely confused: \"???\"","So it’s him again? Because he called the police?","Last time, Lou Tingsi died, Lou Yuejue died, and he died.","This time, he dies again?","He’s really short-lived!"]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: White Cut Black","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu lowered her eyelashes and pondered slowly: [At first, I thought Pei Buxian would be the one killed, but Rayla wouldn't be able to accurately find him because she couldn't be sure Pei Buxian would definitely be in the garden. So, she would kill any Pei family member or someone related to me.]","[As long as one of my brothers enters her range, she'll pull the trigger.]","[The only lead is that jewelry box!]","Qiao Chuchu was suddenly enlightened and looked at them: \"Does anyone want to give me a gift? Bring it out now!\"","The brothers were stunned and each took out a jewelry box from their pockets, presenting them to her with their palms up.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Weisheng Huailing also took out a jewelry box, hesitatingly handing it to Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Ying Chen, witnessing this, was surprised: \"Looks like I’m the only one who didn’t buy anything. I feel so stingy!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed all the jewelry boxes in a rush, staring at the eight identical ones, her mindset shattered!","[They all look the same! How am I supposed to tell them apart!!]","She exclaimed in astonishment: \"Why did you all buy the same brand?!\"","The Pei family members were momentarily flustered, their aura somewhat diminished.","Pei Youchuan rubbed his nose, awkwardly explaining: \"Because you love Bvlgari jewelry the most, I casually bought it at the airport on my way here. I thought I was the only one who had bought one.\"","Ying Chen laughed, teasing them: \"So, you all secretly bought jewelry without telling each other, intending to create a surprise, only to end up buying the same thing, huh?\"","The Pei brothers glanced at each other, awkwardly lowering their eyes.","Weisheng Huailing, sitting across from Qiao Chuchu, gently gestured: \"I noticed you often wear Bvlgari, so I bought one too.\"","Upon hearing this, Qiao Chuchu looked at the eight identical jewelry boxes and suddenly let out a sinister laugh: \"Heh.\"","The Pei family members frowned.","Pei Buxian shivered and leaned closer to Pei Che: \"What’s she laughing about?\"","Pei Che’s brows furrowed: \"I don’t know, but her blood pressure must be pretty high.\"","Pei Mu felt uneasy and moved closer to Pei Ci: \"I feel a bit creepy...\"","Pei Ci nodded grimly: \"Me too.\"","Pei Yuan looked at Qiao Chuchu with concern.","Pei Youchuan and Pei Fengnong, full of worry, didn’t dare to speak.","Weisheng Huailing, however, had his eyes shining with excitement.","Qiao Chuchu seemed angry! This anger was different from any other time!","So cool!","Their car arrived at Lou Tingsi’s house, stopping in the courtyard.","Qiao Chuchu stormed out of the car and walked straight to Weisheng Wenzhan: \"Do you have any jewelry to give me? If you do, bring it out now.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was surprised and slowly took out a Bvlgari gift box from his pocket: \"I bought this for you on the way here, thinking of giving it to you later.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"?\"","When did my brother buy that!","Qiao Chuchu calmly accepted it, \"Thank you, I’ll prepare a return gift for you.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"? I don’t need a return gift.\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored him and turned to Weisheng Biehe.","Weisheng Biehe felt a bit strange: \"...I did buy one too.\"","He also took out a Bvlgari gift box.","Weisheng Huailing: \"??\"","When did my fourth brother buy that!","Qiao Chuchu collected it and then looked at Lou Tingsi.","Lou Tingsi awkwardly blinked and glanced at Song Yu, who was coming out to greet them.","Song Yu understood and signaled to his men, who then presented a set box: \"Miss Qiao, this is from our boss.\"","This time, it wasn’t Bvlgari.","It was Van Cleef & Arpels.","Weisheng Lin, curious, asked in the background: \"Qiao Chuchu, why didn’t you ask me?\"","Qiao Chuchu coldly glanced at him: \"Did you buy one?\"","Weisheng Lin was stumped: \"Uh, no.\"","Ying Chen walked over and draped an arm around Weisheng Lin’s shoulders: \"Don’t worry, Lin, I didn’t buy one either.\"","Weisheng Lin was puzzled: \"Then should we send someone to buy one? It feels like we’re being tight-fisted not buying anything, especially not even a piece of jewelry.\"","Ying Chen chortled and whispered close to his ear: \"This isn’t just about giving jewelry; it's about a death list.\"","Weisheng Lin: \"??????????\"","Giving jewelry leads to a death list?!","Weisheng Huailing lightly clapped his hands, signaling everyone to look at him.","He couldn’t speak, so he set up a group chat and pulled everyone present into it.","In the group, he wrote: \"Anyone who gave jewelry could be targeted by Rayla. We need to protect ourselves and not cause trouble for Qiao Chuchu.\"","Those who weren’t in the same car with Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Giving jewelry leads to being shot?","Weisheng Lin was shocked: \"? Are those who gave Qiao Chuchu jewelry cursed? Will God shoot a bullet to punish every jewelry giver?\"","Pei Che sighed and summarized the situation briefly.","After explaining, he concluded: \"Although Qiao Chuchu predicted that one of us seven brothers will die, it’s absurd that apart from us, you all bought jewelry too, so Rayla might target any of you.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"@Weisheng Huailing, don’t let Rayla interfere.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"I’ll handle it. Once I do, the problem will be solved.\"","Pei Yuan: \"We can’t be too cautious. Lin Qing tried to avoid the plot but failed, so we need to not only deal with Rayla but also set up protective measures around us and protect Chuchu. We must quickly book tickets back home; she must not be harmed.\"","Pei Fengnong glanced at Qiao Chuchu’s back: \"But all these actions are secret. Qiao Chuchu is the one openly aware of the situation. We also have to consider how she’ll approach this.\"","Everyone: \"? What do you mean?\"","Pei Fengnong took a deep breath and patiently explained: \"Chuchu won’t ignore this matter. Although she can’t tell us directly, she’ll definitely protect us in her own way. The question is, how will she do it?\"","Ying Chen: \"? Do we need her to protect us? If so, we might as well hold hands and become transvestites.\"","Weisheng Biehe: \"Ying Chen, you don’t understand. One of us will die, but Qiao Chuchu hasn’t explicitly said who. So, we need to pretend we don’t know and act secretly, while openly following her lead.\"","They furrowed their brows, looking at the silent Qiao Chuchu in front.","So, how would she arrange things for them?","Qiao Chuchu held the full trays of jewelry boxes and climbed the stairs step by step.","When she reached the top, she softly said, \"Let’s all watch a movie together tonight.\"","They were surprised.","Weisheng Lin, quick-witted, jokingly replied without hesitation: \"Didn’t you say you’re scared of our overwhelming handsomeness? Still dare to watch a movie with us?\"","Qiao Chuchu held the boxes and slowly turned around.","She stood atop the staircase, with the cold wind lifting her hair and revealing her clear cheeks.","Weisheng Lin was stupefied.","Qiao Chuchu had a delicate and charming appearance, with non-threatening flat eyebrows, a popular small upturned nose from the plastic surgery template, and thick, well-defined lips. Her baby fat added a touch of youthfulness to her face.","Her eyes were particularly intriguing, large and round like almonds, with double eyelids that curled up at the outer corners, giving a seductive allure.","Her charm was perfectly balanced with her innocence, creating a captivating and approachable aura.","However, at this moment, her eyes were dark and bright, her face devoid of emotion, calmly staring at them.","\"Don’t you want to watch a movie with me?\"","They were speechless, unconsciously shaking their heads. A subtly dominant aura emanated from Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu scrutinized each of them.","【I will never give Rayla a chance to hurt me, my family, or my friends.】","Their hearts trembled, a warm current surging through their bodies.","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head and smiled faintly at them, \"Those who are willing can follow me. I won’t force anyone.\"","She turned and walked away.","The men all lifted their legs in unison, quickly catching up to her, fearful of being left behind.","They all glanced at her, their expressions complex.","Qiao Chuchu never looked back, striding forward with unwavering determination.","【Those who target me will never take away the life of any character close to me.】","【I will win.】","【I must win.】"]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: Song Yu: Miss Qiao, I can","paragraphs":["Lou Tingsi's home had a dedicated entertainment room.","It was equipped with a projector, a pool table, and a variety of board games and gaming consoles.","The space was large and not crowded, making it feel like it could comfortably accommodate over twenty people.","Pei Youchuan was utterly impressed, praising it nonstop ever since they entered: \"Lou Tingsi, I never expected your home to be so cozy, and you even have an entertainment room?\"","Lou Tingsi smiled warmly: \"I'm glad you like it. Normally, no one comes here to play, and I only have my staff maintain it for those rare occasions when it might be needed. I didn’t think it would actually come in handy one day.\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci approached the pool table, picking up the cues: \"Let's just play pool. Need two more to start a game!\"","Pei Fengnong appeared out of nowhere, passing by the two of them, and said in a low voice: \"Qiao Chuchu wants to watch a movie. Are you two really going to play pool?\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci were reminded and immediately put down their cues: \"Right, we forgot.\"","Qiao Chuchu was busy selecting a movie, and she turned to them with a smile: \"I don’t mind. As long as we’re all together, I’m fine with whatever we do. Even if it’s work, I’m perfectly okay with it. I’m really not picky.\"","【If I’m too pushy, they might start getting suspicious.】","【It’s better to let them do their own thing.】","Weisheng Wenzhan sat on the sofa, opening his laptop: \"Then I'll get some work done.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked at him in surprise: \"Aren't you bothered by the noise? If it bothers you, you can leave here.\"","\"I’m not bothered,\" Weisheng Wenzhan replied coolly, his sharp eyes visible behind his frameless glasses: \"I promised you I’d stay, so I’ll be here.\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback, somewhat surprised.","【I didn’t expect Weisheng Wenzhan to be so tolerant. I thought he’d be the temperamental type who can’t stand his friends being loud.】","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......?\"","Weisheng Lin suppressed a laugh and whispered to him: \"Brother, what kind of impression did you leave with her? Do you come off as really bad-tempered?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan gave him a cold look: \"Mind your own business.\"","Weisheng Lin quickly got up and left.","Biehe, with a Buddhist rosary wrapped around his pale fingers, gestured at Weisheng Huailing, motioning to \"take care of Rayla.\"","Weisheng Huailing understood and, glancing at Qiao Chuchu, who was facing away from him, silently exited the entertainment room.","The men watched Weisheng Huailing leave with sidelong glances and felt a bit more at ease.","Lou Tingsi had already dispatched his men to keep an eye on Rayla, so with Weisheng Huailing taking care of the matter, it seemed doubly secure. Rayla wouldn’t have a chance to cause trouble again.","Once Rayla disappeared, the situation would naturally turn for the better, and there would be no need for excessive precautions.","Qiao Chuchu looked up: \"Hey, where’s Weisheng Huailing?\"","Biehe quickly replied: \"He went to the bathroom.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and walked out.","They: \"?\"","Ying Chen was astonished: \"What’s she doing?!\"","Pei Buxian quickly opened the door and peeked out.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci followed closely behind.","Lou Tingsi couldn’t help but also peek out.","Head after head emerged behind Pei Buxian, as they watched Qiao Chuchu run toward Weisheng Huailing and gently tapped his shoulder.","Weisheng Huailing turned around, seeing Qiao Chuchu, and his eyes widened in surprise.","Qiao Chuchu signed to him: \"There’s a bathroom in the entertainment room. Why did you come downstairs to use the restroom?\"","Weisheng Huailing was momentarily speechless, glancing at the entertainment room.","Several heads were sticking out, intently watching them.","It looked like a group of peacocks displaying their feathers.","Weisheng Huailing suddenly felt a bit nervous, looking into Qiao Chuchu’s wet eyes, unsure of how to respond.","Qiao Chuchu waited for a bit too long and couldn’t help but frown.","【Does Weisheng Huailing have something to do?】","【Is he not comfortable being with us?】","【If that’s the case, I won’t force it. I’ll just let him do as he pleases.】","Weisheng Huailing’s heart skipped a beat.","Was Qiao Chuchu thinking he disliked her?!","He immediately shook his head: \"I forgot there’s a bathroom here! Let’s go back!\"","Pei Buxian couldn’t understand: \"What are they talking about?\"","Lou Tingsi frowned: \"Qiao Chuchu told him there’s a bathroom here, but he went downstairs for some reason. Weisheng Huailing said he didn’t know, so they’re coming back.\"","Pei Buxian’s face changed, and he quickly pulled back!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci followed suit!","The few of them banged their heads together, quickly covering their heads in pain but not daring to make a sound, and staggered apart.","Weisheng Wenzhan, who had witnessed everything from the sofa, had a hard expression on his face: \"......\"","Pei Yuan: \"......\"","Pei Che: \"I think they’ll manage to hurt themselves without any help.\"","Weisheng Biehe nodded: \"Agreed.\"","On the other side, Qiao Chuchu reached the door and motioned for Weisheng Huailing to go in.","Weisheng Huailing smiled, looking like a cheerful Pomeranian: \"Aren’t you coming in?\"","She smiled and shook her head: \"You guys go ahead. I have something to do, and it’ll only take three minutes.\"","Weisheng Huailing was stunned and wanted to go out to accompany her, but Qiao Chuchu closed the door directly.","She looked at Song Yu, who was stationed in the corridor: \"Can you help me with something? But please don’t tell Lou Tingsi.\"","Song Yu was puzzled: \"What is it?\"","Qiao Chuchu tiptoed, whispering into her ear: \"Someone’s trying to kill me, and I want to turn the tables on her.\"","Song Yu: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed her hand against Song Yu’s shoulder, continuing: \"Not only will she kill me, but she’ll also target my brother, and possibly Lou Tingsi. She’s indiscriminate in her attacks, but mainly targeting me and my brother.\"","Song Yu’s expression shifted, lowering her voice: \"In that case, shouldn’t you tell the boss? Why don’t you tell him?\"","\"I don’t want them to know. They’ll ask me why,\" Qiao Chuchu said urgently: \"I know someone’s coming to kill me, but the reason why I know this, I can’t say.\"","Song Yu didn’t ask further, though she was puzzled, and replied without hesitation: \"I owe you my life, so I can help you. But I’m under the boss’s command. If he finds out and asks me, I’ll have to tell him.\"","\"I won’t let them find out,\" Qiao Chuchu was certain: \"As long as you help me, I’m sure they won’t find out!\"","Lou Tingsi was eavesdropping at the door, trying to catch their conversation.","Pei Youchuan was doing the same, muttering quietly: \"Why is the soundproofing so good? I can’t hear a thing.\"","Suddenly, Lou Tingsi’s phone rang.","He picked up, and after hearing what the other person said, his expression changed: \"What? Are you idiots?! How could you lose her?!\"","Everyone turned to look at him.","Lou Tingsi hung up the phone in frustration and snapped: \"Rayla's out, my people were already waiting there, but they lost her. She's disappeared. I sent my best squad, people who've never messed up before.\"","Pei Yuan wasn’t surprised: \"Even if you sent a hundred people, if Rayla’s meant to show up here, she’ll still make it.\"","Lou Tingsi understood the logic but still felt irritated: \"I’ve already had people stationed nearby. Song Yu doesn’t know, and Qiao Chuchu doesn’t know either. I just don’t want anything to go wrong.\"","Outside the corridor, Song Yu quickly found Rayla’s profile and handed it to Qiao Chuchu: \"Rayla is a retired female soldier with outstanding military records, so she’s probably very skilled.\"","After saying that, Song Yu hesitated: \"Are you sure you can handle her on your own? Don’t you want me to help?\"","Qiao Chuchu studied Rayla’s profile carefully: \"No need. The enemy is out in the open, while we’re in the dark. I’ll ambush her, and when we meet, I’ll just shoot without any nonsense.\"","Song Yu: \"That makes sense, actually.\"","Qiao Chuchu said: \"You stay behind me, and also, give me your account details. I’ll transfer you some money, and you can help me buy something.\"","Song Yu quickly gave her the account details.","Qiao Chuchu transferred her a million dollars.","Song Yu: \"What do you need to buy with a million dollars?\"","Qiao Chuchu earnestly asked her: \"Go buy fifteen Montblanc pens, around five thousand each, in black or white, no duplicates, not too flashy, and give them to me.\"","Song Yu was shocked: \"Fifteen pens? Are you sure?\"","Qiao Chuchu counted on her fingers: \"My brother needs seven, the Weisheng family needs four, Lou Tingsi’s family needs two, Lin Shen needs one, and Ying Chen needs one.\"","As for Lin Qing and Yu Can, she wouldn’t buy pens. She planned to order two croc-leather handbags, as those would suit the two sisters better.","With that, Qiao Chuchu confirmed: \"So fifteen pens, that’s the right number.\"","After all, they had given her gifts, so this was her polite way of returning the favor.","Song Yu mumbled in a daze, \"Wow, this is the downside of having too many handsome guys around—spending so much money just to give gifts.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't catch what she said. \"What?\"","\"Never mind,\" Song Yu said awkwardly, forcing a laugh. She hesitated for a moment and then asked, \"But even if each pen costs 50,000, 15 pens would only cost 750,000. Why did you give me a million?\"","Qiao Chuchu patted her shoulder. \"The rest is for you. Consider it your fee for the hard work. You can also pass it on to your subordinates. Whoever helps you run errands, just give them a red envelope. The money is yours to manage.\"","Song Yu: \"?\"","How generous?!","Qiao Chuchu turned to leave, but Song Yu grabbed her wrist.","Qiao Chuchu looked back, puzzled.","Song Yu’s eyes sparkled as she gazed at her. \"Miss Qiao, you've saved my life before. I won't take this tip. No need to be so formal between us. The leftover money will be transferred back to you. But I still have to say this to you—I'm totally up for it!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\""]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Can't the Villain Win Without Talking Too Much Don't You Think So","paragraphs":["An hour later.","Qiao Chuchu sat obediently on the sofa watching a movie.","Pei Youchuan grabbed a handful of her popcorn and glanced at her with his peripheral vision: \"How about changing the movie?\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a puzzled look.","Pei Youchuan stared at the special effects-laden scene on the screen, his tone nonchalant: \"Why not switch to a romantic love story?\"","Qiao Chuchu's phone rang, and upon opening it, she saw a message from Song Yu: **\"He's here.\"**","She promptly stuffed the popcorn into Pei Youchuan's lap: \"You watch it yourself.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Huh?\"","Qiao Chuchu pocketed her phone and headed toward the door, mentally preparing herself.","*I'll act swiftly. No wasting time with Rayla—just one shot, and I'll be back before anyone suspects a thing!*","As she reached the door, she turned back and waved at everyone: \"Got some work to take care of. Be back in five minutes!\"","They nodded in unison: \"Go ahead.\"","The moment the door closed, their expressions turned serious, and all eyes fell on Weisheng Huailing.","With a swift motion, Weisheng Huailing leaped up from the sofa, grabbed his drone controller, and started operating it.","Despite being unable to leave, he had set up several drones both outside and inside, ready to be deployed at any moment.","The projection screen instantly switched from the sci-fi movie to a view of Qiao Chuchu's back as she walked down the stairs and approached Song Yu.","Song Yu handed her a silencer pistol: \"That guy's hiding behind a tree to the north, facing the backyard. I've got people surrounding her from behind; she has no idea.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, loaded the gun, and said: \"Take me around the back.\"","Song Yu nodded: \"This way!\"","-","Rayla held a pair of binoculars, aiming them at Lou Tingsi's house. Seeing the many layers of moving figures inside, she murmured to herself: \"It's full of patrolling subordinates, and the security is surprisingly tight. Better wait for someone to come out.\"","She set up her sniper rifle, covered it with something random, and opened her phone.","On the screen was her wedding photo with Meng Yashu.","Her eyes instantly reddened as she gently touched Meng Yashu's smiling face: \"I still can't understand why you'd commit suicide. I feel like you were murdered, but there's no evidence to prove it was homicide. Then I don't get it—why would you leave me alone like that?\"","Overwhelmed with sorrow, she clutched the phone to her chest: \"Your secret was exposed, but don't worry, I'll make that meddlesome person pay. I'll make them experience the pain of losing a loved one!\"","Rayla clenched her teeth, her voice trembling: \"And I'll make them feel the humiliation of strangers rummaging through their home, leaving them with no secrets!\"","Her hatred burned fiercely: \"I'll avenge you! And then, we'll be together!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"You can be with him now.\"","Rayla was stunned. Before she could react, a burst of flame flashed before her eyes!","Qiao Chuchu fired a shot, hitting Rayla's shoulder!","Rayla slammed into the tree, groaning with pain: \"Ugh!!\"","The men in the entertainment room were wide-eyed with shock!","Ying Chen was unprepared: \"Damn! She went straight to shooting! I thought she'd at least threaten her a bit!\"","Weisheng Lin looked at Pei Yuan, his tone amused: \"What kind of girl are you raising? This clearly aligns with our Weisheng family's style.\"","Pei Buxian frowned: \"How is it your Weisheng family's style? My sister has always had this kind of personality. She's always known what matters most.\"","Lou Tingsi raised an eyebrow and nodded: \"That's true. Qiao Chuchu has never let us down in crucial moments. That's why she was able to come save me.\"","At the same time, he received a message from one of his subordinates: **\"Boss? This girl just shot her straight away? Too ruthless!\"**","Lou Tingsi couldn't help but laugh: \"Look, even my men are shocked. It seems they won't have any role to play this time, just watching from the shadows.\"","Weisheng Huailing, staring at the projector, had an idea.","What if he switched to Rayla's first-person perspective?","He maneuvered the ground drone, adjusted its angle, turning it toward Qiao Chuchu's front, and zoomed in.","Qiao Chuchu pointed the gun at Rayla, her face splattered with blood, her eyes cold and menacing as she stared at Rayla.","From the drone's perspective, Qiao Chuchu seemed to be pointing the gun at them.","They held their breaths, transfixed by the scene.","The atmosphere in the room grew increasingly tense.","On the screen, Rayla's half-visible form clutched her right shoulder, her voice filled with pain: \"Qiao Chuchu?! How... how are you here?!\"","Qiao Chuchu gave Song Yu a glance.","Song Yu stepped forward, searched Rayla, and stripped her of all weapons, even taking the sniper rifle: \"No lethal weapons left.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded in satisfaction: \"Move back. I have something to say to her.\"","Song Yu retreated ten steps, aiming his gun at Rayla.","Qiao Chuchu raised her hand, pointing the gun at Rayla's forehead: \"You know why villains lose? Often because they talk too much, giving their enemies time to breathe.\"","She smirked, utterly composed: \"Shooting straight away eliminates a lot of trouble. Now, is there anything you'd like to say to me?\"","Rayla's face turned pale, her voice full of resentment: \"My family bailed me out immediately. You shouldn't have known!\"","\"I didn't know,\" Qiao Chuchu said with a sly smile. \"But my gut told me you'd come to kill me. And guess what? I was right.\"","\"I... I'm not here to kill you...\" Rayla felt like her arm was about to detach, the pain nearly overwhelming: \"I came to kill your brother.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes darkened, and her soft expression turned vicious: \"Killing my brother is the same as killing me. What's the difference?\"","In the entertainment room, the Pei family held their breaths, fixated on Qiao Chuchu's fierce expression.","Qiao Chuchu yanked Rayla’s hair, her voice growing increasingly intense: \"I came into this world and the only person I saw was my brother. My parents and adoptive parents are all gone. My brother raised me. When I had a fever, he carried me to the hospital. They made a lot of sacrifices and endured a lot of hardships for me. And you casually say you're here to kill my brother? Do you think I won't be furious about that?!\"","Rayla screamed in pain, but defiantly lunged at Qiao Chuchu!","Qiao Chuchu shot her in the left shoulder without hesitation!","Rayla shrieked: \"Ah!\"","Qiao Chuchu once again grabbed her hair, forcing her to look at her: \"If your husband hadn't died, the two of you would've dismembered me! The idea of being dismembered made me fearful and angry! But now that you want to kill my brother, all I feel is pure rage!!\"","Rayla wept, the pain making it hard for her to speak.","She felt she was on the verge of death, so she chose her words carefully: \"I loved my husband... deeply. I won't allow anyone... to harm anything about him.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"What kind of nonsense are you spewing? Your love with your husband is love, but my bond with my brother isn't love?\"","Everyone watching the screen: \"!\""]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: Good Driving","paragraphs":["Pei Yuan gasped sharply, his eyes suddenly glistening with emotion, his chest heaving rapidly.","Pei Che remained expressionless, throat bobbing as he unconsciously clenched his fists.","Pei Youchuan bit down on a chunk of flesh from his finger in disbelief, a restless agitation seeping from his eyes.","Pei Fengnong stood in a daze, instinctively slipping his hand into his pocket, where he ran his fingers over the necklace Qiao Chuchu had given him in his childhood.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci downed a full glass of water each, rubbing their necks in discomfort.","Pei Buxian clutched a pillow, his mouth half-open, already stunned into silence.","The members of the Wei Sheng Family wore subtly enigmatic expressions, their glances flicking toward the Pei family before returning to the screen.","Weisheng Wenzhan glanced at the furious image of Qiao Chuchu on the screen and irritably pushed his glasses up.","Biehe, with a rosary in hand, scanned each of the Pei family's faces before looking away in a dark mood.","Weisheng Lin stared blankly at Qiao Chuchu and murmured, \"I... don’t even know how to describe it.\"","Ying Chen threw back a glass of whiskey with ice, his voice hoarse as he said, \"Don’t you think she’s incredibly sexy right now? When she’s soft, she’s quite cute, but when she’s strong... it’s... very alluring, the kind you can’t quite put into words.\"","Weisheng Lin, watching Qiao Chuchu’s aloof expression on screen, finally realized, \"Ah, no wonder I’ve been feeling so hot—she’s literally making me swoon like crazy.\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","Lou Tingsi fiddled with his tie, tugging at it with a restless hand; his eyes inadvertently fell on the strawberries on the table.","...The heat just intensified.","Weisheng Biehe’s voice was hoarse: \"Huailing, can we switch perspectives? This one makes it feel like she’s pointing a gun at me.\"","Weisheng Lin snorted with laughter: \"Looks like someone’s forgotten his little brother’s deaf~\"","Weisheng Biehe’s lip twitched; his gaze turned to Huailing and froze.","Weisheng Huailing gazed intently at the screen, his affection unabashed. His beautiful eyes sparkled like a constellation, utterly transfixed.","Weisheng Biehe’s eyes dimmed, and he couldn’t help but let out a cold snort.","On the screen, Rayla, with her back to the camera, wailed in anguish, both desperate and resentful, \"How can your connection compare to mine? Yours is just a brother, mine is a husband!\"","Qiao Chuchu mocked, her lips curling, \"Oh, really? Does that mean a family bond is any less noble than the love between you two? But why should innocent girls pay the price for your so-called love, huh? Do you even realize how many families and innocent young lives you two have ruined?!\"","Rayla’s eyes ignited with fury, her voice sharp and hateful: \"Their business will be handled by someone else! My husband’s assets are frozen—he’ll definitely have to compensate, so there’s no need for you to lecture me! If my husband weren’t dead, you’d probably be chopped into pieces by now! Both you and that Xia Xuechun would be dead at our hands! And if not for your sneak attack, your brother would be dead too!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s gaze swept over the ground and noticed a cleverly crafted miniature drone.","She sneered, \"You’re using drones to spy now? How very high-tech of you.\"","The men in the entertainment room tensed, fearful of exposing a ruse.","Rayla ignored her, letting out a desperate, heart-wrenching cry, \"Your brother destroyed my husband’s secret! You destroyed me! Your entire family ruined our happiness!\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn’t be bothered to engage, picking up her gun and aiming it at the drone, coolly pulling the trigger.","The loud \"Boom!\" broke the link to the projected screen.","Weisheng Huailing trembled, as though resonating with her actions, his fingertips vibrating.","Closing his eyes, he gradually leaned forward, the corners of his mouth uncontrollably rising into a slowly widening grin.","Qiao Chuchu retrieved the drone, passing it to Song Yu: \"Take a look at this for me and see if it uploaded any videos to the cloud. Just make sure there’s no leftover evidence.\"","Song Yu took the drone, casting a glance at the now listless Rayla: \"I’ll get my people to handle the rest. It’s been more than five minutes now; if you stay any longer, they’ll start to get suspicious. Hurry up and leave! I’ll send your gift over soon.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded and quickly returned to the entrance of the Lou Family’s entertainment room, taking a deep breath to compose herself before pushing the door open: \"I’m so sorry to keep you all waiting. Work was quite the hassle.\"","As soon as Qiao Chuchu entered, every one of the men’s eyes instinctively locked onto her. Their gazes shimmered with an inscrutable blend of emotions, concealing barely veiled amusement as they nodded toward her, \"You’re welcome.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Why does this feel off?]","She walked in slowly, glancing at the blank projector screen and asked in confusion, \"Nothing’s playing? Did you guys not watch a movie?\"","\"We did. Just finished.\" Ying Chen’s hands were clasped on his lap as he cynically looked her over, \"Absolutely thrilling.\"","Qiao Chuchu breathed a sigh of relief, \"Glad to hear I didn’t ruin the fun for you.\"","[Scared me, I thought I’d blown my cover.]","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow, shutting his laptop and said with interest, \"You won’t disappoint us.\"","Qiao Chuchu relaxed and sat down: \"Good to know.\"","Two men sat beside her: Pei Yuan and Pei Che. Both propped their chins in their hands, their gazes intensely fixed on her.","Song Yu quickly entered the gaming room, holding a pile of neatly stacked exquisite pen boxes, stopping in front of Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Qiao, your gift has arrived.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face lit up as she stood up to take the gift in her hands, \"Ah, by the way, these are my return gifts for everyone. Each one has a pen inside. I truly appreciate the gifts you all gave me today!\"","Song Yu smiled warmly, but the moment he saw Qiao Chuchu’s face, his smile abruptly stiffened!","Blood!","Qiao Chuchu’s face had blood on it!","It was too dark outside; there were only a few lights, so she hadn’t noticed the blood on Qiao Chuchu’s face!","But.... Song Yu saw it. Why wouldn’t the others notice too?!","Song Yu’s mind was on edge.","Qiao Chuchu was all innocent smiles, handing out the pens one by one: \"I hope everyone has a smooth journey and good health in the new year! ~\"","Pei Che accepted his with a raised brow, his eyes glancing at the bloodstain near her eye.","Weisheng Lin squinted, smiling maliciously as he stared at her face.","Weisheng Huailing took the liberty to wipe the drop of blood near her eye, giving her a flirtatious wink.","Qiao Chuchu assumed she’d just been lightly poked, giving an indifferent smile.","The pens were all handed out.","Only a few remained for those visiting back home.","She was positively gleeful!","[No one noticed, mission complete! Hehe~]","Qiao Chuchu happily looked at Song Yu.","Song Yu, however, was making faces at her.","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Song Yu dipped his head, then scratched his face, then his hair.","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Lou Tingsi spoke gently, \"Song Yu, you can leave now.\"","Song Yu was slightly taken aback, meeting their eyes filled with secretive implications.","Lou Tingsi’s gaze was the most gentle: \"Go on out now.\"","Song Yu remained silent, slinking toward the door and slowly closing it behind him, glancing into the room one last time.","Qiao Chu stood at the very center of the room, looking at him bewildered.","Song Yu tried to warn her, mouthing, \"Your face——\"","\"Let’s open up the gifts.\" Pei Che suddenly spoke, excitement bleeding into his voice, \"I can’t wait any longer.\"","The others chuckled in agreement: \"Yes, we don’t even know what the pens look like yet.\"","Qiao Chuchu was elated: \"Great, let’s open them together!\"","Lou Tingsi’s eyes crinkled, smiling as he glanced toward the door, \"Song Yu.\"","His breath caught, a chill running down his spine at the moment.","Lou Tingsi’s smile didn’t reach his eyes as he stared at him intensely: \"Make sure the door is latched properly.\""]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: Queued in White","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu watched as Song Yu closed the door and tilted her head, puzzled.","【Why do I feel like Song Yu had something he wanted to tell me?】","Lou Tingsi locked the door and turned to her with a smile. \"What do you think my fountain pen will look like? I'm so excited! How about we open it together?\"","Qiao Chuchu's attention was successfully diverted. \"Sure.\"","Lou Tingsi carried the gift box over to Qiao Chuchu, his gaze fixed on the blood around her eyes. He slowly opened the box. \"Wow, it's pure white.\"","His pale fingers held the pen, exuding a kind of elegance mixed with danger. \"It suits me so well, and I really like the design on it.\"","Qiao Chuchu was delighted. \"Yes, you're so refined, and your smile is beautiful. The white makes you look so gentle.\"","Lou Tingsi's eyes flickered with a subtle glint as he toyed with the pen. \"I... have a nice smile?\"","She nodded earnestly, giving him a thumbs-up without hesitation. \"Your smile has an air of cunning. You look like the kind of mastermind mafia boss who hides knives behind their smile in comic books!\"","Lou Tingsi licked his lips and narrowed his eyes, his expression enigmatic. \"Is that a compliment?\"","Qiao Chuchu enthusiastically nodded. \"I'm not very good at flattering people, but you really are good-looking. The white makes you seem unexpectedly clean.\"","Lou Tingsi smiled tenderly. \"It’s truly—\"","Weisheng Huailing suddenly kicked Lou Tingsi away!","Lou Tingsi: \"?!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Weisheng Huailing handed the gift box to Qiao Chuchu with both hands, excitedly gesturing, \"Open it! Open it!\"","Qiao Chuchu held the box with both hands, her mouth twitching. \"Did you just kick Lou Tingsi?\"","Huailing tilted his head and blinked at her innocently. \"?\"","Lou Tingsi, wincing in pain, sat up from the ground. \"Ugh... my back...\"","Weisheng Huailing glanced at Lou Tingsi, his face expressing surprise and concern. \"So, Uncle, are you alright?\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?! Uncle?!\"","Huailing showed genuine worry. \"Older people really do have bad backs. That's not good. Men can't have bad backs. Maybe you should take some supplements.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"I have a sore back because you kicked me, not because my back is naturally bad!\"","Huailing pointed at his ear and waved his hand.","Hearing nothing~","He then smiled and looked at Qiao Chuchu. \"Open my gift!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Okay.\"","She opened the box. \"Wow, black and white!\"","White cap, black pen body.","Song Yu really has a good eye!","Every pen is so beautiful!","Huailing's eyes lit up with excitement as he took it. \"What a beautiful pen! With a little modification, it could even poke someone's eye out!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Ah?\"","Weisheng Huailing gave her an enthusiastic hug, excitedly gesturing, \"Thank you! I really love it! I'll treasure it!\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed uncomfortably. \"I'm glad you like it, but I'll give you other gifts too, so you don’t have to be so careful with it.\"","\"Every first gift is special,\" Huailing said shyly. \"Just like a first kiss.\"","He hugged Qiao Chuchu tightly and leaned in toward her, closing his eyes.","Qiao Chuchu froze, sensing something was off and just about to push him away—","Weisheng Biehe grabbed Huailing's waist and tossed him onto the couch!","Weisheng Huailing was pinned facedown on the sofa: \"?!\"","Weisheng Biehe smirked disdainfully. \"Trash belongs where trash should be.\"","He handed the gift box to Qiao Chuchu. \"My gift box seems to be stuck. Can you help me open it?\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched. \"Sure...\"","【Somehow, I feel like things started getting weird the moment Weisheng Huailing appeared.】","She lowered her head to open the gift, and suddenly, Weisheng Biehe used a wet wipe to clean her face.","Qiao Chuchu looked up in surprise.","Weisheng Biehe bent down to her eye level, gently wiping around her eyes with one hand, his voice deep and magnetic. \"You had some dirt on your face.\"","Qiao Chuchu blinked. \"What?\"","【Could it be blood?】","Weisheng Biehe smiled faintly. \"It was just dust.\"","Qiao Chuchu breathed a sigh of relief. As soon as she opened the box, Weisheng Biehe vanished from her sight!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Who else got him thrown away?","Weisheng Lin pushed Weisheng Biehe aside and dropped the gift box into her hands. \"Take a look at mine.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Do you all have to kick, push, or throw the previous one away every time?\"","Weisheng Lin stuffed his hands into his pockets, his tone indifferent. \"Don’t worry about small details. He’s tough enough.\"","\"...” Qiao Chuchu frowned and opened the fountain pen box. \"It’s black with a touch of red.\"","The red was subtle, barely noticeable.","She thought to herself. 【It suits Weisheng Lin’s fiery, fierce personality so well!】","Weisheng Lin was also surprised. He picked up the pen and examined it carefully, then glanced at her. \"You’ve got good taste. I do like black and red.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Um, actually—\"","\"Anyway, we haven’t officially introduced ourselves,\" Weisheng Lin said, extending his hand. \"I'm Weisheng Lin, an investment businessman.\"","Qiao Chuchu reached out and shook his hand. \"Hi, I’m Qiao Chuchu, a comic artist.\"","【It’s kind of weird that we’re only now introducing ourselves after so long.】","【But I know him. Weisheng Lin, short-tempered, one of the least sophisticated in the Weisheng family, and he owns the most luxurious nightclub in China.】","【He’s got that rugged, rebellious charm!】","She was slightly distracted. 【It’s pretty cool that I can meet someone like him, with that tough, edgy vibe.】","Weisheng Lin raised an eyebrow.","Is he rugged?","He grinned mischievously. \"I owe you a gift. Let’s go shopping together when we’re back in the country. Whatever you like, I’ll get it for you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was about to respond when someone suddenly pulled her aside!","She stumbled forward, nearly falling into his arms.","A cool, refreshing scent filled her nostrils as she reflexively pulled her hand back.","【It’s Weisheng Wenzhan’s scent!】","She quickly straightened up and looked nervously at Weisheng Wenzhan on the sofa. \"Sorry!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was seated on the sofa, one leg crossed over the other, the pen box already open. \"It’s fine. I pulled you over.\"","His long fingers played with a pure black fountain pen as he smiled calmly. \"Thanks for the pen. I’ll use it to practice calligraphy.\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised. \"You still practice calligraphy?\"","\"When I’m feeling restless, I like to practice calligraphy,\" Wenzhan said, taking a spare sheet of paper from the coffee table and writing her name.","\"Qiao Chu\"","His handwriting was sharp, a reflection of his character.","Weisheng Wenzhan looked up at her. \"Do you like it?\"","She loved it. \"You write beautifully!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan handed the pen to her. \"Now, write my name.\"","He pointed to the name she had written. \"Write it beneath yours.\"","Qiao Chuchu picked up the pen and wrote \"Weisheng Wenzhan.\"","Her handwriting was delicate, contrasting sharply with Weisheng Wenzhan’s bold, forceful strokes.","Qiao Chuchu sighed. \"I should have practiced your style of handwriting back when I learned to write. Your handwriting is so cool.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"No, I think yours is just right.\"","Qiao Chuchu was flattered. \"Really?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, holding the sheet of paper and gazing lingeringly at the two names side by side. His voice revealed his satisfaction. \"Very good.\"","Before Qiao Chuchu could speak, Pei Buxian suddenly snatched the pen from her hand.","Pei Buxian handed it back to Weisheng Wenzhan. \"Take your pen back.\"","He then dragged Qiao Chuchu out of the room. \"Come with me.\"","The others exchanged tense glances as Qiao Chuchu was hauled out of the room by Pei Buxian.","Ying Chen held up a piece of paper, visibly disappointed. \"I was still in line, and they just took her away?\""]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: If You Have a Beloved Man, I Will Send Him to Hell","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian dragged Qiao Chuchu to a corner and looked at Song Yu, who was standing guard in the hallway. \"Can you ask your men to leave?\" he asked.","Song Yu's mouth twitched as he glanced at Qiao Chuchu's face. The bloodstains on her face were gone, likely wiped off without her knowledge. Song Yu sighed, shook his head repeatedly, and left with his men.","Pei Buxian stared ominously at Qiao Chuchu. \"Are you very happy now?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Is it wrong to be happy?\"","[What kind of question is that? I fought off the enemy, protected my family, not only am I happy, I'm over the moon!]","Pei Buxian's expression gradually turned resentful. \"So many men like you, are you thrilled to death?\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a disgusted look. \"How can you be so one-sided? It's not just men who like me; even girls like me. After all, I treat everyone with sincerity. If you all treat me well, I treat you well in return. Isn't it natural for people to like me?\"","She spoke reasonably. \"Emotions are mutual. If you didn't treat me well, I wouldn't waste my time with you!\"","Pei Buxian was taken aback and felt a bit irritated.","What he meant wasn't that kind of \"like.\"","Whatever.","He thought about her shooting earlier and licked his lips, feeling restless. \"Why did you protect me today?\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned.","[He must be talking about when Rayla charged at him, and I pushed her away.]","She sighed, amused. \"Are you stupid? You're my brother.\"","Pei Buxian frowned, tilting his head in confusion. \"That's all?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Otherwise?\"","Pei Buxian lowered his eyes, his long lashes casting a shadow.","What about her anger?","Wasn't it because she feared he might be killed?","His brow furrowed deeper, unsure of how to put it into words. Hesitantly, he managed to say, \"I thought our relationship... you wouldn't protect me like that anymore.\"","Qiao Chuchu was momentarily stunned.","Pei Buxian stood with his head down in front of her, his platinum blonde hair softly falling over his milky white skin, giving him a delicate, almost fragile appearance.","Qiao Chuchu sighed, feeling a pang of guilt. \"Brother, I’ve made mistakes. I’ve embarrassed you in front of so many people, and you’ve endured it all. I’ve hurt you, and I want to make amends. I want you to live a normal life.\"","Pei Buxian stared into her eyes, bewildered. \"What counts as a normal life?\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated for a moment, then looked out the window, envisioning the future. \"You focus on your work, earn money, meet a woman you like, date, and get married.\"","Pei Buxian's eyelids twitched, and his face darkened abruptly. \"How can I get married when you won't let me?\"","She chuckled. \"I told you, that’s all in the past now.\"","[After all, it was part of my mission. If I didn’t do the task, I’d be electrocuted or punished, in utter agony. I had to do it. Now that there’s no mission, I should go back to normal.]","[Unfortunately, I can’t explain this to him.]","Qiao Chuchu sighed helplessly. \"I’ve told you multiple times, I’ve reformed. I won’t bother you anymore, I don’t love you.\"","Pei Buxian shuddered, looking at her incredulously. \"What did you say?\"","She sighed and enunciated clearly, \"I. Don’t. Love. You. Anymore!\"","Pei Buxian's face drained of all color, and his expression turned even darker. He pressed eagerly, \"Is it because I didn’t respond to you back then?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Why would you ask that?\"","Pei Buxian took a step forward, his gaze intense. \"If I had kissed you when you wanted me to, would things be different now?\"","She widened her eyes in astonishment. \"Why would you kiss me?\"","Pei Buxian’s gaze burned. \"Because you wanted to kiss me.\"","Qiao Chuchu gasped, feeling her head buzz. She slapped her forehead. \"Oh my god!\"","[I flirted with him because the system made me do it! The system wanted me to turn him into a monster!]","[Even though I have no idea why pushing him like that would make him a monster, that’s what the mission dictated. I wasn’t really trying to flirt with him!]","Qiao Chuchu racked her brains, trying to come up with a plausible excuse. \"Actually, I had a case of 'newborn affection,' not understanding what love really is. Now I understand. I mistook family for love, you can’t keep misunderstanding.\"","Pei Buxian retreated a few steps, hiding in the shadows, his eyes narrowing with a hint of mockery. \"So... you don’t have a shred of romantic feelings for me. And you helped me when I was in danger merely out of family solidarity?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded vigorously. \"Exactly!\"","Pei Buxian stared at her coldly. \"Now that you’re telling me, if I were to find a girlfriend, you’d be happy for me, right?\"","Qiao Chuchu thought for a moment, then answered earnestly. \"If you found a girlfriend, I probably wouldn’t feel much, it’s your private life, after all. But if you were to get married, I’m sure I’d be moved to tears at your wedding!\"","\"Ahhh... so moved to tears for me,\" Pei Buxian drawled, his voice flat. \"I envy you so much. I can’t be that generous.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt something was off. \"What?\"","\"You protected me at the art exhibition, didn’t you?\" Pei Buxian emerged from the shadows, standing in front of her. \"The way you stood in front of me, pushing Rayla away, I still shudder when I think about it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? What does 'shudder' mean?\"","Pei Buxian didn’t answer. His gaze was like a hook, locking onto hers. \"I used to imagine you getting married, and I’d feel nothing but sadness and pain. But seeing you protect me, I can’t stand the thought of another man taking my place.\"","He looked emotionless. \"If, one day, I see you standing in front of another man, holding his hand, kissing him, doing more intimate things... I’d want to kill him.\"","His voice was soft, almost a whisper in her ear. \"I’d love to send the man you love straight to hell.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face gradually changed, shocked. \"? Do you know how messed up this thinking is?\"","She was in turmoil. [Did I push him to this point of no return? Why is he saying such strange things?]","She hesitated, then tentatively asked, \"Is it because I hurt you—\"","\"It’s not because of you,\" Pei Buxian said, his tone calm and detached. \"Before, I thought some things were impossible to overcome because just imagining them made me feel guilty, like I’m betraying everyone, like I’m a beast, a pervert, a scoundrel.\"","He gazed down at her, his glistening eyes like a net, enveloping her completely.","His calm tone carried a hidden excitement. \"Being normal means losing you. Being a beast means having you.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s face twisted, her eyes wide with terror. [No way...]"]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: Truth or Insincerity","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian raised his hand and gently cupped her cheek. \"The bad news is that I may not be able to be a normal person, but the good news is that I can easily become a beast.\" He took a soft breath, suppressing the excitement in his voice. \"So, don’t ever say you support me getting married again; it makes me angry.\"","Qiao Chuchu's face turned pale, and she shoved him away with all her strength!","Pei Buxian caught her by the back of her head and pulled her into his embrace.","She pushed him away again and ran away in a panic!","Pei Buxian gripped her hand tightly, trying to pull her back into his arms, his voice urgent. \"What are you running for?!\"","Without a word, she attempted to throw him over her shoulder!","However, Pei Buxian reacted quickly, countering and restraining her, pressing her forcefully against the wall.","Her back slammed into the wall hard, but her head didn’t hurt.","Because Pei Buxian’s hand was protecting the back of her head.","She tried to push him away, but Pei Buxian’s strength was immense, and he held her tightly. \"Don’t be afraid!\"","He lowered his head and buried it in the hollow of her neck, tightening his embrace. \"Don’t be afraid! I was scared at first too, but now I’m not, Chuchu! I’m not afraid anymore!!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared at the ceiling, fear spilling from her eyes. \"Are you suggesting something to me?!\"","Pei Buxian gazed at her, his eyes unblinking.","Qiao Chuchu didn’t dare look at his expression and hesitated before speaking, \"You wouldn’t——\"","[Fallen for me, have you?]","Pei Buxian’s breath hitched, and he cupped her face, his tone both calm and fierce. \"Chuchu, don’t evade me. Look at me and ask me anything. As long as you look at me, I’ll answer whatever you ask!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned her head away in rejection. \"No, I won’t!\"","He pinched her cheek, trying to make her face him. \"Listen, be good. Don’t be afraid, it’s fine, really fine!\"","Qiao Chuchu was deeply resistant, struggling against him. \"I won’t! Stop touching me!!\"","Pei Buxian’s eyes slowly reddened, and he forced her chin upward. \"Look at me, just look at me! I’m going to talk to you properly!\"","Qiao Chuchu stubbornly turned her head, gritting her teeth, her body trembling. \"Don’t force me!!\"","[No matter what the answer is, I don’t want to hear it. I’m feeling more and more uneasy!]","Pei Buxian flinched, his nose tingling with the onset of tears. \"Do you hate me so much?\"","He felt like he was falling apart, his nose reddening, tears falling in big drops as he regretfully cupped her face. \"Chuchu, I’m begging you, don’t avoid my gaze. Let me speak my heart out. Please, look at me, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu, her brow furrowed, hesitated several times before finally lifting her gaze to look at him, her expression one of trepidation.","Pei Buxian locked his gaze onto her eyes. \"I love you.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!!!\"","Pei Buxian’s tears overflowed. \"It’s the love of a family member.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s frozen body suddenly warmed up, and she nearly lost her breath. \"Damn it! Must you speak in such a dramatic fashion? I almost had a heart attack!\"","Pei Buxian visibly relaxed and pulled her into his arms, resting his head like a young beast in the hollow of her neck. \"It’s your own fault for not letting me speak. I just wanted to tell you that I won’t get married in the future, and you shouldn’t mention such things again.\"","Qiao Chuchu, who had been tense, finally relaxed, feeling a bit annoyed. \"Then just say that straight out! You had to beat around the bush, and I thought you were going to confess!\"","[I was really scared. This creep’s words were so ambiguous. He wasn’t like this before. Seems his condition is getting worse.]","Pei Buxian ignored her, leaning heavily on her shoulder and kissing the fabric of her coat lightly. \"How could that be?\"","With her clothes in between, he took the liberty, kissing the piece of fabric over her shoulder cautiously yet boldly. \"I... know what kind of feelings I have.\"","He clung to her like a dependent child. \"I’m sorry, Chuchu, for treating you like that before.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"That was my fault——\"","\"It wasn’t your fault,\" Pei Buxian kissed her shoulder and mumbled, \"It was mine. I’m really sorry. Please don’t be mad at me. Thank you for helping me stall Rayla today; thank you.\"","He was so scared...","If he had really said it out loud, Qiao Chuchu would have completely cut him off...","He was terrified...","Pei Buxian hugged Qiao Chuchu tightly, his heart filled with fear and remorse.","Before, he had been ignorant, unable to grasp the crux of the matter, not understanding that Qiao Chuchu was being coerced by the system.","Even after knowing she was coerced, he still blamed her.","What he should have blamed was the system itself.","Most importantly, he couldn’t understand his original self in the storyline.","He couldn’t understand why, after Qiao Chuchu’s death, he had gone to Xia Xuechun.","He held Qiao Chuchu’s slender body tightly. \"I’ve grown accustomed to having you by my side, to sharing everything with you. I just want you in my life; I don’t want anyone else encroaching on our world. I don’t want change, I’m unwilling to change, and I’ve never planned to change. So if you die, I won’t live on.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes widened in surprise.","Pei Buxian pressed close to her neck, his voice heavy and sincere. \"I’m willing to abandon everything and go to hell with you.\"","Her eyes warmed, and finally, she reached out to hug him. \"Don’t say that. We’ll live well.\"","Pei Buxian tightened his arms, closing his eyes, tears of fear tracing down his cheeks. \"I love you, I really do love you.\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched. \"...Although I know it's familial love, please don't say that again. It's weird, and it's so oily.\"","\"No, you know I’m not mentally stable. Can’t you humor me?\" Pei Buxian clung to her like a child, his voice muffled. \"I’m going to say it anyway.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a disgusted look. \"Fine, never say it again, but this time, I’ll let it slide.\"","Pei Buxian didn’t respond.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci stood silently not far away, their expressions dark and ominous.","Pei Buxian, leaning on Qiao Chuchu’s shoulder, noticed them out of the corner of his eye and glanced at them.","The corridor was brightly lit.","Yet Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s faces were dark and terrifying.","Pei Buxian’s eyes darkened, his gaze turning vicious as he slowly tightened his embrace, like a wolf guarding its prey.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci’s eyes flashed with fury, their jaws clenched as they watched him.","Pei Buxian didn’t care, instead taunting them by pressing his face against Qiao Chuchu’s shoulder and lightly kissing it.","Pei Ci rushed forward and punched him hard, grabbing his neck and slamming him against the wall!","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard. \"Brother Wu?!\"","Pei Ci didn’t look at her. \"Take Qiao Chuchu away!\"","Pei Mu lifted Qiao Chuchu and carried her away!","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, struggling on Pei Mu’s shoulder. \"Brother Wu! That was just a friendly hug! A familial hug! He’s got mental issues, you can’t blame him, brother Wu!!\"","Pei Ci, after seeing Qiao Chuchu carried back to her room by Pei Mu, tightened his grip on Pei Buxian’s collar, his lips trembling with anger. \"What do you mean by this?\"","Pei Buxian leaned against the wall, unruffled, a playful glint in his eye. \"What, are you jealous of me?\"","Pei Ci’s face darkened. \"Jealous of what?! I’m saying you’ve gone crazy!\""]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: I Want to Explain, Right Now","paragraphs":["Pei Buxian sneered, \"Am I crazy? I'm totally sober, okay?!\"","He argued rationally, \"Qiao Chuchu went to find Rayla to protect me. Everything she did was for my sake. This is supposed to be my moment to thank her alone, yet all of you are sticking to her like glue. What's wrong with me calling her out alone?!\"","\"Don't you fucking flatter yourself! She went because we were all in danger!\" Pei Ci raised his voice, grabbing Pei Buxian by the collar and reprimanding, \"That's not a reason to overstep boundaries!!\"","Pei Buxian shouted back without backing down, \"Someone has to cross the line first. Why can't it be me?!\"","Pei Ci: \"?!\"","Pei Buxian's face showed little emotion, but his eyes were filled with madness. \"She just told me she could wish me happiness, watch me marry and have children. Her magnanimity scares me. I don't want her blessing, and I don't want to bless her either. I just want to be tangled with her for life—a messy, muddled life!\"","Pei Ci was trembling with anger. \"Didn't you hate it the most when she was clingy with you before?!\"","\"Yes!\" Pei Buxian admitted without hesitation. \"Because every time she was clingy with me, I'd have physical reactions. I felt ashamed. I didn't want her to see it, and I didn't want you guys to see it either. Is that a problem?\"","Pei Ci was stunned, unable to speak.","Pei Buxian laughed coldly. \"But don’t pretend, Pei Ci. Three years ago, when Qiao Chuchu deliberately seduced you in your office, you had a reaction too. I saw it.\"","Pei Ci's face turned pale, full of shock.","Pei Buxian tilted his chin, blatantly provoking him, \"You look like you're lecturing me out of a brotherly sense of righteousness, but in reality, you're just jealous of me.\"","Pei Ci's facial muscles twitched as he slowly retracted his hand, gritting his teeth.","Pei Buxian suddenly felt a surge of pleasure. \"How about it? Don't you feel better after everything's been laid bare? But you'd better keep it hidden from now on, or else your beloved mischievous older brother persona will fall apart.\"","Pei Ci remained silent, enduring and lowering his head.","Pei Buxian mocked him as he bumped shoulders with Pei Ci and walked past. \"Just pretend you didn't see anything today, okay? Just like how three years ago, I kept quiet when I saw your reaction—I helped you keep it a secret.\"","Pei Ci's head buzzed, and he grabbed Pei Buxian's shoulder, punching him hard. \"You knew about my feelings and still provoked me!!\"","Pei Yuan came out of the room and saw what was happening, shouting, \"What are you two doing?\"","The others also began to emerge, watching the two men at the end of the corridor.","An enraged Pei Ci pointed at Pei Buxian and growled, \"He fucking won’t let go of Qiao Chuchu!!\"","The crowd was stunned and quickly rushed toward Pei Buxian. \"What??\"","Weisheng Huailing, who had been casually watching the scene with his hands in his pockets, instantly felt his blood boil upon understanding Pei Ci's words. Rolling up his sleeves, he charged forward!","Something fell out of his pocket.","It was a delicate drone.","Qiao Chuchu came out of the room, intending to intervene, but she noticed the small drone in Weisheng Huailing's hand.","She bent down, picked up the little drone from the ground, and examined it carefully.","[Hmm? This seems to be the same as the one behind Rayla.]","As she toyed with it in her hand, she suddenly thought of something and turned cold. \"Wait a minute!\"","The group pinning Pei Buxian against the wall all turned their heads to look at her.","Qiao Chuchu raised the drone in her hand, her expression growing darker. \"What’s this?\"","They were stunned, subconsciously glancing at Weisheng Huailing.","What's going on? How did this get exposed?!","Weisheng Huailing's face changed as he reached into his pocket.","When did it fall out?!","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes sharply. \"Were you all spying on me just now? Tracking me with this drone?\"","Huailing shook his head like a rattle drum!","Lou Tingsi also reflexively shook his head. \"No! No! No!\"","The others looked bewildered. \"What are you talking about? We don't understand.\"","Qiao Chuchu's face turned cold as she slammed the drone onto the ground with force.","The drone shattered into pieces instantly!","An oppressive silence engulfed the room!","They held their breath, staring at the shattered drone before slowly lifting their eyes to meet Qiao Chuchu's dark expression.","\"Explain,\" Qiao Chuchu's tone grew sinister, her face void of emotion. \"If you can't give a reasonable explanation, don’t bother talking to me anymore.\""]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: This is just playing house to them","paragraphs":["In Lou Tingsi's manor on the second floor, the corridor was bathed in natural lighting.","At the end of the hallway stood a row of tall, handsome men in well-tailored suits, their long legs accentuated by the sharp lines of their trousers.","They were all tense, taking shallow breaths, no one daring to speak first.","Qiao Chuchu stood ten steps away from them, walking towards them.","They instinctively leaned back, their collective atmosphere ruptured by a sharp, invisible blade, a chill seeping into the air.","Qiao Chuchu reached them.","She was petite, not wearing heels, and looked up at them with a mix of innocence and vulnerability.","They breathed more heavily, their gazes growing darker.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes were moist, like a curious kitten, observing them gently: “Why all so quiet?”","She raised an eyebrow: “Are you waiting for me to ask one by one?”","They: “......”","Qiao Chuchu chuckled lightly: “Mr. Weisheng Wenzhan, do you know what that was just now?”","Weisheng Wenzhan stepped out from the group, his gaze deep: “I don’t know.”","Qiao Chuchu squinted, not buying it: “Really?”","“Really,” Weisheng Wenzhan leaned towards her, his smile wicked, his eyes piercingly intense: “You’re so fierce, Miss Qiao. I’ve never had anyone speak to me like this, from childhood to now.”","Qiao Chuchu suppressed her irritation: “I feel like I’m being watched, so it’s normal to be upset, right?”","“Of course, it’s your right,” Weisheng Wenzhan straightened up, tilting his head with a grin: “I just find it rather special when you’re angry, that’s all.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","Weisheng Wenzhan raised his hand, effortlessly charming: “Want to frisk me? I’ve only got the fountain pen you gave me on me.”","Qiao Chuchu: “......”","【Ugh, I feel like he’s underestimating me!】","【But I don’t think he’d be the one controlling this sort of stuff.】","She gritted her teeth: “Go back.”","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded elegantly: “Thank you, Your Honor.”","As he passed her, his gaze lingered on her, stopping behind her.","Qiao Chuchu quizzical: “Why aren’t you going back?”","“I want to see who the culprit is, Your Honor,” Weisheng Wenzhan politely inclined his head, his tone humble: “And maybe help you analyze.”","The others on the opposite side scowled, gritting their teeth.","The turncoat with no loyalty!","Qiao Chuchu frowned, her gaze returning to the group.","【Even though the drone landed closest to Weisheng Huailing, my gut tells me everyone’s got a hand in this.】","She zeroed in on Pei Yuan: “Brother, do you know what this is?”","Pei Yuan’s face twitched: “No idea.”","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes narrowed shrewdly: “Brother, I can tell when you’re lying!”","【Every time Brother lies to me, his ears turn red! All I need to do is watch his ears closely!】","Their faces changed, eyes darting towards Pei Yuan’s ears.","Pei Yuan couldn’t help but chuckle: “I really don’t know.”","He raised his hand: “You want to search me?”","Qiao Chuchu moved forward decisively, patting his pockets.","【Let’s see if there’s a remote control in there!】","Pei Yuan let her do as she pleased, feeling her hands graze his waist, his dark eyes growing even deeper.","Qiao Chuchu pulled out Pei Yuan’s phone: “Can I take a look?”","Pei Yuan nodded: “Go ahead, the password is your birthday.”","She didn’t hesitate, opening his phone and checking the battery usage history.","No suspicious apps.","Weisheng Huailing’s breath hitched!","Qiao Chuchu actually checks app usage records?!","He’d be exposed right away!","There were app usage records on his phone! There’s no time to delete them now!","She stuffed the phone back: “You can go back.”","Pei Yuan raised an eyebrow, leaning down to tease her: “Your Honor, am I cleared of suspicion?”","Qiao Chuchu huffed, pushing the phone back into his hands: “Yeah.”","“Thank you, you truly are sharp-eyed, Your Honor.” Pei Yuan moved to stand beside Weisheng Wenzhan, looking rather pleased.","Qiao Chuchu’s brows knitted together: “Whose drone is it, then?!”","She had seen the drone lying on the ground when she arrived.","It seemed to have fallen from Weisheng Huailing.","But she couldn’t be too sure.","Weisheng Wenzhan chuckled lightly: “Qiao Chuchu, why not feel their hands? Whoever’s sweating the most probably did it.”","He then gave Weisheng Huailing a pointed look: “And maybe it’s not their first time either. Maybe they’ve been using drones to spy on you all along.”","Weisheng Huailing: “!”","He glared viciously at Weisheng Wenzhan!","Qiao Chuchu thought it made sense.","【Right, if they won’t talk, I’ll have to check one by one? That’s too much of a time-waster.】","She grasped Pei Che’s hand directly.","Pei Che, not expecting to be first, squeezed her hand, his voice low: “Am I sweaty?”","Qiao Chuchu: “......No.”","【And that question’s weird.】","Pei Che’s tone was relaxed: “So, am I off the hook?”","Qiao Chuchu nodded reluctantly.","Pei Che, expressionless, leaned down close to her ear, speaking at a leisurely pace: “Chuchu, your pulse is racing. You really don’t have to be so tense. I don’t think anyone here is mad at being suspected. In fact, it’s kind of interesting, especially when you’re angry... you’re quite special when you’re angry.”","Qiao Chuchu: “?”","【Special? My anger is special?! Are my mammaries just gone with the wind?!】","Pei Che: “?”","He squeezed her hand dismissively and moved to stand beside Pei Yuan.","Qiao Chuchu surveyed the group, deciding to shake hands one by one, dismissing each with a simple “You’re free to go!”","Lou Tingsi smiled: “Thank you.”","Qiao Chuchu indicated Weisheng Lin to extend his hand: “I’ll just take a quick look.”","Weisheng Lin: “?No way, everyone else is shaking hands, so I should too for fairness.”","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes, shaking his hand, finding no sweat: “You’re free.”","Weisheng Lin: “Thanks.”","Ying Chen watched amusedly: “Is this a fan meet-and-greet now?”","Qiao Chuchu snapped: “Just extend your hand.”","Ying Chen didn’t hesitate, grabbing her hand firmly: “Nope.”","Qiao Chuchu recoiled in surprise!","He grinned devilishly, squeezing her hand: “Your hands are tiny, so soft and delicate... I never knew a girl’s hand felt like this.”","Pei Fengnong pushed him away, shielding Qiao Chuchu, his voice firm: “Don’t harass her!”","Ying Chen wasn’t fazed, rubbing the fingertips that had touched her, giving her a mock salute: “Yes, Your Honor.”","Qiao Chuchu: “......”","【From the start, it feels like I’m just playing house with them!】","She continued shaking hands, ruling out each suspect, finally zeroing in on Weisheng Huailing.","Weisheng Huailing stood obediently before her, his wet eyes gazing at her like a pitiful little creature.","Qiao Chuchu gripped his hand firmly!","Huailing flinched, his eyes reddening, looking at her plaintively.","His palm was burning.","Way too hot.","Qiao Chuchu frowned, looking up at him.","【Strange, Weisheng Huailing was the last one to approach me and is the most suspicious, but why is his body so hot?】","The others frowned, glancing at Weisheng Huailing.","Hot?"]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Wei Sheng Huai Ling: Anyway, I am very innocent","paragraphs":["Weisheng Huailing tearfully looked at Qiao Chuchu: \"The drone is actually mine, sister.\"","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback: \"Then why didn't you say so earlier?\"","\"I was afraid,\" Huailing bit his lower lip, looking pitiful. \"I was afraid you'd be mad at me.\"","He quickly gestured: \"This is actually something I use for work, but I didn't know why you got mad when you saw it, so I didn't dare to tell you.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned and asked in sign language: \"You use it for work?\"","Huailing nodded vigorously: \"This is the best micro drone on the market. I use it to gather intelligence, since I can't hear. I need this kind of thing to assist me, so I always carry it with me.\"","He lowered his eyes sadly: \"If I didn’t have these tools, I might die at any moment. I didn’t expect you to get mad when you saw the drone. My brothers actually know it's mine, but they didn't speak up for me, so I got more and more scared and didn't dare explain...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"......?\"","Biehe slowly frowned.","Lou Tingsi's face turned as black as coal.","Weisheng Lin's mouth fell open in disbelief, and he laughed in frustration: \"What the hell.\"","Ying Chen: \"... Can he really do this?\"","The others tilted their heads in confusion.","What was Weisheng Huailing signing?","They couldn't understand.","Weisheng Huailing shyly moved closer to Qiao Chuchu, gesturing carefully: \"Sister, I didn’t use this drone on you. Please believe me!\"","He grabbed her hand and gently swayed it: \"Sister, don’t be mad at me, okay?\"","Qiao Chuchu thought it over: \"So this drone is yours, but it's just a common model anyone can buy?\"","Huailing nodded.","Qiao Chuchu felt guilty: \"Oh dear, I... misunderstood you.\"","Huailing shook his head: \"The drone is indeed mine, so I can’t really say I was wronged.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt even guiltier: \"But I broke it, and you’re not even mad at me. I feel so bad.\"","She apologized: \"Sorry, Huailing. I saw this drone on my enemy before, and she used it to spy on me. So when I saw yours, I thought the one spying on me wasn’t her but you!\"","The Pei Family: \"?\"","How did this take a turn?","Pei Youchuan looked at Weisheng Wenzhan, confused, and whispered: \"What exactly did your brother say?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan's face was grim: \"He admitted the drone is his.\"","Pei Youchuan nodded: \"Well, that makes sense. It is his, after all.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan sneered: \"But he also said it's a common drone anyone can buy. We all knew it was his, but we didn’t speak up for him, so he got scared and didn’t dare admit it.\"","The Pei Family: \"???\"","Weisheng Huailing sniffled, looking more and more aggrieved as he seemed to be deep in thought, and then he started softly sobbing!","Everyone was thunderstruck!","He cried?!","He actually cried!!","Qiao Chuchu quickly wiped Weisheng Huailing’s tears, her hands moving like she was casting spells: \"I'm sorry, I'm sorry! I scared you, don’t cry, don’t cry. I’ll compensate you! I’ll pay for everything, including the loss of earnings!\"","She inwardly lamented: [I’m such an impulsive person, breaking someone else’s stuff without investigating properly.]","[But isn’t Weisheng Huailing a killer? How can a killer cry like this?]","[Isn’t he supposed to be a ruthless lone wolf who doesn’t bat an eye while taking lives?]","[How come the tears are falling like heavy rain now?!]","Huailing looked pathetic, took out his phone, typed something, and then played the audio.","A mechanical male voice calmly stated—","\"I don’t need sister to compensate me. As long as sister doesn’t misunderstand me.\"","\"Since I can’t speak, unlike my brothers, I’m clumsy and unsure of how to explain. I panicked a little, fearing that sister would be anxious if I didn’t make myself clear. That’s why I kept quiet for a while.\"","\"The only thing I feel bad about is... my brothers knew the truth but didn’t speak up for me. Being healthy, they probably have their reasons.\"","\"But I don’t blame them. I believe they had their reasons for not helping me explain. Sister, don’t be mad.\"","Pei Youchuan’s blood pressure surged, and he lunged at Weisheng Huailing with a flying kick: \"I'm gonna kick you so hard you’ll stick to the wall and no one can pry you off!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci held him back: \"Brother, don’t act rashly! If you lose your temper, you’ll fall right into his trap!\"","Pei Youchuan kicked in the air, roaring: \"Let me go! I’m gonna fight this melodramatic punk to the death!!\"","Weisheng Huailing, terrified, shrank into Qiao Chuchu’s embrace: \"Brother Pei is mad! Brother Pei is mad!\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned and looked at Pei Youchuan: \"Brother Pei, you scared him!\"","Pei Youchuan gasped, pointed at Weisheng Huailing, and stammered: \"Me?! I scared him?! The blood on his hands could fill rivers, and he’s acting! Qiao Chuchu! He’s acting!\"","Huailing buried his face in Qiao Chuchu’s neck, peeking at them as he raised an eyebrow and smirked.","Heh heh!","Pei Buxian’s eyes suddenly reddened as he charged forward, screaming: \"No one can take that position from me! No one is better at being a green tea than me! Weisheng! Get your ass down here!!\"","Pei Fengnong quickly grabbed Pei Buxian: \"Youngest brother, don’t lose it! Calm down, you can’t fall for his trick!\"","Pei Buxian’s eyes were bloodshot: \"I’d rather die than let him rest in peace!\"","Pei Che’s face darkened: \"Enough!!!\"","Everyone froze and looked at Pei Che in surprise.","Pei Che looked furious, glaring at his two younger brothers: \"After Huailing acted like this, are you going to keep screaming? You really disappoint me!\"","Pei Buxian and Pei Youchuan were stunned, thinking their brother had lost it: \"Second Brother—\"","\"Pei Che is right.\" Pei Yuan stepped forward to stabilize the situation: \"Huailing is timid, and we’re all friends. We should comfort him.\"","He looked at Weisheng Wenzhan: \"What do you think, Brother Wenzhan?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan, who had been solemn, gradually relaxed, his tone intriguing: \"Indeed. My younger brother looks so upset; we can’t just let him cozy up to a girl. That makes me look pretty cold as an older brother.\"","Biehe twirled his prayer beads, smirking: \"Only men truly understand men.\"","Weisheng Lin spread his hands, grinning: \"We’re the perfect people to comfort Weisheng Huailing!~\"","Pei Fengnong happily smiled, looking at Huailing with interest: \"What are we waiting for? Let’s take him away.\"","They all turned and looked towards Qiao Chuchu with sinister smiles.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt a chill: \"What are you planning?\"","Pei Fengnong moved past her and grabbed Huailing’s arm: \"Chuchu, this is none of your business. We need to give him some proper comfort.\"","Weisheng Huailing’s face darkened, and he prepared to strike back!","Weisheng Lin stepped in front of him, his face full of mockery, and gestured: \"Don’t move, Huailing. You’re so pitiful, it’s not your fate to fight~\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"!\"","Pei Mu maliciously laughed: \"Yeah, Huailing little brother. Have you ever heard of the entertainment industry? Seen how a celebrity’s persona crumbles? The consequences aren’t pretty, you know.\"","Weisheng Huailing: \"......\"","He clenched his teeth in fury, his face filled with resentment, then he turned back, looking pathetically at Qiao Chuchu.","Save me~","This is too scary~"]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Shen Zhuoyan","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu gestured for Huai Ling to relax and signed, \"What they're saying is right. They're boys, so they understand you better. I'm the one who's not quite there, since we have different genders, and there are some things I can't offer as much comfort for.\"","Huai Ling's face turned pale, shaking his head vehemently in response!","There's no such thing as \"inconvenient\"!","It's actually very convenient!","Please, by all means, be convenient with him!","Pei Youchuan promptly turned his head back around with a firm hand: \"Quit looking back. Life is about moving forward; that's where the meaning lies.\"","Pei Fengnong spoke with righteousness: \"Indeed, let's all race toward the passionate sunset together.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? But it's nighttime right now.\"","Pei Ci snorted disdainfully: \"Qiao Chuchu, shut up. You don't understand Weisheng Huailing's pain. It's buried deep within his heart, something that words can't express.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"He can't express it anyway—he's deaf and mute.\"","Pei Ci: \"? Are you the designated person for complaints here?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Ying Chen gave her a slight smile: \"Now close your eyes and feel Weisheng Huailing's pain with your heart.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【What kind of ridiculous method is this for sensing pain?】","But still, she closed her eyes: \"Let me be clear, I'm not very good at picking up on emotions. I can't feel what you're talking about. After all, you're not scratch-off lottery tickets—you can't expect me to guess what's on your mind. If you have something to say, just say it. Bottling it up will only lead to mastitis.\"","No one answered.","Qiao Chuchu opened her eyes: \"Huh?\"","The corridor was empty.","Uh?","Where did everyone go?","-","The next morning, Qiao Chuchu was on a flight back to the country, frequently glancing at Weisheng Huailing.","Weisheng Huailing's eyes were swollen red, and his lips were bruised.","It looked like he had been beaten, and not lightly.","Qiao Chuchu patted his shoulder: \"Have you been beaten, Huai Ling?\"","The others coldly glared at Huai Ling, their eyes filled with warnings.","Weisheng Huailing glared back at them resentfully, grinding his back teeth in dissatisfaction.","But he smiled at Qiao Chuchu: \"Don't worry about it, sister. This is my own issue. It's because I wasn't strong enough. When I become truly powerful one day, that's when I'll crush everyone!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","【Couldn't understand, but maybe that's what they mean by 'hot-bloodedness at sunset'】","She looked curiously at Ying Chen: \"Won't you be returning to M country?\"","Ying Chen, looking lazily at his tablet, raised his head briefly: \"There's a mole in my midst. Until the mole is rooted out, I won't return.\"","So he was planning to stay.","Waiting until his storyline arrived.","He leaned lazily, chin propped in his hand: \"My three-hundred-million-dollar offer to hire you remains valid. I hope you can help me uncover the mole. With my sixth sense, that three hundred million, and a bonus, I formally authorize you to protect me.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","She received a message from Lin Qing.","\"Chuchu! Your flight lands at seven PM local time. Feeling like hitting up the nightclub? I've got a few new hot male models I've signed to keep us company!\"","Qiao Chuchu paused, then replied, \"No thanks to the models, but count me in for hanging out.\"","Lin Qing: \"? Aren't you tired of our big bad villain? Wouldn't you like to refresh with some supermodel eye candy? They're super obedient, you know!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Lin Qing: \"No worries though! Whether you want them or not, I've invited Sister Yu Can too. You better come, and don't tell your brothers about it, nor dwell on it in your mind! Let's keep it a bit mysterious, shall we?\"","Qiao Chuchu's mouth twitched:【...... Not letting me think about it in my mind? What is this nonsense?】","Suddenly, the others turned their gaze toward her.","Pei Che narrowed his eyes: \"Got plans after landing?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, \"Yeah, I'm meeting Sister Lin Qing and Sister Yu Can at the nightclub.\"","Upon hearing this, the atmosphere on the plane immediately turned heavy.","Weisheng Biehe furrowed his brows, expressing his concern: \"Qiao Chuchu, my sister likes to party hard. You can't pick up her habits, you know.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt a bit embarrassed: \"Well, I definitely can't follow Sister Yu Can's lead there.\"","【Sister Yu Can is a magnet, drawing flocks of followers begging for her attention, embodying that bewitching charm of the leading lady in a romantic novel. I couldn't compare to that.】","Pei Youchuan leaned on his hand, the other tapping on the table, admonishing: \"And Lin Qing, now that she's off her engagement, parties hard too. Don't follow her lead either, got it?\"","Qiao Chuchu's stubborn streak flared: \"What if I don't?\"","Pei Youchuan smirked coldly, his tone growing darker: \"Then I'll...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"What will you do to me?\"","Pei Youchuan smiled enigmatically, his sharp canine teeth peeking out, creating an eerie effect: \"That's a secret.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? So you guys think I need less oversight, right? I'm an adult now.\"","The Pei family in unison: \"It's never happening. Give up that thought entirely.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","After landing, Qiao Chuchu had a series of one-on-one conversations with the men.","Everyone was heading to work and couldn't accompany her, so they all took turns talking to her, repeatedly reminding her and emphasizing the need to keep in touch over video calls before finally letting her leave.","Qiao Chuchu was left with a headache.","She could understand her brothers' concerns.","But what was with the Weisheng family getting involved and lecturing her multiple times?","Even Ying Chen and Lou Tingsi warned her not to let Sister Lin Qing and Sister Yu Can influence her.","Qiao Chuchu stepped out of the car, carrying the crocodile leather handbag she had Little Xie pick up, and entered Lan City's most prestigious nightclub, making her way to the VIP lounge on the second floor.","She felt a bit out of place as she walked through the corridor, sending a message to Lin Qing: \"I've arrived.\"","Several drunken young men leaning against the corridor walls spotted her, their eyes lighting up: \"Wow, this lady is pure-looking—can we exchange WeChats?\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored them, stepping around them to continue walking.","One of the men grabbed her shoulder: \"Hold on a moment~ Why so cold?\"","Qiao Chuchu executed a swift judo throw, sending him flying!","The man, unprepared, hit the ground hard, groaning in pain: \"Oww, damn!\"","She stood over him, expression stern: \"People on the second floor are only here because they're either rich or well-connected. We're equally matched in status, so don't harass me!\"","The man glared back at her, his eyes burning with rage as he got up, prepared to strike: \"You dirty whore!\"","Lin Qing: \"Chuchu!\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up.","Lin Qing rushed to her side, her breath carrying the faint scent of alcohol, her gaze dropping to the man on the ground. Her smile instantly cooled: \"What? Did he bother you?\"","The man's face paled: \"Oh? Sister Lin Qing?!\"","Lin Qing narrowed her eyes, sneering down at him: \"So, what did you do to my little sister?\"","\"N-nothing at all!\" The man stammered, bowing repeatedly to Qiao Chuchu: \"I apologize, sister, I was wrong, I'll leave now!\"","With a glance to his buddies, he turned and bolted.","Lin Qing coldly watched the men flee, scoffing: \"First time here, huh? That's why they don't know you. Don't take it to heart— they're like this, booze up and think they're invincible.\"","Qiao Chuchu shook her head: \"I'm not mad. I gave him a beating, so if anyone's in pain, it's him, not me.\"","Lin Qing paused, then laughed, gently pinching Qiao Chuchu's cheek: \"That's my girl—so tough. Alright, let's go. Sister Yu Can and I even saved a few male models for you!\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes widened in horror: \"I don't want the male models! I'll just join you for a chat!\"","Lin Qing, however, wouldn't take no for an answer, pulling Qiao Chuchu close, her arm around her waist affectionately: \"Don't worry, we'll keep it a secret from those men. I get it, babe~\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"???\"","【What does she 'get'?! Clearly, she doesn't understand at all!】","As she walked shoulder to shoulder with Lin Qing, she happened to glance into a nearby lounge.","A man dressed as a waiter stood rigidly behind a coffee table.","A rotund man pointed a bottle at him: \"Drink it all! One bottle, a thousand bucks!\"","Qiao Chuchu stopped in her tracks, her feet seemingly glued to the floor, her gaze piercing through the gap, watching the man.","The dimly lit room made it hard to see his face clearly, but she could vaguely tell it was a handsome man.","Who also felt oddly... familiar.","The rotund man thrust the bottle into the man's hands: \"Shen Zhuoyan, aren't you broke? Drink it all, and I'll pay you— as much as you can chug!!\"","Qiao Chuchu's face changed.","Shen Zhuoyan?!","The one who went to prison—Shen Zhuoyan?! Has he been released?","Lin Qing noticed Qiao Chuchu's hesitation, her tone curious: \"What's wrong?\"","Qiao Chuchu was shocked and lowered her voice as she said, \"The waiter inside seems to be Shen Zhuoyan, my deskmate from high school!\"","Lin Qing was stunned, her eyes widening immediately. \"Is it that Shen Zhuoyan who killed his own father, avenged his mother, spent years in prison, and was expelled from the Shen family registry?!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded vigorously. \"Yes, yes, that's him!\"","She poked her head around. \"He seems to be in trouble.\"","Lin Qing's eyes lit up. \"You want to help him?\"","\"Yeah,\" Qiao Chuchu scratched her head. \"After all, we were deskmates for two years. He even called me before turning himself in, telling me he was going to jail.\"","Lin Qing chuckled. \"Oh~ Then go ahead!\"","She pushed the door open directly!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","The people inside were startled and looked at her in surprise.","The pot-bellied man furrowed his brows, about to curse, \"Who the hell—eh? Are you Miss Qiao? Are you the eighth daughter of the Pei Family??\"","Shen Zhuoyan's body trembled as he looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu stood at the door, awkwardly gazing at him.","In the dim private room, only faint light fell on Shen Zhuoyan.","His features were hard to make out, but those cold, phoenix-like eyes hidden behind his bangs were fixed on her, just as they had been during their school days.","It might have just been Qiao Chuchu's imagination.","She felt that there were glimmering tears in his eyes.","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth, but before she could speak, Shen Zhuoyan suddenly lowered his head and brushed past her, rushing out in a hurry!","She exclaimed in surprise, \"Shen Zhuoyan!\"","Shen Zhuoyan paused for a moment.","Qiao Chuchu tentatively said, \"Shen Zhuoyan, do you remember me? I'm Qiao Chu.\"","Shen Zhuoyan's back was so straight that it seemed rigid, his body trembling slightly. His angular face turned slightly. \"I am not Shen Zhuoyan.\"","It seemed he wanted to look at her, but for some reason, he didn't turn back.","\"You must have mistaken me, ma'am.\""]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Xia Xuechun, Believe It or Not, I'll Make You Walk Hand in Hand with Your Two Daddies","paragraphs":["After Shen Zhuoyan spoke, he didn't wait for Qiao Chuchu to say anything and quickly departed in a hurry.","Qiao Chuchu stood puzzled in her place, while Lin Qing chuckled, \"Alright, we've helped him get out of trouble, no need to worry about it.\"","\"But—\" Qiao Chuchu hesitated, \"Why didn't he acknowledge me? He didn't talk to me like that before he went to prison.\"","When Shen Zhuoyan was in school, he was indifferent to everyone, as if devoid of emotions, but we were at least desk mates for two years. He treated me fairly well, and before turning himself in, he only called me. I've checked with others; none of them received a call from Shen Zhuoyan.","As Lin Qing listened, her expression grew increasingly ambiguous. She gently patted Qiao Chuchu on the shoulder, comforting her with a smile, \"Don't worry. If he truly considers you a friend, he'll show up in front of you again.\"","-","Shen Zhuoyan leaned his hands on the sink and looked at himself in the mirror.","His eyes were bloodshot, with dark circles under them, evidence of years of poor sleep, making him look both grim and haggard.","But just this fact alone was vastly different from the spirited young man he once was.","Utterly different.","He clenched his teeth in restraint and slowly tightened his fists.","His phone vibrated faintly.","Shen Zhuoyan opened his phone, viewed the content, and frowned in confusion before putting it away and walking out of the shop.","Xia Xuechun stood outside the nightclub, and as soon as she saw him, she joyfully ran over, \"Shen Zhuoyan!\"","Shen Zhuoyan raised his hand to signal her to stop, maintaining a distance of one step between them, \"Miss Xia, I've already told your father, I'll pay the rent as soon as I get my salary. If you're in a hurry, I don't have it right now.\"","Xia Xuechun was momentarily stunned but then broke into a bright smile, \"I'm not here for the rent. I came to show you something~\"","She turned sideways, revealing a Mercedes-Benz sedan, \"Look, this is my car. I have a car now~\"","Shen Zhuoyan frowned, \"Did you buy it?\"","\"Brother Long Yuntian bought it for me,\" Xia Xuechun purred in a flirtatious tone, \"He got really upset when he heard that Brother Long Yunxiao took me to F country. He insisted on buying me a car to make him happy, so now I have a Benz!\"","Xia Xuechun pointed proudly at the new car with its red ribbons, \"How is it, pretty, right?\"","Shen Zhuoyan narrowed his eyes, looking at the car’s sleek lines, his eyes gradually filling with ridicule, \"Miss Xia, you do know that this is marital property, and Long Yuntian's wife has the right to reclaim it, right?\"","Xia Xuechun didn't understand, \"Why would my sister-in-law take it back? She doesn't even know.\"","Shen Zhuoyan sneered, \"Never mind.\"","He turned to leave, \"I have to go to work.\"","\"Wait, wait, explain it to me.\" Xia Xuechun blocked his path, her smile already gone, \"Do you think I'm a mistress?\"","Shen Zhuoyan looked down at her, his tone calm but unmistakably sarcastic, \"Both Brother Long and Brother Long have wives and kids, yet they buy you cars, clothes, bags, and take you abroad. Isn't the implication obvious to everyone?\"","The more he thought about it, the more disgusted he became, and his tone grew sarcastic, \"Congratulations on hooking up with a big shot, but you don't need to tell me about such things in the future.\"","Xia Xuechun suddenly slapped him, \"Smack!!\"","Shen Zhuoyan was caught off guard, a fiery pain instantly erupting on his cheek.","His anger shot up, and he snapped, \"What are you doing?!\"","Xia Xuechun trembled at his outburst, tears welling up as she retorted, \"You insulted me! I’m just sister-in-law bonds with them! We stayed in a presidential suite in F country, and Brother Long was very polite, knew his boundaries, and didn't cross any lines. Nothing happened!\"","The more she spoke, the more wronged she felt, \"Others misunderstand me, but you too?\"","Shen Zhuoyan only grew more sarcastic at her words, \"What if I misunderstood you? What makes me so special in your eyes?\"","Xia Xuechun widened her eyes, evidently not expecting him to say that. Tears rolled down her cheeks, and she looked utterly wronged.","Shen Zhuoyan showed no pity, coldly asking, \"Or is it that you like me?\"","Xia Xuechun went still, as if her heart had been pierced, her face slowly reddening.","Shen Zhuoyan chuckled, \"People like you, doing morally bankrupt things, yet you like to wrap yourselves in highfalutin excuses. People like you are the purest in the world.\"","He said coldly, \"I won't be renting from you anymore. Tell your father to find a new tenant.\"","As he walked past Xia Xuechun, he seemed to recall something and taunted, \"Your shoes are made of pure calfskin, suitable only for red carpets and smooth floors. They can't get wet. Once they do, they're ruined. Didn't you know that?\"","Xia Xuechun was taken aback, only to realize that she had stepped in a small puddle.","She jumped out with surprise and looked at her shoe's sole, frowning in distress, \"This, this shoe is so expensive! How can it not even get wet?!\"","Shen Zhuoyan sneered, \"Ask your daddy to buy you another pair, since you have two daddies.\"","Xia Xuechun gasped, her face flushing as she retorted, \"I bought this with my own money!\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","The price of these shoes was at least two to three thousand dollars, bought with her own money?","Xia Xuechun defiantly raised her chin, \"I've started painting now; I sold a painting for ten thousand yuan!\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"? Are you an art major?\"","\"No,\" Xia Xuechun boasted, \"But Brother Long says I have talent, so he let me paint, and I sold my first painting right away. Now his friends are all pre-ordering from me, saying they'll buy anything I paint. I'm already self-reliant!\"","Shen Zhuoyan was momentarily stunned, then laughed in disbelief, \"Ha!\"","Xia Xuechun felt confused, \"What are you laughing at? Do you even look down on me for that?\"","Shen Zhuoyan shook his head with mockery, his tone meaningful, \"Some people are just indulging you because they want connections, yet you believe it's your own talent.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"? You can't deny that I'm really capable, right? I know someone who draws comics and earns twenty thousand yuan a month. I earned twenty thousand today alone, and I plan to keep painting late into the night, aiming to earn a million!\"","Shen Zhuoyan wasn't interested and turned to leave.","Xia Xuechun muttered discontentedly, \"Cheeky Qiao Chuchu, I'll step on her head one day!\"","Shen Zhuoyan stopped, suddenly turning back, \"What did you say?\"","Xia Xuechun snorted and cutely said, \"I know someone, she's in the art circle, draws comics, and earns twenty thousand yuan a month. She's not even as good as me; I just entered the art circle and already earned twenty thousand, surpassing her is a piece of cake.\"","Shen Zhuoyan became wary, \"The Qiao Chu you mentioned, does she have seven brothers? Her brothers are surnamed Pei?\"","\"Yes,\" Xia Xuechun nodded, hesitating as she looked at him, \"But isn't her name Qiao Chuchu?\"","\"No, she's just called Qiao Chu.\"","Shen Zhuoyan's expression darkened, his voice grim, \"Qiao Chu's first exhibition, the cheapest painting sold for two million yuan. Many prominent masters were full of praise for her; her talent in painting is renowned. You, with your connections, want to compare with her? You're nothing.\"","Xia Xuechun was caught off guard, extremely surprised, \"You... you know Qiao Chuchu?\"","\"I do.\" Shen Zhuoyan bent down, his gaze fierce as he stared at her, \"I hate women who are mistresses and men who cheat more than anything. So, you better watch it. If I find out you're causing trouble for Qiao Chu, I won't mind sending you and your daddies to meet their maker.\"","He raised three fingers, \"You have two daddies, so three of you can go hand in hand.\""]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Wei Shengyucan: Let Me Add Some Fuel to Shen Zhuoyan","paragraphs":["Xia Xuechun was so startled that her breathing quickened: \"You... how can you say that...\"","Shen Zhuoyan exuded an aura of lethal danger: \"Xia Xuechun, don't put on an act of being pitiful in front of me. I'm not easy to deal with, and I'm not blind.\"","Xia Xuechun regretfully took a few steps back, her face pale.","Shen Zhuoyan let out a cold humph and walked into the nightclub.","The manager hurried to him with urgency: \"I've been looking for you for half a day. Why didn't you pick up your phone?\"","He was visibly irritated: \"Got held up by something. What's the matter?\"","The manager rolled his eyes in frustration: \"VIP Suite 1 specifically requested you to deliver the drinks.\"","Shen Zhuoyan nodded, ready to go.","The manager grabbed him, sternly warning: \"Listen here. VIP Suite 1 is VVVIP! You better not mess with them! If it weren't for your handsome face and the wealthy ladies who come to see you, I would have fired you long ago!\"","Shen Zhuoyan remained unaffected, his expression cold: \"I'm here to deliver drinks, not to entertain. If they insist on me entertaining, I won't do it.\"","The manager: \"?! You're really a stubborn mule. Do you know how much money your face could make if you just loosened up a bit?\"","Shen Zhuoyan ignored him and carried the drinks up to the second floor.","As soon as he set foot on the second floor, his steps faltered.","Qiao Chuchu was here.","In one of the rooms.","He slowed his pace, passing each room, his gaze slowly moving over the doors, until he reached VIP Suite 1.","He slowly pushed open the door, and several beautiful people greeted his eyes.","Handsome men surrounded a seductive woman.","The woman smoked lazily, giving them a languid smile. Noticing him, she exclaimed with delight: \"Oh! You're here.\"","He frowned slightly, feeling repulsed, then turned his gaze to the center.","A short-haired beauty sat between two strikingly different handsome men, interestingly eyeing him: \"Sweeties, our drinks have arrived!\"","The men cheered: \"Yay!!\"","He placed the drinks on the table, his gaze sweeping to the side.","A pair of immaculate, exquisite black boots came into view, neatly placed side by side.","Almost on a whim, he looked up, his eyes widening in astonishment.","Qiao Chuchu sat on the edge of the sofa, her hands nervously clasped between her legs, her body tense.","To her left was a spectacle of handsome men fawning over beautiful women.","And she herself seemed out of place in this scene, looking like a child who had wandered into an adult's domain, her bewildered eyes meeting his, also pausing in surprise.","Shen Zhuoyan stared at her in a daze.","Qiao Chuchu's eyebrows and eyes gradually lit up with joy: \"Shen Zhuoyan?\"","Lin Qing smiled, whispering softly to Weisheng Yucan: \"This is the man I mentioned earlier.\"","Yucan nodded, sizing up Shen Zhuoyan: \"He's not bad. Good face, good physique. He's a good seed.\"","Lin Qing responded indifferently: \"Yes, all the handsome guys around our sister are top-notch.\"","Qiao Chuchu joyfully said to Shen Zhuoyan: \"Shen Zhuoyan, why didn’t you call me after getting out of jail? My phone number hasn’t changed!\"","Shen Zhuoyan snapped back to reality, his face stern: \"I'm not Shen Zhuoyan.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Why does he keep saying he's not Shen Zhuoyan? I'm not blind.]","Shen Zhuoyan was startled, shaking his head, giving Qiao Chuchu a strange look.","Lin Qing and Weisheng Yucan noticed this detail and understood.","This guy can hear people's thoughts.","Lin Qing leaned closer to Weisheng Yucan, whispering in her ear: \"He probably couldn't hear before. Qiao Chuchu said a lot in her mind when she saw him, but he didn't react. Why can he hear her thoughts all of a sudden?\"","Yucan exhaled smoke, playfully eyeing Shen Zhuoyan: \"Maybe something triggered him when he went out earlier?\"","Lin Qing paused, then joked: \"Could it be that when he first appeared, he was on the fence, possibly aligned with Xia Xuechun, but then he was reassigned to our side when the heavens decided his side, so now he can hear her thoughts?\"","Weisheng Yucan laughed heartily: \"You might be onto something there.\"","Lin Qing studied Shen Zhuoyan carefully, teasing: \"Too bad this good seed is too rigid, like a dried-up stick.\"","\"Don't worry,\" Weisheng Yucan said confidently, blowing out a puff of smoke, \"Let me light a fire here.\"","She leaned close to a man next to her, whispering something.","Lin Qing's eyes lit up with mischief: \"Got it, Sister Yucan.\"","Here, Qiao Chuchu was still puzzled, looking at Shen Zhuoyan: \"We haven't had any conflict, so why don't you acknowledge me? You’re clearly Shen Zhuoyan.\"","Shen Zhuoyan lowered his eyelashes, his tone flat, mechanical: \"You’re mistaken, ma'am.\"","Qiao Chuchu opened her mouth, about to respond. But suddenly, someone else sat down next to her: \"Miss Qiao.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","The male model had deeply captivating eyes, gazing at Qiao Chuchu gently: \"Allow me to keep you company with a drink.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?\"","He became tense, staring at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu awkwardly waved her hands: \"I'm sorry, but I don’t drink.\"","\"It's alright,\" the male model said, picking up a glass, pouring her a glass of orange juice, and handing it to her. \"You can have orange juice, while I have the drink. Please don't be prejudiced against me. If you’re all alone here, it makes you seem... lonely. I don’t wish to see you sad.\"","He blinked at Qiao Chuchu: \"May I keep you company?\"","Qiao Chuchu felt pressured, accepting the orange juice: \"Uh...\"","[Lin Qing is truly Lin Qing. She finds such handsome guys who are both beautiful and talkative. Though, I don't like that.]","Lin Qing smugly smiled, taking this praise without hesitation.","Her standards were strict for the artists and models under her management.","Whether male or female, they had to meet the requirement of being impeccable, head to toe, for her to invest resources into making them popular.","Lin Qing gazed at Shen Zhuoyan standing in front of Qiao Chuchu: \"That waiter, you can leave now.\"","Shen Zhuoyan’s gaze was intense, fixed on Qiao Chuchu and the male model, his brows furrowed, not responding.","Lin Qing: \"Excuse me? Waiter?\"","Shen Zhuoyan clenched his teeth, his eyes still locked on Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Yucan chuckled, then raised her voice: \"Hey!\"","Shen Zhuoyan suddenly snapped back to attention, reflexively looking at Weisheng Yucan: \"What can I do for you?\"","Weisheng Yucan crossed her legs, holding a wine glass with a smile towards him: \"You can leave now. Nothing for you to do here.\"","Shen Zhuoyan paused, then looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu was already entangled with the male model.","The male model picked up his phone, intimately leaning closer: \"Are you a painter, Miss?\"","Qiao Chuchu pushed aside in aversion: \"No, I just draw comics.\"","The male model smiled keenly: \"Then, Miss, would you kindly help me check my commissioned drawing? I feel it hasn’t turned out right~\"","Mentioning her drawing, Qiao Chuchu's spirits were lifted: \"Ok.\"","The male model handed her his phone: \"I asked someone to draw my avatar, but I feel it makes me look odd. I turned out uglier, sorry to say. What can be done to make this better, do you think?\"","Qiao Chuchu took the phone, enlarging the image to examine: \"How much was this commission?\"","The male model subtly inched closer, placing his slender fingers on the couch behind her waist: \"I commissioned it for two thousand yuan, waited for three months, but the result just isn't satisfactory. Could you help me alter it, Miss?\"","Shen Zhuoyan stood before them.","The male model’s hand thought he was a snake, creeping slowly towards Qiao Chuchu's leg.","His chest heaved rapidly, his jet-black eyes burning with fiery intensity. As the male model's hand was about to reach Qiao Chuchu, he shoved the male model aside in one move and sat next to Qiao Chuchu!","The male model: \"!\"","Lin Qing: \"?\"","Weisheng Yucan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\""]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Shen Zhuoyan and Qiao Chu's Names Will Always Be Together","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at Shen Zhuoyan.","Shen Zhuoyan sat upright, sandwiched between her and the male model, his handsome face frosted with iciness. \"I'm sorry for lying to you, Qiao Chu.\"","He looked at her as he did in school, cold and awkward, his eyes reflecting emotions she couldn't decipher.","\"I am indeed Shen Zhuoyan.\"","Qiao Chuchu was momentarily stunned, a sense of relief washing over her as if an old friend had reunited after a long separation. \"You've finally admitted it. I've been wondering why you were lying.\"","But then she felt puzzled. \"But why did you admit it now?\"","Shen Zhuoyan's face was stern as he shot a dark glare at the model. \"I didn't expect there to be so many men around you.\"","Qiao Chuchu chuckled in disbelief. \"These men aren't mine.\"","Lin Qing muttered quietly on the other side, \"True, the men here aren't hers, but there are men elsewhere who are.\"","Weisheng Yucan couldn't hold back her laughter and snapped her fingers at the male model.","The model scurried back to her side, flattering her in a hushed voice. \"Sister, did I do well?\"","Yucan ruffled his hair and glanced at the two others whose atmosphere was distinctly out of place. \"See, I said a little spark would ignite it, and here we are.\"","Lin Qing raised a thumb. \"Yucan, you're a pro! But won't your brother be angry?\"","Weisheng Yucan took a drag, dismissive. \"I don't care about Huai Ling. I just enjoy seeing talented girls surrounded by men playing petty tricks. I can't stand a woman orbiting a single man and chasing mistresses around the globe.\"","She shot a glance at Shen Zhuoyan. \"Most importantly, this guy looks like the kind who gets things done quietly.\"","Shen Zhuoyan sat close to Qiao Chuchu, his posture rigid, his gaze flicking to her hand.","For a moment, he seemed transported back to the classroom, watching Qiao Chuchu by the window, enjoying the spring breeze, doodling while spinning a pen.","Back then, she had her hair in a high ponytail, always smiling at him. \"Shen Zhuoyan, have you finished your homework? Can I copy it? I'll buy you milk tea.\"","In truth, he didn't like doing homework.","He didn't care for studying.","But he wanted Qiao Chuchu to copy his homework.","Only his.","Every day, he studied diligently, completing his homework first, his grades soaring.","When he became class monitor, Qiao Chuchu won the Best Creativity Award at a painting competition held in M Country.","Her artwork always hung in the prime spot of the school gallery.","His photo was always at the top of the honors list for the same cohort.","Shen Zhuoyan and Qiao Chu's names were forever linked.","Until he was imprisoned.","Shen Zhuoyan's face darkened, sitting silently beside Qiao Chuchu.","She listened to the laughter on the other side, feeling awkward herself.","She really didn't know what to say.","They had been classmates for two years, but the most they ever talked was the day Shen Zhuoyan turned himself in.","She remembered it clearly.","That day, Shen Zhuoyan suddenly took leave from school, and everyone said his mother had committed suicide.","He rushed out of the school gate in panic and never returned.","Later, she received a call from Shen Zhuoyan.","The young man's breath was heavy, trembling. \"Qiao Chu... my mother is dead.\"","Shen Zhuoyan told her, \"That despicable man and woman pushed my mother to her death. I made those two scoundrels pay back in kind. From now on, I can't attend classes with you.\"","\"I'm turning myself in right away. Can you promise me one thing?\"","His voice, low and hoarse, choked with emotion.","\"No matter what, please don't forget me.\"","Qiao Chuchu came to her senses, looking cautiously at Shen Zhuoyan.","The dim light made his face hard to see.","But his presence was cold, like a guardian deity, lost in thought.","[Back then, he told me over the phone to not forget him, and now that he's met me, he pretends not to recognize me. Why?]","Shen Zhuoyan's eyelid twitched, his gaze snapping to her in shock.","Qiao Chuchu blinked, giving an awkward smile. \"Hehehe...\"","[Why are you looking at me? Why are you looking at me without speaking?]","Shen Zhuoyan: \"???\"","Qiao Chuchu felt something was off, her gaze on him becoming more and more suspicious.","Her phone suddenly vibrated.","Opening it, she saw a message from a long-lost high school classmate: \"OMG babe, a new painter named Xue Er has emerged, and her paintings are incredibly similar to yours from high school~\"","The classmate sent a photo.","Qiao Chuchu clicked on the photo, her expression changing drastically!","The painting wasn't just similar—the composition and details were almost identical to one she had done in high school!","And there were signs of AI manipulation.","It seemed her painting had been fed into an AI, then slightly altered.","Her anger flared as she stormed out of the room, typing a reply to her classmate: \"Where did you see this?\"","\"Dragon Family's Long Yunxiao is promoting a little painter named Xia Xuechun. I saw it and thought the style was too similar to yours. She's selling them for at least ten thousand each.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Xia Xuechun?\"","[Why is Xia Xuechun painting now? In her character profile, wasn't she supposed to be the useless damsel in distress?]","Shen Zhuoyan stepped outside, silently standing behind her.","The more Qiao Chuchu thought about it, the more absurd it seemed. She dialed Xia Xuechun's number.","As the call connected, she pressed the record button and got straight to the point. \"Xia Xuechun, I saw your paintings. Did you feed mine into an AI and then tweak it to sell for profit?\"","On the other end, Xia Xuechun was momentarily stunned, pulling her car to the side of the road, her voice taut. \"What evidence do you have that I modified your painting?\"","Qiao Chuchu scoffed. \"I have the original painting, photos of it hanging in the school gallery, and even magazine clippings from when I won the award! I don't care if you paint, and I can't stop you from studying and taking inspiration. But you can't just take mine and modify it. That's plagiarism.\"","Xia Xuechun shivered, her grip on the steering wheel tightening.","Qiao Chuchu's tone grew even colder. \"Stop now. If I find out you're selling or promoting this painting, I'll make sure this scandal blows up. Ads everywhere, non-stop trending on Douyin, letting everyone know you're a thief who steals other people's work.\"","Xia Xuechun shivered, her voice dripping with mockery. \"Fine, I won't let that painting appear again. But let me tell you, Qiao Chuchu, back then you humiliated me, paying me a measly fifty thousand a month, treating me like a beggar. You'll get your karma.\"","Sitting in her car, gazing at the Mercedes logo, Xia Xuechun's tone was filled with delight. \"Now, I've changed. I can sell a painting for ten thousand with ease. It's just a matter of time before I surpass you. I can already see my brighter future ahead of yours.\"","With that, Xia Xuechun hung up the phone.","Qiao Chuchu smirked in anger, wanting to call back and lash out, but scenes flashed through her mind.","She saw Xia Xuechun's rise, admired by a big shot, propelling her obscure art to stardom.","But she didn't know why she had offended that big shot, causing even Weisheng Yucan to be implicated. The situation began to shift.","Her brothers met with unexpected deaths one by one.","The Wei Sheng Family started experiencing fatalities as well.","Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue died in a murder.","Lin Qing was raped and killed, found dead in the streets.","The Lin Family went bankrupt, and Lin Shen passed away.","And she was strapped to a psychiatric hospital bed, her limbs bound, held captive by Xia Xuechun's people.","The Dragon Family father and son stood by her bedside, smirking.","Xia Xuechun, wearing a massive diamond ring, smiled brightly. \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm about to marry Ji Yanchuan. You must feel so lonely without your brothers around, huh? Let my two brothers come take care of you. I guarantee they'll be very loving!\""]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: Chairman, Look, Your Sister and Her Handsome Boyfriend","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her daze, her gaze gradually clearing as she let out a sardonic laugh.","【Looks like the plot has changed completely.】","【The one who died is no longer me, but everyone around me is dead, leaving only me. Xia Xuechun has locked me up in a mental asylum and even arranged a few people to stand by my bed. I guess she's hoping to drive me insane.】","Qiao Chuchu's eyes darkened with malice, but she wasn't in a hurry.","【I've really grown. In the past, when I saw the future, I would get angry and anxious, but now I'm calm.】","She proudly placed her hands on her hips: 【Guess listening to \"Queen\" wasn't in vain! Full of confidence!】","Qiao Chuchu then furrowed her brows: \"But where is that pivotal big shot? What exactly did I do to offend him, and why did I even drag Yu Can into this?\"","She couldn't figure it out and turned around, bumping straight into Shen Zhuoyan.","Qiao Chuchu jumped in fright, clutching her chest: \"When did you appear behind me?\"","Like a ghost.","Shen Zhuoyan stared at her expressionlessly, not answering but instead asking, \"Qiao Chuchu, do you know Xia Xuechun?\"","At the mention of the three words, Qiao Chuchu felt a chill run down her spine: \"Of course, I know her.\"","【Not only do I know her, but from the looks of it, Xia Xuechun is the mastermind behind locking me up in a mental asylum in the future.】","Shen Zhuoyan's face darkened, his tone cool: \"I understand.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","He understands?","What does he understand?","Shen Zhuoyan turned and left: \"I'm going to find Xia Xuechun.\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, following behind him in confusion: \"What are you going to do?\"","Shen Zhuoyan ignored her, picking up his phone to call Xia Xuechun: \"Come back to me.\"","On the other end of the line, Xia Xuechun sounded a bit surprised: \"Luckily, I haven't gone far yet. Have you regretted arguing with me?\"","Shen Zhuoyan didn't respond, hanging up the call and heading toward the entrance of the nightclub.","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled: \"Shen Zhuoyan, what exactly are you doing?\"","Shen Zhuoyan didn't answer her, his gaze fixed on the passing vehicles.","Xia Xuechun's Mercedes stopped in front of him.","His eyes darkened as he fished something out of his pocket and walked straight toward Xia Xuechun.","Unaware of the danger, Xia Xuechun stepped out of the driver's seat: \"Shen Zhuoyan!\"","Shen Zhuoyan's face was grim as he quickened his pace. As he approached Xia Xuechun, his eyes filled with killing intent, ready to strike when suddenly a car flashed by and slammed into him, sending him flying!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu rushed to Shen Zhuoyan's side, carefully inspecting him.","She was deeply shocked: 【Shen Zhuoyan didn't even touch Xia Xuechun before he got mowed down?】","【I was scared to death, thinking he had something big planned, but it turned out to be a dud!】","Shen Zhuoyan: \"......\"","Qiao Chuchu crouched down with concern: \"How are you? Can you move?\"","Shen Zhuoyan lay on the ground, his head spinning: \"I don't know, but I think I'm fine...\"","The car that hit Shen Zhuoyan sped off!","Qiao Chuchu angrily watched the car disappear: \"Damn! I'm calling the police right now! He must have been drunk driving!\"","Shen Zhuoyan's head throbbed with pain, and he didn't respond.","It was strange.","Just as he was about to make his move, that car seemed to deliberately drive over, preventing him from acting.","Qiao Chuchu also felt something was off.","【I don't know if it's just my imagination, but I feel like Shen Zhuoyan was about to attack Xia Xuechun, so the luck forcefully protected her.】","She picked up her phone: \"I'm calling an ambulance to take you to my brother's hospital, so you can get checked right away.\"","No, it's too expensive,\" Shen Zhuoyan changed his expression and deliberately tried to snatch her phone: \"It's too much, I'm fine.\"","Qiao Chuchu dodged: \"I'll pay, don't move!\"","Shen Zhuoyan paused, staring at her in astonishment.","Soon, the ambulance arrived.","She helped Shen Zhuoyan into the ambulance.","Xia Xuechun also wanted to follow, but seeing Shen Zhuoyan with Qiao Chuchu, she gritted her teeth and stayed put.","Once they reached the hospital, Qiao Chuchu immediately took Shen Zhuoyan for a check-up.","Shen Zhuoyan kept trying to get up from the hospital bed, worried: \"Qiao Chuchu, I'm fine, I'm good, this is too expensive.\"","\"Good for what? We need to check to see if there's any internal damage,\" Qiao Chuchu pressed him back down, her expression serious: \"You just got out of prison, you have to cherish your life.\"","Shen Zhuoyan was struck with a look of daze, his gaze falling on Qiao Chuchu's hand holding him down on the bed.","Her hand that used to rest on a desk.","Now so close to him.","Close enough to see the texture on the back of her hand.","He looked into Qiao Chuchu's anxious furrowed brow, finding it hard to look away.","Pei Che, in his white coat, walked out from the other side, speaking to his assistant: \"There were no issues at the hospital these past two days while I was gone, right?\"","The assistant shook his head: \"No issues, you can rest assured.\"","As they spoke, the assistant inadvertently glanced toward the radiology department and exclaimed in surprise: \"Oh, it's Miss Qiao!\"","The assistant pointed at Qiao Chuchu in the corridor: \"Look, Chairman. It's your sister and her boyfriend, apparently!\"","Pei Che: \"?\""]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: I Can Be Your Most Loyal Dog by Your Side","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu stood by Shen Zhuoyan's hospital bed, waiting until the CT room doors slowly opened. She then pushed the bed inside.","Pei Che stood at a distance, watching quietly.","After a while, Qiao Chuchu came out and picked up her phone to make a call.","Pei Che tilted his head, listening closely.","\"Sister Lin Qing, something unexpected happened here, and I can't make it... Yes, it's about Shen Zhuoyan. He got hit by a car, and I'm at my second brother's hospital for checkups.\"","\"I'm not injured, don't worry!\"","\"Oh, by the way, I bought bags for both you and Sister Yu Can, one for each of you. I forgot to give them to you earlier at the nightclub. The bags are on the sofa, go ahead and take a look! It's a New Year's gift for you!\"","\"Really?~ I'm glad you both like them. I'll stay here a bit longer to accompany him for the checkups!\"","After hanging up, Qiao Chuchu leaned against the wall.","[Should I call my second brother to inform him?]","[No, better not. My second brother isn't idle. If I tell him, he might come over, and that would be troublesome.]","Pei Che showed no expression, his gaze locked onto Qiao Chuchu's profile.","An hour earlier, they had returned home to rest, but Pei Ci had suddenly called an urgent family meeting.","Pei Ci leaned on the dining table, speaking with a sarcastic tone: \"I'm honored to inform everyone that the reason I beat Pei Buxian was because he confessed to Qiao Chuchu!\"","All the brothers looked shocked, turning toward Pei Buxian.","Pei Buxian held his dog, the secret abruptly exposed, but he remained calm: \"It's fine, I managed to spin the confession, so the good news is she didn’t notice, and the bad news is she thinks I'm mentally unwell.\"","Pei Ci slammed the table: \"Is this about whether she noticed or not?!\"","Pei Buxian stood up, his voice cold as he retorted: \"If she didn't notice, then there's no problem.\"","Pei Ci was seething: \"If you had really confessed, have you thought about what kind of family life we would have? You're too selfish!\"","Pei Buxian sneered: \"Pei Ci, stop being hypocritical. Three years ago, you had a physical reaction to your own sister, yet you're lecturing me?\"","Enraged, Pei Ci threw a glass against the wall: \"Yes, I was aroused, but so what? Can't I get aroused by a woman I like? Did I press her against a wall and kiss her like you did?!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"? Where did he kiss her?!\"","Pei Youchuan let out a laugh, finding it absurd: \"Well, this day has finally arrived, just as I imagined, insane.\"","Pei Che rested his chin on his hand, looking like a lazy cat observing his brothers quarrel.","Pei Fengnong clenched his teeth, glaring at the two younger brothers: \"Listen, if you're going crazy, go to the mental hospital. How can you even say such things?\"","Pei Mu chimed in sarcastically: \"What’s wrong with saying it? We're already at this stage, it's just a matter of time.\"","He sneered: \"Anyone who wants to back out, leave the table now. Just pretend this never happened.\"","The words fell, and none of the brothers left their seats.","Pei Buxian patted his chair: \"I'm sticking to this chair today! I won't leave!\"","Pei Ci, unwilling to back down, sat back: \"You stay, so will I!\"","Pei Buxian sneered at him: \"Weren't you against these kinds of things?\"","Pei Ci gritted his teeth, challenging Pei Buxian: \"I can adapt, can't I?\"","Pei Fengnong felt a pain in his stomach: \"Brother, say something.\"","The other brothers, hearing this, turned their eyes to Pei Yuan, seated at the head of the table.","From the beginning, Pei Yuan had been thinking with his head bowed, seemingly unconcerned.","When he heard Pei Fengnong's plea, he responded calmly: \"If that's how it is, then everyone should follow their heart.\"","Everyone was stunned.","This was an unexpected answer.","Pei Che raised an eyebrow, his finger tapping lightly on the table as he said with interest: \"Since we've all laid it out, I have a question.\"","He fixed his gaze on Pei Yuan: \"Brother, after Qiao Chuchu and Lin Qing got kidnapped, Qiao Chuchu fell unconscious in the hospital for a whole day. Once she woke up, she said someone had kissed her. Was that person you?\"","The brothers were stunned, their eyes again falling on Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan, still seated at the head, calmly smiled at Pei Che but did not answer.","It seemed as if he had said nothing.","Yet, it also seemed as if he had said everything.","The brothers all drew in a breath sharply, as if struck by lightning.","Pei Yuan ignored their expressions, speaking lightly: \"I don’t care what you do, but you must not quarrel amongst yourselves. No infighting, and there must be no more fights. If anyone causes trouble, bringing it before Qiao Chuchu, don’t blame me.\"","Pei Yuan’s gaze sharpened: \"And no one is to hurt Xiao Ba. Anyone who does will be kicked out of the Pei Family.\"","Pei Che came back to the present, his gaze on Qiao Chuchu as she paced anxiously in the corridor.","His eyes darkened, as if a stealthy mist was quietly spreading: \"How did Shen Zhuoyan appear again, as if out of nowhere?\"","Shortly after, the door of the CT room opened.","Qiao Chuchu pushed Shen Zhuoyan out, walking toward the direction of Pei Che: \"Before the results come out, we should rest well.\"","Pei Che concealed himself, avoiding being seen by Qiao Chuchu.","Shen Zhuoyan lay on the bed, tranquil like a newly awakened beauty, his tone tinged with a hint of probing: \"Then... will you be with me?\"","Qiao Chuchu responded decisively: \"Don't worry, I've already said I'll cover the costs, so naturally, I have to stay with you until you're safe. Back when I was studying, you helped me through a lot.\"","She passed by Pei Che, leaving behind a faint scent that lingered in his nostrils.","Pei Che watched their retreating figures.","Qiao Chuchu’s slender body, easily tossed onto a bed, was surprisingly pushing the heavy hospital bed.","An assistant by Pei Che's side remarked: \"Chairman, it seems your sister is a very gentle girlfriend, this lad she's with must be really lucky.\"","Pei Che scoffed: \"He's not her boyfriend.\"","The assistant was puzzled: \"Ah?\"","Pei Che’s eyes darkened with a sinister gleam, his voice sharp: \"He won’t be her boyfriend either.\"","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu sat beside Shen Zhuoyan's hospital bed. As she relaxed, she began to lose focus.","Pei Che stood not far from the emergency room, stepping toward her.","Qiao Chuchu sighed inwardly.","[I just saw a new future for myself. It turns out I’ll have a downhill life because I offended a powerful force. So, no matter what, I have to make that person mine, or I have to become that powerful force.]","She tapped the edge of her phone absentmindedly, her expression turning deep.","[If I fail to grasp that power, the ones I love, the ones I care about, will all perish.]","[The only one to survive will be me.]","[The new ending I saw proves that I’ll be humiliated by the two old men of the Dragon Family, yet I feel... it won’t just be those two.]","[Those men will bring more. They’ll humiliate me in a mental hospital, possibly even using my body for transactions.]","Feeling an indescribable frustration in her chest, Qiao Chuchu absentmindedly scrolled through videos on her phone, the more she thought, the angrier she became!","[Damn it, I never imagined Xia Xuechun would go so far as to arrange for me to be raped. I thought her worst act would be trying to kill me!]","[Since she’s so vindictive, then I’ll send her to a mental hospital and let those two men who tried to humiliate me taste the shame of being violated themselves! I’ll make them suffer horribly!!]","Her phone was suddenly covered by a hand.","Qiao Chuchu was startled, her gaze meeting Shen Zhuoyan’s deep and dark eyes.","Her anger had brought a sparkle of moisture to her eyes, despite her attempts to control it, her facial expression still showed a vicious fierceness.","Like a trapped beast growling behind a corner.","Shen Zhuoyan lifted his upper body slightly, his cool phoenix-like eyes mirroring her silhouette, and slowly moved closer to her: \"Qiao Chu, can you offer me a job?\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned: \"What kind of job do you want?\"","With a focused gaze, Shen Zhuoyan’s cold eyes looked directly at her: \"Become your bodyguard.\"","\"?\" Qiao Chuchu thought she had misheard: \"Become my bodyguard? I don't need a bodyguard.\"","\"No, you do,\" Shen Zhuoyan propped himself up, moving closer to her, his voice a gentle persuasion: \"I'm very capable. You don't have to pay me, I just need room and board and to be by your side every day.\"","He took her hand: \"I can be your most loyal dog, trust me.\"","Qiao Chuchu grew more and more shocked with each word.","[A loyal dog?!]","Shen Zhuoyan's eyes, intense and deep, sparkled with a passionate fire. \"What do you think? Do you want me?\""]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: The Future of Victory and the Future of Defeat, Which Do You Want","paragraphs":["Pei Che’s face darkened as he strode towards Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu suddenly felt her vision go black and collapsed to the ground!","Pei Che’s expression changed drastically as he crouched beside her!","Shen Zhuoyan also jolted to his feet, panic-stricken: “Qiao Chu!”","He frantically looked at Pei Che: “Why did she suddenly faint?!”","Pei Che ignored him, directly lifting her up and rushing towards the emergency room. While seeking help, he sent a message in a group:","**“Qiao Chuchu has fainted, come to my hospital quickly!”**","-","Qiao Chuchu felt as though she was still lying on the ground.","After hearing Shen Zhuoyan’s words, something surged up within her, and her body seemed to be sealed, her left and right eyes seeing different worlds upon opening them.","She tried closing her left eye and looking with her right.","An elderly grandmother with a kindly appearance stood before her, disdainfully gazing down at her.","She trembled and reached out, gripping the grandmother’s trouser leg, unwilling to let go: “I helped you so many times, and you always said you treated me like a granddaughter. So why did you betray me?!”","The grandmother pulled her leg back, her tone revealing her dislike: “So many people fawn over me daily, and you’re just one of them. You’re doing it for money, status, and fame, so what’s wrong with not choosing you?”","She was stunned, a fury sweeping through her: “Even if I was fawning over you, so what? I helped you so many times, even saving your grandson’s life! Now you’re colluding with Xia Xuechun to send me to a mental hospital. You’re heartless!”","The grandmother’s face grew colder: “Xuechun genuinely cares for me. You’ve hurt her too much, and your sins are countless!”","“Moreover, your family is all gone, and you’re alone, already crazy. Xuechun wants you in a mental hospital to get proper treatment, and how can you not tell good from bad?!”","The old lady sighed with disappointment: “Qiao Chuchu, once you’re treated, I’ll let you out. This old woman values loyalty and righteousness!”","Xia Xuechun, standing nearby, gently patted the grandmother’s chest: “Grandma, don’t be angry. Qiao Chuchu is just insincere. Don’t waste your anger on someone like her.”","Qiao Chuchu grew more heartbroken the more she looked, so she closed her right eye and focused on her left eye’s vision.","She stood amidst a burning island, surrounded by many people.","Her brothers, friends, and family.","A surge of indescribable glee coursed through her as she smiled gleefully, gazing ahead: “Xia Xuechun, run faster with your people! If you slow down, you’ll be caught, and how can you live happily then~”","Xia Xuechun, the grandmother, and two men from the Lou Family, along with several vague figures, were all terrified, fleeing forward.","But their injured legs made it impossible to run fast, limping awkwardly.","They could only panic and glance back at her.","She strolled leisurely, watching them fall one by one, scrambling to get up and forcing themselves to face her.","Their expressions made it seem as though she was a demon from hell.","The grandmother knelt on the ground, pleading desperately: “Please let me go! I shouldn’t have treated you poorly, I’m sorry, child, truly sorry! I’m old, so please forgive me! I’m pitiful too!”","The Lou brothers, seeing this, also fell to their knees, begging: “Miss Qiao, we’re sorry, we shouldn’t have opposed you! Please forgive us, we dare not do it again! We dare not!”","Xia Xuechun and Ji Yanchuan, lacking strength, collapsed together like fish on a chopping board, frightened as they watched her approach.","She reached them, lifting her foot and grinding it down hard on Ji Yanchuan’s face: “Who’s being sent to a mental hospital now?”","She looked at the despairing Xia Xuechun, grinning: “It’s you.”","Qiao Chuchu suddenly opened her eyes, sitting up from the hospital bed!","A group of powerful figures in the ward stared at her in surprise: “You’re awake?”","Qiao Chuchu excitedly covered her mouth, completely unaware of the crowded room!","A sense of victory against the odds surged through her, warm and exhilarating!","This sudden victory felt like five trillion dollars falling from the sky, landing directly into her account!","**[This is incredible! I’ve seen so many humiliating futures, but this time I finally saw something real!]**","**[Though not very clear, I know who that influential figure is who affected my future!]**","**[A powerful old lady, whose influence rivals even the Wei Sheng Family, but due to her family’s stronger connections, she’s even more formidable than them.]**","**[Initially, I discovered this old lady and tried to form a connection, but there was a misunderstanding, later cleared up, and I fully entered her life, using my ability to foresee the future to help her multiple times.]**","**[But this old lady never respected me from the start!]**","**[She accepted my help, called me her granddaughter, but favored the clumsy Xia Xuechun even more!]**","**[She liked the cheap plastic bracelets Xia Xuechun made for her, but disliked the high-quality jade I gifted her, yet still took it and later gave it to Xia Xuechun!]**","**[My brothers died one after another, all orchestrated by the old lady and Xia Xuechun, secretly manipulating everything without my knowledge!]**","**[She and Xia Xuechun, along with Ji Yanchuan, destroyed my family, my life, and locked me in a mental hospital. When the Lou brothers tried to harm me, I took the chance to kill myself and reset!]**","**[Now, with four lives left, I’ve been reborn, back to the day I first met this old lady!]**","**[Originally, in the timeline where I lost, there was a misunderstanding during our first meeting, but later cleared up, she apologized, and I focused on helping her, believing it would earn her sincerity.]**","**[The old lady was excellent at pretense, always talking sincerely, casually mentioning her tragic past, so I never thought she’d betray me!]**","**[So, in my second reincarnation, I was extremely cautious, aligning with my family to restrain her.]**","**[With her restrained, she sped up her alliance with Xia Xuechun, directly confronting me!]**","**[I anticipated her every move, protecting everyone I loved, and ultimately winning!]**","**[I WON! And achieved success, becoming a big shot in the art world!]**","Qiao Chuchu was grinning foolishly when suddenly numbers appeared before her eyes.","Her life count, which was 4, now became 3.","Qiao Chuchu's smile froze.","**[Huh? Only three lives left now?]**","**[I’ll ask the system about this when I have time!]**","**[Most importantly, I’ve seen my triumphant future!]**","She excitedly rolled all over the bed!","**[I’ve been reborn! Back to the day I tried to appease the old lady! Hahahahahaha!]**","Qiao Chuchu grinned with her big white teeth, sitting up again happily, but her smile stiffened.","Because a group of people stood in front of her hospital bed, staring at her in disbelief.","Her seven brothers.","Five figures from the Wei Sheng Family.","Lou Tingsi and Lou Yuejue from the Lou Family.","Even Lin Qing and Lin Shen were there.","And... Shen Zhuoyan and Ying Chen.","They filled the ward, seemingly forming an impenetrable wall.","Qiao Chuchu looked at them.","They looked at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu glanced around, scratching her head, her gaze gradually becoming vacant: “When did you all come in?”","Lin Qing, trying to stifle a laugh, said: “Chuchu, sweetheart, we’ve been here the whole time, haven’t left.”","Qiao Chuchu blinked in realization: “Oh.”","She got out of bed and walked to the window, opening it: “Sorry, there’s no room for me in this world, so I’ll go die for a bit.”","Everyone: “?”"]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Heading to a Tea Party with Wei Shengwenzan and Yu Can","paragraphs":["Finally, Qiao Chuchu sat pale and lifeless on the hospital bed, surrounded by people.","She thought about jumping out the window (just a thought, since she was terrified of heights) to salvage her shattered dignity.","But before she could even open the window, Pei Youchuan picked her up and tossed her back onto the bed.","Like a slaughtered half slab of pork!","She bounced off the bed with no dignity left!","At the moment, she was flanked by people on both sides.","On her left was Lou Yuejue, hugging her arm with cheerful enthusiasm, reassuring her: \"Sis, it's not a big deal, everyone has talked to themselves at home, don't take it to heart~\"","On her right, Pei Buxian playfully twirled her hair: \"Yeah, who hasn't talked to themselves like a lunatic before? Plus, we're all family here.\"","Weisheng Huailing gestured in front of Qiao Chuchu, miming: \"It's fine, I'm deaf, I can't hear anything, I just saw you rolling around on the bed.\"","Pei Ci and Pei Mu stood in front of her on the right, solemnly promising: \"Qiao Chuchu, don't worry, we'll keep this secret safe, we promise not to bring it up during holidays and tease you! Trust us!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...!!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared expressionlessly at Lou Tingsi: \"I'll buy a bullet, just shoot me in the head, right now.\"","Lou Tingsi: \"?!!\"","Yu Can giggled: \"It's okay, Chuchu, they're just teasing you.\"","Qiao Chuchu sighed, covering her face: \"I know they're teasing me, but that doesn't stop me from wanting to die.\"","[Public humiliation, too much public humiliation! How did I not see this coming?!!!]","Everyone exchanged glances, their smirks turning slightly ominous.","It was quite the situation.","After all, they had all heard the new plot developments, understood the new dynamics, and discovered possible new outcomes for themselves and their relationships—especially the old lady manipulating Qiao Chuchu.","As they laughed, their smiles grew darker, their eyes glinting with danger.","Shen Zhuoyan stood behind everyone, his gaze sweeping over them one by one.","He didn't pay much attention to Lin Qing and Weisheng Yucan.","Instead, he focused on these handsome men.","Counting them on his fingers—excluding Lou Yuejue, the child—there were still over ten of them.","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...!!\"","Suddenly, these men turned as one, their cold eyes glaring at him as if he were an outsider and an enemy.","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...!!\"","Qiao Chuchu buried her face in her hands, sighing inwardly: [Though I'm humiliated now, at least I've identified the key points leading to my death.]","[First, there's that old lady—I must never treat her with sincerity, I have to use her!]","[Second, Shen Zhuoyan wanted me to hire him, but I refused, and then Shen Zhuoyan died.]","[He died at Xia Xuechun's doorstep, seemingly intending to harm her with a knife but collapsing from a heart attack and dying on the spot.]","[...Could it be that Shen Zhuoyan knew I had a bad relationship with Xia Xuechun, so he wanted to help me take revenge, only to be struck down by something beyond his control? But how did he find out? And why would he risk so much to help me?]","Shen Zhuoyan looked at Qiao Chuchu in shock.","He had indeed planned to deal with Xia Xuechun.","But if he harmed her, would he really just have a fatal heart attack?","He didn't have any heart problems, did he?","What was going on?","As Shen Zhuoyan pondered, a barrage of piercing stares locked onto him again.","The intimidating figures in front of him glared coldly, scrutinizing him from head to toe.","Some of the men he didn't even recognize had particularly fierce expressions.","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...☼\"","Weisheng Yucan, however, chuckled, showing him something on his phone.","It read:","\"Welcome to the family, the key point is that you must never let Qiao Chuchu know you can hear her thoughts. Someone will explain the details later, but for now, stay quiet.\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"?! \"","This meant... everyone could hear Qiao Chuchu's thoughts?!","Not just him?!","He glanced at Qiao Chuchu in disbelief.","Qiao Chuchu remained oblivious, her face buried in her palms as she tried to sort out her thoughts.","[Now I need to handle two things: First, persuade Shen Zhuoyan not to harm Xia Xuechun and find him a proper job instead of hanging around bars late at night, to prevent him from dying of a sudden heart attack.]","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...❀\"","[Second: Two days from now Yu Can will invite me to Old Lady Wang's tea party where Xia Xuechun will also be present. She'll be aligned with Yu Can's enemies. Xia Xuechun and that woman she's sucking up to will steal an important bracelet from Old Lady Wang and frame me for it. This is a critical point.]","Weisheng Yucan narrowed his eyes, typing in a group chat:","\"True, I do plan to invite Qiao Chuchu to Old Lady Wang's tea party two days from now.\"","Since he wanted to introduce Qiao Chuchu to the upper echelons, laying the groundwork for her social connections and helping her thrive in his circle.","But this well-intentioned plan had inadvertently pushed Qiao Chuchu and him closer to disaster.","Weisheng Yucan clenched his phone.","Xia Xuechun and that woman she was currying favor with were truly audacious!","The others' expressions also darkened.","Qiao Chuchu lowered her hands, her thoughts finally cleared.","[Let me handle them one by one. First, deal with Shen Zhuoyan! Find him a new job!]","With renewed energy, she looked up: \"I want to talk to Shen Zhuoyan alone—\"","\"Oh, isn't this Shen Zhuoyan?!~\" Pei Youchuan suddenly draped an arm around him, acting buddy-buddy: \"Long time no see, I think you were the classmate of our little eighth, right?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"...!!?\"","This Pei Youchuan had been glaring at him just moments ago, but his attitude flipped the moment Qiao Chuchu looked up.","How talented at acting.","He tried to dodge Pei Youchuan's grip, but the man only tightened his hold: \"You were quite the legend during Qiao Chuchu's high school days, I've heard about you. Where are you working now that you're out of jail?\"","Shen Zhuoyan reluctantly replied, his tone darkening: \"Bar.\"","Pei Youchuan tsked: \"Tsk, tsk, tsk, a legend like you working at a bar? What a waste of talent. I'll introduce you to a better job, let's talk in the corridor!\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci rushed over to Shen Zhuoyan's other side, nudging him: \"Yeah yeah, we're friends here, let us help you find a job!\"","Shen Zhuoyan was shooed out of the ward, looking back at Qiao Chuchu: \"Wait, Qiao Chuchu, you wanted—\"","Pei Mu and Pei Ci blocked his view: \"Don't be shy, come on, let's go!~\"","Shen Zhuoyan was forcefully pushed out of the room: \"Qiao—\"","Pei Youchuan clamped a hand over his mouth, turning to Qiao Chuchu: \"Chuchu, I really like your old classmate, I'll take him out for drinks, alright?\"","Shen Zhuoyan: \"Mmm! Mmm!\"","Qiao Chuchu stared blankly as the group closed the door.","Yu Can laughed: \"Qiao Chuchu, looks like your classmate is about to get a great job. By the way, I need to tell you something too.\"","She checked her watch: \"We’ve got a tea party at Old Lady Wang’s at three in the afternoon in two days. You should come, I’ll introduce you to some influential people.\"","Qiao Chuchu paused, then nodded rapidly: \"Sure!\"","[So I’m skipping finding Shen Zhuoyan a job and heading straight to the battlefield with Xia Xuechun? I’m getting excited.]","[I like not wasting time with small talk, going straight into action! There’s no way I can’t handle this!]","Weisheng Wenzhan smiled: \"I'll be going too, Qiao Chuchu.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Huh?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan wore a curious smile: \"See you then, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"....Huh?\"","[So I’ll be facing not just one but two members of the Wei Sheng Family at once? Including even Weisheng Wenzhan? Why do I feel so uncomfortable about that!!]","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...?\"","Yu Can: \"Hee~\""]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: Extremely Likely to Cause Poisoning Hazards","paragraphs":["Madam Wang's tea party day arrived.","Qiao Chuchu stood formally dressed in a tasteful white suit, rigidly positioned between two formidable figures in a subdued yet luxurious club. To her left was Weisheng Wenzhan, dressed in a black overcoat paired with a tailored suit. To her right was Weisheng Yucan, draped in fur, adorned in a dark green qipao. Both sides were flanked by black-suited bodyguards ensuring their safety. Clutching a petite handbag in both hands, Qiao Chuchu found herself sandwiched between two towering figures bristling with powerful energy. Weak, pitiable, yet utterly helpless.","[Every time I'm alone with the Wei Sheng Family, I feel the pressure mounting. I need to train myself not to be so nervous.]","As she pondered, she felt Weisheng Wenzhan's gaze descend from the left. She looked up to meet his eyes.","Weisheng Wenzhan, like a shrewd, elusive fox, adjusted his glasses, a cryptic smile flitting across his face before he averted his gaze.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...?\"","[Why is he smiling? It's sending shivers down my spine.]","[If he didn't resemble my anime son, I wouldn't like being around someone like him. The air feels too heavy.]","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Weisheng Yucan, astonished, glanced at her brother: \"??\"","What?","In Qiao Chuchu's eyes, was her brother actually her comic book son?","Noticing his sister's shocked expression, Wenzhan frowned: \"...\"","Yucan's lips twitched, struggling to suppress her laughter, her shoulders quivering subtly.","Weisheng Wenzhan, utterly exasperated: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu, puzzled, glanced at Yucan, about to inquire what was wrong, when two figures approached the door: \"Are we late?\"","She turned sharply to the source of the voice. A woman in a dark green qipao, draped in fur, entered, accompanied by the petite Xia Xuechun.","The woman’s gaze fell on Weisheng Yucan’s outfit, her smile faltering: \"Weisheng Yucan?\"","Xia Xuechun hurried to keep up with the woman, her gaze following suit and landing on Qiao Chuchu, her expression also shifting.","Qiao Chuchu's eyes instantly hardened, radiating a fierce, predatory aura: [Heh, here they are, the cunning sisters who accused me.]","[Premonition didn't reveal how I resolved the issue or how they framed me, but it's definitely them.]","[I really want to grab a Gatling gun and just mow them down.]","Weisheng Wenzhan's brooding face instantly lightened, a smile glimmering as he glanced at Qiao Chuchu.","Weisheng Yucan, disdainful, glared at the woman: \"Long time no see, darling.\"","Lan Ying forced a smile, nodding: \"Yes, it's been a while.\"","Weisheng Yucan introduced Qiao Chuchu: \"Chuchu, this is Lan Ying, my old classmate.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave Lan Ying a casual glance, nodding politely.","[I know her. She's part of Xia Xuechun's first-tier inner circle. She’s like our Yucan, but, well, she’s not as pretty, rich, or capable as Yucan.]","Weisheng Yucan's smile widened.","Qiao Chuchu couldn't help but stand straighter, puffing up with pride.","[Looking at it this way, my villain team is all top-tier!]","[And I'm the great seer, the mastermind controlling the entire game board~]","[Hehe, feeling more and more like a big shot.]","Weisheng Yucan: \"...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","Lan Ying: \"...\"","What’s going on?","Why does this Miss Qiao feel so impudent? Is she looking down on me?!","The more Lan Ying thought about it, the more uncomfortable she became, a cold snort escaping her lips: \"What does Miss Qiao do?\"","Qiao Chuchu curved her lips: \"A mere painter, I'm afraid.\"","Lan Ying nodded, realization dawning: \"Oh~ a painter~\"","She squinted, scrutinizing: \"Never heard of you.\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded: \"Normal. I started my exhibition around seventeen, became a sensation in the art world, and then retired a few years later to draw comics.\"","Lan Ying smirked: \"Why leave painting? Are you out of ideas?\"","\"Oh, not that~\" Qiao Chuchu theatrically flipped her hair: \"Because too many people groveled before me, I lost track of my true capabilities. I was just too popular, got burned out~\"","Lan Ying: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu smiled sweetly: \"Since it's our first meeting, how about a hug?\"","[Let’s see if you dare to make a move on me.]","Lan Ying: \"No need—\"","Before she could finish, Qiao Chuchu pulled her into a tight embrace!","In an instant, a scene flashed before her eyes!","Weisheng Wenzhan, slumped in the lounge, panting heavily.","Weisheng Yucan, retching uncontrollably in the bathroom.","Standing bewildered in the lounge, she saw Weisheng Wenzhan weakly extending his hand towards her: \"Chuchu...\"","She hurried over: \"What's wrong?\"","Wenzhan loosened his tie, breathing heavily, his eyes smoldering with desire: \"I'm so hot... too hot...\"","She grew anxious: \"Telling me you're hot doesn't help! I've already set the air conditioner to the lowest! Maybe I should knock you out! That'd be healthier!\"","His hand gripped her wrist tightly, his eyes reddening as he leaned closer: \"I—I want... to...\"","Qiao Chuchu abruptly pulled away, calmly releasing Lan Ying.","Lan Ying, repulsed, glared at her before dragging Xia Xuechun away.","Qiao Chuchu, suddenly aware, was drenched in cold sweat: [Someone dosed Wenzhan and Yucan's drinks! With that kind of aphrodisiac found only in novels!]","Weisheng Yucan: \"?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu was frazzled, her thoughts racing: [Not only that, Wenzhan seems unable to resist the drug’s effect and is coming onto me!]","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"???\"","Yucan, shocked, signed furiously behind Qiao Chuchu: \"You’re beyond indecent! She’s so much younger! Even if you have a crush, how could you even think of doing that?!\"","Wenzhan, his brows furrowed, gestured back: \"I didn’t! I wouldn’t do something so disgraceful!\"","Anger flared: \"And don’t go spreading rumors about me having a crush!\"","Yucan glared: \"Stop pretending! I’ve lived this long and never seen you give a second glance to any woman! Am I blind?!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was momentarily stumped, gesturing: \"You’re mistaken! I don’t have a crush on her! I just think she’s—\"","\"Your younger sister?\" Weisheng Yucan mocked: \"When I was ten, I cried in front of you and you said I looked like a dirty rag. When Qiao Chuchu was twenty, she cried, and you flew across the country to buy her gifts!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan: \"...\"","\"In any case,\" he said, his face darkening, \"I won’t fall for it. And neither should you. You’re allergic to that drug. Drink it, and you’ll vomit until you’re swollen.\"","Yucan’s face darkened: \"I know. I’m here to kick ass, not act like an idiot.\"","Qiao Chuchu turned to look at them.","The two quickly composed themselves, calmly returning her gaze.","Qiao Chuchu licked her molars.","[I have to warn them.]","Weisheng Yucan and Wenzhan raised their eyebrows, intrigued by her impending warning.","With a cryptic air, Qiao Chuchu warned: \"You two shouldn’t drink anything offered by strangers today.\""]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: The Truth Behind the Drop from Four Lives to Three Lives","paragraphs":["Yu Can and Wen Zhan raised their eyebrows, not surprised: \"Why?\"","\"It affects your fortune and wealth,\" she said seriously. \"Today, drinking water will delay your chances of making big money, so don't drink it.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan was taken aback, then smirked playfully: \"Is this another fortune-telling from your app?\"","Qiao Chuchu's expression was grave: \"I must say, my app is very accurate. I can guarantee you that drinking water will lead to no good.\"","Yu Can teased: \"What if we're thirsty?\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes rolled, and she replied: \"I'll buy it!\"","【I'm also trying to figure out why this situation arose since I didn't see this story in the first timeline.】","She hurried off.","Yu Can and Wen Zhan watched her retreating figure, both smiling faintly.","Wen Zhan narrowed his eyes, reminiscing with interest: \"Have you ever thought about this—if it weren't for Qiao Chuchu helping us, you'd be dead, and I might have been angered to death by Ji Yanchuan.\"","Yu Can was momentarily stunned but then smiled along: \"Yes, she saved not only my life but also the lives of our entire family, and even our family's wealth.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded, his tone slightly rising: \"So what are we waiting for? We can't let her do all the work; we just need to find someone to handle it.\"","Weisheng Yu Can took out his phone and sent a message in the Weisheng Clan group.","「We have an emergency; anyone available, come to the club ASAP. Someone is planning to drug us!」","Weisheng Biehe:「Understood.」","Weisheng Huailing:「111」","Weisheng Lin:「? Wait for me; I'll come after finishing this meeting.」","Weisheng Yu Can:「Then don't bother coming.」","Weisheng Lin:「?」","Yu Can locked his phone, feeling confident: \"With Qiao Chuchu around, we can't lose.\"","Wen Zhan smiled confidently, picking up his phone: \"I’ll think about what gift to give her. I remember she likes sports cars. I can give her my unused Bugatti.\"","Yu Can raised an eyebrow: \"You give her the black one; I’ll give her my pink one, which hasn’t been used much.\"","After all, custom-made cars take years to arrive. By the time it comes, it’ll be outdated. It’s better to gift one from the garage that’s the best and newest.","-","Qiao Chuchu walked towards the club exit and found a convenience store.","This timeline is getting more and more confusing.","Thinking carefully, she had seen two futures.","One that ended in failure, and one that didn’t.","The failed one had more details, basically telling her how she failed.","The successful one mentioned two key points: Shen Zhuoyan + the Old Madam.","However, the failed timeline didn’t mention any drugs involved today.","Suddenly, a system voice echoed in her mind:「Because this is already the second timeline. Strictly speaking, it’s a fusion of prophecy and actual events that have occurred, so things might feel a bit scrambled.」","Qiao Chuchu:「!」","She was astonished:「Second timeline?」","The system explained calmly:「You saw that you lost a life, right? That wasn’t a bug; it was a real loss of life.」","Qiao Chuchu, holding a bottle of mineral water, turned pale:「? Explain it clearly.」","The system continued:「In the failed timeline, you actually experienced it. You failed step by step, and ultimately, at the end, you died by suicide. That was your true experience.」","「Just before your death, you foresaw another outcome where you succeeded. So, with that vision in mind, you chose to end your life and returned to me.」","「Originally, you couldn't freely choose timelines, but you completed several tasks for me, securing the chance to return to this crucial moment. You also requested that I erase your memories so you could seamlessly integrate into this timeline.」","「In other words, the two outcomes you now see were gifted to you by the previous, failed version of yourself. So, it's more accurate to say it's a combination of a timeline and a prediction, rather than a single timeline.」","Qiao Chuchu stood frozen,「Why would I ask you to erase my memories?」","The system replied:「That's something you'll have to explain to yourself. You’ve left a voice message for your current self, asking me to play it if you feel confused.」","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback.","In her mind, she heard her own voice.","A hoarse, lifeless voice spoke.","—\"You may be wondering why I had your memories erased.\"","—\"Memory overlaps lead to emotional overlaps. The feeling of truly experiencing hardships is different from merely predicting them. So, by erasing the memories, it was as if I had completely died, but I passed on my experiences to you.\"","—\"Please prevent any of these predictions from coming true. The people around you are essential; without them, you cannot rise. You must surpass the Old Madam.\"","—\"Also, everyone around you has secrets they’re hiding. They confessed to me just before their deaths. Of course, some died suddenly, not having the chance to even see me before they died. Only those who managed to say their last words confessed to me. I’ve warned you; you can discover their secrets whenever you figure them out.\"","—\"Of course, I didn't deliberately conceal this from you. The victorious future I saw involved you succeeding without knowing everything. I don't want to lose again.\"","Qiao Chuchu's grip on the mineral water tightened as she felt an incredulous sensation: \"What?!\"","【So, I’ve truly experienced torment once, huh?】","【And everyone around me has been hiding secrets that they confessed to me only before their deaths?】","【What secrets?!】","Weisheng Huailing's eyes widened in surprise.","He looked at Biehe, their eyes meeting.","What was going on?!","Why did Qiao Chuchu suddenly know something?","Who tipped her off?!","Huailing immediately sent a message in the group:「Emergency! Emergency! Qiao Chuchu knows that we've all been hiding secrets from her! But she doesn’t know what those secrets are yet!!」","Pei Youchuan:「?」","Pei Mu and Pei Ci:「?」","Lin Qing:「?」","Lin Shen:「...I said from the beginning that we should just tell her. Now that she’s found out, she’s definitely going to be mad!」","Lou Yuejue:「Oh no, I’m scared! What if she stops talking to me?」","Lou Tingsi:「What’s Qiao Chuchu’s reaction?!!」","Weisheng Huailing nervously peeked out, observing Qiao Chuchu’s aggressive stride as she emerged from the store.","He typed hurriedly:「She’s walking fast!」","Pei Che:「?」","Pei Yuan:「?」","Pei Fengnong:「?」","Pei Youchuan:「What does her fast walking even matter? Even if she does a split or a double backflip, that’s not the issue!」","Pei Che:「Don’t beat around the bush; get to the point.」","Qiao Chuchu stood at the entrance, taking out her phone to call someone.","Weisheng Huailing quickly typed:「Qiao Chuchu is probably trying to make a call, but I don’t know who she’s calling!」","The group was on high alert!","Was she just going to call and ask directly?!","That made sense for the straightforward Qiao Chuchu!","But they weren’t ready for that!","Qiao Chuchu scrolled through her contacts, finally stopping at Pei Yuan.","After hesitating, she decided not to make the call.","【No.】","【I can’t ask directly. They’re all too cunning. If they don’t want to reveal it, no matter what I ask, they won’t tell me. They might even coordinate among themselves and tip each other off.】","【So, I absolutely cannot ask directly!】","【I have to figure out how to trick the information out of them.】","Huailing:「Good news: Qiao Chuchu didn’t make the call.」","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","That’s good.","Huailing:「Bad news: Qiao Chuchu is planning to trick us into revealing the secrets.」","Everyone:「? Must you always speak in such ambiguous terms?!!」"]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: Please Make an Effort to Divert Qiao Chuchu's Attention","paragraphs":["Weisheng Huailing and Biehe stood in a corner, wearing sunglasses and baseball caps, their entire bodies concealed as much as possible.","The two of them peeked out from behind the wall, cautiously observing Qiao Chuchu's back.","Qiao Chuchu's thoughts grew more chaotic with every second, caught in a dilemma:","*[If everyone has secrets they're hiding from me, what could they be?]*","*[Do they know I'm a time traveler? Do they know about my system? Do they know about the script?]*","Biehe's palms were icy cold, and panic began to set in. \"We can't let her keep thinking like this—she'll figure it out soon. We need to find a way to stop her!\"","An idea suddenly struck Biehe, and he gestured to Weisheng Huailing: *\"You run out into the street and get hit by a car!\"*","Huailing: \"?\"","Huailing: *\"Why don't you get hit by a car?!\"*","Biehe spoke with complete seriousness: *\"Because your luck is ironclad!\"*","Weisheng Huailing: *\"My luck can only go so far before even I get splattered!\"*","Biehe frowned and suddenly noticed two suspicious figures in front of the club.","One of the men was wearing a blue suit and had a somewhat lecherous grin on his face.","The other man was visibly uneasy, constantly looking around, as if trying to reach into his pocket for something.","Clearly, these two were up to no good.","Biehe looked around and found a small pebble on the ground. With precision, he flicked it to land right at Qiao Chuchu's feet!","Qiao Chuchu furrowed her brow, trying to locate the source of the pebble, but her attention was drawn to the two men across the street at the club entrance.","The man in the royal blue suit picked up an unlabeled vial and inspected it under the sky.","She quickly sprinted across the street, slipped into the club, and hid behind a wall near the two men to eavesdrop.","The man in the blue suit grinned maliciously: \"Are you sure this stuff works? Will it make someone lose their mind completely after they drink it?\"","Qiao Chuchu's expression changed, and she quickly began recording on her phone.","The other man nodded firmly. \"I’m certain. Totally certain. The drug is one hundred percent effective.\"","The man in the blue suit grinned: \"In TV dramas, corporate warfare is always about various schemes and attacks, but in reality, all you need is to get Weisheng Yucan and Weisheng Wenzhan to sleep together, record the video and photos, and then spread them over the internet. Once it’s online, the video will spread like a virus—impossible to kill.\"","Her eyes widened in shock, and her face twisted in disgust. \"Oh my god...\"","*[The reason Weisheng Yucan and Mr. Weisheng are being drugged is that their rivals want them to—]*","*[Ugh! Disgusting! Disgusting to the core!]*","*[What kind of twisted mind would come up with such a plan?! There are plenty of men and women at the club—even if they felt the need to relieve themselves, why would they choose each other?!]*","But she understood.","*[No wonder Weisheng Wenzhan couldn't hold back and tried to seek me out. The drug must be pretty strong. Well, good, my \"big son\" persona hasn't fallen apart.]*","Meanwhile, already having moved to an outside position near the club, Weisheng Biehe: \"?\"","Huailing: \"?\"","Would Mr. Weisheng really resort to looking for Qiao Chuchu to resolve the situation after being drugged?","Did Qiao Chuchu have a nickname for Mr. Weisheng as her \"big son\" in her mind?!","Huailing's face instantly turned green: *\"I’m going to go ask the boss!\"*","Biehe grabbed him, gesturing furiously: *\"What’s the point of asking him about something that hasn’t happened yet?! Solving the problem is the most urgent matter!\"*","Huailing's face darkened as he glanced at the man in the blue suit: *\"Then I’ll make him disappear right now!\"*","Weisheng Biehe nodded. But then, a head peeked out from the other side of the wall.","He tugged on Huailing!","Huailing recoiled with annoyance: *\"What is it?!\"*","Biehe pointed toward the inside of the wall!","Huailing frowned and looked in that direction, his expression turning grave.","Qiao Chuchu's head emerged like a ghost from behind the wall, her hands braced against it, looking down at the man in the blue suit from above."]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Even while eavesdropping, don't forget to exercise","paragraphs":["The attendants inside the club were shocked and ran towards Qiao Chuchu, \"Ma'am, you can't be climbing over the wall! Please get down right away!\"","The Blue-Clothed Man was stunned, feeling an eerie chill run down his spine. Slowly, he looked up.","Qiao Chuchu's head was barely peeking over the wall, glaring at him icily.","Blue-Clothed Man: \"?\"","Man: \"?\"","Attendant inside: \"Ma'am! Please come down!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't care, leaning against the wall with a blank expression, \"It's fine, I'm just doing pull-ups.\"","The Blue-Clothed Man's eyes widened, \"? What kind of pull-ups is that? You're clearly eavesdropping on my conversation!!\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't respond, slowly retracting her head.","Blue-Clothed Man: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu slowly poked her head out again.","Blue-Clothed Man: \"??\"","She was like a tortoise, freely extending and retracting her head from behind the wall, bobbing up and down with a blank expression, saying, \"Isn't this pull-ups?\"","Blue-Clothed Man: \"......\"","Biehe: \"......\"","Huai Ling: \"......\"","The Blue-Clothed Man was furious, \"You're eavesdropping on my conversation! And you have the nerve to use pull-ups as an excuse!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Even if I am eavesdropping, I am doing it in a fashionable way, is that a problem?\"","Blue-Clothed Man: \"?\"","Biehe: \"......Pfft!\"","Huai Ling: \"What did she say? I didn't catch it!\"","Yu Can and Wen Zhan walked to the entrance, spotting Qiao Chuchu's head bobbing over the wall: \"?\"","Lan Ying and Qiao Chuchu followed closely behind, equally astonished.","Was that really Qiao Chuchu hanging on the wall?!","The attendant spoke to Qiao Chuchu nervously, \"Please come down, I beg you, don't do pull-ups anymore! It's against the rules!\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded easily, \"Alright, then I'll do the Thomas Flair.\"","Without hesitation, she flipped onto the wall and started dancing on it!","Attendant: \"?\"","Everyone: \"?!\"","Blue-Clothed Man: \"???\"","Qiao Chuchu twirled on the wall, her legs pointed skyward, striking a cool pose!","She smirked, devilishly saying, \"Heh, didn't expect sis could break out some street dance moves, huh?\"","The Blue-Clothed Man's mouth twitched, outraged, \"You're eavesdropping on people's conversations and daring to provoke me! Do you even know who I am?!\"","Qiao Chuchu was indifferent, \"No. Who are you?\"","The Blue-Clothed Man roared, \"I'm Lan Ying's brother, Lan Yao! How dare you eavesdrop on me? You'll face the consequences! Which family are you from? Speak up!\"","Qiao Chuchu was surprised, \"I wasn't eavesdropping, though.\"","Blue-Clothed Man: \"? Don't lie, you just admitted it!\"","Qiao Chuchu sat firmly on the wall, taking out her phone, \"I was mainly recording.\"","Blue-Clothed Man: \"Ah?\"","Drug Dealer: \"Ah??\"","Recording was even worse, wasn't it?!","Biehe was taken aback, letting out a chuckle.","Huai Ling bit her lip, \"I don't know what Qiao Chuchu is doing, but it's getting fun!\"","Qiao Chuchu sat on the wall, sneering at the Blue-Clothed Man, \"I'm calling the cops right now, you scum who wants to drug others!\"","The Blue-Clothed Man's face changed drastically, reaching out to grab her!","Qiao Chuchu slid down the wall effortlessly, landing steadily in the courtyard!","Yu Can and Wen Zhan hurried over to her side, \"What were you doing just now?\"","Lan Ying approached with Xia Xuechun, speaking sarcastically, \"Just being a decoration on the wall, huh.\"","Lan Ying looked her up and down, \"You're really uncultured.\"","\"Not as uncultured as your brother,\" Qiao Chuchu said while dialing the phone, glancing at Lan Ying, \"Your brother wanted to drug Yu Can and Wen Zhan, hoping to trap them. Should I be clearer?\"","Everyone's expressions changed.","Yu Can and Wen Zhan looked at each other in shock.","So... someone had drugged them, not because they wanted to seduce them.","But because they wanted to trap them—","Yu Can's face turned green, trying to keep composed but failing to suppress a gag reflex, \"Ugh!\"","Wen Zhan's face was ashen, feeling queasy and his brow furrowed tightly, \"... \"","Lan Ying's eyes widened, \"What?! Do you have evidence?!\"","Lan Yao came storming from the entrance, \"You damn woman!\"","Qiao Chuchu pointed to Lan Yao, \"Evidence, like a mad dog, is running over.\"","Lan Yao clenched his fists furiously.","Qiao Chuchu: \"Evidence is about to punch me.\"","Lan Yao swung a punch at her!","Qiao Chuchu: \"Evidence is about to deliver a powerful right hook.\"","A man with a hood suddenly appeared, kicking Lan Yao away!","Lan Yao flew three meters, landing in the grass, \"Ah!\"","Qiao Chuchu, who had been prepared to counter, was stunned by this unexpected turn, her mouth twitching, \"Evidence... flew several meters away?\"","She looked at the hooded man who had just appeared.","The hooded man wore a mask and glasses, not just a hood but also a cap, completely concealing his face.","He ignored Qiao Chuchu, instead looking at Wen Zhan.","Wen Zhan's gaze deepened as he tilted his head up to look at the hooded man.","The hooded man gave him the middle finger.","Wen Zhan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Who is this guy?\"","The hooded man turned to Qiao Chuchu, placing his hand on his head and making a heart shape, swaying left and right like a reed.","Then he placed his hand over his heart, making another heart shape~","Then he pointed with his fingers, making another heart shape~","He kept making hearts, hearts everywhere~~","Suddenly, another cap-wearing man appeared, kicking the heart-making man away!","The heart-making man fell flat on the ground!","The cap-wearing man hoisted the heart-making man up and walked off steadily.","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","Wen Zhan: \"......\"","Yu Can chuckled, already guessing the identities of the two men, \"What warm-hearted people.\"","She smiled at Qiao Chuchu, \"Right?\"","Qiao Chuchu's expression remained bland, \"Mhm.\"","Yu Can: \"?\"","Wen Zhan: \"?\"","Why was she so indifferent?","Qiao Chuchu continued dialing the phone to call the police.","Lan Ying panicked, reaching out to grab her phone, \"Give it to me!\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly took a few steps back, \"Don't touch me, I have osteoporosis. Touch me and my arm breaks, I'll fall and cry loudly, accusing you.\"","Lan Ying was incredulous, \"Are you really a young lady like that?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"What? A young lady can't have osteoporosis?\"","Lan Ying: \"??\"","Qiao Chuchu laughed mockingly, \"I'm being unreasonable, so what is your brother who wants to drug people? A lowlife?\"","Lan Ying's expression twisted, \"You——\"","Qiao Chuchu stepped forward, her gaze burning, \"Do you know about it?\"","Lan Ying was stunned, the anger dissipating instantly, \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered at her, \"Do you know about your brother's plan to drug people?\"","Lan Ying's face turned pale, \"How dare you slander me?!\"","\"If it has nothing to do with you, then shut up,\" Qiao Chuchu locked eyes with her, her gaze sharp, \"Don't interfere, even if it's your brother. Or do you want the police to take you away?\"","Lan Ying's pupils contracted, her body trembling faintly.","As if furious.","Her face turned purple, but no words came out."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Excuse me... Do you have any secrets you're keeping from me","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu finished her phone call, and soon after, Lan Yao and the evidence were taken away.","But as a witness, she would also need to go, though she said she had some urgent matters to attend to and would reschedule.","As the evidence was being taken, the vision she previously had flashed before her eyes again.","Weisheng Wenzhan tightly gripped her wrist, breathing heavily as he leaned closer, as if to kiss her.","This scene gradually faded into black and white, withered, and disappeared.","She couldn't help but smile.","【Heh, my precognition ability is getting more advanced. I altered the future; events that won’t happen anymore appear in black and white before me, signaling their departure.】","【This puts my mind at ease. Yu Can and Wenzhan won’t be drugged anymore. Extra problems are solved, now I just need to wait for the setup against me to unfold.】","【However... now it seems I was framed because I sought justice.】","Qiao Chuchu scoffed, 【Now Xia Xuechun’s circle are all shady characters, so let’s just hurt each other. She frames me, and I’ll frame her.】","Yu Can and Wenzhan listened quietly, their lips curling into smiles unconsciously.","They could secretly help her.","Qiao Chuchu’s ruthless methods are truly commendable.","Yu Can stepped forward, affectionately holding Qiao Chuchu’s hand: “Chuchu, I—”","Qiao Chuchu immediately pulled her hand back, handing her a bottle of mineral water, and coldly said, “Even though the one who drugged us is gone, you should still drink the water I bought. It’s the most expensive I could get, though it’s only three yuan a bottle, no poison in it, don’t worry. I used to drink the one yuan bottles.”","Yu Can was startled, holding the mineral water, feeling Qiao Chuchu’s attitude was colder than the water.","Wenzhan also subtly frowned.","Huai Ling in the hidden corner tilted her head with confusion.","Biehe also looked puzzled.","It wasn’t the water’s issue.","It was... her attitude.","“Are you angry?” Yu Can got straight to the point, probing, “I feel like you’re upset.”","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes darkened, sharp light gleaming in her eyes.","Weisheng Yu Can felt a quiver in her heart, uncomfortably guilty, yet still intently stared at her.","Everyone else couldn’t help but feel nervous.","Qiao Chuchu squinted her eyes: “Yu Can, do you have a secret you’re hiding from me?”","Yu Can: “!”","Chuchu leaned closer, her curious eyes locking onto every part of Yu Can’s face: “Do you?”","Weisheng Yu Can swallowed hard, looking away toward Qiao Chuchu’s back.","Biehe signaled her with hand gestures: 「Qiao Chuchu knows we’ve all hidden secrets from her! But she doesn’t know what those secrets are! We were discussing this in the group earlier!」","The group chat was still exploding!","Pei Youchuan and Pei Buxian were non-stop spamming like bombs!","Weisheng Yu Can: “......”","Neither she nor Weisheng Wenzhan had the chance to look at their phones!","She calmly looked at Qiao Chuchu, puzzled and smiled: “Why do you ask me that?”","Qiao Chuchu squinted, saying profoundly: “I just saw a TikTok, a girl poured her heart out to make friends with someone, but all of her friends had a shared secret hiding from her.”","“The girl didn’t know what the secret was, nor did she know what those friends plotted behind her back, but she felt very heartbroken because from the beginning, she genuinely wanted to be friends with them.”","After saying that, she lifted her lips with a gentle smile: “So I was wondering, Yu Can and Wenzhan, do you have something you’re hiding from me?”","Weisheng Yu Can’s charming face showed a brief awkwardness, then she smiled and shook her head: “No.”","Her smile widened: “How could we have a secret hiding from you?”","Qiao Chuchu’s face darkened, glancing at Weisheng Wenzhan: “Wenzhan, you too?”","Standing aside, Wenzhan maintained a poker face: “No.”","She leaned her head, sweetly asking: “Absolutely nothing?”","Weisheng Wenzhan took a deep breath, calm and composed: “Absolutely nothing.”","【Liar.】","Wenzhan: “?”","Qiao Chuchu still smiled, but her eyes had lost their warmth.","【All liars.】","【I was sincere with each and every one of them, even willing to give up my life if needed, yet they have a secret in common!】","【What exactly are they plotting behind my back?】","【How unspeakable is this secret for them?!】","【I thought we were heart to heart! Instead, they mess with my head!】","The more Qiao Chuchu thought about it, the angrier she became, forcing herself to remain calm.","【Stay calm, stay calm...】","【I’ve been through a traumatic experience, I need to reverse the plot carefully, I can’t lose control!】","【The me from that timeline told me I need to salvage every prediction, so even if they’ve kept a secret from me, they have a stake in the plot too, they are my co-stars!】","【I can’t let emotions ruin my future!】","【I absolutely cannot end up locked away in a mental institution!】","Repeating these thoughts to herself several times, Qiao Chuchu gradually calmed down.","【Don’t feel like talking to them anymore, let’s wait for the plot to unfold.】","【Xia Xuechun and Lan Ying are probably plotting how to frame me right now, I need to give them the chance to play their hand so I can turn the tables on them.】","Qiao Chuchu walked past Wenzhan.","Wenzhan felt a tightness in his heart, grabbing her hand: “Miss Qiao—”","She immediately shook him off!","Wenzhan was caught off guard, his palm suddenly empty, his glasses nearly falling off.","His usually calm eyes quickly filled with surprise.","Qiao Chuchu said indifferently: “My hands are dirty, I’m going to wash them.”","Weisheng Wenzhan stood there, staring blankly at her receding figure, his hand still frozen in the air.","Huai Ling, hidden off to the side, was recording this scene with her phone, grinning uncontrollably, and sent it to the group chat!","「Hahaha, look who’s been dumped!」","The group couldn’t wait, everyone eagerly clicked on the video.","The video showed Qiao Chuchu walking past Weisheng Wenzhan.","Wenzhan grabbed her hand.","She forcefully shook him off!","Wenzhan stood there, stunned, like a statue, watching Qiao Chuchu walk away step by step.","He was tall, his coat billowed in the wind, his profile showing lingering affection, starkly contrasted with Chuchu’s resolute back.","Lin Qing: 「? Is this a TV drama? The scene is quite beautiful, can I say that?」","Lin Shen: 「You’re just looking at the visuals? Didn’t you see Qiao Chuchu is angry?」","Pei Youchuan: 「@Weisheng Huai Ling, you’re very happy, huh?」","Huai Ling giggled: 「Of course I’m happy~ Some uncle is going to be out of the picture now! After all, he’s already forty-four!」","Lou Yuejue: 「But sis didn’t dump the uncle because of his age, she dumped him because she felt we were hiding things from her. Even if it was you, you’d be dumped too, so what’s so funny about that?」","Huai Ling: 「?」","Huai Ling’s expression changed, uncertainly asking: 「Really?」","Pei Yuan: 「Really.」","Pei Fengnong: 「Really.」","Ying Chen: 「Huai Ling, I’m starting to wonder if your face was traded for your brain and ears?」","Biehe next to Huai Ling, rolled his eyes at his brother.","Pei Ci: 「Like this, and you’re a cold-blooded killer?」","Pei Mu: 「Because he’s cold-blooded he’s so low on EQ.」","Weisheng Huai Ling: “......”"]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Plot Companion","paragraphs":["Weisheng Huailing: \"Huh? Doesn't crying work with her? What about being clingy? If all else fails, I can even confess, can't I?\"","Pei Che: \"We don't know what the consequences of confessing will be. Plus, even if you confess, she'll get mad... very mad!\"","Huailing: \"... \"","Weisheng Huailing sent a panicked emoji.","He: \"Then what should I do, boohoohoo?\"","Pei Buxian's hands trembled as he typed: \"It's not about what you should do.\"","Lou Tingsi picked up the thread: \"It's about what all of us should do.\"","Huailing: \"... \"","Yu Can glanced at the group chat, scrolling from top to bottom, her face turning greener by the second: \"How did Qiao Chuchu suddenly find out? What if she refuses to talk to us anymore?!\"","Wen Zhan remained motionless, maintaining his pose.","Yu Can, frustrated, said: \"Stop posing already and think of a solution! This is the critical moment—you love-brains should at least contribute something!\"","Wen Zhan's eyes darkened as he shot her a cold glance: \"What are you yelling at me for? I'm not a love-brain.\"","Yu Can's palm was sweaty, struggling to dry it, her anxiety mounting: \"I approached her with purpose at first, yes, but this girl is so endearing. She genuinely cares for me, and I genuinely care for her too.\"","\"I’ve paved the way for Qiao Chuchu, teaching her how to connect with art world big shots, how to make big money, and how to climb her way to the top of the art world. I’ve planned everything!\"","Yu Can grabbed Wen Zhan's arm: \"I admit I initially used her, but now I’m sincere with her!\"","Wen Zhan's expression grew darker: \"Then let's confess.\"","Yu Can shook her head decisively: \"No way. The story isn't over yet. I’ll confess at the end, for sure!\"","She spoke nervously: \"Besides, I’ve read tons of system-type novels, and the setups are always like this: once the system’s secrets are known to the side characters, the world collapses. For us, we feel alive, but in reality, we’re just paper people. Our lives aren’t worth much!\"","Wen Zhan's face grew grim: \"If you’ve already decided to hide it from her, then why are you agonizing over it?\"","Yu Can felt absurd: \"Because it hurts, dammit! I’m now sincere with her, yet she's turning cold toward me. Isn't that the same as dangling me along? I refuse to believe you don’t feel the same!\"","\"I don’t feel anything,\" Wen Zhan said, expressionless, as he turned and walked away: \"Not a thing.\"","---","In the restroom, Qiao Chuchu pulled out a bracelet that had mysteriously appeared in her pocket.","She sneered: *Just now, Xia Xuechun suddenly bumped into me, and I felt my pocket being tugged. Sure enough, she slipped a bracelet into my pocket.*","Wen Zhan, who had been about to knock on the door, paused upon hearing her voice, holding his breath to listen.","*In the first timeline, I didn’t notice this bracelet, so I fell for Xia Xuechun and Lan Ying’s scheme. Old Madam accused me of stealing her precious bracelet.*","*Even though I later proved my innocence and Old Madam apologized, the experience of being framed left a mark. Many bystanders never even realized I was innocent.*","*And back then, I had no idea who was behind the framing. It wasn’t until later that I heard Xia Xuechun admit it.*","Qiao Chuchu let out a cold chuckle: *I truly thought she wouldn’t stoop to framing someone, so I considered everyone but her.*","*But how could I have forgotten? Xia Xuechun has always been relentless, acting by her own twisted logic. She can swap a plastic bracelet for jade, all while maintaining her righteous demeanor. She can also confess to Ji Yanchuan while he’s still engaged.*","*I need to find a way to return this bracelet.*","*If only I could turn the tables in a big way and send her a feast of jewelry as payback for her theft.*","*But alas, I’m just stealthy, not some legendary thief. I guess I’ll have to quietly return the bracelet to Xia Xuechun and let her face the consequences.*","She stashed the bracelet away, ready to step out, when the door swung open.","Weisheng Wenzhan walked in, flanked by his bodyguard.","The atmosphere in the room grew heavy the moment he entered.","Qiao Chuchu’s demeanor turned frosty yet polite as she glanced at him.","Wen Zhan’s dark eyes flickered as he took slow, deliberate steps toward her: \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave a nonchalant \"Hm.\"","He lowered his eyelashes, hesitating before extending his hand toward her.","She frowned, purposely dodging, but Wen Zhan firmly grasped her wrist!","She resisted, trying to pull back!","Wen Zhan’s grip tightened, his palm freezing cold.","He seemed oblivious to her rejection, locking his intense gaze on her, his tone steady yet firm: \"My bodyguard just informed me that someone placed something in your pocket. Is that true?\"","The bodyguard: \"?\"","When did he say that?","Qiao Chuchu shot a wary glance at the bodyguard: \"How do you know? I didn’t notice you.\"","The bodyguard opened his mouth: \"Uh...\"","Weisheng Wenzhan’s face paled: \"He’s a professional pickpocket, so his skills in this area are razor-sharp. He caught it from afar.\"","The bodyguard blinked, then nodded furiously: \"That’s right! That’s right!\"","Qiao Chuchu narrowed her eyes suspiciously, scanning Wen Zhan: \"Really?\"","*I can’t help but feel there’s something fishy about him stepping in to help. I’ve lost too much trust in people hiding secrets.*","Wen Zhan’s grip on her wrist tightened unconsciously as he glanced at the bodyguard.","The bodyguard caught the cue, standing straighter and introducing himself: \"Miss Qiao, I’ve served ten years in prison for theft. Mr. Weisheng gave me a second chance at life, and I now serve as a skilled professional by his side. My eyes are astute, and my skills are unparalleled. There’s nothing you can think of that I can’t steal!\"","Qiao Chuchu’s mouth twitched: \"...That’s quite the skill set.\"","*This is hard not to be tempted by!*","*One gold chain just doesn’t cut it for me. I want to overwhelm her with chains, bracelets, and bangles, turning Xia Xuechun into a human Mummy!*","*Alas, I don’t have the skills. All I can do is slip my bracelet in, but that feels too risky—there’s a high chance of getting framed back. Someone else’s bracelet would be far better.*","*Even though it’s a bit of a stretch, I really want to see Xia Xuechun get her just desserts.*","\"What do you think?\" Wen Zhan pulled her closer, looking down at Qiao Chuchu, his tone steady yet laced with a hint of persuasion: \"Are you tempted?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"... \"","She hesitated, looking up at him.","Wen Zhan’s pitch-black eyes held a flicker of tension: \"We’re in this together. Being framed for theft doesn’t just affect you—it reflects poorly on me and my sister. We need to strike back.\"","He leaned down, locking eyes with her, his every word carrying the weight of sincerity, as if offering his very heart.","\"You need him.\"","\"And you need me.\"","\"So.\" He looked deeply into her eyes: \"Let me help you.\""]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: How much did you actually steal","paragraphs":["The tea gathering went smoothly.","Yu Can sat beside Madam Wang, chatting with her with a smile.","On Madam Wang's other side, Lan Ying finally found an opportunity to speak: \"Madam Wang, allow me to introduce you to Miss Xia Xuechun, a rising star in the art circle.\"","She gently waved Xia Xuechun over: \"Come, Xuechun, hurry over and greet Madam Wang.\"","Xia Xuechun took a deep breath to calm her nerves and stepped forward quickly.","Suddenly, she felt a light bump on her shoulder.","Curious, she looked over.","A handsome bodyguard gave her a slight nod: \"Sorry.\"","She wrinkled her nose and brushed off her shoulder before walking up to Madam Wang: \"Madam Wang.\"","Upon seeing her, Madam Wang widened her eyes in surprise, momentarily stunned.","Qiao Chuchu appeared silently in the corner, letting out a cold laugh.","[Look at Madam Wang's expression—clearly she's thinking: This is like seeing a live-action figurine of my granddaughter.]","[And Xia Xuechun's behavior is practically saying: Yes~ I’m your granddaughter’s living doll~]","[Lan Ying's inner thoughts are: Look at the perfect setup I’ve arranged! I brought in a replica of Madam Wang’s beloved granddaughter. I bet these two will hit it off~]","Yu Can and Wen Zhan: \"?\"","They glanced at Qiao Chuchu nervously and with a hint of teasing.","Is she narrating the scene in her head?","Qiao Chuchu didn't notice their stares and her expression gradually turned serious.","[Knowing that Xia Xuechun resembles Madam Wang's deceased granddaughter, using such a relationship as a bridge, why did I ever think I could win over Madam Wang? Was I out of my mind?]","[However, Madam Wang is also in the art circle, a top-tier figure in China. I've admired her since I was young and have always looked up to her. So, trying to please and support a more accomplished senior felt quite natural.]","[Without even thinking, I acted like a devoted follower, circling around her, only to end up with nothing.]","Qiao Chuchu squinted: [I need to surpass Madam Wang to rid myself of this pent-up resentment!]","Wen Zhan's gaze deepened.","Yu Can looked at Qiao Chuchu in surprise.","She wants to replace Old Madam Wang?","That's something Yu Can would fully support! Along with some generous rewards prepared as well!","Yu Can and Wen Zhan simultaneously picked up their phones, sending a message to their drivers: \"Bring my newly customized sports car to the club immediately.\"","Meanwhile, Lan Ying and Xia Xuechun exchanged glances.","Lan Ying blinked: Did you put it in?","Xia Xuechun nodded: It's done.","Lan Ying nodded in satisfaction.","She wanted revenge for her brother and had managed to steal Madam Wang's precious bracelet.","The bracelet, a gift from Madam Wang's deceased granddaughter, wasn't worth much monetarily but held immense sentimental value.","If Qiao Chuchu were found with the stolen bracelet, her reputation would be ruined! This could also affect Weisheng Yucan, who brought her here.","Overstepping her bounds, interfering with their family's plans, and even calling the police to arrest her brother!","Lan Ying and Xia Xuechun exchanged another look, both seeing the confidence of victory in each other's eyes.","It's time to act!","Lan Ying opened her mouth: \"Old Madam—\"","Yu Can, who had been watching closely, intervened before Lan Ying could finish: \"Oh? Old Madam, where's your bracelet?\"","Yu Can beat Lan Ying to the point because Wen Zhan had warned her about Lan Ying and Xia Xuechun conspiring to frame Qiao Chuchu.","Yu Can was on Qiao Chuchu's side in this drama, so it was better for her to initiate the action.","Lan Ying and Xia Xuechun stared at Yu Can in surprise, scoffing with disdain.","Surprise, the bracelet is in your dear Miss Qiao's possession!","Wen Zhan sat on the other side, observing their subtle expressions with ease.","His bodyguard had already returned the gold bracelet and added something extra.","This plot to frame Qiao Chuchu was a sure win.","Qiao Chuchu glanced at him coldly.","Wen Zhan, who had been calm and composed, couldn’t help but slightly frown, his air of arrogance dissipating as he brooded.","Madam Wang looked down and realized her bracelet was missing, her face turning pale: \"Ah! My bracelet is gone! Help me find it!\"","The waitstaff panicked and searched, spending a full five minutes before the club manager apologized: \"We've searched everywhere, Madam Wang. Even the security cameras were checked, but they seem to be malfunctioning. I'm very sorry.\"","Madam Wang's face darkened: \"So, the bracelet my granddaughter gave me is lost here, and I can't even check the security footage?\"","The atmosphere grew tense instantly.","Yu Can tried to comfort her: \"Old Madam, don’t worry. Maybe it fell somewhere unnoticed. It will definitely turn up.\"","Lan Ying sneered: \"Oh dear, what if someone found it but was too greedy to return it? It could even be someone who stole it.\"","Others disagreed: \"No way. Who here would steal a gold bracelet? It’s not even valuable.\"","Xia Xuechun chimed in: \"I think stealing isn’t about the money. It’s more about the thrill. Even the wealthy can have strange habits, right?\"","The room fell silent.","Well, this argument does make sense.","Madam Wang's gaze sharpened: \"So, someone here took my bracelet while I wasn’t looking? Who could it be? Could it be one of the waitstaff?\"","The waitstaff widened their eyes in shock, their faces full of innocence.","Xia Xuechun rolled her eyes and softly suggested: \"I think the Eighth Miss of the Pei Family is quite suspicious.\"","She looked toward Qiao Chuchu: \"After all, I saw her acting suspiciously just now.\"","Everyone at the round table turned to look at Qiao Chuchu.","Their astonished gazes were filled with anticipation for a good show.","Old Madam Wang looked coldly at Qiao Chuchu: \"Miss Pei, shouldn’t you offer an explanation?\"","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head, staring back without flinching: \"Explain what? Does whatever she says count as the truth? Madam, being your age, your brain should serve a purpose, don’t you think?\"","Madam Wang: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a cold laugh.","She thought back to her past self in another timeline.","In those days, Xia Xuechun had accused her, making her furious: \"I’ve never even seen that bracelet!\"","Xia Xuechun had challenged her: \"If you didn’t do it, prove it with a search!\"","Back then, she had stood there, arms open, letting the bodyguards search her: \"Go ahead, search me!\"","And so, the waitstaff had eagerly produced the bracelet from her pocket.","She had been dumbfounded.","The next thing she knew, she was out the door, her reputation in ruins.","Coming back to the present, Qiao Chuchu slowly revealed a confident smile: \"By the way, I also saw Xia Xuechun acting suspiciously. Looks like we’re both suspects.\"","Xia Xuechun’s eyes widened incredulously: \"Don’t frame me! I didn’t steal anything!\"","Qiao Chuchu ignored her and marched up to Old Madam Wang: \"I just have one question, Madam Wang. Me, the Eighth Miss of the Pei Family, would you really think I’d steal your bracelet?\"","Xia Xuechun also pleaded to Madam Wang: \"Madam Wang, I didn’t steal it! You have to believe me!\"","Madam Wang frowned, scrutinizing Qiao Chuchu: \"Whether she stole it or not, a search will clear things up.\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked: \"Oh? Just search me?\"","Madam Wang lifted her chin, her sharp eyes gleaming: \"Yes, search you first.\"","Qiao Chuchu’s gaze hardened: \"What if I refuse?\"","Madam Wang’s face darkened: \"Then that proves your guilt.\"","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"On what basis do you judge me as guilty? Who do you think you are?\"","The room gasped at her audacity.","How dare a junior speak to Madam Wang like that!","Madam Wang's fury flared: \"What did you just say?!\"","Qiao Chuchu stood tall, staring down at her: \"I was invited here, not begging for an invitation. If I let you search me today, where would future generations' regard for me stand?\"","Madam Wang’s aged face was suffused with anger: \"Then it means you’re hiding guilt.\"","Qiao Chuchu pressed on: \"The second suspect hasn’t been searched yet. Why assume I’m guilty?\"","Madam Wang’s face darkened further, angry: \"Do you think Miss Xia would incriminate herself?\"","Xia Xuechun fumed: \"Madam Wang, you don’t need to defend me. I’ll just undress right now and prove my innocence!\"","Lan Ying immediately chimed in, \"Exactly! Xia Xuechun, let Qiao Chuchu see what a truly innocent person looks like!\"","Xia Xuechun defiantly took off her clothes!","She turned them inside out!","And shook them vigorously!","\"Clang~\"","A string of pink diamond bracelets fell out.","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Lan Ying: \"?\"","The guests at the round table stared in astonishment: \"Isn't that my bracelet? Wait... when did I lose it?\"","Xia Xuechun was shocked, her hand instinctively shaking again.","\"Jingling~\"","A Paraiba tourmaline necklace tumbled out.","Another guest touched her collarbone in disbelief: \"When did my necklace disappear?\"","She shook them again.","A pink diamond necklace fell out.","The woman who owned the stolen necklace was horrified: \"Good heavens! You must be so greedy—how many things have you stolen?\""]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Saying I'll give you a toy and I'll give you a toy, haha","paragraphs":["The expressions of the distinguished guests gradually turned astonished: \"Exactly, this isn't introducing friends, it's a meeting of notorious thieves!\"","\"That's right! And they even falsely accused Ms. Qiao!\"","Xia Xuechun blinked vigorously, confirming that the jewelry on the ground was not an illusion, and her limbs felt weak.","It's impossible!","This can't be possible!","Just as she was about to turn her clothes back, suddenly someone snatched them away!","Qiao Chuchu grabbed Xia Xuechun's clothes and shook them vigorously three times!","A golden bracelet clearly fell onto the carpet!","Everyone gasped in shock!","It was indeed her who stole them!","Although they already knew the answer, they were still greatly surprised!","The youngest sister among them couldn't help but exclaim, \"Oh my god, is Ms. Xia a legendary female thief? This could be a book material!\"","Xia Xuechun's face turned ashen, terror making her tremble all over: \"No, it wasn't me! Qiao Chuchu was the thief!\"","She had specifically placed the items in Qiao Chuchu's clothes, clearly remembering putting them in her chest!","How did they end up in her own clothes?!","What do you mean, they ended up in her clothes!","Qiao Chuchu threw the clothes to the ground, taunting: \"You're framing me, huh?\"","Xia Xuechun came to her senses, panic-stricken, shaking her head in disbelief: \"I-I don't know... It was clearly you... How am I the one...\"","Qiao Chuchu gave a glance to her bodyguard.","The bodyguard walked up to Xia Xuechun and said, \"I'm sorry.\"","Then he slapped Xia Xuechun hard across the face!","Xia Xuechun was caught off guard and fell to the ground, tears instantly filling her eyes: \"How dare you hit me?!\"","The bodyguard remained expressionless: \"Apologies, but since you insulted Miss Qiao, I'm avenging her. You can hit me back, but only if you can defeat me.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"!\"","Everyone looked astonished at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu turned to look at Old Lady Wang: \"Do you need me to search her? Lady Wang.\"","Old Lady Wang's face turned livid, stiffly staring at her.","Qiao Chuchu sneered: \"Don't you owe me an apology, Madame Wang?\"","Old Lady Wang's face darkened, her facial muscles twitching slightly.","She was clearly furious.","But she still gritted her teeth and said, \"I'm very sorry, Miss Pei. It was my fault. I wronged you. Please don't take it to heart.\"","Qiao Chuchu coldly laughed and didn't seem inclined to accept: \"Hm, then what? What about the others?\"","Old Lady Wang took a deep breath and looked at her own bodyguards: \"Throw Xia Xuechun out!\"","Lan Ying's face changed: \"Lady Wang, this—\"","Old Lady Wang shouted: \"Please leave too!\"","Lan Ying was stunned, looking absurdly at Qiao Chuchu, feeling wronged and clutching her chest.","Old Lady Wang also looked at Qiao Chuchu, a bit awkwardly: \"You can sit down, next to me.\"","Qiao Chuchu snorted: \"No thanks, I'm leaving too.\"","Old Lady Wang: \"?\"","Others: \"?\"","The youngest sister's eyes sparkled: \"!!!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed her handbag and disdainfully glared at Old Lady Wang: \"I won't stay in an environment that has insulted me, and I certainly won't sit next to someone who has doubted me.\"","Without looking back, she left with a contemptuous snort.","[This old woman really thinks she's the honorable empress dowager. This two-faced, merciless person... just thinking about sitting next to her makes me sick!]","[I'm not Qiao Chuchu anymore; I'm the reborn 2.0 version of Qiao Chuchu!]","[Let's go! I'm in a hurry to advance the plot! No more unnecessary services!]","Weisheng Yucan stood up and said with a smile: \"I’m leaving too.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan followed closely behind Qiao Chuchu.","Some others stood up: \"The executives of Weisheng must be unhappy, we should go check on them.\"","All those with good relations with the Weisheng Family left.","Only half remained in the club.","Old Lady Wang clenched her teeth, her heart already full of anger at Qiao Chuchu's disrespect.","Reckless!","Too reckless!","This Miss Pei of the Pei Family dared to talk to her like this? Which one on earth does she think she is?","She suppressed her anger: \"Since everyone has business, let's call it a day.\"","The crowd awkwardly agreed.","Old Lady Wang stood up, took the golden bracelet handed over by a waiter, and angrily left the club.","Lan Ying and Xia Xuechun exchanged a glance and quickly ran out too.","They wanted to ask Qiao Chuchu what exactly happened!","Qiao Chuchu strode toward the entrance.","Weisheng Yucan and Wenzhan quickly followed behind her.","Others also walked out, all eyes on Qiao Chuchu leading the way.","She stood straight-backed, proudly leading everyone, her high heels clicking, looking like a boss.","Old Lady Wang's eyes almost popped out, glaring at her with clenched teeth.","Suddenly, two sleek, shiny sports cars drove into the club entrance, performing a beautiful drift that stopped right in front of Qiao Chuchu.","One was pure pink.","One was pure black.","Qiao Chuchu paused, her head tilted in surprise.","Weisheng Huailing got out of the pink car and enthusiastically waved: \"Sister!\"","Weisheng Biehe got out of the other black car and nodded slightly at Qiao Chuchu.","Qiao Chuchu asked: \"How are you all here?\"","[And all at once, too.]","Others were even more shocked: \"Wow! All four members of the Weisheng Family are here?!\"","\"I heard that Ms. Pei is only pampered by Yucan, not by the others!\"","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow in confusion, looking at his two younger brothers: \"I remember I told the driver to come. How are you two here?\"","\"We've been having the butler keep an eye out,\" answered Weisheng Biehe, as he walked up to Qiao Chuchu, raising an eyebrow and looking at her: \"When we heard that my sister and brother are giving you this year's new sports car, we came to deliver it. We're not late, are we?\"","Qiao Chuchu was astonished: \"Gifting me a sports car?\"","She was baffled: \"When did that get decided?\"","Weisheng Huailing smiled and said, \"It was always meant to be yours. After all, you helped us out earlier! Otherwise, my brother and I would have been disgusted.\"","Weisheng Wenzhan nodded.","Qiao Chuchu still felt it was perplexing, but Weisheng Huailing came up to her and gestured with his hands: \"Don't think too much! Just take the car!\"","Of course, his sister didn't ask them to come.","But they saw Qiao Chuchu was unhappy and when they saw the driver come to deliver the car, they quickly stepped in to help.","They needed a legitimate chance to make an appearance!","Both of them felt a bit guilty.","Hopefully, they won't reveal anything.","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","[...So, not only did my sister Yucan and the Weisheng Family agree to give me a sports car, but the brothers even delivered it themselves? I can hardly imagine such enthusiasm towards me without a secret involved.]","The expressions of the Weisheng Family members involuntarily tensed up.","Qiao Chuchu whispered to Weisheng Yucan and Wenzhan: \"Did you mean it, really giving me a car?\"","Weisheng Wenzhan raised an eyebrow: \"Why would we joke about that?\"","Weisheng Huailing smiled radiantly, her admiration undisguised: \"You also helped us this time, saving us from poisoning. So, of course, we have to reward you with a sports car. Pick one to play with, and I'll have the other delivered to your garage. The contract for the delivery will be sent to you tonight.\"","Qiao Chuchu was overwhelmed by the kindness, glancing at the shocked faces of the other guests behind her.","She stepped forward, lowering her voice: \"But if it weren’t for the bodyguard’s help, I wouldn’t have been able to handle things today. I can’t accept so much from your help. This is just too much.\"","Weisheng Yucan raised an eyebrow: \"How could you say you didn’t help us? The first time we met, didn’t you save my life?\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, her brows furrowing as she thought: \"But that was a long time ago.\"","[In other situations, I’ve helped them, but I was very discreet, not anything very obvious, yet they’re so grateful. Could this also be related to a secret?]","[So maybe it’s because my identity as a time-traveling girl was revealed? So far, that’s the most reasonable guess, right?]","Weisheng Yucan's brows relaxed, and he gently patted her with concern, saying, \"A small kindness deserves a great return. Those two sports cars are nothing more than toys; you don't need to take them to heart. Besides, whatever we give you, you've earned it because you deserve it.\"","Weisheng Biehe nodded and genuinely smiled at her, \"That's right, Qiao Chuchu, you truly deserve it.\"","Weisheng Huailing, full of energy, gestured enthusiastically, \"Sister, don't stand on ceremony! What's mine is yours, and what's yours is still yours. Come on, let's get in the car!\"","Qiao Chuchu couldn't believe it, covering her mouth with both hands. She felt touched but also somewhat conflicted.","[If I didn't know they were hiding something from me, I would really feel like they're treating me so well. I would genuinely want to exchange my sincerity for theirs, but something just feels off.]","[They don't admit it, and I won't bring it up either. It's really awkward.]","The members of the Wei Sheng Family were momentarily stunned, their brows furrowing imperceptibly.","Weisheng Wenzhan reacted quickly, speaking with firm steadiness, \"Qiao Chuchu, pick one. The atmosphere is set, and this is a good opportunity for you to make a grand entrance and show those people what's what.\"","The other three nodded in agreement!","Qiao Chuchu hesitated for a moment, then forced a smile and looked at the sports cars, \"Well... I'm so torn. I can't decide which one to choose.\"","[Old Lady Wang is watching, so I'll pick a fancy one to make a grand exit and annoy her to death!]","Weisheng Huailing patted his chest confidently, \"Choose mine!\"","Weisheng Biehe remained expressionless, \"Choose mine.\"","Weisheng Yucan interjected, \"Wait, isn't there a possibility that these two cars were a gift from me and our eldest brother?\""]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: As Long as You Act Cool, She Can Run on Anything","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu bit her lower lip, deeply torn.","【I kind of want to choose pink because the pinker the color, the fiercer the hit, making me look both sweet and cool, creating a contrast with what just happened.】","But I also want to choose black because black is understated and steady, perfectly matching my earlier actions!","【How am I supposed to choose between these two amazing options?! Both are perfect for a grand exit!!】","【If only there were a third option!】","Suddenly, a loud engine roar came from the sky!","Qiao Chuchu looked towards the source of the sound, her eyes widening in amazement.","A pure white helicopter was flying towards them!","Old Lady Wang and Xia Xuechun gaped in disbelief.","Lan Ying was astonished: \"Is this also here for Qiao Chuchu?!\"","A man opened the helicopter's door, holding a microphone as he leaned out: \"Hello? Is Qiao Chuchu here? Qiao Chuchu, are you here? I've come to take you shopping.\"","The Weisheng Family members' faces changed.","Old Lady Wang's eyes widened in shock.","The guests were even more surprised: \"Weisheng Lin?!\"","Weisheng Lin stood inside the helicopter, waving triumphantly at Qiao Chuchu: \"Hi, Qiao Chuchu!~\"","Qiao Chuchu looked up, her face stunned as she watched Weisheng Lin in the sky.","【I said there should be a third option, and here it is! A third option just appeared!】","The helicopter slowly landed on the lawn.","Weisheng Lin, wearing a black leather jacket, strode towards her with arms outstretched, carefree: \"Qiao Chuchu, tell me, isn't Second Brother of the Weisheng Family handsome?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Before she could speak, Huai Ling and Biehe stepped forward!","Biehe blocked Weisheng Lin's path and warned in a low voice: \"What are you doing, you clown?!\"","Huai Ling angrily gestured: 「This old man, what does he have to do with anything? Get back in your helicopter and leave! Qiao Chuchu is going in my car!」","Biehe narrowed his eyes and taunted the fifth brother: \"In your car? Didn't you hear her say black is understated and luxurious? She's going in my car, so don't get ahead of yourself.\"","Huai Ling sneered: 「But you didn't see her say pink has a rebellious charm? Besides, do you think she would ride with a boring monk?」","Biehe was surprised, his voice suddenly dangerous: \"You think I'm boring?!\"","Weisheng Lin laughed carelessly, spreading his hands: \"Hey, hey, there's no need to doubt your own charm. I know I'm rogue-cool and a bit mischievous, but it's not like I'll make you both so anxious, right? Besides~ Who would choose a sports car when there's a helicopter?\"","Weisheng Biehe's face darkened: \"Shut up, old man!\"","Weisheng Lin's heart sank: \"Old man?!\"","Biehe glared fiercely at Huai Ling: \"Am I boring?\"","Huai Ling fake-smiled: 「When I stand here, even the sunlight shines on me. I'm sweet and adorable, anyone normal would choose me!」","Weisheng Biehe sneered: \"You're just putting on an act. I'm sincere through and through, unlike your fake, overly sweet-to-the-point-of-nausea charm. Do you really think you can win over women?\"","Huai Ling smiled coldly: 「I don't need to win over women; I just need to win over Qiao Chuchu.」","Weisheng Biehe spoke in a low voice: \"Well, Qiao Chuchu doesn't like your type.\"","Weisheng Lin clutched his chest, greatly hurt: \"I... I'm an old man... even if I look good, stay young at heart, and have no generational gap, am I still an old man?\"","Biehe and Huai Ling looked at him and nodded firmly.","Weisheng Lin was struck like lightning, pointing at Weisheng Wenzhan: \"So does that make the eldest brother her father?\"","Wenzhan frowned: \"Why does this involve me? The black Bugatti is mine, so what are you all showing off about?\"","Weisheng Yucan, standing beside them, looked extremely uncomfortable: \"Aren't you afraid Qiao Chuchu will think you're noisy?\"","They paused.","They had deliberately lowered their voices while arguing, chatting as if nothing was wrong. No one knew what they were really saying.","But—","Would Qiao Chuchu think they were noisy?","They turned around and found that Chuchu was gone.","Huai Ling was anxious: 「Where's Chuchu?」","Biehe also frowned: \"Where's Qiao Chuchu?\"","The guests, who had been watching in a daze, twitched their mouths.","The youngest girl among them pointed awkwardly towards the door: \"Miss Qiao just borrowed an electric bike from across the street and rode away.\"","Weisheng Yucan sneered: \"Yes, she waved at me.\"","The Weisheng family men looked at Yucan in shock: \"Why didn't you say anything?!\"","Yucan scoffed: \"Why should I? With all of you fighting over her, of course she'd run away!\"","They exchanged glances and split up to chase her!","Some got into sports cars, others into business cars, and some even took the helicopter, disappearing in a flash.","Weisheng Yucan stayed behind, glancing at the stunned guests, and smiled charmingly: \"It's a shame you've seen this, but Chuchu is just that adored by our family~ We all treasure her like a precious gem.\"","She taunted Old Lady Wang and Xia Xuechun, whose faces were livid: \"Those who treat her well, we, the Weisheng Family, remember. Don't worry.\"","Lan Ying: \"......\"","Xia Xuechun: \"......\"","Old Lady Wang: \"......\"","Others realized the underlying meaning—it seemed Qiao Chuchu was the family's darling!","That meant Old Lady Wang, Lan Ying, and Xia Xuechun were in trouble!","---","Qiao Chuchu rode her electric bike proudly, standing up, her expression as calm as a corpse.","It was proven.","As long as you play your confidence well, you can ride anything and escape.","And she needed time to digest the issue they had hidden from her. She couldn't immediately return to her previous state because that would be too fake.","Fake emotions—she'd rather discard than cling to.","Gradually, a car pulled alongside her.","The window slowly lowered, revealing Ji Yanchuan's gloomy face: \"Long time no see, woman. How have you been?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan glanced up and down at her, sarcastic: \"So, you don't have a car anymore? Aren't your brothers caring for you anymore?\"","He reached out, trying to pull her: \"Why don't you get in my car? I'll feel sorry for you.\"","A loud shout came from the sky: \"Hey, the Rolls-Royce below! Don't you know you're not allowed to stick your hand out the window while riding? Put your hand back in!\"","Ji Yanchuan was stunned and looked out.","A helicopter was hovering above the car!","Weisheng Lin leaned out with a microphone: \"I command you, old man! Stop pulling her around, got it?\"","Ji Yanchuan: \"?\"","Ji Yanchuan turned in shock to Qiao Chuchu: \"There's a helicopter, and you're not taking it? Are you flying a kite or something?!\"","Qiao Chuchu, expressionless, continued riding her electric bike.","A pink sports car blared its horn frantically, moving parallel to Ji Yanchuan's car!","A black Bugatti followed closely behind Ji Yanchuan's car!","Another Rolls-Royce elegantly overtook the two cars and blocked Ji Yanchuan's car.","The driver: \"Uh, sir, it looks like we're surrounded.\"","Ji Yanchuan stared in shock at Qiao Chuchu: \"How many people are following you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu indifferently turned her handlebars, riding the electric bike away coldly.","Leaving the chaos for Ji Yanchuan while she enjoyed the freedom of the wind.","【I don't have time to waste. I need to catch up on the plot because someone close to me is dying.】","The people in the car: \"?\"","Huai Ling quickly typed: 「Qiao Chuchu is rushing to follow the plot! She's in a state of suspicion+anger, so anyone who faces her next, good luck!!」","The group chat: 「?????????」"]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Who's Next on the Chopping Block","paragraphs":["Weisheng Huailing, who had previously surrounded Ji Yanchuan, no longer had the heart to do so.","He now had only one question: \"Who is the unlucky bastard next in line for the plot?\"","Lin Qing: \"Sob, sob, sob, I hope it’s not me! I can’t handle Qiao Chuchu’s suspicion and wrath.\"","Lou Yuejue: \"And it definitely shouldn’t be me! I’m not mentally prepared to handle it yet!\"","Lou Tingsi: \"@Pei Yuan, I think the probability is higher for someone from your family. Any thoughts?\"","Pei Yuan, cold as ice: \"As long as it’s not Pei Youchuan, anyone else is fine.\"","Pei Fengnong’s sharp remark: \"Third Brother is a guy who can’t keep his mouth shut. No problem with his work skills, but when it comes to matters of the heart, he’s got zero tact.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"What do you mean, who can’t keep his mouth shut?\"","Pei Mu: \"You.\"","Pei Ci: \"You.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"......\"","Pei Buxian said ominously: \"Pei Youchuan, if you expose us, I’ll come to your room at night...\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Ying Chen: \"What, to clobber him with a stick?\"","Pei Buxian: \"To cut up all his sneakers.\"","Ying Chen: \"?\"","Ying Chen sent a meme.","Weisheng Biehe: \"You better watch out. We’ve lost track of Qiao Chuchu. Currently, she’s MIA.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"Haha, you’re all way too nervous. It’s definitely not me. Although my plot hasn’t started yet, I have a feeling it’s still a long way off. After all, I’m the strongest guy in the Pei family. I’m the toughest, no one can touch me!\"","He raised his phone, filming a short video of his beaming smile: \"And I’m at the Lan City docks right now, about to board a luxury cruise to talk business. Let you guys in on this gorgeous view of the sea!\"","As Pei Youchuan turned around, he inadvertently caught Qiao Chuchu in the frame.","She appeared like a ghost, and her voice echoed in his mind: [Oh, my soon-to-be-drowned Third Brother, cherish these moments while you’re still breathing. Once you board that ship, you’ll become the sole unlucky soul to meet your end in this capsizing disaster.]","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Huh?","He put down the phone, his fingers instinctively hitting send.","No one had opened the video filled with his self-admiration.","But then Pei Buxian chimed in: \"Ah! Chuchu’s in the video! It’s definitely Third Brother’s turn to die!\"","Even Qiao Chuchu’s inner thoughts were recorded!","Pei Fengnong couldn’t believe it: \"Pei Youchuan is going to drown?\"","Among the Pei brothers, Pei Youchuan was the most robust, practically a double-door fridge.","Pei Ci couldn’t help but comment: \"You really can’t judge a book by its cover. I thought he’d at least get trampled by an elephant.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","What’s with the elephant comment?!","He nervously looked up, staring at Qiao Chuchu not far away.","The sea breeze caressed Qiao Chuchu’s fluffy curls as she hopped off her scooter, standing beside it, watching him.","Pei Youchuan instinctively took two steps back.","...Why do the things I fear the most always happen?","What would Qiao Chuchu do to him? Would she hate him?","Punish him?","He wanted to back away further, but his feet felt rooted to the ground, refusing to budge.","To his surprise, he realized that if Qiao Chuchu were to punish him for this, he didn’t want to escape. He only wanted to apologize, to please her, no matter what, just don’t ignore him.","But if Qiao Chuchu ignored him because of those thoughts...","It would be better to kill him.","Thinking this, he grinned, spreading his arms and running toward her: \"It’s been a minute, and you’re already coming to see me. You must miss me. Come, let Third Brother give you a hug, and let’s head to the luxury cruise together!\"","Qiao Chuchu turned and walked away, straight to the staff, pulling out a wad of cash: \"I’m a mom, and my son Zihan will be boarding the ship later. I believe your ship has safety issues. Please thoroughly inspect it now.\"","[It’s so easy to fix Pei Youchuan’s mess. Just find the bad spot on the ship, have the staff switch it, and that’s it. I don’t even need to waste words on Pei Youchuan. This will be solved effortlessly.]","Qiao Chuchu smirked: [Zihan is a treasure, always ready to shine.]","The staff was a bit awkward: \"Eh...that doesn’t really comply with regulations. Where’s your son Zihan?\"","Pei Youchuan, looking like a mobile fridge, stepped up to the staff, his voice booming: \"I am Zihan.\"","The staff: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\""]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: I Will Not Let You Go","paragraphs":["The staff member glanced at Qiao Chuchu, then at Pei Youchuan, and repeated the process, his mouth twitching: \"Is this really your Zihan?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","The staff member looked up at Pei Youchuan's tall stature: \"You said Zihan is your child, right? Is this boy your son?\"","Qiao Chuchu, who had initially shown a disdainful expression, instantly perked up: \"Yes, he is my son.\"","Staff member: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan calmly replied: \"If she wants you to check, then check. I am a diamond client here, and so is she.\" He pressed money into Qiao Chuchu's hand, took out his phone, first proving his identity as a diamond client, and then prepared to scan with WeChat: \"I'll give you the money, as a token of appreciation for your hard work and the staff around you.\"","Staff member: \"?\"","This girl is saying he's her son, yet he doesn't even bother to clarify and just smoothly moves on to the next step?","The staff member scratched his head: \"Alright, since you are a diamond client, I'll just seek approval from my supervisor, no need for you to pay.\"","The staff member walked away.","Pei Youchuan put away his phone and smiled at Qiao Chuchu: \"I thought you were in a bad mood.\"","Earlier, from quite a distance away, her face looked so sour.","As if she was about to kill someone.","After all, she had just found out that they had collectively kept a secret from her, and if it were him, he would definitely be upset too.","He tentatively asked: \"Are you really not angry?\"","Qiao Chuchu raised her chin, not answering the question, but instead asked: \"Do you know how some cases of breast cancer are caused?\"","Pei Youchuan furrowed his brow: \"How?\"","\"By holding in anger!\" She relaxed: \"I've indeed been in a bad mood recently, but I've already adjusted!\"","【They have a secret they're hiding from me, but it doesn't matter to me anymore. I can't keep moping around forever.】","【They have something they're hiding from me, but I can also hide something from them. Once I survive until the end, I'll just go abroad and live it up!】","【Let my brother search and he won't find me!】","Pei Youchuan's smile stiffened: \"?\"","What?!","Qiao Chuchu was in a great mood.","【Most importantly, riding a scooter just reminded me of my past life when I worked odd jobs delivering takeout. Back then, no money, no home, I couldn't even afford to buy clothes, and I had to deal with people every day, so tired.】","【Compared to the trivial problems I faced in my past life, the setbacks in this life of wealth and luxury are nothing.】","【By the time of the finale, I'll take the money I've earned and go on a lavish world tour!】","【As for the secret, if they want to tell me, fine, if not, whatever. I'll be cautious and not invest too much genuine emotion, to avoid getting hurt once the truth comes out.】","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","He picked up his phone and decisively did something.","Qiao Chuchu's phone dinged, and she casually glanced at it.","?","Received a transfer of two million from Pei Youchuan?!","Qiao Chuchu looked up in shock: \"What are you doing?\"","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow at her, his tone mysterious: \"Just giving you some pocket money, go ahead and spend it. If you need more, just ask your big brother.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"Ha?\"","She squinted suspiciously: \"Are you hiding some secret from me and feeling guilty so you're trying to compensate me?\"","Pei Youchuan scoffed disdainfully: \"Ha, little sister, you really underestimate your big brother's love for you.\"","With a dramatic turn, he lifted her chin, leaning in close with a deep expression: \"Big brother just wants to give you some pocket money, that's all. It's been seven years, so it's about time I made up for it.\"","Qiao Chuchu squinted incomprehensibly: \"Don't you think you're being a bit too... oily?\"","Pei Youchuan, pinching her chin, his mouth twitched, a bit embarrassed: \"I do think so, but I'm not saying it, so I look cool.\"","She laughed and cried at the same time: \"Then why don't you just act normal?\"","Pei Youchuan immediately straightened up: \"Yes! Listening to sister!\"","While saying that, his hand that was pinching her chin very malevolently rubbed her lips.","Qiao Chuchu was caught off guard and stepped back: \"Ouch! It hurts!\"","Pei Youchuan gently wrapped his arm around her waist and said, \"Don't move, there's dust.\"","He leaned down, his fingers lightly brushing her lips: \"Hmm... why can't I wipe it off?\"","As he spoke, he glanced away, looking into Qiao Chuchu's eyes.","Her beauty was magnified close up, yet it seemed to be shrouded in a misty haze.","Right in his hand, yet not in his hand.","Pei Youchuan swallowed hard.","Qiao Chuchu stood on tiptoe, frowning: \"Is the dust still not gone? I can't stand any longer.\"","Pei Youchuan didn't answer, instead lifting her by the waist, effortlessly lifting her entire body up!","He pressed down a gradually heavier breath: \"Just a moment, just a moment longer.\"","His hand worked with force and restraint on her lips, his Adam's apple rolling as he unconsciously licked his own lips.","Pei Youchuan glanced away, his gaze on Qiao Chuchu's face.","Qiao Chuchu glanced away to look at the sea, already zoning out.","Compelled by some inexplicable force, he pursed his lips and slowly leaned closer to her.","He felt her gentle breathing.","Pei Youchuan's heart was about to leap out, and he carefully moved closer, closing his eyes...","Qiao Chuchu: 【Which country should I live in after the finale? By myself, I should choose a country as safe as China, with good scenery, somewhere I can relax and paint. Preferably somewhere my brother can't find me.】","His almost bursting heart suddenly stopped, and he stared at her in shock.","Qiao Chuchu came back to herself: \"Wow! Why are you so close to me?!\"","Pei Youchuan didn't speak, instead holding her face close, his other hand around her waist, his eyes silently turning red.","Qiao Chuchu was astonished: \"You? Are you crying?\"","Pei Youchuan blinked: \"Sand got into my eyes.\"","That said, his grip on her didn't loosen.","Qiao Chuchu struggled a bit: \"If sand got into your eyes, you should rub it, let me go first.\"","\"I won't, I want you to blow on it,\" he firmly grabbed her wrist: \"Blow on it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She sighed: \"Bend down then.\"","Pei Youchuan leaned down, pointing to his eye.","She carefully opened his eyelid, inspecting: \"I don't see anything, and I'm not very good at blowing into eyes, I'll try okay?\"","She gently blew, then let go, expecting: \"How is it?\"","Pei Youchuan, still bent over, looked up at her, tears slowly gathering, and then rolling down in large droplets!","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Did I blow the sand inside?!\"","He didn't speak, just showing that pitiful, abandoned-big-golden-retriever expression.","Qiao Chuchu tilted her head curiously, and he suddenly rushed up, lifting her from below with all his might!","Qiao Chuchu felt like a ball being tossed by a big ox!","She was off the ground, panicking and hugging his head: \"Wow! Isn't this a bit too much for sand in the eye?!\"","Pei Youchuan buried his face in her chest, sniffing her scent, tightly tightening his arms: \"No...\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"No?\"","Pei Youchuan whispered lowly, very softly: \"Don't leave... don't leave...\"","His voice was blown away by the wind: \"I won't let you go.\""]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Please Don't Hate Me, I'll Do Whatever You Say","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu could barely make out a word: \"What are you mumbling about in that silly voice?\"","Pei Youchuan felt her arms wrap around his head, rubbing against him forcefully.","Qiao Chuchu: \"......?\"","【Although I have no idea what he's doing, I just want to ask, doesn't his arm get sore holding me up for so long?】","She glanced around and saw the staff member who had gone to inspect the boat heading towards her.","Qiao Chuchu quickly patted him: \"Put me down! They're back!\"","【They must have found a flaw in the boat!】","【That's great! Not only will Pei Youchuan not drown, but the others will be spared this scare!】","She struggled violently, but Pei Youchuan didn't let go; he held her tightly.","The staff member who walked over saw them still in that position and chuckled teasingly: \"You two seem quite close.\"","Qiao Chuchu felt embarrassed and gave Pei Youchuan a hard pat on the shoulder, gritting her teeth: \"Put me down! Right now!\"","He held on tightly, ignoring her.","Qiao Chuchu pulled a face: \"It's okay, our Zihan just has a few screws loose. How's the inspection going?\"","The staff member laughed: \"Exactly, I came back to tell you about that. After inspecting, we found a serious flaw in the cruise ship. So, we've decided to switch to another ship that's in perfect condition. We've already inspected the new ship thoroughly and there are no issues. To thank you, we'll offer you a gift once you board. Could you please give me your name?\"","\"Pei Youchuan,\" Qiao Chuchu replied without hesitation: \"I won't be boarding; I don't have a ticket.\"","The staff member's eyes lit up: \"If that's the case, we can give you a ticket since your husband is a diamond client.\"","Qiao Chuchu let out a dry laugh: \"Ah, well, I think I'll pass.\"","【I want to go home and clear my head.】","Pei Youchuan, muffled in Qiao Chuchu's embrace, heard her words and suddenly felt as if his soul was being violently tugged!","His head spun, and he didn't know where he was being pulled. Opening his eyes, he found himself floating in the air, witnessing Qiao Chuchu lying on the road, her head smashed and bloody.","He sucked in a sharp breath, urgently setting her down: \"You can't go home!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Why not?\"","He didn't answer, instead looking at the staff member: \"Give her a ticket. She'll stay on my floor. My name is Pei Youchuan.\"","The staff member nodded and quickly went to handle it.","Qiao Chuchu was perplexed: \"Pei Youchuan, what are you doing??\"","Pei Youchuan nervously grabbed her hand, his palm sweaty: \"You can't leave. I just saw you—\"","Suddenly, a sharp pain struck his heart, and he clutched his chest, collapsing to the ground!","Qiao Chuchu's face shifted dramatically as she crouched before him: \"Are you having a heart issue?!\"","Pei Youchuan breathed rapidly, his vision gradually shrouded by a layer of darkness that slowly cleared.","But his view was no longer on the beach.","Instead, it was a strange place.","His perspective was fixed in one spot.","Surrounded by flowers and trees, it seemed to be a cemetery.","Qiao Chuchu stood before him, wearing black.","Her cheeks were gaunt, her hair disheveled, her eyes devoid of light. She spoke slowly: \"Brother, do you know what day it is today?\"","Beneath her eyes were heavy dark circles, and with tears in her eyes, she smiled: \"It's my mom's memorial day, and also the day we met. When we were little, we would always go to pay our respects to her on this day.\"","\"Now my mom is gone, my foster mom is gone, and all of you are gone.\"","\"It's just me left.\"","Weeping and laughing, she continued: \"But it's not like I'm completely alone; I have so many suitors chasing after me. I can't shake them off; they cling to me like dogs, wanting to marry me.\"","With self-mockery, Qiao Chuchu added: \"Well, they only want my fortune. Since all of you are gone, all of the Pei Family's wealth belongs to me now. Even those who could speak before they died transferred their assets to me. I'm now a very, very rich woman. They all want a piece of me.\"","\"So, I suddenly thought, when you were alive, you used to help me burn love letters. Back then, I didn't understand and got angry. But now, I wonder if you were actually helping me screen for someone genuine.\"","Her tears fell onto their tombstone: \"But where are the genuine ones? Once all of you were gone, I had no true friends left by my side.\"","Pei Youchuan raised his eyes and saw several men walking towards her in the background.","They were all dressed in well-tailored suits, with hair slicked back, competing to approach her: \"Chuchu.\"","They reached her side, supporting her affectionately, and spoke over each other: \"Chuchu, don't cry, you know, death is inevitable. You're breaking my heart with tears like that.\"","\"My mom cooked a whole table of dishes just for you, and my whole family is waiting for you to come home and eat, Chuchu. With us here, you'll have a family again. You don't have your brothers, but you have me!\"","\"Chuchu, I love you. You know that. I fell for you in elementary school, but back then I was too timid to talk to you. But now, I've changed; I've worked hard!\"","\"Chuchu, you're becoming more and more unstable. Trust me, my sister is a psychiatrist, and she'll definitely help you.\"","Qiao Chuchu tried to escape, but she was too thin.","Emaciated to the point of being skin and bones, she couldn’t push their bodies away. All she could do was desperately clutch onto their tombstone, but to no avail, as they tore her away, fighting over her.","She looked wearily at the men surrounding her, then suddenly, with newfound strength, broke free from all of them and threw herself toward their tombstone: \"Brother, I already have a detailed plan. If you're watching from heaven, please bless me!\"","Qiao Chuchu was once again seized by the men, being pulled further and further away, shouting with all her might—","“Brother, let me try again. I promise we won't end up like this. Please wait for me, just wait for me!!”","Pei Youchuan jolted awake, the smell of the sea breeze hitting his face.","He knelt there, lost.","Qiao Chuchu crouched in front of him, looking at him curiously: \"What’s wrong with you? Why are you crying so hard?\"","Pei Youchuan said nothing.","In front of him, Qiao Chuchu’s skin was fair and tender, her cheeks full, her eyes brimming with vitality.","She was like a different person compared to the broken, gaunt Qiao Chuchu from moments ago.","That Qiao Chuchu would come every day to visit them, dressed entirely in black, bringing their favorite foods, sitting in the cemetery talking to them.","The caretakers whispered among themselves, saying she was a rich, crazy woman, surrounded by the dead.","But she didn't mind; she talked about so many things, recounting their shared past and her own experiences alone.","She even mentioned the system she was trapped in, starting with her refusal to comply, to being gradually broken down and forced to submit.","She confessed her regrets for letting them down.","Regret for letting herself down.","Pei Youchuan felt as if he had lived through those experiences himself, something surfacing in his mind like creeping vines, slowly blending with his current memories.","He began to feel overwhelming panic, clutching Qiao Chuchu tightly in his arms!","\"Chuchu, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry!\"","Qiao Chuchu found it bewildering: \"What?\"","Pei Youchuan wept uncontrollably, trembling: \"I'm sorry for blaming you, for neglecting you. I was wrong, I know I was wrong. I'll make it up to you, whatever you want. Don't hate me, please don't hate me!\""]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: Pei Youchuan 2.0","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu: \"????\"","She was confused: \"What did you hear? Or see? Why did you suddenly admit your mistake?\"","[Did the system talk to him?]","[Or did Pei Youchuan gain some kind of precognitive ability?]","She became more and more anxious: \"What did you see?!\"","Pei Youchuan opened his mouth to speak, but a sharp pain hit his heart.","It was as if saying it out loud would result in his immediate demise.","After hesitating for a moment, he shook his head: \"I just saw you crying at the cemetery while holding you. You looked very thin, and I seemed to be dead, unable to move.\"","Qiao Chuchu was astonished: \"Really?\"","[Is that the 'me' from the first timeline? Could Pei Youchuan's memory be also messed up?]","Pei Youchuan nodded: \"Yes, just for a moment. I felt that emotion.\"","His heart ached with a dull pain: \"Now that I think about it, it was probably just a hallucination.\"","The pain in his heart instantly disappeared.","Qiao Chuchu was taken aback and nodded thoughtfully: \"A hallucination, huh.\"","[So he can't see anything after all. Probably just a connection that was made. But why would that happen all of a sudden?]","[If only I could ask the system. Unfortunately, it can contact me, but I can't contact it. I'll have to wait for it to talk to me again and ask then.]","She frowned in thought.","[Could it be that Pei Youchuan from the first timeline merged into this Pei Youchuan's body?]","Pei Youchuan knelt on the ground, his deep eyes flickering with an eerie light. Although his face didn't show any expression, a layer of anger and gloom enveloped him, making him look both menacing and terrifying.","Qiao Chuchu stood up, trying to help him up: \"Can you stand now? Should we go to the hospital?\"","A black object came flying from the shadows!","Qiao Chuchu turned to look but had no time to dodge!","Her body was suddenly pushed down by someone!","Pei Youchuan's strong force pressed her down, lifting her face and moving it to the side!","A shot put slammed heavily beside her face!","A loud \"Boom!\" echoed.","Qiao Chuchu widened her eyes, looking rigidly to the side.","The shot put was pressed tightly against her skin.","If it weren't for Pei Youchuan, the shot put would have crushed her head...","Qiao Chuchu was still in shock as she looked at Pei Youchuan who was lying over her.","[Goodness, I've been assassinated so many times that I forgot accidents could kill me too.]","Pei Youchuan's gloomy eyes locked onto her. His robust figure like a beast completely protected her underneath. His handsome yet cold expression was now completely dark, exuding an unpredictable aura.","Qiao Chuchu's breath caught, feeling a change in his presence—a mysterious, dangerous vibe.","A man rushed over hurriedly: \"I'm sorry, my son accidentally threw the shot put. He just didn't aim well!\"","Without a word, Pei Youchuan grabbed the heavy shot put and slammed it hard onto the man's shoulder: \"GET LOST!!!\"","The man jumped in fright, clutching his painful shoulder with some anger, but when he saw Pei Youchuan's fierce gaze looking like he wanted to kill, he became intimidated. Muttering to himself, he picked up the shot put and left.","Qiao Chuchu stared blankly at Pei Youchuan.","He gently picked her up, repeatedly comforting her: \"Don't be afraid, I'm here, we're not afraid.\"","She leaned on his shoulder, feeling a bit awkward: \"Um... I wasn't really scared, though.\"","[As long as it's not someone trying to assassinate me, I handle accidents just fine.]","She pushed herself away from him: \"I'm going home now.\"","[Time to rest at home, now that the boat has been replaced with a new one, probably nothing will happen.]","Pei Youchuan frowned, thinking of the scene where Qiao Chuchu would die in a car accident.","He grabbed her hand, determined: \"I won't let you go!\"","Qiao Chuchu was stunned, her face showing disapproval: \"What, are you into the overbearing CEO forced imprisonment series now? Do you think I'd listen to you?\"","Pei Youchuan scoffed, taking out his phone: \"If you stay, I'll give you three million more, as your payment for our date—uh, for our 'relaxing together' fee.\"","Qiao Chuchu's face darkened, pulling her hand free: \"You're underestimating me! In your eyes, just a few million from you would be enough to make me get on that boat with you? Am I really that money-obsessed?!\"","Pei Youchuan was surprised, a bit flustered: \"You... aren't?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"No, I am.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu took out her phone, speaking with righteous indignation: \"Transfer the money now, and I'll throw in a hand-drawn portrait as a gift. I'll draw it for you on the boat, and deliver it to your doorstep once we return, what do you say, feeling tempted yet?!\"","Pei Youchuan was surprised for a moment, then his lips gradually curved into a smile.","The murderous glint in his eyes was slowly suppressed, his expression calm yet cunning as he revealed a tiny canine tooth: \"Tempted, I'm tempted to death.\"","He took out his phone and swiftly transferred the money, wrapping his arm around Qiao Chuchu's shoulder. He moved close to her, greedily inhaling her scent: \"Then let's get on the boat together, my little sister.\""]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Who on Earth is the Weirdo","paragraphs":["As the ship sailed into the open sea, Qiao Chuchu stood by the window, gazing at the scenery, but suddenly felt a bit puzzled: \"It seems like most of our recent alone time has been on boats.\"","[My third brother must have a watery fate, always hanging out on boats. No wonder his name is You Chuan.]","Pei Youchuan didn't respond, lost in thought, staring out the window.","He was still thinking about that Qiao Chuchu who visited the cemetery every day.","That Qiao Chuchu would kneel on the ground, tuck her disheveled hair behind her ears, and greet each tombstone one by one, speaking softly.","Every time she came to his tombstone, she would put a flyer for a new event from his mobile game company.","\"I may not be very smart, but I've managed your mobile game company very well, and the profits are high, though not as high as when you were here. Still, we've consistently ranked in the top three, so you can rest easy.\"","She bit her lower lip, hesitating: \"Third Brother, that day years ago when I delayed you, I never wanted to embarrass you in front of your client. I fainted twice trying to resist the system. I was in so much pain, but the system forced me to stay awake, making me act crazy in front of your client, almost hurting your partner and causing you to lose that big deal.\"","Tears welled up in her eyes: \"You must hate me, I know. If it were you who ruined my deal, I would hate you too.\"","\"You died so suddenly, we didn't even get a chance to talk things out.\"","She choked up: \"I wish so much... that you wouldn't have blamed me at the end.\"","Pei Youchuan felt a lump in his throat, his eyes reddening.","No, he was the one who should be blamed.","He was the one in the wrong.","He had been wrong all along.","He knew fully well that Qiao Chuchu was forced by the system, yet he still put all the blame on her.","It was his stupidity that had hurt her heart and made her so sad!!","Pei Youchuan followed behind Qiao Chuchu, his eyes reddening again: \"Chuchu, third brother here—\"","A bottle flew out from the shadows!","He caught it with ease!","Qiao Chuchu was completely unaware and continued walking upstairs.","Pei Youchuan stared angrily at the bottle in his hand, turning to glance at the crowd below.","Several mischievous kids were curiously watching him, laughing and dispersing as soon as they saw him catch the bottle.","One of them, the loudest, called out gleefully: \"He caught my bottle! I thought it would hit that girl!\"","Pei Youchuan threw the water bottle with precision, hitting the boy squarely on the back!","The boy was caught off guard, landing face first on the ground, and got up crying loudly.","Pei Youchuan glared at him fiercely, muttering under his breath: \"Cry! Cry louder!\"","\"As long as I'm alive, no one can hurt my Chuchu, not even myself!\"","Qiao Chuchu was completely oblivious as she reached the third-floor balcony, glancing towards the restaurant: [Thirsty, want to drink water.]","Suddenly, Pei Youchuan appeared behind her!","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Moments later, Pei Youchuan reappeared in front of her, eagerly presenting a tray: \"We've just boarded the ship, you must be thirsty now. I've got juice, soda, tea, and coffee here. Which one would you like?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","She stared in shock at the tray filled with various drinks: \"How did you know I wanted to drink water?\"","\"Because I'm thirsty.\" Pei Youchuan looked at her expectantly, like a big dog wagging its tail: \"So after you choose one, the rest will be mine.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Can you even finish all of that?\"","[And does one even buy so many drinks just because they're thirsty?]","She scanned the juices: \"No peach juice?\"","Without hesitation, Pei Youchuan replied: \"You can't drink that. The peach juice here is made from real peaches, and you're allergic to peaches. If you drink it, you'll have difficulty breathing, and if not treated in time, you could die of anaphylactic shock.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? I'm not allergic to peaches.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"You are now.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"What?\"","Pei Youchuan paused, clearing his throat uncomfortably, squinting as he questioned: \"Qiao's Mother is allergic to peaches, didn't you know?\"","Qiao Chuchu furrowed her brows: \"How would I know? My mom passed away when I was three.\"","[And I was transported to this world during her funeral. I don't know much about her, only that Pei's Mother told me she was a strong, free-spirited woman.]","Pei Youchuan watched Qiao Chuchu thoughtfully, secretly relieved.","When he saw Qiao Chuchu at the cemetery, he connected with the memories of his own dead self from that timeline.","In that timeline, he had died earlier and had remained in spirit form by Qiao Chuchu's side, witnessing many things.","The memories were blurry, hard to recall, but the emotions remained.","That mixture of hatred and helplessness, a feeling that lingered in his chest, unable to be released.","Qiao Chuchu herself wasn't originally allergic to peaches.","But due to the reason she was being erased from the world, her body had developed severe allergic reactions to certain fruits.","Qiao Chuchu would end up in the hospital due to a peach allergy.","And in that timeline, someone had tried to use her peach allergy as a means to kill her.","That Qiao Chuchu had wearily told them at the cemetery: \"Now I only dare to drink boiled water and eat food I make myself. That day, I discovered that the cook I hired had intentionally put peach juice in my food, because they were after my bag, my jewelry.\"","Pei Youchuan snapped back to reality, a flash of killing intent passing through his eyes: \"Trust me, Chuchu, I would never hurt you.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked into his sincere eyes.","Pei Youchuan's eyes reflected her silhouette, speaking resolutely: \"I won't let anyone have the chance to put you in danger!\"","A strange warmth spread through her heart, warming her entire body.","[Ah, suddenly saying something like that... I kind of like it.]","[But I think the secret they're hiding is that they know I'm a transmigrator. That's why he's saying this, isn't it?]","Pei Youchuan watched her moved expression and moved closer: \"From today on, your food and drink will be supervised by me and your other brothers equally!\"","He spoke with conviction: \"Even if we hire a chef to cook, I'll personally supervise them. I'll sleep on a rug in your room, have us take turns guarding you, set up surveillance cameras in your room, and track your every move. Additionally, I'll put a pinhole camera on you, ensuring that no perverts can get close to you!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? You're the real pervert here.\"","Pei Youchuan spoke very seriously: \"With the pinhole camera, I'll know which men and women you've come into contact with. Of course, I can overlook the women, but with men, I must be highly vigilant!\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him a sidelong glance.","He looked back at her seriously.","Qiao Chuchu picked up an orange juice, enunciating clearly with one word:","Roll."]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Has Pei Youchuan secretly acted behind the scenes","paragraphs":["She turned around and left.","Pei Youchuan followed her with a tray in hand: \"Chuchu, my little sister—\"","Suddenly, a sharp pain shot through his heart!","Pei Youchuan's face turned pale in an instant!","Damn, every time he thought about telling her the truth, his heart hurt so much!","He couldn't help but feel even more upset.","No wonder Qiao Chuchu had been coerced by the system all this time.","He must have been an idiot, blaming her when she had suffered so much!","With great effort, he kept holding the tray, ready to catch up with her: \"Chuchu, aren't you going to try the other drinks? You haven't tried them yet.\"","\"Mr. Pei?\" A male voice called from behind.","Pei Youchuan looked back.","Boss Zhang, the man he was supposed to meet, was standing behind him with a smile.","Boss Zhang said, \"I was looking for you. I sent you a message, but you didn't reply. I thought something had happened to you.\"","He glanced at the tray in Pei Youchuan's hand: \"Why do you have so many drinks?\"","Pei Youchuan, who was tall and impeccably dressed in a suit, held a tray filled with colorful liquids and various styles of cups.","His temperament and this vibrant tray didn't match at all.","It was like a handsome, contrasting \"mother hen.\"","Even Boss Zhang's secretary couldn't help but chuckle.","Pei Youchuan didn't care and said indifferently, \"These are for my sister. I didn’t know which ones she would like, so I got them all.\"","Boss Zhang laughed: \"Everyone says you're very fond of your sister. Seeing is believing. Let me have my secretary take the tray for you.\"","Boss Zhang's secretary stepped forward and took the tray.","Boss Zhang commented: \"Your relationship with your sister is so close, even if you weren't blood-related, it seems like you are.\"","Pei Youchuan picked up his phone: \"Well, we've lived together for so long, so we've developed a deep bond.\"","Boss Zhang: \"?\"","Why did that description seem a bit off?","Pei Youchuan sent Qiao Chuchu 50,000 yuan via WeChat: \"Want to play a bet that tests your endurance?\"","Qiao Chuchu quickly accepted the 50,000 yuan: \"What kind of bet?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"I'm at the third-floor restaurant. Come and find me. Stay within my sight until my meeting with the client is over, and you can earn another 100,000 yuan!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?? Is this some low-difficulty task that earns me 150,000 yuan? Are you insane, or am I insane? Or do you just have too much money to burn?\"","Pei Youchuan pondered for a moment and typed: \"I’m betting that you won’t want to stay within my sight. If you don’t show up, or if you leave before the time is up, you owe me 200,000 yuan. You’ve already taken the money, so you’re in. If you don’t come now, you owe me 200,000 yuan right now!\"","Knowing Qiao Chuchu’s personality as a little money-grubber, he was sure she would bite.","Indeed, Qiao Chuchu replied: \"You've sparked my competitive spirit! I guarantee you won't get a single penny from me!\"","She rushed upstairs and appeared within Pei Youchuan's sight, smirking confidently, looking like she had already won.","She resembled the popular \"Fresh Brother\" meme from the internet.","Pei Youchuan stood tall, put away his phone, and raised an eyebrow as he looked at her and smiled: \"Come with me.\"","Just before entering the restaurant, he whispered to her: \"Don’t forget, if you leave my sight, you owe me 200,000 yuan.\"","Qiao Chuchu gave him an OK gesture!","【150,000 yuan is mine for the taking!】","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow and smiled cheerfully. He followed Boss Zhang into the restaurant.","Qiao Chuchu sat by a bar and started making a mind map on her phone, continuing to sort out the plot and character relations.","A familiar voice came from behind her: \"Luna, thank you for letting me come on the cruise with you. I've never been on such a luxurious cruise before, and I didn't even have a ticket. You managed to get me on at the last minute. I'm really grateful.\"","Qiao Chuchu looked toward the source of the voice.","Xia Xuechun was walking alongside a beautiful woman with voluminous curls.","Luna was tall and alluring, wearing a sexy short skirt paired with fur, while Xia Xuechun was still in her wrinkled Chanel suit, shoes a bit dirty, her whole demeanor looking dull and lifeless.","Clearly, she was Luna's subordinate.","Luna glanced at Xia Xuechun proudly: \"It's nothing. You weren't able to stay at the dinner after it was interrupted, so I just let you keep me company. After all, you’re Uncle Long’s adopted daughter.\"","After saying that, Luna added curiously: \"But why did Madam Wang’s tea gathering end so early? It usually lasts for hours.\"","Xia Xuechun lowered her head in guilt: \"Someone framed me for stealing, and Madam Wang got mad at me.\"","Luna's eyes widened in surprise: \"Who?\"","Xia Xuechun's clear eyes flickered with resentment as she looked up: \"Qiao—\"","Before she could finish, she saw Qiao Chuchu.","Xia Xuechun's breathing hitched, and her lifeless appearance immediately transformed into one of vigor, like a rooster pumped full of adrenaline: \"Qiao Chuchu?!\"","Luna was also surprised as she looked at Qiao Chuchu, her expression changing: \"Qiao Chu?\"","Qiao Chuchu put her hand under her chin and lazily stared at the two of them: \"How surprising, my two not-so-friendly acquaintances meeting each other. Guess that old saying is true—the enemy of my enemy is my friend, huh?\"","Xia Xuechun looked at Luna in surprise: \"Luna, you’re not on good terms with Qiao Chuchu either?\"","Qiao Chuchu gave a playfully wicked smile: \"What do you mean 'not on good terms'? She fled the country out of fear and didn’t dare come back for years. Right, Luna?\"","Luna's face turned pale as she stared at Qiao Chuchu without saying a word.","Qiao Chuchu gave Luna a cold smile.","During the dark years after Pei Mom passed away and the Pei family fell into chaos, Luna had led the girl gang that bullied her.","The school they attended was full of wealthy and influential families, so overt bullying was rare. It was usually a case of the leader of a clique exploiting their underlings.","Luna was one of those leaders.","She had pursued Pei Youchuan intensely for many years, but he always rejected her.","After Pei Mom's death, the family's fortune was taken by other members of the Pei family, leaving them penniless.","Luna then turned on them, getting boys to beat up Pei Youchuan and girls to beat her up.","But Qiao Chuchu wasn’t easy to bully. She brought homemade stink bombs to school for revenge, and the one who got it the worst was Luna.","Luna, however, didn’t back down. Even after being tricked multiple times, she kept bringing her gang to attack Qiao Chuchu in the girls’ bathroom.","During those times when the numbers were against her, Qiao Chuchu indeed suffered, but she was cunning and developed crude, dirty weapons to fight back, refusing to let Luna have the last word.","Later, one by one, the members of the Pei family met with unfortunate accidents, and her status grew stronger day by day.","Luna must have sensed the ominous atmosphere and fled the country without looking back.","After so many years, it seemed Luna still hadn’t changed, still reveling in her role as a clique queen.","The only difference was that she now had Xia Xuechun among her plastic sisters.","Qiao Chuchu was a bit curious.","Luna wasn't part of Xia Xuechun’s usual circle. What role did she play in Xia Xuechun’s group? Perhaps a support character?","Luna, feeling Qiao Chuchu’s gaze, began to feel uneasy, her expression growing more timid: \"Long time no see, Qiao Chu. You’ve become more beautiful.\"","Xia Xuechun looked at Luna in astonishment.","What?","So timid?","She had expected Luna to argue with Qiao Chuchu for a bit.","Qiao Chuchu was also surprised and said sarcastically: \"You’re praising me? I thought you’d drag me into the girls’ bathroom and beat me up again!\"","Luna frowned and suddenly felt a cold gaze upon her.","She looked up and gasped!","Pei Youchuan was sitting in the restaurant inside, separated by a transparent glass, his gaze cold and menacing, locking onto her.","He had one hand under his chin and the other on the table, tapping rhythmically.","It felt like he was counting.","Luna grew increasingly terrified and didn’t dare look at Pei Youchuan any longer. She quickly left: \"I’m sorry, Qiao Chu, it was my fault before. I’m leaving now.\"","Qiao Chuchu was puzzled, watching Luna’s swift departure, feeling something was off. She then looked at Pei Youchuan.","Pei Youchuan had a calm expression, his gaze fixed on her.","There seemed to be anger in his eyes, but when he met Qiao Chuchu’s gaze, he smiled, showing his characteristic little canine tooth, like an innocent dog wagging its tail.","Qiao Chuchu: \"......\"","【Luna just looked like she’d seen a ghost. Was it because of Pei Youchuan?】","【Did Pei Youchuan do something to her?】"]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: The Boat Capsized","paragraphs":["Pei Youchuan retracted his gaze, suppressing the ominous killing intent within him, and continued his conversation with Boss Zhang.","Qiao Chuchu was still pondering.","Xia Xuechun strode up to her: \"Qiao Chuchu, what's the deal with that gold chain?\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped out of her thoughts, raising an eyebrow with a sly smile: \"You stole it, didn't you?\"","Xia Xuechun was furious: \"I didn't steal it! You're the one who stole it!\"","Her loud voice drew the attention of the surrounding guests, who now looked at the two of them in surprise.","Xia Xuechun, mindful of the onlookers, lowered her voice, hissing fiercely: \"I didn't steal it! You must have done it! You're framing me!\"","Qiao Chuchu propped her chin on one hand, looking at Xia Xuechun as if she were a performing monkey, unconcerned as she took out her phone: \"I just remembered, based on what you stole back then, you could probably spend several years in jail. I think I'll call the cops~\"","Xia Xuechun was startled and quickly grabbed her phone: \"I've already gained the forgiveness of a few guests. Calling the police won't help.\"","\"I'll call them first and see,\" Qiao Chuchu said, opening her phone.","Xia Xuechun's face darkened, and she reached out to snatch it: \"Give it to me!\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed her arm and twisted it hard!","Xia Xuechun screamed in pain: \"Ah! Let go!!\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked coldly: \"Touch me again and see what happens.\"","Xia Xuechun struggled to distance herself, tears welling in her eyes from the pain: \"You just can't stand to see me happy!\"","Suddenly, Qi Xiaojia's voice cut through the air: \"Right, in your eyes, no one can stand to see you happy.\"","Qiao Chuchu heard this and looked up in surprise.","Qi Xiaojia was dressed in a staff uniform, working while shooting a cold glare at Xia Xuechun: \"Now that you're rich, everyone can't stand to see you happy, got it?\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately adopted a gleeful posture, keen on the drama unfolding.","Oh?","It seems these two are having a fight!","Xia Xuechun saw Qi Xiaojia and immediately lost her aggressiveness, giving her a scrutinizing look: \"Why are you here?\"","Qi Xiaojia sneered: \"Working, big sis. I couldn't find a job, and I need to make money to support my family.\"","Qi Xiaojia's resentment was stronger than a ghost's, as she wiped tables while muttering: \"You think everyone has it as easy as you, relying on sugar daddies.\"","Xia Xuechun flushed with shame: \"Xiaojia, you're just too ambitious. Otherwise, you'd already be working at Uncle Long's company.\"","Qi Xiaojia directly threw the rag at her face: \"Spare me your nonsense! Get lost!!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"!\"","She excitedly covered her mouth, astonished by the drama unfolding between the two.","[Drama alert!]","[I love drama!]","Pei Youchuan glanced at Qiao Chuchu, observing her happily caught between Qi Xiaojia and Xia Xuechun, her hands covering her mouth in delight.","Then, Qiao Chuchu noticed him, pointing discreetly at the two women, mouthing: \"They're arguing!\"","His eyes lit up, captivated by her mischievous eyes and the uncontrollable smile on her face. His lips curved involuntarily, unable to hold back his smile.","Who was arguing with whom didn't matter.","What mattered most was...","How much he loved Qiao Chuchu's smile.","Xia Xuechun pulled the rag off her face, gave Qi Xiaojia a tearful look, and then, without saying more, flung the rag onto the floor and went to find Luna.","Qiao Chuchu was nearly bursting with excitement: \"Qi Xiaojia, how about I give you a hundred and you tell me your story?\"","Qi Xiaojia let out a cold chuckle, picking up the rag: \"You don't need to pay. I've cut ties with Xia Xuechun. She's entangled with two old men with families and kids, yet she looks down on me.\"","Qiao Chuchu propped her cheeks with both hands: \"Oh? Tell me more?\"","Qi Xiaojia took a deep breath, slamming the rag on the table, clearly annoyed: \"The Dragon Family dudes are over fifty, and they bought her a Mercedes and clothes. I told her she could date anyone but not someone with a family, like a homewrecker. She thought it was grieving, so she told the Dragon Family, and the next day, two thugs showed up at my door, spraying paint, labeling me as the mistress!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Qi Xiaojia sniffled, holding back her tears: \"I asked Xia Xuechun to explain, but she said she didn't expect the Dragon Family to act that way. Then, as if doing me a favor, she had someone clean my door without even apologizing, saying not to mind it, that the Dragon Family just loved her too much.\"","Qiao Chuchu found it increasingly outrageous: \"And then?\"","\"Then she offered to get me a job, at ten thousand a month, in the Dragon Family's company.\"","Qiao Chuchu was flabbergasted: \"I offered you fifty thousand a month, and she said I was insulting you, but now a ten thousand job isn't insulting?\"","Qi Xiaojia sneered: \"I said the same thing. But Xia Xuechun claimed that the money you offered was dirty, insulting us, while the Dragon Family's offer was in line with my abilities, even generous.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Wow, very on-brand for Xia Xuechun.","Qi Xiaojia grew more disgusted as she continued: \"Her mom and dad even came to me, telling me not to ruin their daughter's future. I asked them if they were content with their daughter being a mistress, and her mom left crying. The next day, my door was ripped off.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Sorry, she couldn't help but chuckle a bit.","Qi Xiaojia saw her laughter and smiled too: \"Funny, isn't it? I think it’s hilarious. I was sincere with Xia Xuechun, treating her like a friend, and this is how I ended up. Guess I had it coming.\"","Qi Xiaojia leaned on the table, coldly smirking: \"Just a heads-up, Xia Xuechun constantly dreams that your brother is her lapdog, at her beck and call. Every time, she tortures him to death in her dreams. She even told me once that she'd love to attend your brother's funeral.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"... My brother's funeral?\"","Qi Xiaojia lazily nodded: \"Yep. She says she dreams about your whole family dying a horrible death, and afterwards, she inherits all your family's money. So, watch out. With her mindset, she might really try to kill you.\"","Qi Xiaojia nonchalantly added: \"I used to think it was impossible, but after what happened to me, who knows? After all, even though she kicked me out of her life, she said I had it coming.\"","Just as Qi Xiaojia finished speaking, the ship abruptly shuddered violently!","Qi Xiaojia slammed into the table!","Qiao Chuchu gripped her tightly as the ship started to tilt sharply!","Countless people plummeted from higher levels, screaming endlessly: \"Ah!!!!\"","Quick-witted, she vaulted over the counter, using the railing to hold herself in place, and pulled Qi Xiaojia over!","Qi Xiaojia’s face turned pale with fright: \"What's going on?! Isn't this supposed to be a luxury cruise?! Isn't it supposed to be absolutely safe?!\"","Qiao Chuchu had no time to explain, her eyes darting to the restaurant.","Pei Youchuan was stuck inside, unable to get out!","The restaurant's doors were automatic, and with the ship tilting, they had stopped working!","All the guests inside were banging on the glass, begging for help: \"Save us! Save us!!!\"","Pei Youchuan looked at her through the glass, about to speak, when the ship tilted again!","Someone screamed: \"Water! Water's flooding in!!\"","Panicked, the passengers scrambled aimlessly, the entire restaurant in chaos!","Seeing the dire situation, Pei Youchuan banged on the glass, shouting to her: \"Get out of here! Qiao Chuchu, don't worry about me! RUN!\"","His heart was in turmoil.","How could this happen!","If Qiao Chuchu had boarded the ship, it would capsize.","If she hadn't, she'd be in a car accident!","How could this happen!","Pei Youchuan was filled with self-reproach: \"Don't care about me! RUN!\"","But as soon as he spoke, Qiao Chuchu dashed straight towards him from the counter!","Like a panther, she leaped over the counter, pulling out a safety hammer from her bag, and slammed it hard onto the glass!","The glass shattered instantly!","Kicking the glass away, she declared with composure: \"Calm down! I was prepared for this, that's why I brought a safety hammer!\"","She then pointed at the stunned Pei Youchuan: \"Get out here right now! I'm not leaving without you!!\""]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Qiao Chuchu tightly held in her grasp was his Pei Youchuan's life","paragraphs":["Guests rush out in a frenzy!","Boss Zhang and his assistant flee in panic, completely disregarding Pei Youchuan!","Qiao Chuchu grabs Pei Youchuan's hand and points outside, \"Let's go to the outer deck—there are too many obstacles here, we'll get crushed!\"","[The ship is tilting, we have to move to higher ground, or it'll be too late when the ship tilts completely!]","[According to my foresight, Pei Youchuan dies because he gets trapped somewhere. But now he's by my side, there's no way he'll die!!]","Objects keep falling around them.","Screams and cries echo through the air.","Pei Youchuan follows behind her, glancing at her firm grip on his hand.","Her fair skin contrasts sharply with his darker complexion.","Her delicate, slender fingers, pressed so hard, show faint traces of bluish marks.","In her palm, she holds his life.","Suddenly, Pei Youchuan feels everything around him blur.","Only Chuchu stands clear and vivid in the center.","So vivid that it feels like he'll never forget her for the rest of his life.","Qi Xiaojia suddenly screams, \"Qiao Chuchu, something's falling!\"","Qiao Chuchu looks up and sees a pile of cups heading straight for her!","She instinctively tries to back away but loses her balance, falling backward!","Pei Youchuan leaps forward from behind, wrapping his arms tightly around her, as countless shattered cups pelt his back!","Qiao Chuchu is stunned, wanting to look up at him, but he presses her head down, \"There's broken glass, it's dangerous!\"","Her ears ring as she processes what happens, by which time Pei Youchuan is already pulling her toward the outer deck.","The ship tilts slowly, more objects crashing down!","She follows behind Pei Youchuan, seeing blood seeping through his back.","Sharp glass pierces through his suit, spreading bloodstains across his clothes.","Tables and chairs slide down; he clears the path deftly while still holding her hand, opening a clear way forward.","Behind them, Qi Xiaojia screams again, \"Ah! So many knives and forks are falling!\"","Qiao Chuchu looks up to see knives and forks raining down on her!","[What the hell!]","[They’re here to kill me!!]","Pei Youchuan suddenly lets go of her hand, his arms flailing like octopus tentacles, catching every falling knife and fork!","Qi Xiaojia keeps screaming, \"Ah! He caught them all! Qiao Chuchu, your brother is so amazing!\"","Pei Youchuan steadies himself, holding a handful of caught knives and forks, then turns firmly to Qiao Chuchu, \"Are you hurt? Did any knives or forks hit you?!\"","Qiao Chuchu glances down, \"...No, they didn’t hit me.\"","But they did hit him!!","Two forks are stuck in Pei Youchuan's shoulders!","One on the left and one on the right!","Deeply embedded in his flesh, blood is gushing out!","It’s like a human fountain!","Pei Youchuan, unaware of the injuries, gives her a thumbs-up, his wounds squirting blood, \"Don’t worry, I’ll protect you! Let’s keep going!\"","He throws the knives and forks aside and grabs her hand to continue moving forward!","Qi Xiaojia: \"Uh... Should we remind him about his injuries?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...Nah, let’s not.\"","If we remind him, he might realize how much it hurts.","Pei Youchuan acts like a fearless warrior, leading her over the railing to the outer deck.","Sparse groups of people are on the bow.","Some are clinging to the railing, others have climbed outside, anxiously waiting for rescue.","Xia Xuechun and Luna are hiding in the outer deck.","Xia Xuechun takes a quick glance down, seeing Pei Youchuan helping Qiao Chuchu climb up.","It's noisy, only a few people are in this corner.","She’s tempted and looks to Luna, \"Pei Youchuan is below, he’s about to climb up. You have a grudge with him, right? Now is your chance to get revenge!\"","The vessel tilts further, the slope becoming steeper.","If Pei Youchuan doesn’t make it up now, Qiao Chuchu won’t either!","They’ll both die!","Xia Xuechun tugs Luna’s sleeve, \"Luna, Pei Youchuan’s right below! This is your chance to get back at him!\"","Luna ignores her, hugging the railing and wailing, \"What do I do, I don’t want to die, what do I do, what do I do, what do I do, what do I do!\"","Xia Xuechun is speechless, scanning the area.","She notices a chair nearby.","She climbs over the railing, grabs the chair, and sneaks to the corner.","Pei Youchuan tries to lift Qiao Chuchu up, \"Come on, Chuchu, you go first.\"","Xia Xuechun’s face darkens. She pushes the chair onto the path and kicks it hard!","Qiao Chuchu is shocked, grabbing Pei Youchuan and hugging the railing tightly, \"Dodge it!!”","Pei Youchuan can’t avoid it, getting hit by the chair, collapsing instantly!","Qiao Chuchu instinctively grabs his hair!","Pei Youchuan’s body slides downward, now unconscious!","Qiao Chuchu clings tightly to the railing, barely holding him!","He’s too heavy!","She strains with a twisted expression, \"Pei Youchuan! Wake up!\"","She tightly holds his hair, \"Snap out of it!\"","Suddenly, there’s a \"hisss,\" and her hand feels lighter!","Qiao Chuchu is left holding a tuft of hair, bewildered, \"Huh?\"","Qi Xiaojia exclaims, \"Ah! You’ve turned your brother into a balding middle-aged man!!\"","Pei Youchuan’s body falls to the bottom, landing on a table.","He’s propped up, sitting, as water slowly seeps in, rising to his waist.","Without a second thought, Qiao Chuchu is about to head down.","But Qi Xiaojia grabs her, \"If you go down, you won’t make it back up. The water is freezing, you’ll lose body heat and die!\"","\"Besides, with your height, you can’t save him!\"","Qi Xiaojia tightly holds her arm, fiercely proclaiming, \"How can a single-celled organism like you save a fridge-sized him?!\"","Qiao Chuchu looks at Pei Youchuan.","He’s slumped against the table, the forks gone from his shoulders.","Water around him turns red as his blood spreads.","Blood he shed to protect her.","She struggles free from Qi Xiaojia, determined to go down!","Qi Xiaojia is frantic, looking up.","Xia Xuechun peeks from above.","But upon meeting Qi Xiaojia’s gaze, she ducks right back.","Qi Xiaojia gasps in shock, \"Xuechun?\"","Qiao Chuchu reaches Pei Youchuan, shaking him hard, \"Brother, wake up, please wake up!\"","Pei Youchuan shows no response, his face turning paler, likely due to blood loss.","Her hands go cold as she presses on his nose bridge, tears falling unconsciously, \"Brother, please wake up! You can’t die, or I’ve come all this way for nothing!\"","Still no response from Pei Youchuan.","She tries to carry him, but his broad, sturdy frame is too much for her!","Qiao Chuchu wipes her tears with determination, glancing around, looking for something to tie them together.","With Pei Youchuan strapped to her, she can bring him out of here!","A shout comes from above, \"Qiao Chuchu!!\"","She looks up to see Qi Xiaojia throwing a bundle of hemp ropes down at her, \"See if you can tie your brother to you!!\""]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Death, we can only be late, not early.","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu's eyes lit up, and she quickly took the rope offered to her.","Pei Youchuan, in a daze, opened his eyes but found himself unable to move: \"Chuchu...\"","Qiao Chuchu was busy tying him to herself when she heard his voice and became elated: \"You're awake?! Can you move?!\"","His eyes were barely open, and he couldn't even manage a shake of his head. In a foggy state, he mumbled, \"I... made a will... If I die... all my assets... will go to you. The bank card password... is your birthday...\"","Qiao Chuchu's heart clenched as she secured him to her back: \"No way, who cares about your will? I want you alive! Don't say such gloomy things!\"","\"You... can't carry me,\" Pei Youchuan mustered a little strength. \"Give up on me, live well... Losing me doesn't matter... You still have... other brothers...\"","Looking at his face, Qiao Chuchu felt as if she were staring at a photograph of Pei Youchuan.","If she didn't try her best,","the living, breathing person in front of her would turn into a photo, capturing the smile he used to have.","A wave of acidity surged from her nostrils to her skull, blurring her vision with watery mist.","Qiao Chuchu blinked hard to clear her sight and continued to firmly bind him to herself.","She recalled being eleven years old, when she had a high fever. No matter how much medicine or warm water she took, it only got worse. She was getting delirious, dangerously close to death.","Back then, her eldest and second brothers were already studying abroad, and the other brothers had no money. They could only turn to their grandparents, who had taken over their family's fortune.","As an adopted child with no blood ties and not even registered in the Pei household, the Pei matriarch and patriarch naturally didn't care.","She had collapsed weakly into the arms of her seventh brother, watching as her brothers negotiated with their relatives.","Only their third brother, unable to contain himself, suddenly leaped into action.","He was like the character Runeng described by Lu Xun, poised under the moonlight with a fork, ready to stab a wild boar. He jumped over the table and grabbed the old lady's precious grandson, pressing a pencil firmly against the plump boy's eye!","\"If you don't give us the money, I'll stab this pencil right into his eye!\"","She wasn't sure if it was because her vision was blurred, but she saw Pei Youchuan trembling.","Even so, his hand holding the pencil was as steady as Mount Tai, his voice resounding with conviction—","\"Give us the money!!!\"","That day, their relatives looked at Pei Youchuan as if he were a madman, tossing two stacks of cash at him in disgust.","Their sixth brother, as slippery as an eel, deftly picked up the money from the floor: \"Let's go!\"","Their fifth brother carried her away in a hurry,","while Pei Youchuan, still holding the boy hostage, didn't let go until they reached the front door, fearing they might take the money back.","Leaning against her fifth brother, Pei Youchuan quickly caught up to her, gently wiping the sweat from her forehead.","Despite his bravery earlier, he was terrified seeing her in such a sickly state, pleading, \"Chuchu, you have to hold on!\"","\"Don't die!\"","\"Promise me you won't die!\"","The rising water had already reached her knees, and Qiao Chuchu had finished tying herself to Pei Youchuan.","She had learned rescue techniques from firefighters, and this method allowed her to carry someone heavier than herself.","Despite the correct technique, she wobbled precariously, barely able to stand, each step feeling like she was drunk.","Walking on the slanting ship deck was even harder.","But a tremendous force within her made her ignore the unbearable weight and grip the railing to climb upwards.","Pei Youchuan's weight dragged heavily on her.","The icy water rose above her knees, ruthlessly pulling her towards the unknown depths of the sea.","Qiao Chuchu held onto the railing, and after a few steps, she felt utterly exhausted. She glanced at Pei Youchuan leaning on her shoulder.","Once, when all the Pei family members had passed away, she and her brothers stood before the family tomb at the Pei family cemetery, looking at the photos on the graves.","Though the photos showed them smiling,","she felt as if the spirits buried there were giving them the middle finger.","She felt a bit guilty: \"Brothers, if there really is karma, will we end up having a miserable death?\"","Pei Youchuan, with his hand behind his head, laughed carefreely: \"Don't worry.\"","She looked at him.","Pei Youchuan showed a little toothy grin, looking quite pleased: \"Even if someone were to die miserably, it'd be us brothers. Not you, because you're pure.\"","Qiao Chuchu snapped back to reality, gazing at the scene that resembled hell on earth.","\"No, brother,\"","Qiao Chuchu gritted her teeth and continued to climb, \"We're a family. If we're going to hell, we go together. Only later, not sooner!\"","\"Now, I want you to live!\"","Her fingers dug into the railing, muscles straining with pain, as she shouted furiously, \"I will make sure you live!!!\"","As her words echoed, an incomprehensible strength surged through her, allowing her to grip the railing and move steadily up the slope!","Pei Youchuan felt her voice pierce through his ears. He opened his eyes dazedly to see Qiao Chu's hand gripping the railing.","His eyes moistened, and tears began to fall, dripping onto her neck.","If his world had a deity,","it was undoubtedly Qiao Chuchu.","Qi Xiaojia clung to the railing, watching the frail Qiao Chuchu climb step by step, moved to tears, \"Oh my God! I don't even know what to say! Qiao Chuchu, keep going! You've got this!!\"","Many people were holding their phones, recording the scene for TikTok. They cheered in unison, \"Come on, Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Other passengers leaned out, joining in: \"Go Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Qiao Chuchu's teeth were clenched almost to breaking point as she gripped the railing and continued to climb.","Several strong passengers reached out their hands, ready to help her bear the weight: \"Just a little higher, and we can grab the person behind you! Don't give up!\"","She felt as if she were hanging on by a single thread, gripping the railing with all her strength to climb higher!","She wouldn't give up!","She would fight until the very end!!!","The onlookers, witnessing this scene, were also motivated. They cheered her on: \"You're doing great! Go, Qiao Chuchu!!\"","Qi Xiaojia helped spread the word: \"The person she's carrying is her brother! She's doing this to save her brother!!\"","Qiao Chuchu climbed step by step, her face turning red from the strain. It was hard to tell if it was from pain or sheer effort.","Her tears dripped down in heavy drops, her steps resolute and heavy.","Xia Xuechun watched as Qiao Chuchu's hands gradually came into view. Many passengers went to help her, and Xia Xuechun let out a bitter laugh.","Everyone who could lend a hand did so, pulling both Qiao Chuchu and Pei Youchuan to safety.","When Qiao Chuchu straddled the railing, applause erupted around her!","Those who could spare a hand were clapping for her: \"Well done!\"","\"You're incredibly brave!\"","Qiao Chuchu's hands trembled as she mustered her strength to thank everyone: \"Thank you all for helping! I really appreciate it!\"","Qi Xiaojia was overjoyed: \"You're amazing! You really did it!\"","She also expressed her gratitude: \"It was thanks to your good rope-tying skills.\"","Qi Xiaojia shook her head, expressing her gratitude: \"No, no, you also saved me first, otherwise, I would have died already. We're all in this together.\"","Xia Xuechun, on the other side, stared coldly at the two of them.","Qi Xiaojia felt her gaze and her eyes filled with resentment as she looked back.","Xia Xuechun sneered, then turned her gaze elsewhere, as if nothing had happened.","Qi Xiaojia was incensed but, after glancing at Qiao Chuchu, refrained from saying anything.","She wanted to tell Qiao Chuchu about Xia Xuechun's actions.","But—","After hesitating, Qi Xiaojia decided to stay silent.","She'd find another opportunity to ask Xia Xuechun why she had acted that way."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: The Legendary Eighth Mistress","paragraphs":["Ten minutes later, everyone on the ship was rescued.","Fortunately, no one died in this accident, but multiple people sustained serious injuries.","Videos and surveillance footage from the incident went viral online!","Both Weibo and Douyin trending lists exploded!","#Royal Cruiser Shattered#","#The Girl Carrying Her Brother#","#Qiao Chuchu, Hang in There#","Pei Fengnong finally had some downtime and opened his phone, only to be greeted by a notification about \"Qiao Chuchu, Hang in There.\"","Pei Fengnong: \"?\"","He clicked on it and saw Qiao Chuchu on the deck, tightly gripping the railing, carrying the towering Pei Youchuan on her back, struggling to climb up.","The background audio was a crisp female voice, shouting loudly, \"Qiao Chuchu, hang in there!!\"","Pei Fengnong: \"???????????\"","The comment section was full of praise:","「I actually cried watching this, who else felt that?」","「Seeing this petite girl carrying such a muscular guy on her back, I got teary-eyed. In times of trouble, true feelings surface—this girl didn't abandon her boyfriend!」","「FYI, it seems this isn't her boyfriend, but her brother.」","「Ahhh, such a great sister! I want a sister like that too!」","「Holy crap, isn't that Qiao Chuchu? The guy on her back is her older brother!」","「Anyone know who she is? I'm really liking this sister!」","「She's quite wealthy, probably wouldn't be out in public much. She has seven brothers—she's the eighth child in her family.」","「Wait, seven brothers, she's the eighth, and has reddish-brown hair? Could she be the infamous Eighth Young Mistress from the internet buzz recently?」","#Is Qiao Chuchu the rumored Eighth Young Mistress?# This hashtag quickly climbed to the top of the trending list!","「If it's true, the Eighth Young Mistress is incredibly beautiful!」","「Is this my daughter I've been following online? Is this my online-raised daughter?!」","「The man she's carrying—I feel like I've seen him somewhere before! Isn't he the CEO of some mobile game company?」","「No way, is this some kind of pampered royalty drama script? Her brother owns a gaming company or something?」","Pei Fengnong decisively dialed Qiao Chuchu's phone number.","It was turned off.","He became increasingly panicked and quickly called Pei Yuan: \"Qiao Chuchu and Pei Youchuan's boat capsized, do you know? Do you know where they are now??\"","Pei Yuan was even more shocked: \"What? I don't know anything!\"","Pei Fengnong was so anxious he couldn't sit still: \"Hold on, I'll send the video to the group. Right now, I have no clue where Qiao Chuchu is—both her and Pei Youchuan's phones are off!\"","Without a second thought, Pei Yuan hung up and called his assistant: \"Qiao Chuchu and Pei Youchuan are likely at a hospital in Lan City, go check where they are.\"","The assistant immediately began investigating.","Pei Yuan opened the video Pei Fengnong sent in the group.","In the video, Qiao Chuchu was wrapped in a rope, carrying the unconscious Pei Youchuan on her back, struggling to climb upwards!","He couldn't believe it, feeling like a bucket of cold water had been poured over him, leaving his blood cold!","How could this have happened?!","His brother and sister nearly died?!","The group chat exploded with messages:","Ying Chen:「Pei Youchuan is almost twice as wide as Qiao Chuchu, yet she's carrying him? She's really something...」","Lou Yuejue:「What incredible willpower the sister has, she's so amazing!」","Lin Qing:「I just came out of a meeting and saw tons of people talking about the shipwreck. Apparently, Qiao Chuchu is the one who went viral? Lots of media are already tracking her down for interviews!」","Pei Che:「Location?」","One minute later, Lin Qing posted the location in the group:「Here it is!」","Everyone who saw the message rushed to the hospital!","The hospital was already surrounded by a large crowd of media personnel.","Even many ordinary people were live-streaming, holding their phones and saying, \"Haven't seen Qiao Chuchu yet, not sure where she is, but there sure are a lot of red-haired people around.\"","At that moment, Qiao Chuchu was hiding in the police car at the back door of the hospital, her head wrapped in Pei Youchuan's clothes, her hands trembling nonstop.","Of course, it wasn't out of fear or anger.","It was because she had used so much strength earlier that her muscles were strained, causing her hands to tremble uncontrollably.","But she was indeed annoyed.","Because the hospital was now filled with people!","Everyone was looking for her!","Many people were so disrespectful that whenever they saw a red-haired person, they'd shove their camera in their face, and even after realizing it wasn't her, they'd laugh shamelessly without even offering an apology!","The whole hospital was in chaos because of these people!","Even the hospital security couldn't stop them, and many had already called the police.","Both her and Pei Youchuan's phones were waterlogged and unusable, so they couldn't contact anyone or even call for a cab home.","So the police planned to take her home first to avoid any bigger disturbance if she were discovered.","Pei Youchuan hadn't woken up yet, and she couldn't stay in the hospital.","Luckily, he only had a mild concussion and was severely dehydrated.","The doctor said he needed to sleep a bit more, and the police assured her that as long as she wasn't there, everything would be fine, and they'd drive these people away.","Qiao Chuchu looked at the crowd blocking the hospital entrance and irritably turned her head away.","Another street over, one luxury car after another slowly rolled in.","The live-streaming civilians immediately aimed their cameras at the luxury car convoy: \"Wow, so many rich people are arriving!\"","Pei Yuan stepped out of his car, scanning the area with a grim face.","The self-media person quickly focused their cameras on his face.","Bullet Screen: \"Ahhhhh!! I'm even more convinced Qiao Chuchu is the rumored Eighth Young Mistress, who is this young master?!\"","「So handsome, so handsome, so handsome! Is he one of my cloud husbands? Is he?!」","Pei Yuan scanned the surroundings, his expression dark: \"Why is there such a crowd? Surrounding the hospital completely.\"","Pei Che walked up beside him, unfazed: \"Qiao Chuchu's gone viral; everyone's here to ride the wave and find her.\"","Pei Fengnong stepped forward calmly: \"Don't worry about all that, we need to hurry upstairs to find her. Many here are crazy for traffic, we can't let her get hurt.\"","They quickly strode into the hospital.","In a hospital bed, Pei Youchuan suddenly jolted awake!","He shot up from the bed: \"Chuchu! Chuchu?!\"","Pei Youchuan was icy cold, panicked, scanning his surroundings.","This wasn't the ship's cabin anymore.","It was a hospital room.","Pei Youchuan got out of bed, barefoot, searching the room repeatedly: \"Chuchu! Chuchu, where are you?!\"","A nurse, exasperated, stood at the door of the ward, repressing her anger and shouted: \"Is Qiao Chuchu's family here? It's been an hour, how come no one has come to handle the deceased yet? So irresponsible!\"","Pei Youchuan quickly ran to her: \"I am! I'm Chuchu's family!\"","The nurse gave him a curious once-over, her gaze stopping at his receding hairline: \"You are? But the person I was just speaking to wasn't you.\""]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Is Qiao Chuchu Dead","paragraphs":["Pei Youchuan's brows were tightly furrowed as he looked into the hospital room, his eyes falling on the deceased shrouded in white cloth.","His mind exploded with shock, and he stumbled toward the bedside, \"No, how could it be...\"","Just moments ago, Qiao Chuchu was full of life, carrying him around like it was nothing.","How could she be dead now!","Pei Youchuan's knees gave way, and he fell to the ground, gripping the edge of the bed as he wept, \"Chuchu!!!\"","Pei Che arrived at Pei Youchuan's room but found it empty, and hearing the commotion, rushed to the adjacent room, his face turning pale at the sight!","Pei Yuan followed right behind, seeing the white cloth and feeling a wave of dizziness!","Pei Fengnong swayed and leaned against the wall!","Pei Mu and Pei Ci, unable to believe their eyes, turned to the nurse: \"Is Chuchu lying in there?!\"","The nurse, caught off guard by their sudden appearance, was utterly baffled: \"Yes, it's Chu Chu, but I have a feeling we're not talking about the same Chu Chu.\"","Seeing the white cloth, Pei Buxian's face lost all color. He raced to the bedside and knelt beside Pei Youchuan, sobbing uncontrollably—","\"Chuchu! How could this happen to you?! I only took my eyes off you for a moment, and you're gone!\"","Tears streaming down his face, he continued, \"We promised, even if we were to die, we would die together. You can't leave me behind, my Chuchu!\"","Pei Buxian cried as he pulled back the white sheet: \"Look at me, please!\"","An old face was suddenly revealed to Pei Buxian.","His crying abruptly stopped.","Pei Youchuan, still caught in his tears, exclaimed, \"Wha—?\"","The room fell silent.","Pei Buxian blinked a few times, gently laid the white sheet back over the face.","He hesitated, then lifted the sheet again.","And finally, tucked it back under once more.","Pei Buxian remained silent for two seconds, slowly straightened his back, and very respectfully bowed his head: \"I'm sorry, you don't need to open your eyes to look at me. I cried over the wrong person.\"","He walked out of the room with Pei Youchuan and kicked him hard in the rear!","\"You cried over the wrong grave, you idiot!!!\"","Pei Youchuan, looking like a stunned gorilla, tearfully said, \"But I clearly heard the nurse say it was Chuchu.\"","The nurse was speechless: \"I said Chu Chu, with the surname Chu and the character Chu.\"","Pei Buxian urgently asked, \"Then where is our Qiao Chuchu?\"","His eyes red, he thought of something and pitifully shed tears again: \"Tell me, no matter what the result is, I can accept it. I'm ready to leave with her at any moment. I made a vow to die with her.\"","The nurse looked at him as if he were crazy: \"If you're referring to the Qiao Chuchu who went viral from the boat incident, she's already left with the police.\"","Pei Buxian: \"? Did she go to jail?\"","The nurse: \"?? She went home!\"","Pei Yuan turned and left immediately!","Pei Buxian followed close behind!","Pei Youchuan followed closely: \"I'm going too, to find Chuchu!\"","Pei Buxian angrily shoved him aside: \"No! You don't even know where your sister is. You're a pure idiot for crying over the wrong grave, and have you seen the videos of Qiao Chuchu all over the internet behind your back? She's been trying so hard!\"","Pei Youchuan was stunned, a bit indignant: \"I just woke up, I don't know where she is. The moment I opened my eyes, I heard the nurse looking for Chu Chu's family. I thought it was my Chuchu!\"","Pei Buxian jumped up, grabbing his collar: \"It's MY Chuchu, you baldy!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"? You callin' me bald?\"","Pei Buxian pointed at the large bald patch in the middle of his hair: \"That's right, you're a baldy now!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan felt the top of his head.","?!","Where was his hair?!","Where was his middle-part hair?!","Pei Yuan, unable to stand it any longer, turned back and scolded: \"Stop arguing! Let's go home and find Chuchu!\""]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Who's Gift Made Chuchu the Happiest","paragraphs":["Pei Family’s seven brothers hurried toward the elevator.","Pei Buxian muttered to himself, “Wait, now that Chuchu is already home, and she probably has some injuries, am I just going to visit her empty-handed? Shouldn’t I buy a gift?”","Pei Youchuan, stumbling while putting on his shoes, replied, “Huh?”","The other brothers exchanged blank looks and suddenly quickened their pace!","Dressed in a hospital gown, Pei Youchuan called out, “Wait for me! I don’t have a car, take me with you!”","Pei Buxian suddenly turned back and pushed Pei Youchuan aside!","Pei Youchuan, wincing from the pain in his shoulder, grunted, “Hmph!”","Pei Buxian sprinted off, grinning mischievously.","Pei Youchuan staggered a few steps, his anger rising. He hurried after Pei Buxian and threatened, “Take me to buy the gift too, or I’ll tell Qiao Chuchu you touched my wound!”","Pei Buxian retorted, “Pei Youchuan, you’d better not sleep too soundly tonight!”","---","Qiao Chuchu leaned comfortably in the bathtub, the warm water dispelling the chill from her body.","The pain in her torn arm was also alleviated.","Little Xie entered her room with her home clothes, her eyes widening in surprise.","The room was packed with the Pei Family gentlemen!","Some sat in chairs, others on the sofa, a full house.","Little Xie stumbled at the doorway, unsure of what to do.","The seven brothers went about their business, ignoring her presence as if she were invisible.","Feeling awkward, Little Xie bowed her head and carried the clothes into Qiao Chuchu’s bathroom. “Miss, I’ve put your clothes at the door. Do you need me to help you dry your hair later?”","From inside the bathroom, Qiao Chuchu’s voice replied faintly, “No, thank you. You can go rest.”","Little Xie nodded, “Yes, Miss Qiao.”","She closed the bathroom door and glanced at the brothers.","Goodness, they were like wolves glaring at the bathroom door!","Little Xie quickly hurried away.","Pei Buxian’s eyes lit up, and he came up with an idea. “Why don’t we play a little game?”","A few of the brothers glanced at him, while others completely ignored him.","Pei Buxian picked up a pencil from Qiao Chuchu’s desk and twirled it deftly between his fingers. “We’ll write our names on our gifts. Let’s see who she’s most interested in.”","Only then did the others look up at him.","Pei Buxian leaned against the desk, his figure glowing golden under the light from the window. His platinum-white hair seemed to shimmer with gold.","He smiled like a cunning little devil, “The one whose gift she likes the most gets to spend an hour alone with her afterward.”","Pei Che snorted disdainfully from his nose, “Stupid.”","Pei Yuan lowered his eyelashes, completely uninterested.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci, however, seemed intrigued. They picked up other pens and declared, “Anyone who doesn’t participate will automatically forfeit. Even if she picks your gift, you don’t get to spend time alone with her!”","Pei Che exclaimed, “What?”","He snatched the pen from Pei Ci’s hand and forcefully wrote his name on his gift box.","Then he handed the pen back to Pei Ci and said, “I’ll wait outside.”","Pei Fengnong took a pen and wrote his name while muttering, “Winning isn’t important. I just want to see who’s gift she’ll be happiest with.”","Pei Mu put an arm around his shoulder and teased, “On the surface, Fourth Brother, you seem laid-back, but deep down, you’re really hoping Chuchu picks your gift, aren’t you? How endearingly innocent!”","Pei Fengnong’s breath hitched, his face flushing like a flustered cat’s. “H-how could you think that?!”","Pei Mu squinted, his gaze sharp like a little fox who saw through everything. “Because your face is red.”","Pei Fengnong’s face turned crimson, and he lowered his head, stammering, “D-don’t spout nonsense! I’m just hot!”","After writing his name, he hurriedly left, his movements stiff and awkward.","Pei Yuan stood up and walked out without a word.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci were surprised. “Aren’t you writing your name, eldest brother?”","Pei Yuan’s mouth curled into a confident smile. “I don’t need to write my name. There’s already a mutual understanding between Qiao Chuchu and me.”","Pei Mu: “Huh?”","Pei Ci: “Huh?”","Why does that feel so irritating?","The two of them gritted their teeth, signed their names on the gifts, and exchanged them to sign again.","Pei Youchuan glanced at them and frowned. “You guys wrote your names on every single gift?”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci responded without hesitation, “Because we’re always together, so even if she picks one of us, it’ll still be the three of us spending time alone.”","They leaned on each other, their brows raised in mockery. “Unlike you, Mr. Tough Guy.”","Pei Youchuan scoffed and snatched the pen to sign his name. “You twins are so clingy, it’s ridiculous. Don’t tell me if you ever get girlfriends, you’ll both date one and stick together like sandwich bread.”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci exchanged glances, their laughter even more devilish. They leaned together and asked in unison, “So, who do you think would be our filling?”","Pei Youchuan: “What?!”","Pei Youchuan raised his fist. “I’ll punch you two!”","Pei Mu and Pei Ci laughed and ran off, “Hahaha! You can’t catch us!~”","Pei Buxian completed his signature with a sinister smile. “I can feel Chuchu’s soul resonating with mine.”","Pei Youchuan retorted, “If your legs are shaking, go get them checked. Don’t talk nonsense about soul resonance.”","Pei Buxian glared coldly at him, exuding an aura of pride that made Pei Youchuan feel inferior, then strutted off.","Pei Youchuan looked somewhat dejected at his own gift.","Because his phone was broken and he had no money, he had to borrow from his brothers.","But each of them, full of mischief, refused to lend him anything!","In the end, Pei Mu and Pei Ci practically forced a measly 30,000 yuan on him as if it were charity.","All of them were splurging on six-figure gifts, while he was stuck with a budget under 50,000!","As the one who had been rescued, his gift was the most pathetic!","Pei Youchuan nervously bit his lip and carefully wrote a note on the box.","Sounds came from the bathroom!","He quickly placed the gift on the table and hurried out.","Pei Buxian stood in the corridor, arms crossed, eyeing him suspiciously. “Why did it take so long? Did you cheat?”","The other brothers also shot suspicious glances at him, the atmosphere suddenly tense.","“What reason would I have to cheat?” Pei Youchuan said, his hand behind his back. “My gift is the cheapest; she’ll definitely prefer someone else’s.”","Pei Buxian relaxed slightly. “Good.”","He peeked through the crack in the door. “Chuchu’s coming out!”","Pei Youchuan quickly squeezed in to watch.","Qiao Chuchu walked out of the bathroom drying her hair and noticed several gift boxes in her room.","She approached them.","Inscribed on each exquisite gift box were the names of her brothers.","Qiao Chuchu: [What? They’ve given me so many gifts? Why?]","She picked up one box and found ‘Pei Che’ written on it.","Opening the box, she found a set of pink diamond jewelry!~","Qiao Chuchu’s eyes lit up as she lifted the necklace. [Second Brother really loves giving me jewelry, especially pink diamonds. He’s so into diamonds!]","She immediately put on the necklace and checked herself out in the mirror. [So pretty!]","Outside, everyone shot sidelong glances at Pei Che.","Pei Che, hands in his pockets, proudly raised his chin.","That’s right, it was his gift.","Qiao Chuchu then opened a smaller, exquisitely wrapped box.","There was no name on it.","Inside was a Patek Philippe white gold watch.","[Ah ha! This must be from Big Brother!]","She put on the watch.","It fit perfectly!","[Big Brother always gives me practical things, and the color suits me so well!]","The brothers furrowed their brows and turned to look at Pei Yuan.","Pei Yuan modestly nodded, his lips curling into a satisfied smile. “I told you, I don’t need to write my name. She just knows it’s from me.”","They all furrowed their brows in anxiety.","Qiao Chuchu opened Pei Fengnong’s box.","[Wow, a pair of earrings!]","She put them on and checked herself in the mirror. [They suit me, too! I didn’t expect my straight-laced Fourth Brother to have such good taste.]","Pei Fengnong puffed out his chest proudly.","Qiao Chuchu then opened the gifts from Pei Mu and Pei Ci.","It was a bracelet.","Pei Buxian’s gift was also a watch, slightly more delicate than Pei Yuan’s.","She grew more and more delighted as she opened each gift, finally reaching Pei Youchuan’s.","[What’s today’s occasion? They’ve all given me gifts at once?]","She opened the package and saw a message on the box:","“My phone is broken, I have no money, and my card is not with me. This is just a small gift. I’ll make it up to you by buying you a new one once I get my phone fixed. Thank you for saving my life—Pei Youchuan”","Qiao Chuchu slowly opened the box.","It was a Dior pink tote bag.","She was a bit surprised: [I have a few of these bags, but I just so happen to not have a pink one. Pei Youchuan is that observant? He bought me a color I don’t already have.]","The members of the Pei Family outside the corridor looked at Pei Youchuan in surprise.","Pei Youchuan's face remained expressionless, but he pursed his lips slightly in regret.","His gift was the cheapest, and he hoped she wouldn’t dislike it just because it’s not expensive.","Qiao Chuchu picked up the lid of Pei Youchuan’s gift box again and read the message written on it once more.","She couldn’t help but smile.","[Even his phone got soaked and ruined. He couldn’t even transfer money, so he must have borrowed it to buy this. Given his overly flashy personality, I bet he tried to borrow five or six figures but failed, which is why he ended up with this gift for me.]","Pei Youchuan’s eyes widened in disbelief.","She understands him so well!","She understands him so well!"]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: Pei Youchuan, Who Is Afraid of Nothing and No One, Also Has Someone He Fears","paragraphs":["Pei Yuan's face darkened, and he left unhappily: \"It seems the outcome is decided, I'm leaving.\"","Pei Che snorted and turned to leave.","Pei Fengnong lowered his head in disappointment and followed them out.","Pei Mu and Pei Ci glared at him: \"One hour! We'll come back after one hour!\"","Pei Buxian directly took out his phone and set a timer.","One hour countdown began.","He said fiercely: \"I will be back!\"","Pei Youchuan watched their retreating figures, feeling a bit pleased as he blinked, his heart starting to race.","What's going on?","It's not the first time he's been alone with her, why is he still nervous?","Pei Youchuan took a deep breath and knocked on the door.","Qiao Chuchu closed the lid of the gift box: \"Come in.\"","He pushed the door open and raised his eyes to look at her by the window.","Qiao Chuchu didn't turn around, trying to remove the necklace but was a bit off because her hands were still trembling.","[My arm hurts so much... Ouch...]","He strode behind her, lifted her hair, and helped her remove the necklace.","She sighed: \"Little Xie, has the masseur arrived? My arm hurts a lot.\"","Pei Youchuan was stunned, removed the necklace for her, and didn't answer.","Qiao Chuchu turned around almost bumping into his chest, surprised: \"Pei Youchuan?\"","She looked up at him: \"Why are you here? And — and you got a buzz cut?!\"","Pei Youchuan put the necklace back into the gift box and scratched his head a bit awkwardly: \"The hair in the middle of my head just fell out for no reason, and the sides were too long, making me look like a balding middle-aged man. So I had someone shave it short, planning to grow it out again.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Hahaha!\"","Pei Youchuan: \"? What are you laughing at?\"","She waved her hands while trying to suppress her laughter: \"Nothing.\"","[Luckily, Pei Youchuan doesn't know that it was me who caused his hair to fall out. It happened when he fell, I tried to catch him but only grabbed his hair, and it couldn't bear the weight, so it just snapped off. Hahahaha!]","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu's face turned crimson.","[But... not telling him seems a bit too mean, at least I should let him know how he went bald.]","She looked up, still trying to suppress her laughter: \"Actually, it was me who caused the hair in the middle of your head to fall out. I grabbed your hair, and it broke.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes crinkled, her mischievous emotions unconcealed: \"Are you mad?\"","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, a teasing smile curling his lips: \"You're quite honest.\"","Qiao Chuchu composed herself, serious all of a sudden: \"Yes, at least I should let you know how your hair 'died.'\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","Qiao Chuchu took the opportunity to sneak a glance at him.","[Pei Youchuan actually looks really good with a buzz cut.]","[His head shape is round and full, he's already muscular with dark skin, and his features are deep, his temperament wild. His previous shaggy curls made him look like a playboy noble, but now with the buzz cut, he looks more like a fierce, uncontrollable mafia boss.]","Pei Youchuan tilted his head, the corner of his mouth slowly rising.","Uncontrollable?","He leaned down: \"Want to touch my head?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, his dark eyes filled with amusement, inviting her: \"Go ahead, touch it.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"No, it's prickly.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu was curious: \"Is it okay for you to come out of the hospital like this? The doctor said you had a mild concussion and lost a lot of blood.\"","\"My head is a bit dizzy, but it's not a big deal,\" Pei Youchuan straightened up: \"Nothing matters more than you.\"","He looked down at her, his gaze so deep it felt like he was enveloping her in a world that belonged only to him.","\"You saved my life, so I wanted to come and thank you immediately.\"","Qiao Chuchu's eyes gleamed with mischief: \"If you really want to thank me, why don't you answer a question for me?\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","He knew what she wanted to ask.","Qiao Chuchu got straight to the point: \"Do you have any secrets with the others that you're keeping from me?\"","Pei Youchuan frowned imperceptibly, his deep eyes flashing with a fleeting sense of guilt: \"No.\"","She immediately lost interest, her tone also turning dull: \"Oh, then go back to the hospital, take good care of yourself.\"","Pei Youchuan: \"...\"","He tried to find a topic: \"I saw a video of you saving me on Pei Buxian's phone.\"","Qiao Chuchu pulled the blanket over herself, feeling embarrassed when she thought about it: \"Yeah, I saw it on the police officer's phone too, it's so embarrassing.\"","[I was carrying a double-door refrigerator, at that time I only felt my hands were about to break, I tried my best to save Pei Youchuan, never thought someone was filming me for TikTok!]","[Now everyone on the internet knows that the girl with her face twisted in pain is called Qiao Chuchu!]","[Actually, my name in my ID is Qiao Chu, can I deny that the ugly girl is Qiao Chuchu instead of Qiao Chu?]","Pei Youchuan walked to the edge of her bed: \"No, you didn't look ugly in the video.\"","Qiao Chuchu came back to her senses: \"?\"","He sat down next to her, looking deep into her eyes, honestly saying: \"You're always beautiful, no matter what.\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled, without hesitation pressed her hand against her chest: \"Of course, I know I'm always dazzling!\"","[Except for that cringe-worthy video!]","[Except for that video that everyone in the whole internet has seen!]","Pei Youchuan lowered his eyes and smiled, noticing her trembling hands: \"You saved me, and I was so heavy, your hands must be very sore, right?\"","He took out a tube of muscle strain medicated oil from his pocket: \"Let me massage you, this oil works wonders, it can relieve pain right away when I had muscle strain before.\"","Qiao Chuchu immediately refused: \"No, Little Xie already called a masseur, I can't let a man rub my arms like that.\"","Pei Youchuan was stunned, feeling a bit hurt: \"Not even me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","\"Why not?\" He frowned, a bit urgently: \"Is it because I rejected you before?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","[Why is he like Pei Buxian, mentioning the past? What's the deal with the past?]","She was speechless: \"Of course because we're family, massage is something really intimate, unless you're my sister or my mom!\"","Pei Youchuan didn't hesitate: \"You can think of me as your sister then.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? With what, your muscular chest?\"","Pei Youchuan frowned tightly, feeling defeated as he dropped his hands: \"I even left the hospital before finishing my dose of medicine to come see you.\"","Qiao Chuchu coldly glanced at him: \"Blackmailing me with your morality won't work, I have no morality.\"","Pei Youchuan ignored her, flipping the half-used bottle of medicine in his hands, murmuring: \"I just wanted to thank you for saving my life, I didn't expect you to reject me just because of my gender.\"","He looked up at her, like a guilty dog: \"Are you mad at me, Chuchu?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Pei Youchuan was ashamed: \"Is it because I caused you trouble, is it because I treated you badly before, that in your heart there's already a gap between us, so you naturally reject me?\"","He nervously gripped the bedding, anxiously waiting for an answer: \"Are you blaming me for neglecting you for seven years?\""]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: Pei Youchuan: Why Did You Save Me","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu looked at Pei Youchuan's worried expression, her feelings a tangled mess.","[...It’s not that strange, really.]","[Because during that time, even if I lived separately from them, I was still like a lingering, malicious supporting character, showing up at every important occasion they attended.]","[For example, with Pei Youchuan, I once hid in his closet and suddenly popped out while he was changing. I also deliberately held his hand at a dinner party with many people, among other things I won’t mention.]","[The most intimate thing I did was pin him against a wall and force him to kiss me.]","[Ugh!]","[The more I think about it, the more disgusting it feels!]","[Back then, Pei Youchuan firmly rejected me and even sent me off to a nunnery for a week to \"detox\" from my inappropriate behavior.]","[Even though I was just following the system’s requirements, to Pei Youchuan and the others, I was just a creepy, obsessive sister who had gone off the rails after hitting puberty.]","[They had no idea how much torment I endured behind the scenes.]","\"I know,\" Pei Youchuan suddenly said.","Qiao Chuchu was stunned. \"What?\"","Pei Youchuan’s eyes were filled with concern. \"I know you were in pain, struggling, and suffering.\"","Her eyes widened in disbelief. \"Could it be...?\"","[Can he hear my thoughts?!]","Pei Youchuan lowered his gaze and said solemnly, \"I know you pulled a muscle in your arm while saving me. I know how unbearable that kind of pain can be.\"","He moved closer to the stunned Qiao Chuchu. \"Since I hurt your arm, let me take care of you, Chuchu.\"","[Oh... So that’s what he meant. I thought he could read my mind.]","Qiao Chuchu was wearing a casual three-piece set, with a pale yellow padded camisole underneath.","Pei Youchuan, as if bewitching her, gently removed her outerwear.","He averted his eyes from her chest, warmed the medicated oil in his palms, and gently applied it to her arm.","She hissed in pain. \"Ouch!\"","Pei Youchuan massaged her muscles with a tender touch.","His warm hands kneaded her arm rhythmically. \"Does it hurt?\"","Chuchu leaned against the headboard, suppressing a groan and nodding.","Pei Youchuan licked his lips. \"It’s okay, you can relax. If it hurts, you can cry out. It’s fine.\"","His Adam’s apple bobbed as he stared at her furrowed brows. \"Does it feel better now?\"","Qiao Chuchu nodded, trying not to let out a sound, her voice strained. \"I have to admit, you’re pretty good at this.\"","Pei Youchuan’s lips curved into a slow smile. \"I used to suffer from muscle strains a lot, so I learned how to do this to recover faster.\"","He glanced at his hands massaging her fair, delicate arm, feeling the softness of her skin. His breathing grew uneven. \"Back then... why did you save me?\"","Qiao Chuchu rolled her eyes. \"Why do you even ask? Are you a child or something?\"","\"You could have died,\" Pei Youchuan muttered. \"I’m willing to die, but I can’t let you risk your life.\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned, looking at him in surprise. \"Did you get possessed or something? Did someone else’s soul take over your body?\"","Pei Youchuan froze.","Qiao Chuchu pinched his face, scrutinizing him closely.","He blinked, flustered.","Qiao Chuchu leaned in closer, unaware that her thin camisole revealed a glimpse of something private.","He quickly looked away!","At the ceiling!","At the window!","At the stray hair on Qiao Chuchu’s forehead!","Qiao Chuchu leaned back against the bed, her expression puzzled. \"Where did the confident, shameless you go? Why are you acting so weird now? If it were the old you, you’d be setting off fireworks and telling the whole world that I saved you. Why are you tiptoeing around me now?\"","[It feels like you’re being humble, as if you don’t deserve me.]","Pei Youchuan’s heart skipped a beat, and he guiltily lowered his gaze. \"I’m scared.\"","He whispered, so softly only he could hear, \"I’m scared you’ll leave me.\"","Qiao Chuchu didn’t hear him, as she was busy gritting her teeth against the pain in her arm. \"Use your brain. Isn’t it normal for me to save you? You’re family, after all.\"","[Actually, it had nothing to do with the plot. In that moment, I just wanted to save Pei Youchuan.]","Pei Youchuan looked up, surprised.","Qiao Chuchu tilted her chin up, looking at him playfully. \"If I hadn’t saved you, you wouldn’t be here massaging me with medicated oil. You’d be lying in the morgue, waiting for us to cremate you.\"","She smiled warmly. \"I don’t want to see you in the morgue!\"","Pei Youchuan’s eyes reddened, his voice trembling. \"Because you love me?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? I love your grandma’s shoehorn.\"","She puffed out her cheeks. \"If I had to put a name to it, I’d say I care about you. You’re my third brother, the one I grew up with.\"","Pei Youchuan’s breath hitched, his face turning bright red, his chest heaving!","In a panic, he grabbed a pillow from Qiao Chuchu’s bed and covered his legs!","Qiao Chuchu: \"? Why are you taking my pillow?\"","\"To cover myself,\" Pei Youchuan said gruffly, trying to hide his embarrassment. \"I want to cover up.\"","Qiao Chuchu was confused and tried to take the pillow back. \"Then don’t cover your legs with it.\"","Pei Youchuan pressed down on the pillow, refusing to let her lift it, his ears burning red. \"I’ll buy you a new one. Don’t tell me you’re too stingy to give this to me!\"","Qiao Chuchu, surprised by his intense reaction, let go. \"Fine, fine, it’s yours!\"","She leaned back against the bed, closing her eyes. \"I’m going to nap. Don’t talk.\"","Pei Youchuan nodded, continuing to massage her arm while stealing glances at her.","Chuchu fell asleep.","Under his gentle touch.","His lips curled into an unconscious smile, his cheeks practically glowing, though the smile was silent.","Suddenly, he felt the atmosphere shift.","Pei Youchuan turned to look at the door.","Lin Shen stood there, holding a delicate thermal lunchbox, frozen in place.","He seemed to have just arrived.","Pei Youchuan raised an eyebrow, glanced at the peacefully sleeping Qiao Chuchu, and walked over to Lin Shen. \"What do you want?\"","Lin Shen was dazed, mumbling, \"I made some porridge. I came to bring it to Qiao Chuchu.\"","His gaze dropped to Pei Youchuan’s legs. \"Why are you...\"","Pei Youchuan looked down. \"Sorry, it’s a natural reaction.\"","He lowered his voice, almost boastfully. \"You’re a man too. You understand, right? It’s hard to control around the woman you love.\"","Lin Shen’s eyes widened in shock, as if struck by lightning!","Pei Youchuan pushed him out the door. \"You can leave. This hour is mine. From now on, have Lin Qing deliver your stuff. Didn’t you already lose your chance?\"","Lin Shen: \"? I lost my chance?\"","\"Yeah,\" Pei Youchuan grinned, though his eyes were cold. \"You left her behind and went abroad for three years without coming back. Our Chuchu was heartbroken for a whole year because of you.\"","Lin Shen was even more stunned, his gaze turning dark. \"No wonder you wouldn’t let her get a boyfriend. You had ulterior motives!\"","Pei Youchuan’s face darkened, but he bit his tongue and said nothing.","Inside the room, Qiao Chuchu suddenly woke up, looking around. \"Third brother?\"","Pei Youchuan was about to go back in but stopped, turning to Lin Shen with a cold warning. \"Seeing you will only remind Chuchu of her past pain. Leave!\"","\"No!\" Lin Shen refused to back down, pushing past Pei Youchuan and entering the room. \"Chuchu, I need to talk to you!\""]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: Qiao Chuchu: My Brother Is Really Clingy and Needy","paragraphs":["Qiao Chuchu looked at Lin Shen in surprise: \"Lin Shen? Why are you here?\"","She glanced at the nervous Pei Youchuan and felt something was off: \"What's going on between you two?\"","Lin Shen, holding a thermos flask, was furious: \"Pei Youchuan he—\"","Pei Youchuan suddenly covered his mouth and urgently said: \"You have such a high-speed mechanical device entering China! Remember the principle I gave you! From when we were kids!\"","Lin Shen: \"?\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","What is he talking about?","Pei Youchuan dragged Lin Shen out while saying: \"The principle of the developer is governed by the underworld regime!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Lin Shen slapped his arm: \"Wha—?!\"","Pei Youchuan dragged him out: \"The Huanglong River faction all use Bluetooth!\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"??\"","Lin Shen: \"Waaaaah!\"","At the door, Pei Youchuan placed the porridge Lin Shen made on the cabinet and smiled shamelessly at Qiao Chuchu: \"This is the porridge Lin Shen made for you, remember to drink it!\"","Then, he whispered devilishly in Lin Shen's ear: \"I gave your porridge to her. If you say anything you shouldn't, I'll feed your porridge to my Husky!\"","Lin Shen: \"?????\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","She got out of bed, picked up the thermos flask, and opened it to smell it.","It was seafood porridge, with lots of expensive ingredients added.","She licked her lips: [Lin Shen's seafood porridge is the best, I really miss it.]","Pei Buxian appeared ghost-like at her door, looking expressionless: \"Did Lin Shen come to deliver porridge for you?\"","Qiao Chuchu was startled: \"How did you know?\"","Pei Buxian replied indifferently: \"I saw him carrying a thermos flask coming in.\"","He handed her a delicate box of cake, his tone flat: \"This is what I baked for you, eat this. Give me the porridge, I'll drink it.\"","Qiao Chuchu hesitated, reluctant to give it up: \"But I want to drink porridge now.\"","Pei Buxian took the porridge without argument: \"I'll cook porridge for you, eat the strawberry cake first, it's the same thing.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"? How is it the same?\"","Pei Buxian retorted confidently: \"How is it not the same?\"","After all, it's all made by a man.","Qiao Chuchu felt his aura was off, so she gave in: \"Alright, take it, but don't waste it.\"","[My seventh brother is so moody, hard to deal with. If I don't give it now, who knows what he'll do later. Better give in.]","Pei Buxian raised the thermos flask, serious but eerie: \"Don't worry, I plan to savor this seafood porridge, analyze what seasonings are in it, and discuss with the chef what kind of flavor makes you like it so much.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"?\"","Pei Buxian carried the thermos flask, grinning creepily: \"Hehehehehe... No one can beat me... I'll outshine them all.\"","Qiao Chuchu: \"...\"","Speaking of which, she hadn't properly thanked Qi Xiaojia since returning.","Although Qi Xiaojia wasn't on good terms with her, that rope was crucial, saving her and Pei Youchuan's lives.","Without that rope, she would have wasted a chance at life.","Even though Qi Xiaojia said no need to repay the favor, it's better to settle it clearly.","She called Little Xie: \"Didn't Qi Xiaojia leave her address when she came to work here? Give me the address, I'm going to see her.\"","Little Xie quickly pulled up the address on a tablet and was a bit concerned: \"Are you going alone? The gentlemen are all at home, should I call them to go?\"","Qiao Chuchu didn't want to take them: \"They're getting more and more clingy lately, not sure if it's my imagination, but I feel like they're oozing with unspent hormones, always being all touchy-feely with me.\"","Little Xie twitched her mouth: \"Maybe just towards you, I haven't seen them having any overflow of hormones towards other girls.\"","Qiao Chuchu grabbed her old phone from the bedside table and handed the tablet back to her: \"Go get me three bodyguards to come with me, they're tough guys, don't tell my brothers.\"","Her bodyguards were very professional, capable of taking down two to three skilled opponents, so going to see Qi Xiaojia should be enough.","After all, fear comes from insufficient firepower.","She needed to be well-equipped when going to unfamiliar places."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Qi Xiaojia and Xia Xuechun","paragraphs":["Qi Xiaojia dragged her exhausted body to her doorstep.","The security door was defaced with the glaring red spray-painted word: \"Homewrecker.\"","...","Had Brother Long's thugs come to harass her again?","She scoffed mockingly, took out her keys, and unlocked the door.","There were several footprints at the entrance.","Frowning, she cautiously peered inside.","Xia Xuechun was sitting obediently on her sofa, smiling at her. \"You're back.\"","Qi Xiaojia remained silent, her eyes scanning Xia Xuechun's shoes.","A pair of unbranded thick-soled Mary Janes were neatly placed together, with a clean tissue paper tucked underneath.","She let out an exasperated laugh. \"If you're worried about dirtying my floor, why not just take off your shoes before coming in? Why bother wearing them and then pretending to care by placing a tissue under them?\"","Xia Xuechun glanced at the tissue beneath her feet. \"I'm not worried about dirtying your floor. I'm worried your floor is too dirty and might ruin my shoes.\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"Get out. Leave right now.\"","Xia Xuechun sighed with a helpless smile. \"Why are you so angry? You haven't had time to mop the floor, so your place is indeed dirty. Can't I just speak the truth?\"","Qi Xiaojia hung her bag on the wall, not wanting to engage. \"Give me back my house key and get out. I don't want to see you again.\"","Her parents were still in the hospital, their condition critical, and the family's savings were nearly drained.","She had been working day and night, taking on the most grueling jobs that paid well.","To prepare for emergencies, she had given a spare key to her house to Xia Xuechun.","In this world, apart from her parents, Xia Xuechun was the person she trusted the most.","Qi Xiaojia's chest felt heavy. \"I've been working all day and almost died on the boat. I don't have the energy to argue with you. Just return the key and leave.\"","\"Who hasn't almost died on a boat? Stop being dramatic,\" Xia Xuechun said dismissively. \"I want to know why you helped Qiao Chuchu today.\"","Qi Xiaojia changed into her slippers and looked at her with sarcasm. \"Maybe because I'm a decent human being.\"","Xia Xuechun's eyelids twitched, and her expression gradually hardened. \"Are you saying I'm not decent? You betrayed a friend, and you think you're in the right?\"","\"Betrayed?\" Qi Xiaojia pointed at herself, laughing bitterly. \"I dislike Qiao Chuchu, but I couldn't just stand by and watch two people die in front of me. Is that betrayal?!\"","Xia Xuechun sneered mockingly. \"If you dislike someone, you should want them dead.\"","Qi Xiaojia retorted sharply, \"No! Disliking someone and wanting to kill them are two completely different things!!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"?\"","Qi Xiaojia stared at her firmly. \"I don't like dogs, but I can't stand seeing someone abuse one. If I see it, I'll stop it because it's a living being. Is that logic really so hard to understand?!\"","Xia Xuechun: \"...\"","Qi Xiaojia's voice was filled with disgust. \"I'm not like you. You claim to be kind, but your actions are vile!\"","The atmosphere in the room turned icy.","Xia Xuechun's facial muscles twitched slightly, and an imperceptible anger crept into her expression. \"Just because I didn't find you a job paying fifty thousand a month, you're going to judge me like this?\"","Qi Xiaojia was momentarily stunned, then laughed sarcastically. \"Xia Xuechun, let me say it again. I'm not angry about the fifty thousand. I'm angry because you're two-faced.\"","Xia Xuechun: \"? How am I two-faced?\"","Qi Xiaojia rolled her eyes. \"Qiao Chuchu offering you fifty thousand is an insult, but an old man giving you twenty thousand is love? Isn't that being two-faced?\"","Xia Xuechun shot back, \"How is Qiao Chuchu offering me fifty thousand a month not an insult? After getting to know the two Brother Longs, I now drive a Mercedes and have a new house. My parents can live comfortably in their old age, all thanks to Brother Long. Could Qiao Chuchu do that for me? Could she buy me a car or a house?! Isn't that an insult?\"","Qi Xiaojia couldn't bear to listen anymore. \"If you don't want to live a hard life, just say it outright!\"","\"Say it outright that you want easy money, that you're blinded by vanity. Would it kill you to be honest with me?! Didn't I support you when you wanted to get close to Weisheng Biehe?! I even helped you steal his dog!!\"","Her voice grew more sorrowful. \"There's nothing wrong with wanting material things, with wanting a car and a house. But I can't stand your hypocrisy. You've already inserted yourself into those old men's lives like a homewrecker. I even saw them fighting to kiss you! And you still try to act innocent!!\"","Xia Xuechun's breath hitched, and she slapped Qi Xiaojia hard across the face!","Qi Xiaojia was caught off guard, her head snapping to the side.","The room fell silent.","Xia Xuechun's hand trembled as she clenched her teeth, speaking with righteous indignation. \"You have a dirty mind, so you see everything as dirty. You claim to be my friend, but I don't have such a disgusting friend.\"","Qi Xiaojia was stunned, then nodded with a bitter laugh.","\"Fine... fine!\"","She pointed to the door. \"Get out. I don't want to see you again.\"","Xia Xuechun sneered. \"Of course, I'll leave. But tell me, does Qiao Chuchu know I was the one who pushed the stool?\"","Qi Xiaojia: \"?\"","She looked at Xia Xuechun's dark expression and felt a chill. \"No, I didn't tell her.\"","\"Good.\" Xia Xuechun picked up her bag and walked to the door. \"Qi Xiaojia, once this door closes, we're no longer in the same world.\"","She didn't look back. \"I'll rise to the top, and you'll regret not clinging to me. You'll never climb up again.\"","Qi Xiaojia turned her back to her, laughing self-deprecatingly. \"Xia Xuechun, I never wanted anything from you. I genuinely wanted to be your friend.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, several men emerged from her room.","Qi Xiaojia: \"? Who are you?\"","The men didn't answer, holding contraceptives in their hands and leering at her suggestively.","Qi Xiaojia's face paled, and she bolted for the door!","But Xia Xuechun slammed it shut with a loud \"Bang!\"","Without hesitation, she used the key Qi Xiaojia had once entrusted to her and double-locked the door.","Qi Xiaojia tried to open the door twice but failed. Finally, she understood, her voice trembling—","\"Xia Xuechun! What are you doing?! Open the door!!!\"","She glanced back at the men slowly approaching her and pounded on the door frantically!","\"Open the door! Open it now! You can't do this to me! Open the door!!!\"","\"Xia Xuechun! I trusted you as my best friend! How could you do this to me— Ah!!!\"","Xia Xuechun ignored her, wiping the fingerprints off the key with a wet wipe.","The sound of struggling and dragging came from inside the house.","She remembered the day Qi Xiaojia had given her the key.","Qi Xiaojia had pressed the key into her hand, saying playfully, \"This is a spare key to my place. I'm entrusting it to you for now!~\"","Xia Xuechun had been overjoyed, basking in the trust, and teased her, \"Aren't you afraid I'll steal from you?\"","Qi Xiaojia had laughed carelessly. \"Come on, we've been close since we were kids. You wouldn't steal from me, right?~\"","Qi Xiaojia had slung an arm around her shoulder. \"My parents aren't around these days, and I'm working nonstop. If I don't reply to your messages, come check on me. I'm afraid I might drop dead without anyone noticing.\"","Xia Xuechun had tucked the key close to her heart. \"Don't worry, I'll definitely come to your rescue!\""]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: The Mantis Stalks the Cicada, Unaware of the Oriole Behind","paragraphs":["Xia Xuechun clutched the key, her head bowed as she stood outside Qi Xiaojia's door, listening to the muffled sobs from within. Silent tears streamed down her face.","Every tear she shed was for herself. She bit her lip and forced a bitter smile. \"In the end, isn't it because I didn't find you a job worth fifty thousand yuan that you resent me? Calling me hypocritical—you're the real hypocrite, Qi Xiaojia.\"","She tossed the key at the doorstep and walked out of the building, dialing a number. \"Brother Long, thank you for your advice. I think this is the best way to keep her quiet.\"","Recording a video of Qi Xiaojia was meant to serve as insurance, to shut her up and prevent her from revealing the truth to Qiao Chuchu.","This was the plan Brother Long had suggested.","The man on the other end of the line spoke gently, \"Are you crying?\"","Xia Xuechun nodded, her voice trembling with sobs. \"I'm heartbroken. I truly considered her a friend, but she insulted me like this.\"","The man chuckled softly. \"It's alright. I'm right outside. Look up.\"","Xia Xuechun looked up in surprise.","A middle-aged man stood in front of a luxury car, smiling as he hung up the phone and opened his arms. \"Come here, let me hug you.\"","Her eyes lit up, and she rushed into his embrace. \"Brother!\"","He patted her head affectionately. \"Don't waste your tears on someone unworthy. Come on, let me take you shopping. You've had a rough day, haven't you?\"","Xia Xuechun was on the verge of tears again, overwhelmed with gratitude. She got into the car with him, and they drove off.","Meanwhile, Qiao Chuchu, sitting in her car and recording the scene, muttered under her breath: \"Ugh! Disgusting! Absolutely vile!\"","She saved the video and uploaded it to the cloud, grumbling, \"Watching this might help me lose ten pounds. I'll use it as a weight-loss tool from now on.\"","Qiao Chuchu hurriedly got out of the car, suppressing her nausea as she approached Qi Xiaojia's apartment. Two bodyguards walked ahead of her, and one followed behind.","As they reached the door, one of the bodyguards paused. \"Someone's crying.\"","Qiao Chuchu dismissed it. \"It's probably Qi Xiaojia. Those two must have had a fight. That's why Xia Xuechun left in tears.\"","The other bodyguard frowned. \"No, Miss. The crying sounds... off.\"","Qiao Chuchu's heart tightened. Her eyes flicked to the ground. \"There's a key here.\"","Without hesitation, the bodyguards shielded her and cautiously unlocked the door.","The moment it opened, the sound of weeping and a man's lecherous laughter flooded out.","Qiao Chuchu and the bodyguards rushed in, only to be stunned by the scene before them.","Multiple cameras were aimed at Qi Xiaojia, who lay on the floor, her clothes torn, with no blanket to cover herself. Her mouth was sealed with tape, and she was surrounded by men, utterly trapped and desperate.","Her tear-filled eyes widened when she noticed Qiao Chuchu.","Qi Xiaojia let out a heart-wrenching wail: \"Mmmph! Mmmph!!\"","It was Qiao Chuchu!","Save her!","Please, save her!!","Qiao Chuchu stared in shock at the equally stunned thug across the room.","Was this... Xia Xuechun's doing?","Had she sent people to harm her own friend?!","The thug, seeing Qiao Chuchu, snarled and charged forward. \"Where the hell did you come from?!\"","Qiao Chuchu's expression darkened. \"Take them down!\"","Her bodyguards sprang into action, swiftly overpowering the thugs and leaving them writhing on the floor in pain.","One of the thugs tried to get up, defiant.","Qiao Chuchu stomped on him, her foot landing squarely between his legs.","The man howled in agony: \"Aaaah!!!!\"","The bodyguards winced, instinctively covering their own groins as they glanced nervously at Qiao Chuchu.","Her face cold, Qiao Chuchu twisted her foot, grinding it until the man was drenched in sweat, on the verge of passing out from the pain. Only then did she relent.","She took off her coat and draped it over Qi Xiaojia, helping her pull up her pants and removing the tape from her mouth. \"It's over. You're safe now. Don't be afraid.\"","Qi Xiaojia, her face streaked with tears, clung to Qiao Chuchu, sobbing. \"Xia Xuechun locked me in here! I didn’t even have time to grab my keys before they dragged me away!\"","Qiao Chuchu frowned. \"What?\"","Qi Xiaojia tightened her grip, nearly suffocating Qiao Chuchu. \"Thank you for saving me. Really, thank you so much!\"","Qiao Chuchu glanced at the key on the floor, her mind racing.","In the original timeline, Xia Xuechun would have narrowly escaped danger and become Ji Yanchuan's wife, while Qi Xiaojia would have made a fortune with her support.","But Xia Xuechun's marriage to Ji Yanchuan depended on others \"donating blood\" for her.","Her hands were clean; she only needed to stand on the moral high ground, spouting inspirational quotes to secure her victory.","The dirty work was always left to others.","Qi Xiaojia had been one of Xia Xuechun's most loyal pawns, shouldering all the high-risk tasks.","Now, the plot had deviated so much from the original story. The \"donors\" were no longer sufficient or of high quality. Xia Xuechun, always one to say one thing and do another, had started to exploit those around her.","Qiao Chuchu thought carefully before taking Qi Xiaojia's cold hand. \"I have an unreasonable request. I need your consent.\"","Qi Xiaojia looked at her warily, then fearfully at the three towering bodyguards behind her. \"Y-you're not going to hurt me too, are you?\"","\"No,\" Qiao Chuchu said seriously. \"I want you to delay exposing Xia Xuechun.\"","Qi Xiaojia blinked in confusion. \"What?\"","Qiao Chuchu recalled the new storyline from her premonitions and explained patiently, \"Tonight, there's a charity auction. It's Xia Xuechun's official debut in high society.\"","\"The Dragon Family and Old Madam Wang are planning to promote her. They'll have her present a painting, then orchestrate a bidding war to drive the price up to one and a half million. Her painting will be the only one at the event, making her the center of attention. The Dragon Family has already bribed influencers to call her a prodigious grassroots artist. She'll trend online, her reputation skyrocketing overnight.\"","Qiao Chuchu smirked coldly. \"My original plan was to bring my own painting and steal her spotlight. With me there, her title of 'genius artist' would be exposed as undeserved.\"","\"But if you team up with me, when Xia Xuechun tries to compete with me, you can accuse her of hiring those men to assault you. The impact would be completely different.\"","She laid out her strategy carefully. \"I'll let Xia Xuechun soar high, only to fall harder. I also have a recording of her admitting to plagiarizing my work. I can humiliate everyone who supported her.\"","\"And you,\" Qiao Chuchu pressed Qi Xiaojia's hand. \"I'll cover all your parents' medical expenses, from their hospitalization to their discharge. If you perform well, I'll even give you five million yuan.\"","Qi Xiaojia was stunned. \"Is Xia Xuechun worth five million?\"","\"She is,\" Qiao Chuchu confirmed. \"Absolutely.\"","With Xia Xuechun's incredible luck, once she rose to prominence, it would be nearly impossible to bring her down.","In the timeline where Qiao Chuchu had failed, Pei Youchuan had died around this time. Distraught and preoccupied with his funeral, she hadn't paid attention to the charity auction.","That was the day Xia Xuechun had soared to fame, appearing before the entire world.","By the time Qiao Chuchu emerged from her grief, seven days had passed.","Then, the events spiraled out of control.","One by one, her brothers died.","She couldn't remember how she had felt in that previous timeline. All she knew was that, by the end, she had become numb.","Numbness wasn't a good sign—it meant her mind was protecting her from the unbearable pain.","Clearly, her failure had dealt her a devastating blow.","Qi Xiaojia was a crucial piece in this game."]}]);
